window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3601,"title":"Chapter 3601: Frightening Destruction Energy","paragraphs":["Chapter 3601: Frightening Destruction Energy","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor. Henyee Translations","So this was the essence of fire?","Ling Han picked up the fiery red thing on the ground. It looked a little like a flickering flame, and was very scorching, but in truth, it was not burning. It was just that the temperature was extremely high.","“All right, let’s move separately.” Ling Han nodded.","“All right!” the Calabash Brothers shouted one after another, running off on their little legs.","Ling Han had brought them over naturally because he wanted them to help him “fight monsters”. He had already tested out the battle prowess of the seven toddlers, and they were not much inferior to him.","An Innate Divine Physique was really that awesome. There was no need to cultivate at all, and one could naturally advance just by eating and drinking normally.","However, the little loli still followed Ling Han. She was a lazy person, so how could she be willing to be a coolie?","Ling Han didn’t mind either. If he didn’t have the little lolita’s help, he wouldn’t have been able to come to the Moonlight Planet either. This alone was enough help to him.","He charged into the midst of the flaming creatures, and began his barrage of attacks.","Peng, peng, peng! Under the crushing pressure of his powerful strength, they were completely outmatched, and he destroyed everything in his path, leaving behind a field of essence of flames.","The seven babies were also incredibly powerful, using all kinds of methods, pushing aside all obstacles in their way.","They headed deeper into the valley, smooth sailing all the way.","Even if this valley was very big, it could not hold up to the strength of the eight of them. In only half a day’s time, they had advanced to the end of the valley.","That was it?","“The fire here is strong, and the fire element is endless. Probably, tomorrow morning, the fire creatures will once again fill this valley to the brim,” the little loli said, licking the toffee.","Second Baby was also licking one. The seven babies and the little loli were already a group. She said, “However, there are a great many mountain caves in the valley, and there should be even more fire elements inside. Though I can’t see clearly, I can still sense a strong wave of fire energy.”","“Alright, then we’ll continue to move separately. Each person will take a cave, and after dealing with it, we’ll meet back here,” Ling Han said.","“Yes, Father.”","The babies dispersed one after another. Ling Han and the little loli also found a mountain cave. It was very big, and the cave mouth had to be fifteen meters tall. They had not even entered yet, but could already feel an intense burning sensation surging over.","This valley was already very hot, but the cave was even hotter.","Ling Han strode forwards, while the little loli pulled on the corner of his shirt and followed behind.","Not long after, a human-shaped flaming creature appeared ahead of them.","It was very tall, as tall as six meters, and its body was even more sturdy. However, it had arms but no legs. It just floated in midair like that, and there was a flaming halberd in its hand.","It was high level; those fiery creatures outside didn’t bring weapons.","This flaming creature also discovered Ling Han’s presence, and immediately floated over, launching an attack at Ling Han.","The halberd stabbed over, fierce flames raging.","This attack contained a powerful high-level energy, and the scorching flames could melt metal.","Ling Han threw a punch that was also enshrouded in flames, which landed on the tip of the halberd.","Peng!","Ling Han’s body trembled, and so did that monster. It was sent flying from the impact.","Its strength was not weak; he actually did not manage to insta-kill him with a single strike.","Ling Han pounced out again. Peng, peng, peng! He threw ten consecutive punches, and the flaming monster collapsed.","The elemental essence left behind this time was slightly larger than the outside.","En they were similarly farming monsters. Clearly, the gains here were greater, but outside, one punch was enough, while ten punches were needed here. Going by that calculation, in terms of efficiency, it was actually more profitable outside, but the fire monsters outside were farmed too slowly, so there was not enough for him to kill.","Unless... he could increase the efficiency of his slaughter here.","‘I got it!’","Ling Han continued to advance, and very soon, he saw a second large-sized fire monster. It similarly held a halberd in its hand, and the moment it discovered Ling Han, it immediately floated over and began to attack.","“Handsome Brother, go!” As the little loli licked the toffee, she cheered Ling","Han on.","Ling Han still threw a punch, but this time, his fist was wrapped in destructive energy, and it was completely dark.","Peng!","The punch landed on the halberd, and the black-colored energy instantly spread along the halberd’s body, quickly covering the entire body of the flaming monster. Then, this giant crumbled with a bang, leaving behind a streak of fire essence.","So awesome?","Even Ling Han himself experienced a shock. He knew that destructive energy was terrifying, but being powerful to this extent was still far beyond his expectations.","“Yi, Handsome Brother, are you on steroids?” Tang Yun’er was extremely stunned, and did not even lick the candy anymore. She wormed her head in, “This high-level energy is so terrifying, filled with destructive power.” Ling Han suddenly became curious. Where had Primordial True Lord obtained this Spirit Diagram from?","Did it have any relation to the reason the other had stayed behind in the Celestial Sea Planet?","He shook his head and put away the essence of the flames. Since his slaughter was so shocking, collecting the essence of the flames in this cave was obviously a good idea.","“It’s a secret!” He gestured for the little loli to keep quiet.","“AU right, I will keep your secret.” The little loli spread out her hands, “Adults are really troublesome.”","They advanced again, and Ling Han was completely unmatched. Once the destructive energy was unleashed, everything would be destroyed, and the destructive power was endless.","This cave was quite complicated. There were many crossroads, and Ling Han would take a right turn whenever he encountered a crossroads. He first constructed a three-dimensional map in his mind.","He quickly swept through one cave after another, and after returning to the starting point, he continued onwards.","Yi?","After walking for a while, he revealed a surprised expression, because he had already walked for a very long time, and he actually did not encounter a single flaming monster.","According to his previous experience, this shouldn’t be the case. At most, he would have to walk for a minute before he would definitely encounter a new flaming monster.","Unless... there was someone in front that was also killing monsters.","Ling Han quickened his pace. After walking for a while, a flaming monster appeared ahead of him, but he didn’t find anyone else.","Right at this moment, shua, a flash of Sword Qi rapidly stabbed down from the top of his head.","A cold smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. Since he was already suspicious, how could he be unprepared?","He stretched out his hand, and pa, grabbed onto the sword’s blade. The energy of Stone wrapped around his hand, and his defenses soared, allowing him to ignore the sharpness of the sword’s blade. Then, he pulled strongly and smashed down again, and a figure was sent flying and smashed onto the ground.","Peng!","Ling Han had used his full power, and under the powerful impact, that person instantly threw up blood madly.","This was a man who looked to be in his thirties. There was a scar on his face, which added a bit of toughness to him, but now that he had been knocked dizzy, he was actually unable to get back to his feet for the moment.","Ling Han casually waved his hand, and the sword in his hand instantly shot out, soaring towards the flaming monster in the distance.","The flaming monster discovered Ling Han’s presence, and it had already charged over. With a wave of its hand, it sent the sword flying. Its speed was practically unaffected.","But Ling Han followed up with another punch, and as destructive energy surged past, this flaming monster was blasted into smithereens.","At first, the man on the ground was still very fierce, but when he saw that the flaming monster was actually no match for Ling Han, and was directly destroyed, he shivered in fear, losing all his courage.","Ling Han put away the essence of the flames, then looked at the man, and asked, “Why did you sneak attack me?”"]},{"number":3602,"title":"Chapter 3602: Flame King","paragraphs":["Chapter 3602: Flame King","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","The man stammered. In this kind of dangerous place, it was very normal for people to kill each other. Since he had sensed that someone was pursuing him from behind, he would definitely make the first move.","In the Extreme Flame Valley, it was extremely common to kill others and plunder their fire essence. What other reason could there be?","Now that Ling Han had asked this question, he did not know how to answer.","He thought for a moment, then said, “Little brother, we’re all on the same side. I also saw the bounty notice issued by the Pang Clan of Nanyang, and thus came here to collect the essence of fire. We are all just here to earn a living, and previously, it was also a misunderstanding.”","“Pang Clan of Nanyang?” Ling Han murmured. He grabbed the man, “Be more specific.”","“You don’t know?” The man was surprised.","Pa, Ling Han smacked him on the head, “Am I asking you, or are you asking me?”","The man gritted his teeth. This was really painful, but when he saw Ling Han’s cold eyes, he could only tell him the truth.","This Pang Clan of Nanyang was a very powerful clan. In the past, there had been a Spirit Transformation True Lord in the clan, but after this ancestor died, the Pang Clan became weaker and weaker with each generation. Now, there were only a few Core Formation Tier elites overseeing the clan.","However, a starving camel was still bigger than a horse. The Pang Clan was still very wealthy, and in this generation of the Pang Clan, a prodigy had appeared. His name was Pang Yunfei.","Precisely for the sake of nurturing this outstanding descendant, the Pang Clan spared no expense to concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill for Pang Yunfei. Thus, they issued a bounty. As long as anyone gathered enough essence of the Five Elements, they would be able to trade it for various treasures.","For example, Celestial Tools, Celestial medicines, cultivation techniques, and so on. As long as you had enough Five Elements essence, you would be able to trade for them.","When the news spread out, it naturally attracted a great many people to enter into the land of the Five Elements to collect the essence of the Five Elements.","“Oh, that’s right. Aside from the Pang Clan, it seems like there is also the Luo Clan that is collecting the essence of the Five Elements.” The man thought for a while, then squeezed out another piece of information for Ling Han.","Two forces were competing with him?","Ling Han thought for a moment. Fine, others could rob him, so why couldn’t he rob others?","There was strength in numbers. In this way, perhaps he would only need a few years, or even a year, to be able to concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill.","Ling Han patted that person’s shoulder, “Hand over the essence of flames.”","“Er, little brother, haven’t I already apologized to you?” the man said with a grimace.","“Flame essence or your life, choose one,” Ling Han said calmly. This person had launched a sneak attack on Ling Han to kill him, and now he was merely robbing him. Just how broad-minded was he?","The man had no choice but to hand over the essence of flames.","Oh, quite a lot.","“How long have you been here?” Ling Han asked.","“Two years.”","It had actually been two years?","Ling Han shook his head. By the looks of it, his gains were pitifully little, “You are too lazy. You only managed to gather this little bit in two years?”","The man was speechless. His efficiency was already very high!","Fire monsters had fire poison in their bodies, and if one battled for too long, he would definitely be contaminated with a sliver of fire poison. It had to be cured. Otherwise, if the fire poison accumulated, it would cause serious consequences, and it was not impossible that one would be burnt to death.","“Get lost, and don’t let me see you again.” Ling Han casually tossed the man backwards.","He paid no further attention to them, and strode forwards.","After a while, a new flaming monster appeared, and was naturally killed with a single punch.","Ling Han had seen someone burn to death by the fire poison before, so he naturally wouldn’t be unguarded against it. However, he could kill his opponent with a single punch, and under the barrage of destructive energy, even the fire poison could be easily destroyed. He didn’t need to worry about being corroded by the fire poison.","Thus, even if there were people that were his equal in abilities, they were completely incomparable in terms of efficiency.","The more he killed, the more shocked Ling Han became. Just what kind of background did this destructive energy have? It was too terrifying, wasn’t it?","After roaming the secondary cave, Ling Han returned to the main cave and continued to advance.","There was more than one person here. Clearly, the bounty issued by either the Pang Clan or the Luo Clan had been effective. Ling Han had not taken too many steps, when he was attacked by another sneak attack.","He went by the usual practice. Capture him, and after giving him a good thrashing, search him thoroughly for his essence of flames.","Why didn’t he kill him?","There was another purpose, and that was so he could get the best deal. In future, when he encountered these people, he could rob them again, and treat them as free labour.","After circling over a dozen caves, Ling Han also looted a dozen over people, causing his gains to increase explosively.","En, added with seven babies, he might be able to complete the step of condensing a Fire Element Crystal in a few months’ time.","He did not worry about the babies in the slightest. They were all cunning, and their abilities were extraordinary. It was only them that would be screwing others over.","After walking for a while longer, he finally arrived at the end of the main cave.","Previously, he had robbed a great many people, and had also obtained some useful information.","For example, there was a Flame King in every mountain cave. Its abilities were far stronger than ordinary flame creatures, and the essence of flames it provided was also slightly more. In fact, Fire Origin Stones would occasionally drop, which could gather the power of heaven and earth and speed up cultivation.","This was very similar to the Ice Origin Stone.","Of course, not every Flame King would drop Fire Origin Stones; it depended on luck.","However, no one dared to have any ideas about the Flame King.","Firstly, the Flame King was too strong, being able to sweep aside Mystery Realm Tier elites, and secondly, the Flame King could detonate the fire poison in a cultivator’s body. Even if the amount wasn’t enough to kill him, how could he withstand such torture in battle?","Hence, everyone only dared to kill monsters in the side cave. If it was the main cave, no one dared to visit.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid. Instead, he was in high spirits. In the last two months, he had not cultivated, so he could use the power of the Fire Origin Stone to catch in progress of his cultivation.","He stepped into the last place of this cave. This was a very large cave, and there was a massive flame monster that was currently floating back and forth, and in every corner of the cave, there were bones scattered everywhere.","Clearly, it was not that no one had challenged the Flame King, but the majority of them had probably lost their lives.","The Flame King also discovered Ling Han’s presence at the first instant. He immediately raised his hand and threw it out. Xiu! The flaming halberd in his hand shot toward the little loli.","“Ah, help!” Tang Yun’er screamed.","Ling Han threw a punch. Peng! The flaming halberd instantly shattered.","The little loli was furious. She pointed at the Flame King and said, “Flame Head, why are you hitting cute, beautiful, obedient, filial, er... Little Toffee?”","The Flame King naturally ignored her. He formed another halberd of fire in his hands, and this time, he threw it at Ling Han.","Ling Han threw another punch to block the attack, but the Flame King condensed a third flaming halberd and threw it over.","This offensive was really rapid. If it was not Ling Han, if it was another person, they might not even be able to fight back, and would be shot dead.","Ling Han humphed, “You’re not done yet?”","He opened his mouth and spat out a golden sword that slashed at the Flame King.","“Do you think you’re the only one who can do this?”","Xiu, the golden sword swept past, and the Flame King didn’t dare to be careless. He waved his large hand, and fiery flames blazed.."]},{"number":3603,"title":"Chapter 3603: Pang Shu","paragraphs":["Chapter 3603: Pang Shu","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Flame King sent the golden sword flying with a single palm strike, but the flames on his hand also dimmed for a moment. Obviously, dispersing this attack wasn’t as easy as it looked.","“Handsome Brother, charge!” The little loli cheered Ling Han on. He actually dared to sneak attack her, how detestable!","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t allow others to attack him as they liked. Moreover, if he attacked from afar, he wouldn’t be able to unleash the might of the destructive energy either. He charged forward, planning to engage in close-quarter combat with the Flame King.","The Flame King was completely unafraid, and it also sent out a palm strike.","Peng!","The flames clashed with the darkness. Both were high-level energies, but while they were both high-level energies, there was still a difference in their density, as well as a difference in quality.","As the black energy surged, the flames instantly faded greatly.","The Flame King was astonished. Its extremely simple brain was only filled with battle instincts, and it knew that this was disadvantageous to it.","It hurriedly retreated, but half of its arm had already completely dimmed, and there were no longer any flames burning.","This human was so terrifying.","It stretched out its other hand, and pulled forcefully on its dim left arm. Peng, this arm was torn off, but it was only an instant. Flames burned fiercely, and its severed arm immediately regrew.","However, if one looked closely, they would discover that the brightness of the flames on its body had dimmed slightly.","Clearly, there was a price to pay for its severed arm to regenerate.","This ability would definitely be envied to death by countless cultivators, because the regrowth of severed limbs would at least have to be an ability that only Venerate Tier elites could possess, and in the case of Saints, they could even regrow a drop of their blood. The tenacity of their vitality was practically chilling.","Ling Han was also slightly surprised, but he immediately charged out again.","This time, he would kill the Flame King with a crushing force, not giving it any chance to recover.","The Flame King was truly afraid of this human. It stretched out a finger and pointed at Ling Han, wanting to detonate the fire poison in his body.","However, it immediately looked dumbfounded, because there were no flames burning inside Ling Han’s body.","More or less, there had to be something, right?","However, Ling Han had killed his enemies with a single punch before, so what fire poison could invade his body with the Destructive Energy there?","Since there was zero fire poison, how could it be detonated?","The Flame King didn’t believe it and tapped Ling Han again, but it was still ineffective.","Thankfully, it did not know how to speak. If it continued to point and shout “explode, explode, explode” at the same time, the situation would be even more awkward.","‘Holy f*ck! Are you a freak?! 1","The Flame King’s expression looked constipated, and he was about to go crazy.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and threw out a punch.","The Flame King hurriedly parried, but the destructive energy corroded, and wherever it touched, the flames all dimmed.","And this was still because it was strong enough. If an ordinary fire monster was hit by a punch, it would be directly destroyed, but it had only dimmed slightly. It lived up to its name as a king.","But so what?","Ling Han followed up with a few more punches. The Flame King was like a fire that had been splashed with water, and very soon, it was completely extinguished.","Die.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over, and couldn’t help but sigh. There was only the essence of fire, and no Fire Origin Stone.","Forget it, it was just that there was no icing on the cake. Furthermore, there were so many caves here. He would look for it elsewhere.","He went back the way he had come. When he arrived at the exit, he immediately sensed that there were a great many people outside.","Previously, he had robbed a dozen over people, and now they had come to exact revenge?","Hehe.","Ling Han was completely unconcerned. In this place, cultivation level was suppressed, and he was unafraid even if elites of Celestial Path came. He would still beat them to burst.","He strode out, and saw that there were indeed over twenty people standing at the cave entrance, led by a young man in red robes who looked to be in his mid-twenties.","When he saw Ling Han, the young man in red smiled faintly, “My name is Pang Shu, a member of the Pang Clan.”","“And then?” Ling Han asked.","Pang Shu was taken aback. He really did not know what else to say now that Ling Han had replied like this.","He was a little embarrassed, and coughed before saying, “I’m the person-in-charge here from the Pang Clan. The essence of flames that you’ve gathered will all be handed over to me. I’ll record the amount for you. When the time comes, you can go to the Pang Clan to trade for what you need.”","‘Oh, this guy thinks I’m a hired help from the Pang Clan? 1 Ling Han thought to himself.","“Additionally, malicious competition is not advisable.” Pang Shu continued, “Return all the essence of flames that you have snatched, as well as compensate for some losses, and this matter will be considered over.”","“It’s still Seventh Young Master Pang who is more just,” the others praised.","“Brat, did you hear what Seventh Young Master Pang said? Hurry up and return the essence of flames to us!”","“And compensation!”","“There’s no need for too much, just double it.”","These people clamored. The source of their confidence naturally came from Pang Shu. This was a Foundation Building elite. Even if the cultivation level of this place was suppressed, Foundation Building Tier elites were still considerably stronger than the ordinary Mystery Realm Tier.","“Hey, hey, hey, what are you guys shouting for? There’s not even a single handsome guy, and you have the nerve to say that,” the little loli said in displeasure. How had these people grown up to look like this? She actually couldn’t find a single handsome guy among the twenty over people; they were way too embarrassing.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “You are the person-in-charge of the Pang Clan here?”","“Of course,” Pang Shu said proudly. He looked down on everyone here. There were differences between immortals and mortals, all right? However, in order to complete the mission, he had to be cordial, and this naturally made him very displeased.","Ling Han rubbed his hands together, “Then you must have a lot of essence of fire on you?”","Hold on, why did these words sound so awkward?","Pang Shu was surprised, and asked with a frown, “What do you want to do?”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Rob you!”","The essence of flames couldn’t be brought out of the valley, so Pang Shu definitely had a lot of essence of flames.","Pang Shu faltered for a moment, then laughed loudly. This young man had really gone mad, to actually say that he wanted to rob him.","When he smiled like this, the others naturally laughed as well. They all looked like they had encountered an idiot.","This was too funny. A mere Mystery Realm Tier actually dared to threaten a Foundation Building elite... if they knew that Ling Han was actually an Enlightenment Tier, they would definitely be even more surprised.","Ling Han did not get angry, and laughed along with everyone else.","Pang Shu suddenly stopped laughing, and said balefully, “Don’t think that just because you have some abilities, you can be condescending. A mere Mystery Realm Tier — yi?”","He looked at Ling Han, and felt that this was a little strange.","Was this really a Mystery Realm Tier?","If this was outside, he would be able to see through Ling Han with a single glance, but now that his cultivation level had been suppressed, his insight had also become considerably poorer. He only felt that Ling Han was a little unusual, but could not tell the exact details.","“With enough strength, you naturally can be arrogant and condescending!” Ling Han suddenly charged out, and shot out a punch.","Pang Shu revealed an expression of disdain. A mere Mystery Realm Tier actually dared to make a move on him?","Fine, he would kill him as a warning to the others.","He was just about to make a move, when he felt a massive pressure assailing him, as if there was a Primordial Beast exerting pressure on him, causing his heart to tremble in fear.","With this shock, his movements suddenly slowed.","Peng, Ling Han’s fist shot out, and Pang Shu was forcefully smashed onto the ground, his face deeply smashed into the dry and cracked ground.","This... All of a sudden, the whole area was silent, without the slightest bit of sound.."]},{"number":3604,"title":"Chapter 3604: Sword-wielding Youth","paragraphs":["Chapter 3604: Sword-wielding Youth","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","That was Pang Shu, a Foundation Building elite, yet he was thrown onto the ground with a single punch.","How could this be believed?","These people had basically been taught a lesson by Ling Han before, and knew that he was very awesome, but the fact that he was awesome to the extent that he could defeat a Foundation Building cultivator with a single punch was still something that they could not accept.","There was no logic to his strength.","Pang Shu scrambled to his feet. It was not that he was no match for Ling Han, but rather that he had been intimidated by a murderous aura. Otherwise, there was absolutely no way he could have been knocked down with a single punch","from Ling Han.","However, he had only gotten halfway up, when a foot had already stepped heavily on his back, forcibly pressing him back down.","He knew that this was definitely Ling Han’s doing.","Damn it, a mere Mystery Realm Tier actually dared to step on his pride?","Are you tired of living?","If it weren’t for the fact that this was the Extreme Flame Valley, he would have","been able to kill Ling Han with a single breath.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Where’s the essence of flames? Hand it over.”","Pang Shu ignored him. If Ling Han had compelled him successfully, how would he be able to face others in future?","Peng!","Ling Han didn’t care that his opponent was a Foundation Building Tier cultivator and immediately threw a punch at him. To say nothing of Foundation Building, even if a Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator came, he would still dare to beat them up.","After a few punches, Pang Shu became obedient, and obediently handed over a","box.","Ling Han opened it and took a look. There was more than half a box of fire essence inside.","“How unpresentable.” He shook his head, and placed the essence of flames he had gathered inside as well. It was just about enough to fill the box.","Everyone didn’t know how much Ling Han had gained from roaming around, and only thought that he had come to rob others. Naturally, all of them were envious and furious.","Ling Han swept an eye over them, and asked with a smile, “What is it? Want to gang up on me?”","?Go, go, kill him!” Pang Shu roared. He refused to believe that they would still be unable to capture Ling Han with so many people joining forces.","Everyone exchanged looks, and rushed forwards.","There were more than twenty people fighting against one, so how could they lose?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and suddenly activated the barrage of murderous aura. Instantly, everyone stiffened slightly. He then activated Lightning Fist, and his punches rained down. Peng, peng, peng, the figures were instantly sent flying like straws, falling all over the ground.","In front of him, it was impossible to bully him with numbers, unless the latter could very well withstand the barrage of his murderous aura.","Ling Han put away the box, and said calmly, “If you want to seek me out for revenge, just bring it on. Without obtaining the Fire Element Crystal, I will not leave.”","“Hehe, next time, you should find someone stronger!” The little loli made a face, then grabbed onto the corner of Ling Han’s shirt, and followed him to another mountain cave.","At the scene, there were wails of pain, but Ling Han did not use too much force. In a short while, everyone got back to their feet, baring their teeth. Only Pang Shu was still lying there. This guy had been heavily attacked by Ling Han. In any case, you are not going into the cave to fight monsters, so what was the use of having you maintain a good condition?","“Seventh Young Master Pang.” Everyone hurriedly went to help him up.","Pang Shu was picked up by the masses, his face a mess of blood and flesh. His face had been harshly stomped into the sand and rocks, so his face had naturally been scraped open.","His expression was livid. This time, not only had he been defeated by a mere Mystery Realm Tier cultivator, he had also been publicly humiliated, and robbed of the Pang Clan’s hard work for close to three years. How could he accept this?","Pang Yunfei was a prodigy of the Pang Clan, and also the future of the Pang Clan. Whether the Pang Clan could return to the heights that it had once been was dependent on him.","Thus, every member of the Pang Clan was willing to sacrifice themselves for Pang Yunfei. When this clan became stronger, they would be filled with confidence when they ventured out in future.","The Five Elements Karmic Pill was extremely important, and definitely couldn’t be lost.","“You guys continue to gather the essence of flames. I will find someone to come over, and will definitely suppress this brat!” he declared balefully, practically going mad with fury.","“All right.” Everyone could only nod, and hoped that the Pang Clan would not renege on their debt. After all, the flame essence that they had previously handed over had already been recorded. It was Pang Shu’s business if it was stolen.","Pang Shu left. This place suppressed his cultivation level, so merely cultivation level was useless. He had to find a prodigy that was invincible among his peers.","“If we’re considering the vicinity, the fourth son of the Zhang Clan, Zhang Qjhua, is a one-star genius. All right, I’ll find him!”","Ling Han believed that his speed would be much faster than the seven babies. Thus, he did not wait outside. Instead, he decided to sweep through another cave.","He cleared all the caves, and finally went to find the Flame King.","The destructive power surged, and the Flame King was also easily killed. This time, aside from the essence of flames, there was also a Fire Origin Stone!","“Haha, I’m rich!” Ling Han laughed loudly.","He returned, and when he exited the cave, he discovered that Eldest Baby, Second Baby, and Third Baby were already waiting outside. When he asked, they had not come out for very long. After a while, Fourth Baby, Fifth Baby, and Sixth Baby also came out one after another, not much time had passed in between each baby coming out.","Aside from Seventh Baby.","Seventh Baby was completely unaffected by any force. Theoretically speaking, she should be the strongest among the seven children, but taking into account her narcolepsy, that was a different story.","...The little girl must have fallen asleep in some corner of the cave.","Sigh, he had best not let her move out next time.","The babies also had good and bad luck. Only Second Baby and Fourth Baby each obtained a Fire Origin Stone, while the others only had the essence of fire.","Ling Han calculated carefully. They would only need to stay here for two months at most, and they should be able to gather a single Fire Element","Crystal.","His speed was so fast?","Didn’t he need as long as a hundred years?","Firstly, Ling Han and his group had eight, er, seven and a half of them. Seventh Baby was too unreliable, and secondly, the strength of the seven and a half of them was too strong. The babies were all born with Divine Physiques, and had grasped powerful special abilities, so they were unafraid of fire poison, and the moment Ling Han unleashed his destructive power, even the Flame King could only surrender in an instant.","This was the reason why they could be so efficient. Otherwise, if others fought for a while, they would have to cure the fire poison. Otherwise, they would be burnt to nothing. In truth, the majority of their time had been wasted on expelling the fire poison.","Ling Han was in a very good mood. At first, he had thought that he would have to stay here for one to two years, but by the looks of it now, perhaps two months would be enough. The efficiency had increased a whole tenfold, and added with Fire Origin Stones, when he returned to the Celestial Sea Planet, he could say with absolute certainty that he was already in Foundation Building","Tier.","He whistled as he fought the monsters one by one in the caves. After the flaming monsters in these caves were killed, it would take about five days for the heaven and earth to reform them, and it was much slower for the Flame King. At least, until now, no new ones had appeared.","Ten days, half a month, and it was as if the Flame King wouldn’t appear again.","On this day, Ling Han had just walked out of the cave, when he saw a young man sitting cross-legged on the ground in the valley. There was a sword laid across his legs, and there was the essence of flames shining around him, forming a circle.","Right at this moment, a flaming monster manifested out of thin air, not far from that youth. When it was completely formed by the heaven and earth, it immediately floated towards that youth, and began its attack.","Shua, sword light swept past, and that fire monster was immediately cut in half. The flames were instantly extinguished, leaving behind a little bit of bright fire essence.","Powerful!"]},{"number":3605,"title":"Chapter 3605: Who is more pretentious?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3605: Who is more pretentious?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Though the flaming monsters outside weren’t very strong, they were still Mystery Realm Tier-level beings, no matter what. Yet, they were killed by the young man with a single strike, which proved that this young man’s strength was truly extraordinary.","It was at this moment that the young man slowly stood up. He did not look like a sixteen or seventeen year old at all, and his speed was very slow. After he stood up, he even carefully tidied the corner of his robes, as if he would not allow the slightest bit of wrinkle.","“Show-off,” the little loli mumbled from the sidelines, “He likes to put on airs , but if he shows off too much, he’ll be easily struck by lightning.","Yet the young man opposite them acted as if he had not heard anything. After he had cleaned himself up completely, he turned to look at Ling Han, and asked, “Are you Ling Han?”","Ling Han also agreed with the little loli’s opinion. This youngster was too showy.","Wasn’t it?","If he didn’t show off, then why did he have to sit on the ground if he thought it was dirty? Since he was sitting on the ground, couldn’t he just get up and pat his behind casually?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Aside from someone as brilliant and mighty as me, is there a second person worthy of being called Ling Han?”","This was enough to show off.","The little girl rolled her eyes at him, and the sword-wielding young man’s eyes sharpened.","“My name is Zhang Qihua, and I have been entrusted to kill you.” The young man stroked the blade of his sword lightly, his eyes as bright as stars.","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’, and asked, “Pang Clan?”","“That’s right.” Zhang Qihua did not hide anything.","Ling Han shook his head, “Looks like you won’t be able to do business on this ticket.”","“Oh, you think you can escape from my pursuit?” Zhang Qihua showed a disdainful smile.","Who was he?","He was the 29th prodigy of the younger generation of Peaceful Splendor County, and he was also known as the beautiful title of the Flying Divine","Sword.","Ling Han shook his head, “No, no, no, how could someone as brilliant and mighty as me possibly be hunted down? In a battle of equal cultivation levels, I am invincible!”","Invincible!","Zhang Qihua was also startled, then laughed loudly. This was really too funny.","Someone actually dared to claim to be invincible?","The strongest person in the younger generation of Peaceful Splendor County was Ge Tong, but he did not dare to say that he was invincible among his peers, because the person ranked second and third was not inferior to him. It was just that their battle merits were slightly inferior, and that was why he had been pushed to the position of the strongest person in the younger generation.","And there was also his twenty-ninth place. He believed that he could be ranked in the top ten, but he had been too low-key, and that was why he had degraded to his present ranking.","“A person who hasn’t even stepped into Celestial Path actually dares to have such big talk!” he sneered, feeling that the Pang Clan was really useless. They couldn’t do anything against even a mere Mystery Realm Tier.","“I don’t like killing people. Hand over the essence of flames, and sever your own arm, and I’ll let you go,” Zhang Qihua continued.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “Seeing as you didn’t want to kill anyone, I’ll only break one of your arms.”","“Impudence!” Zhang Qihua finally couldn’t hold himself back. He was a Foundation Building elite, so how could he tolerate Ling Han’s attitude? He charged out, and with a wave of his sword, shua, Sword Qi soared into the heavens.","Ling Han had no choice but to admit that this young man was indeed an expert swordsman. In future, it was possible that he would become a master of swordsmanship, but in a battle of equal cultivation levels – in truth, he was still one major tier away, but that was fine. There were also very few that could match him.","He swung his fist, which was wrapped in golden energy. Xiu, xiu, xiu! The Lightning Fist was activated, and he instantly threw over a hundred punches.","“Petty tricks!” Zhang Qihua smirked coldly, wielding his sword as he charged out from the fist shadows that filled the skies.","Ling Han shook his head. The Lightning Fist’s grade was too low. Aside from being fast, it was full of weak points. When he encountered a Sword Dao elite like Zhang Qihua, his weak points were easily grasped, and he directly broke through his offensive.","He immediately channeled out the Eighteen Claws of the Golden Eagle. It was as if his whole person had turned into a golden divine bird that pounced towards Zhang Qihua.","“En?” Zhang Qihua was shocked. He had not thought that Ling Han’s offensive would become so fierce in an instant.","This was practically a completely different person.","Ling Han’s every move was swift and fierce. Though this young man was very extraordinary, and was very possibly a one-star genius, and had already stepped onto the Celestial Path, even if he was suppressed to the Mystery Realm Tier, he would definitely have some advantage, but in front of Ling Han, this was still not enough.","And this was still because Ling Han had not used any destructive energy. Otherwise, he could possibly end the battle in a few seconds.","However, Ling Han felt that this destructive energy was extremely important, and he didn’t want more people to know about it. Thus, unless he intended to kill, he wouldn’t use it.","This also caused the battle to become drawn out. Both sides exchanged blows, both of them attacking with all their might.","Zhang Qihua looked stunned. Though this guy opposite him was even more arrogant than he was, he was really very powerful. His battle prowess was astonishingly strong. He had to admit that Ling Han was indeed more proactive in this battle, and had a slight upper hand.","However, he was only a Mystery Realm Tier. Being strong in Mystery Realm Tier did not mean that it would be the same after he had advanced into Celestial Path. That was because the foundations of the Celestial Path that he had built were too important. How many prodigies had managed to leap over the Celestial Gate yet become mediocre?","Furthermore, he had not used his ultimate move. After all, he was an elite of Celestial Path, and had grasped a celestial technique.","“The falling flower has its will, and the flowing water is merciless!” His sword’s momentum changed, and he channelled out a sword technique that had a completely different style.","An illusion appeared before Ling Han’s eyes. Countless petals fell from the skies, filled with an air of grief and resentment, infecting him and making him want nothing more than to break out into tears.","But it was at this moment that a flash of sword light assailed. Like merciless flowing water, it shattered the petals that filled the sky.","Emotional influence?","Ling Han was surprised. This Zhang Qihua was really quite powerful. At least, that Pang Shu from before was not able to do such a thing.","Er, Pang Shu had been defeated by him right from the start, and did not have the chance to fight back at all, so this could not be confirmed.","However, would he be weaker than this?","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face as he unleashed his murderous aura.","“Wu!” Zhang Qihua instantly groaned in pain. This attack from Ling Han was like a sharp blade that had pierced into his mind, causing him to involuntarily scream in pain.","In this moment of distraction, the Intent Realm that he had created was instantly destroyed. The falling petals disappeared, and the flowing water ran off to who knew where.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and leaped out, attacking aggressively.","Zhang Qihua roared in fury. With a wave of his sword, he once again unleashed a powerful attack, but this time, he did not even manage to create the Intent Realm before it was directly destroyed by Ling Han’s murderous aura attack.","p***i","He felt extremely aggrieved. Only a prodigy like him could create Intent Realms and influence others, but when he encountered a boor like Ling Han, he didn’t reason with him at all, he simply released barbaric spiritual attack after spiritual attack, making him unable to unleash his powerful strength in the slightest.","If Ling Han had defeated him with earth-shattering power, he would have nothing to say. More importantly, stabbing him from time to time like this made him feel sullen.","He had never been beaten so painfully before.","“Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!” he shouted loudly. With his mental state in chaos, his sword technique was naturally in chaos as well, and he was falling further and further into a disadvantage.","Ling Han attacked aggressively. Even if he didn’t use Destruction Energy, he was strong enough to suppress a prodigy like Zhang Qihua.","After several dozen moves, Zhang Qihua was completely unable to fight back.."]},{"number":3606,"title":"Chapter 3606: Prodigy of the Lei Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3606: Prodigy of the Lei Clan","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor. Henyee Translations","Zhang Qihua retreated rapidly, escaping the battle area, and withdrew his sword as he said, “I am no match for you.”","When he said these words, his expression was completely dark.","However, as a prodigy, if he didn’t even dare to admit the gap between them, then he wouldn’t be qualified to take another step forward.","However, Zhang Qihua was still filled with confidence. It was only because his cultivation level had been suppressed, and if he battled again in the Foundation Building Tier, he would definitely not be inferior, because his battle prowess was ranked in the 29th place of the younger generation. In fact, his battle prowess was even slightly higher than that rank.","Jumping over the Celestial Gate could possibly turn prodigies into mediocre people, and would also make mediocre people become even more mediocre.","Ling Han nodded. This young man’s abilities were really not weak.","Furthermore, he could be considered frank and upright, which dissipated some of his animosity.","Pa!","Zhang Qihua stretched out his right hand, which turned into a palm blade that slashed onto his left arm, emitting a crisp sound. That left arm instantly drooped down; apparently, even the bones had been broken.","Cold sweat trickled down his forehead, and he said, “The next time we meet, I hope that you have already advanced into Celestial Path and we can have a good spar.”","Ling Han was surprised. He had actually planned to let him go, but Zhang Qihua really had his own personality, and directly broke his own left arm.","This kind of person was worth making friends with.","He nodded, and said with a smile, “All right. Next time, let’s spar a bit. Here-”","Ling Han threw out a bottle of alchemical pills.","Zhang Qihua took it, and looked at Ling Han in surprise.","“Injury medicine,” Ling Han said.","Zhang Qihua nodded, and revealed a smile. He directly poured out a pill and swallowed it, showing his strong trust in Ling Han.","“Pretty boy, take care that there is poison,” the little loli said. She was the type to wish for the whole world to be in chaos.","Zhang Qihua ignored her completely, and only nodded at Ling Han, “We’ll meet again.” He leaped out of the valley.","just as they were about to leave the valley, he said a few more words, which slowly drifted towards them.","“Be careful of the Pang Clan. They will definitely ask others for help.”","Ling Han smiled. This Zhang Qihua was really quite interesting.","“Little girl, will you feel uncomfortable if you don’t speak?” He looked towards the little loli.","“That’s right.” The little loli licked the toffee very quickly, “Unfortunately, that guy did not fall for it.”","“Let’s go!” Ling Han pulled the little loli into another mountain cave.","Ling Han fought monsters every day. Every morning, he would still cultivate under the morning sun, while he held the Fire Origin Stone in his hand. The power of heaven and earth surged towards him, boosting his cultivation level rapidly.","After so many days, his cultivation level had also improved rapidly, and he had opened another eighteen apertures.","Theoretically, he could already attempt to break through to the Mystery Realm","Tier.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t do that. He still yearned to open the Hidden Apertures. Thus, his path to the Enlightenment Tier was still incredibly long.","He collected more and more fire essence. It was said that when the amount of fire essence reached a certain extent, there was no need for him to do anything at all, as it would naturally condense into a Fire Element Crystal.","“It should be about time. At most, it would take another dozen over days.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. These few days, he had been battling with the flaming monsters. Though he was not afraid of battle, if he kept fighting with the same opponent, he would also get bored.","They were about to leave this place.","They had been battling for so many days, and there were times when Ling Han didn’t pursue efficiency. When he fought with the Flame King, he didn’t use any destructive power. Instead, he fought head-on and went all out against the Flame King, deliberately suffering some fire poison to temper himself.","In this way, even if he broke through immediately, there would be no shortcoming of unstable foundations.","In this place, Ling Han had already become a publicly acknowledged overlord. Everyone would avoid him.","The efficiency of him and the seven babies in killing monsters was too high. Even with how big this valley was, the number of fire monsters was still a little insufficient, often making it so that there were no monsters to kill.","But what could be done? Who would dare compete with Ling Han and the others over the kills?","This caused complaints to arise from the masses. How were they supposed to continue to make a living?","Right at this moment, the Pang Clan finally moved again.","When Ling Han walked out of the cave, he saw a young man standing in the valley. He looked to be in his mid-twenties. He was dressed in black, and his black hair was like ink, exuding a soft divine light.","“Ling Han?” The young man looked towards Ling Han. His eyes were like divine light, causing one’s skin to crack.","This was another elite.","Ling Han looked back, and asked, “And who are you?”","The young man in black strode over. Boom! His entire body surged with vitality, and it was as if he were a terrifying beast.","“You are not worthy of asking my name. I have come to kill you!”","p***","Ling Han’s expression immediately darkened. ‘You’re seeking death.","“As expected of Lei Jiujun, domineering!","“Of course! He’s a prodigy of the Lei Clan! He’s ranked 19th among the younger generation of Peaceful Splendor County!”","“If Young Master Lei makes a move, it would definitely be a sure bet this time.’ “We can finally eliminate this bringer of calamity. Otherwise, we’ll have to fight fire monsters here for decades. Just the thought of it makes me want to throw up.”","This time, there were a great many spectators. After so many days, they were already filled with anger, all wanting to see Ling Han being killed. At the very least, they wanted Ling Han to be chased off.","Lei Jiujun strode over. He couldn’t unleash the strength of a Foundation Building Tier cultivator, but he had also cultivated to an extremely powerful level in the mortal levels. His vitality surged like smoke, and he was like a cauldron that could incinerate everything.","“Do you have any last words?” he asked calmly.","“Handsome Brother, do you want to eat toffee?” The little loli approached. This Lei Jiujun looked quite good, which made her drool.","“Stand aside.” Ling Han picked up the little loli, and sent her to the side with a gentle force. Then, he looked towards Lei Jiujun, “I only have two words for you, heh.”","“Ignorance.” Lei Jiujun leaped out. Boom, he had cultivated a secret technique, and as he leaped out, lightning flickered behind him. All of a sudden, he had pushed his speed to the pinnacle, as if he was a bolt of lightning.","Ling Han humphed, and with a wave of his right hand, xiu, the Heavenly Pattern Jade had already shot out. With the activation of his Spiritual Power, its speed instantly soared to fourteen times the speed of sound.","Lei Jiujun’s speed was extremely fast to begin with, so he naturally couldn’t dodge the Heavenly Pattern Jade that was 14 times the speed of sound. However, he didn’t care. So what if it was a hidden weapon? He could send it flying with a single punch.","Sure enough, he waved his hand and swatted at the Heavenly Pattern Jade.","Peng!","His hand clapped onto the Heavenly Pattern Jade, and his expression changed drastically.","What terrifying destructive power. Such a small thing was actually so heavy, and added with fourteen times the speed of sound, with his present cultivation level of Mystery Realm Tier, how could he block it?","Instantly, blood spurted out, and his right hand was directly destroyed. However, even so, the Heavenly Pattern Jade’s course wasn’t blocked, heavily smashing into his lower abdomen.","“Oh!” Lei Jiujun stumbled backwards. His whole face turned pale at first, then turned dark purple in colour.","He knelt on the ground, his hands gripping onto his lower abdomen, as cold sweat rolled down his face.","At first, the people nearby were still cheering for him, but when they saw this scene, they all stopped abruptly.","How was this possible?","That was the prodigy of the Lei Clan! How had he been defeated with a single strike?"]},{"number":3607,"title":"Chapter 3607: Killed directly","paragraphs":["Chapter 3607: Killed directly","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lei Jiujun, a prodigy of the Lei Clan, could also be ranked in the top twenty among the younger generation of Peaceful Splendor County.","This kind of prodigy had actually been defeated with a single move.","How was this possible?","Who could accept this?","Ling Han strode over. This Lei Jiujun was already impressive enough. He had taken the Heavenly Pattern Jade head-on, yet he had not died from a single strike. Furthermore, this was also because Lei Jiujun had been too careless. Otherwise, he would not have been in such a miserable state.","“Ling Han, you’re too ruthless! You even broke Handsome Brother’s hand! I don’t want a cripple!” the little girl shouted from the sidelines.","Ling Han ignored her, his eyes fixed on Lei Jiujun. His killing intent had already locked onto the latter.","Lei Jiujun wasn’t Zhang Qihua; Zhang Qihua didn’t want to take his life from the very beginning. Moreover, this person was forthright and frank, so Ling Han naturally didn’t have any killing intent. In fact, he didn’t even plan to break Zhang Qihua’s arm in the first place.","But Lei Jiujun was different. Whoever wanted to kill him, he would kill. It was only right and proper.","Sensing Ling Han’s chilling killing intent, Lei Jiujun couldn’t help but shudder. At first, he was still screaming in pain, but now, he suddenly stopped, and looked towards Ling Han.","“You’re so ruthless!” he said through gritted teeth, filled with resentment.","One arm was crippled, and it was his right arm at that, which was enough to cripple one third of his battle prowess.","Though the Lei Clan was extraordinary, it was also impossible for them to obtain Saintly medicine, which meant that he would always be a cripple in future.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “It’s all right. There is no need to worry that you will become a cripple in future, because you will soon lose your life.”","“You actually want to kill me?” Lei Jiujun’s expression was filled with shock.","Peng!","Ling Han shot out a punch, and directly blasted Lei Jiujun into smithereens.","He knew that Lei Jiujun would definitely say some threatening words, such as how he was the Young Master of some clan, or the Dao Child of some sect, or having a powerful cousin, or something along those lines.","But did he care?","After refining the Five Elements Karmic Pill, he would return to the Celestial Sea Planet. You guys can just slowly look for him.","“Y-you’re in big trouble!” someone said in a trembling voice.","“He’s the young master of the Lei Clan, and he’s also the most highly anticipated clansman of the Lei Clan. Having killed him, the Lei Clan will turn the sky upside down!”","“It should be known that the strength of the Lei Clan is not the slightest bit inferior to the Pang Clan. Now that Lei Jiujun has died because of the Pang Clan, the Pang Clan would probably go crazy as well.”","“He’s dead, he’s definitely dead.”","“Will we be implicated?”","Everyone was extremely pessimistic. They could only watch helplessly as Lei Jiujun was killed. If the Lei Clan took their anger out on them, all of them would definitely be out of luck.","Ling Han picked up the Heavenly Pattern Jade. He naturally wouldn’t be explaining anything to these people.","He continued to kill monsters, and after about nine days, the seven babies gathered once more, putting the essence of flames together. Strangely, these bright and flickering things fused together by themselves, as if they had a life of their own.","In an instant, a crimson red bead appeared in the box. There seemed to be a flame flickering inside.","Ling Han stretched out a hand to touch it. Hiss, it was so hot.","He closed the box. It was made of jade, so there was no need to worry that the box would be burnt.","All right, the trip to the Extreme Flame Valley had been successfully completed, so it was time to go to the next place.","Ling Han took out the map that Li Xingchen had given him, and soon confirmed his next destination.","Cold Water Lake.","This was the closest stop to the Extreme Flame Valley, so Ling Han naturally arranged for it to be his next stop.","However, before the nine of them had even set out, a group of people had already walked in.","“One, two, nine, five, six...” Second Baby began to count.","Ling Han’s mouth twitched slightly. Though Second Baby had the best eyesight, he could not have any expectations when it came to counting. He took a look for himself. There were a total of seventeen people in the other party’s party, and every single one of them was exuding the confidence that was unique to elites.","At the very least, they had to be elites that had advanced into Celestial Path.","“Ling Han, how dare you, you actually dare to kill the prized son of the Lei Clan!” A middle-aged man shouted at Ling Han, obviously looking down on him.","This was natural, because he was a Foundation Building elite. Against a mere Mystery Realm Tier, how could he be reserved?","Ling Han’s eyes sharpened, “Since you know of this Demon King’s great reputation, why have you come to seek death?”","“Ling Han, don’t steal my nickname!” The little loli was displeased, and immediately protested.","“I’ll borrow it for a while, and return it to you later.” Ling Han turned his head, yet smiled.","“That’s more like it.” The little loli stopped playing around and continued to lick the candy.","Those seventeen people all exploded in fury. These two people were really too arrogant, to actually dare to ignore elites like them.","“No need for nonsense, just apprehend him,” someone said impatiently. Wasn’t it a joke to waste time on a Mystery Realm Tier cultivator?","“That’s good too. Capture him, and execute him with a thousand cuts, as a tribute for Jiujun,” someone beside him nodded.","Ling Han humphed and said, “Do you guys think you can defeat me?”","“Nothing but a mere Mystery Realm Tier!”","These 17 people were the coalition troops of the Lei Clan and Pang Clan. They knew that no one could match Ling Han in a one-on-one battle. Even Lei Jiujun had been killed, so they joined forces to charge in.","...Originally, they had been waiting outside. After all, if they entered the valley, their cultivation level would be suppressed, so it was not as safe as if they were outside. However, Ling Han had not come out even after a long time, and upon further thought, he was also collecting fire essence, so no matter what, he would have to stay inside for a good number of years.","This was too long, and they could not afford to wait.","Oh, the prodigy of the Lei Clan had been killed, and they actually had to wait for a good number of years before they could get their revenge. Wasn’t this going to be a huge joke?","Thus, even if they had to sacrifice a few people, they were determined to enter the valley and capture Ling Han.","This time, the Pang Clan was also implicated. It could not be helped. They could not escape the responsibility of Lei Jiujun’s death, so it was naturally impossible for them to stay out of this matter.","However, 17 Foundation Building elites, even if their cultivation level was suppressed, should be enough to suppress a mere Mystery Realm Tier.","A baleful killing intent appeared on Ling Han’s face, and he said, “Since you people are so determined to seek death, I’ll oblige you!”","“Charge!” Seventeen people charged over at the same time.","Ling Han stepped forwards, and directly channelled the destructive energy, throwing out a heavy punch.","Peng!","Someone had just approached, wanting to impede him and allow the others to take advantage of the opening to make a move, but under the attack of destructive energy, that person was immediately blasted into smithereens.","This was utterly terrifying.","In a single exchange, the seventeen people had become sixteen people.","F***, when the elites from the Pang Clan and Lei Clan saw this, they all looked shocked. They knew that Ling Han was very strong. Otherwise, he could not have possibly killed Lei Jiujun, and defeated Zhang Qihua.","However, being able to kill a Foundation Building Tier cultivator with a single punch still caused them to go numb with shock.","Didn’t that mean that Ling Han only had to throw another sixteen punches, and they would all be done for?","Since Ling Han had already started killing, why would he hold back?","With the use of Destruction Energy, he had the intention to kill everyone to keep the secret.","‘Die!’","Peng! Peng! Peng!","His figure turned, and destructive energy surged. Even if his opponent was prepared, and similarly greeted him with high-level energy, the stronger one would still have one of his arms destroyed, and those with weaker abilities would still be unable to escape death.","In just a few moves, the number of seventeen people had already decreased sharply to nine.","This scared everyone out of their wits, so how could they still bother to kill the enemy? They hurriedly turned around and fled.."]},{"number":3608,"title":"Chapter 3608: Hit again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3608: Hit again","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","As long as they could escape from the valley, then after recovering their original abilities, wouldn’t suppressing a Mystery Realm Tier be a piece of cake?","However, when they turned around, they discovered that their path of retreat had actually been blocked by six toddlers.","Eldest Baby: “I was the one who opened this path.”","Second Baby: “I planted this tree.”","Fourth Baby: “If you want to pass this path.”","Fifth Baby: “Leave your life here.”","Third Baby had a proud expression as she said, “Childish.”","Those Foundation Building elites were about to go crazy. Now, they had actually fallen to the extent that even toddlers dared to bully them?","“You’re seeking death!” They naturally had nothing to fear, and directly charged over.","Then, it was a tragedy for them.","Which of the babies was to be trifled with?","Peng, Eldest Baby grabbed the legs of two of them and threw them back, while Second Baby saw through one of their weak points and sent one of them flying with a light punch. Hu, Fourth Baby spat fire, and Fifth Baby spat water, which similarly made it impossible for others to take another step further.","The first wave of attack from the nine of them was declared unsuccessful, and not one of them actually managed to successfully break out of the siege.","Monsters, these people were all monsters.","The members of the Pang Clan and Lei Clan were about to cry. What was wrong with them? Why did they insist on charging into the valley?","In this place, their cultivation level had been suppressed, so they could not use their powerful abilities to their fullest.","However, what time did they have to feel rueful? That was because the God of Death had already arrived.","Ling Han caught up to them, and the destructive energy surged out. The efficiency of this massacre was too frightening. He could still sweep aside all opponents of the same cultivation level, and even those at a cultivation level higher than him.","After another round of slaughter, the nine people became five.","“I surrender, don’t kill me!” Immediately, someone cowered.","He had no choice but to cower. Otherwise, he would be seeking death.","“You have no backbone, die!” Ling Han showed no mercy, and killed that person with a single punch.","“I’m not surrendering!” The remaining three people decided to do the exact opposite.","“All right, then let’s battle!” Ling Han did not stop attacking.","F***, you can’t play like this.","The three of them wanted to cry but had no tears. They had already surrendered, so why did you still not stop?","Peng!","After a few punches, the remaining three people were all killed.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t waste it. He searched everyone, and in the end, he gained very little.","What Foundation Building elites were these, so poor?","Oh, that was true. This was the Moonlight Planet, and the environment for cultivation was mature. Though Foundation Building Tier cultivators had advanced into Celestial Path, that was all. There were many people stronger than them, so it was naturally impossible that they would possess any kind of treasure.","Forget it, he had best quickly concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill.","Ling Han and his group exited the valley. At this time, there were naturally no members of the Pang and Lei Clans outside. They had all gone in to capture him.","The little loli took out the shuttle, and they boarded it. Xiu, the shuttle tore through the air.","“You didn’t hit someone again, did you?” Ling Han couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat when he saw Tang Yun’er boost the shuttle to at least 20 times the speed of sound. Under such high speeds, even his vision was slightly unable to capture the changes in the environment, and it would be very easy for them to crash into someone.","“It’s fine. Both of my grandpas have strengthened this shuttle respectively, so it won’t be damaged,” the little loli said?.","Ling Han’s expression was dark. Was he worried about the shuttle? He was afraid that you would run someone over and kill them!","However, if the shuttle couldn’t be damaged, he would at least be able to breathe a sigh of relief. At least, he wouldn’t be killed by the little loli.","Hold on, when had he also been led astray by the little loli?","Wasn’t it too immoral to think that way?","Ling Han weakly reflected on himself.","If they travelled on foot, they would need around three days to reach their destination, but if they travelled on the shuttle, that would only take about half a day’s time. The Cold Water Lake was already close.","“Oh no, it’s too fast, we can’t stop in time!” the little loli suddenly said.","You are really too f****** unreliable.","“Prepare to land forcefully,” the little loli called out. Though she was very anxious, there was not the slightest bit of panic in her voice. Instead, she was filled with excitement.","—You f****** did it on purpose, didn’t you?","Boom!","Without waiting for Ling Han to speak, the shuttle had already landed. It crashed down heavily, and with the powerful force pushing it forwards, it continued to slide forwards. After a whole ten seconds, the shuttle finally stopped.","“Haha, it landed perfectly!” the little loli said excitedly.","You damn child, just see if I won’t beat you to death!","Ling Han gritted his teeth. What kind of problematic child was this?","Peng, right at this moment, a hand suddenly slapped the window of the shuttle, and then a dark face appeared.","Yi, this scene seemed very familiar.","Ling Han thought. When they had first arrived on the Moonlight Planet, the little loli had also steered the shuttle and crashed into the ground. In the end, she had even crashed into someone. Thankfully, Li Xingchen was a Foundation Building Tier. Otherwise, he would definitely have died from such a collision. And now, they must have crashed into someone again!","Ling Han looked at the face outside the window that was almost burning with fury, and muttered internally. Though his face was completely dark, whether it was his expression or movements, why did he look so familiar?","They wouldn’t have crashed into the same person, right?","Ling Han immediately shook his head. How was this possible? This was far too coincidental.","He did not dare to be careless. As he had the little loli stow away the shuttle, he prepared for battle. Who knew if the other person would be easy to deal with.","It was true that they were in the wrong, but it did not mean that they would be beaten.","The little loli directly equipped the shuttle on herself, and prepared for battle. She was a great demon king, so what was a person she had ran over worth in her eyes?","“As expected... it’s you guys again!” the black figure on the other side said through gritted teeth.","Ah?","A muscle twitched in Ling Han’s cheek, “Brother Li?”","What a coincidence. This unfortunate guy that had been hit was still Li Xingchen.","Strange, I didn’t use the shard of the tombstone to smash your head, so why are you so unlucky?","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh, and said, “Brother Li, if I said that we didn’t deliberately crash into you, would you believe me?”","Li Xingchen bit his lip, and asked, “Do you think I should believe you?”","“You should,” Ling Han said righteously. “Brother Li, we didn’t put any tracking devices on you, so how could we have deliberately crashed into you? Thus, all of this is a coincidence.”","Li Xingchen sighed, “I keep thinking that you are a jinx. As expected, I have deliberately hidden myself in such a remote place. I had not thought that I would still be unable to avoid you!”","“Gegege!” The little girl clutched her stomach in laughter.","“Brother Li, there’s a One Star Tool here. I’ll give it to you as compensation.” Ling Han retrieved a sword and handed it over. He had obtained this sword after killing Lei Jiujun. Because he had been insta-killed, Lei Jiujun didn’t even have the chance to draw his Spirit Tool.","It could not be helped. He had almost killed the other twice, and Ling Han also felt very guilty. He really felt apologetic.","Li Xingchen couldn’t help but feel pleasantly surprised. Although a One Star Spirit Tool was nothing in a large force, for lone cultivators, especially Foundation Building lone cultivators, a One Star Spirit Tool was incredibly valuable.","More coincidentally, he also used a sword.","Thus, he was unable to resist this gift, and could only shamelessly stretch out his hand to receive it. He sighed, “In future, even if you guys crash into me again, I will accept it.”","“How could that be!” Ling Han hurriedly said with a smile. However, he was a little suspicious. With this guy’s bad luck, it was really possible that he would be crashed into again.","Li Xingchen’s temper had also subsided. They sat down to drink some wine and eat some food. As it turned out, Li Xingchen had come here in the morning because he had discovered a place of seclusion nearby. It had once belonged to an ultimate dao elite that had built the foundation of ultimate dao, and now that elite had long since died, it was possible that he had left behind a treasure.","He had been invited to join forces with another to enter this place."]},{"number":3609,"title":"Chapter 3609: Cold Water Lake","paragraphs":["Chapter 3609: Cold Water Lake","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han naturally could not possibly go to that place with Li Xingchen. He had not even entered into Mystery Realm Tier yet, so what was the point of joining in on the excitement?","Moreover, the Heavenly Dao Foundation elites weren’t worthy of his attention. If he wanted to make a trip on the way, he wouldn’t mind, but it definitely wouldn’t be at the price of delaying his time to obtain the Five Elements Karmic Pill.","After eating, Ling Han bid farewell to Li Xingchen. The latter now had a One Star Spirit Tool, so he was much more confident.","Ling Han took a look. He was less than 50km away from the Cold Water Lake.","Bringing the children with him, it wasn’t long before they arrived at their destination.","Rather than calling the Cold Water Lake a lake, it would be better to call it a sea.","This lake was extraordinarily huge, and the edge could not be seen at all. It was said that the widest place was about 2500km, and the narrowest place was also more than 1000km.","The entire lake area was suppressed by heaven and earth. Even if elites of Celestial Path came, they would also be suppressed to Mystery Realm Tier.","Sometimes, when Celestial Path elites weren’t paying attention, they would fly over the lake on their divine tools. If they weren’t high enough, they would also be affected by the heaven and earth, falling down from the sky for no reason.","This was the same as the Extreme Flame Valley. With the condensation of the power of heaven and earth, the Water Element would form unique creatures that would wander in the lake. Destroying it would allow one to obtain the essence of water, and if one gathered enough essence of water, they would be able to gather it to form the Water Element Crystal.","“I hate this place,” Fourth Baby immediately said.","She naturally had grasped the Mystical Power of Fire, and also especially disliked cold and humid environments, what more when this was an ocean.","“Hehe, I like this place.” Fifth Baby revealed a satisfied expression.","“All right, let’s move separately. This time... we’ll meet back here a month later,” Ling Han said.","“Yes, Father.” The seven children all nodded.","“Ling Han, you’re enslaving child workers like this, aren’t you afraid of a sore conscience?” the little loll said in rebuke as she licked the toffee.","Ling Han picked her up and said, “If you don’t speak, no one will think you’re mute.”","“Sigh, I told the truth, and was targeted.” The little loll shrugged and spread her hands, looking very helpless.","Ling Han and the others split up, and it was still Ling Han and the little loli who were in the same group. He had to keep an eye on this problematic child; she was too good at causing trouble.","The two of them entered into the lake, but it was obvious that this place was more troublesome than the Extreme Flame Valley. That was because there was a three-dimensional space in the water, which was far larger than the Extreme Flame Valley. The distribution of the Water Element was also more dispersed, so it was very difficult to find it.","Moreover, they hadn’t reached the Foundation Building Tier yet, so they couldn’t open their mouths to absorb the power of heaven and earth. Thus, they had to rely on air.","Which also meant that they could only hold their breaths and enter into the lake. When this breath was used up, he would have to breathe again. Otherwise, he would be suffocated to death.","Thankfully, with his present strength, it was not a problem for him to hold his breath for an hour or so.","“Girl, are you going into the gourd or are you going to hold your breath and come with me?” Ling Han asked.","“Of course, we’ll go into the sea together. If I stay in the gourd, I’ll die of boredom,” the little loli said without hesitation.","“All right then.”","The two of them took a deep breath, then entered into the lake. Suddenly, a strange chill assaulted them, causing their blood to instantly freeze.","So cold!","The little loli hurriedly crossed her arms over her chest, shivering incessantly.","Ling Han communicated with the flame energy and burned it on the surface of his body, instantly expelling the coldness, but in this way, there would be an additional expenditure on his Spiritual Power.","The little girl also activated the power of flames, expelling the coldness.","“What a godforsaken place.” She bared her teeth, “I hate this place.”","“Gourd?” Ling Han pointed at the Essence Nurturing Gourd.","“No.” The little girl still shook her head.","The two of them dived into the lake. There was not a single Water Element creature that could be seen on the surface of the water, so they had to dive in.","This lake was too big, so it was naturally abnormally deep. Ling Han activated his eye technique and could see about three hundred meters underwater. If it was any deeper, it would be too dark, and he wouldn’t be able to see anything at all.","The lake water was extraordinarily cold, and there were also a great many icebergs in the lake. It was said that some icebergs were as big as small islands, and there would also be Water Element creatures on them.","After the two of them swam for a while, a fish appeared ahead of them. It was about three meters long, but its body was very flat, and the widest part was only about a foot, looking like a very long sash.","It was brightly colored, and when it discovered Ling Han and the little loli, it immediately launched an attack. It opened its mouth, and xiu, an ice arrow shot out, rapidly shooting towards Ling Han.","“You think you’re the only one who knows how to shoot?” Ling Han mumbled inwardly. He resolutely opened his mouth and shot out a golden sword.","This was formed after he advanced into Seven Inscriptions, and was formed from the power of Metal, possessing extremely terrifying destructive power.","Shua, the sword slashed out, greeting the ice arrow. Instantly, the ice arrow was shattered, and its momentum did not decrease in the slightest, as it once again charged towards the multicoloured fish.","With a single strike, this long fish was killed by him, its body rapidly melting. It was originally formed from ice crystals, and now, it had turned back into water.","However, there was still a small drop of water that had not melted.","It was very strange. That was clearly a drop of water, but it had not fused with the lake waters.","Essence of Water.","Ling Han reached over and grabbed the drop of water.","It was very small, a hundred times smaller than a grain of rice. If it was not for the fact that Ling Han had extremely good eyesight, he would probably have missed it.","“The first,” Ling Han said with a smile. Of course, he only released a few bubbles of water.","He continued to swim in the lake waters, searching for new water element creatures.","This lake was really too big, and it seriously affected Ling Han’s speed in the water. Thus, after about ten minutes, he finally encountered a second water element creature. This was a massive ice turtle.","The ice turtle was 30 meters long, and its body was massive. There were also mysterious seals on its body, and it was extremely powerful. Ling Han had to expend some effort to kill it.","However, the water essence he obtained from it was also pitifully little, not much more than the colorful long fish from before.","Ling Han was depressed. He had spent several times the time to kill this ice turtle, but the gains he had obtained actually did not correspondingly increase. This was too unfair, wasn’t it?","After an hour, Ling Han finally used up all the air in the breath he was holding. He did not float back up, but rather entered into the Essence Nurturing Gourd.","In this place, he could breathe freely. Though the Essence Nurturing Gourd would not replenish his air supply, with how big the space in the gourd was, it was completely enough for him to enter and breathe in quite a number of times.","Most importantly, fighting monsters here required the continuous channelling of flame energy. This consumed a lot of Spiritual Power. Thus, after staying underwater for three days, Ling Han had no choice but to surface. He had to recover his spiritual power.","Coincidentally, a massive ice floe had appeared ahead of them.","Just how big was this block of ice?","It could more or less be called an island, with a diameter of six hundred meters. The part that surfaced from the water was actually flat.","No, this was not naturally formed, but had rather been forcefully flattened.","There were two people standing opposite each other on this icy mountain. Their robes fluttered in the wind, and both of them exuded an air of elegance and otherworldliness.","Looking at their gazes, his fighting spirit blazed like fire.","Were they fighting here?"]},{"number":3610,"title":"Chapter 3610: You are not worthy of watching the battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3610: You are not worthy of watching the battle","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In the Cold Water Lake, on top of this ice island, two elites were fighting? These two people were both very young. One was dressed in green robes, while the other was dressed in purple robes. Both of them were very young, but standing there, they had an intimidating bearing.","“Qian Senlai, you were no match for me when you were a Human Dao Foundation, you were no match for me when you were a Heavenly Dao Foundation, and now that er’ve returned to the mortal level, you’re still no match for me,” the young man in green said proudly.","There was a sword in his hand, and it shone with brilliant light, exuding a fierce and cold aura.","The purple-robed young man who had been referred to as Qian Senlai snorted, “Luo Xi, is the reason why my ranking is lower than yours because my battle prowess is lower than yours? It is just that you are very lucky, and that is why you are ranked one place higher than me every time.”","The young man in green, Luo Xi, shook his head, “Keep being stubborn, and see how I will teach you how to behave!”","-Do you think I’m afraid of you?” Qian Senlai was completely unafraid. “However, before that, we have to chase off a fly!” Luo Xi looked towards Ling Han. Previously, neither of them had cast a second look at Ling Han, but that did not mean that they had not discovered Ling Han.","—Tang Yun’er had already entered into the gourd. Though her Spiritual Power far surpassed her peers, it was obviously incomparable to Ling Han. She had long since been unable to hold on.","Meanwhile, Qian Senlai had already strode over to Ling Han. He held a black saber in his hand, which was covered with veined patterns, exuding a monstrous might, “Get lost. You are not qualified to observe our battle!” initially, Ling Han had only planned to leave after he landed on the ice island and recovered his Spiritual Power In any case, there were no Water Element creatures here, but the prerequisite was that he had willingly left.","You want to chase me away?","What right did he have!","“Was this island of ice built by your family?” Ling Han asked.","Qian Senlai faltered for a moment. Of course, that was impossible. This was naturally formed, but don’t you know who I, Qian Senlai, am? To actually dare to speak insolently to me?","“Even if it was built by your family, does this Cold Water Lake belong to your family? Building illegal structures in a public place, you should be fined!” Ling Han blurted out.","Qian Senlai was a little dumbfounded. What was going on here?","-Hahahaha!” Meanwhile, Luo Xi laughed loudly. Because of his ranking, he and Qian Senlai had already been enemies for a very long time. Now that he saw this old rival being duped into a daze, he was greatly pleased.","Qian Senlai’s expression darkened, and he said, “Are you determined to suffer a little?”","He strode over, dragging the blade of his saber on the ice island. Crackle!","Sparks flew into the air.","In truth, this Island of Ice was incredibly sturdy, and was completely capable of sustaining normal Mystery Realm Tiers battling on it. Yet now, the two of them had actually sliced off the top, so their strength was indeed terrifying.","This naturally was because they had used high-level energy. Otherwise, in terms of pure brute force, Mystery Realm Tiers were really not qualified to cause damage to this kind of ice mountain.","Ling Han crossed his arms over his chest, and knew, “What is it? Want to fight?”","“Are you even qualified?” Qian Senlai said with a cold chuckle. He was the ninth-ranked prodigy of the younger generation of Peaceful Splendor County. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, there were at most five prodigies who were more powerful than him, or even fewer.","—This kind of ranking naturally would not be strictly calculated based on battle prowess in a battle of equal cultivation levels, so he was sure that his true battle prowess was definitely not just ranked ninth.","Even if he was only ranked ninth, that was not something that this unfamiliar young man in front of him could compare to. The gap was too wide.","Ling Han stretched his neck and arms and legs, and broke into a grin, ”1 just happen to be a little bored in the water, so I’ll use you to relieve my boredom.” Qian Senlai raised his thick brows. Did this guy really want to die? He actually dared to provoke him like this?","That’s right, this person did not know who he was at all. No wonder he was bursting with confidence.","Hehe, then let him see what a top-grade prodigy was.","“Get down!” He moved, and stretched out his left hand. Boom, a frightening power surged out, pressing down on Ling Han.","Ling Han casually sent out a palm strike. Peng, Qian Senlai’s attack was dispersed.","“Yi?” “En?”","Qian Senlai and Luo Xi were both stunned. This scene had exceeded their expectations.","Even if Qian Senlai hadn’t used his full strength, Ling Han’s strength was already not to be underestimated.","“If you could also have that kind of strength in the Foundation Building Tier, you would be qualified to be ranked in the top hundred.” Qian Senlai judged, “Unfortunately, you are only a mere Mystery Realm Tier. With a leap from the Celestial Gate, you may be reduced to a mediocre character.","“Even a mediocre person can beat you to burst!” Ling Han counterattacked. He charged forwards, his fists moving continuously. Boom, boom, boom, the power of his fists surged out, incredibly domineering.","Qian Senlai showed a hint of seriousness. He did not use his saber, but rather put it away. Instead, he used his palms to deal with Ling Han.","What a joke. He was one of the few prodigies of Peaceful Splendor County. If he still needed to use a Spirit Tool to deal with a nameless nobody, would he still have any face?","They had only exchanged a few blows, and Qian Senlai immediately frowned. This opponent was unexpectedly strong.","Thankfully, his opponent did not seem to have cultivated Spiritual Power, and did not use any high-level energy. Though battle prowess was strong, his destructive power was only brute force. He could deal with it by dispelling his attacks.","This was natural. In the first place, Ling Han’s Spiritual Power had almost been used up before he had surfaced. Though he could still use it for a while, wasn’t there another person on the other side? He naturally had to keep some trump cards.","Good steel should be used on the cutting edge. If he used Spiritual Power, he would definitely communicate with the power of destruction, and directly kill these two people.","Even so, Ling Han still activated his Eye Technique, easily seeing through to all of Qian Senlai’s weak points. It wasn’t long before he gained the upper hand.","Yet Qian Senlai did not panic in the slightest. Instead, he laughed loudly, “Brat, I don’t know why you have such great power, but without cultivating Spiritual Power, your battle prowess has weakened by at least half!","“Hl let you see just how strong a Mystery Realm Tier can be! With a soft exclamation, his palms immediately became silvery white. This was also the Energy of Metal, and its level was extremely likely to be denser than the Metal Energy that Ling Han had stimulated. The way it was arranged was also different, and that was why it appeared silver in colour. Boom, he delivered a palm strike, and the silvery light was dazzling. Ling Han still greeted the incoming attack with his bare fists. Peng, the two of them exchanged a blow, and both took a few steps back.","Bloodstains appeared on Ling Han’s fist. The destructive power of high-level energy was too great, and the Spirit Diagram that Qian Senlai had mastered was extremely extraordinary, possessing even greater might. Thankfully, Ling Han’s bones had been tempered too hard, so it had only broken his skin. Looking at Qian Senlai again, he was not much better. The web between his thumb and forefinger had actually split open.","Why?","Ling Han used Frequency Attack. After all, now that you have used high-level energy, it can’t be that I would continue to maintain my original battle prowess, right?","“I have really underestimated you,” Qian Senlai said solemnly. He had really gone all out in that attack just now, but he had actually only managed to tie with Ling Han. The strength of his opponent was really extraordinary.","At least on the level of Mystery Realm Tier, the other already possessed the qualifications to stand against him.","The smile at the corners of Luo Xi’s lips also disappeared. He too felt the pressure.","If Ling Han could still maintain his standard when he leaped over the Celestial Gate, then this person would definitely become a powerful competitor for them.","Most importantly, what was it? The other party was already so powerful without even knowing how to communicate with high-level energy.. How amazing would it be if he learnt the amazing use of Spiritual Power?"]},{"number":3611,"title":"Chapter 3611: Improvement","paragraphs":["Chapter 3611: Improvement","Translator: Henyee Translations l Editor: Henyee Translations","Qian Senlai wore a solemn expression as he looked at Ling Han. He withdrew his last shred of contempt.","Though in the outside world, he could crush Ling Han with a single finger, in this place, Ling Han was a strong opponent.","He took a deep breath, and assumed an attacking stance.","“Three Elements Floating Wind Palm,” Luo Xi blurted out. There was also a hint of shock in his voice. This was one of Qian Senlai’s trump cards. He hadn’t expected him to use it so quickly.","Ling Han was not careless either. The present Qian Senlai was exuding a powerful aura, as if even if the sky collapsed, he would be able to send even the sky itself backwards with a single palm strike.","This was probably a celestial technique.","One of the advantages of Celestial Path elites was that they could truly grasp celestial techniques, and using the power of a Mystery Realm Tier to activate a celestial technique, although its might would be considerably weaker, it would definitely be stronger than a normal martial arts technique.","Fine then, celestial technique versus celestial technique.","Ling Han’s fist turned into a claw, and his body was like an eagle spreading out its wings, similarly exuding a vicious aura. He was like a fierce bird of prey that was about to attack from the primitive era.","The Eighteen Claws of the Golden Eagle.","Qian Senlai was naturally stunned again. F*ck, what was going on here? How had a Mystery Realm Tier learnt a celestial technique?","Are you a monster!","While he was still stunned, Ling Han had already charged over. His claws danced, and golden light filled the skies.","Qian Senlai was stunned, but he naturally wasn’t afraid either. He instinctively charged forward.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them clashed endlessly, and golden and silver light flashed madly.","Ling Han suddenly recalled that since the Demonic Monkey Fists was taught by Brother Monkey, it must also be a celestial technique. Furthermore, he had once stimulated an incredibly terrifying illusion of a Demonic Monkey. That might was really indescribably powerful.","However, the strongest trait of the Demonic Monkey Fists was Frequency Attack, which allowed him to attack a stronger opponent and not fall into a disadvantage.","The problem was that he needed to first grasp the rhythm of his opponent’s attacks before he could use Frequency Attack.","He was now passive.","Could he simply ignore his opponent’s attacks, and form Frequency Attack on","his end?","He could give it a try.","Once he succeeded, his battle prowess would steadily increase.","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He suddenly switched to the Demonic Monkey Fists.","F***, what are you playing at?","Qian Senlai felt gloomy. He had just about gotten used to the rhythm of the Eighteen Claws of the Golden Eagle, but Ling Han suddenly turned his claws into fists again, and the rhythm of his attacks completely changed, making him feel so terrible that he felt like he was about to throw up blood.","Elites loved to study the ultimate techniques of their opponents, and then decipher them. Now, he had just grasped a bit of it, yet Ling Han was not using it anymore, making him feel like a child whose beloved toy had been snatched away, feeling extremely terrible.","However, the moment Ling Han used his fist technique, he felt a tremendous pressure. His opponent was exuding a ruthless aura, exerting pressure on his mind.","Intent Realm!","Qian Senlai was shocked. Only a celestial technique could cultivate an Intent Realm, but not every celestial technique could do it. It had to be a considerably first-class celestial technique, and the user would also have to have astonishing natural talent, and have completely grasped the essence of the celestial technique.","A Mystery Realm Tier cultivator could actually grasp the essence of a celestial technique? Moreover, this fist technique was so powerful at that?","Ordinary Intent Realms would only affect the environment. For example, one would be placed in a furnace or an iceberg. Only a very limited number of Intent Realms would directly suppress one’s mind. This effect was more direct, but it was also a double-sided blade.","Because once the opponent’s willpower was strong enough, they could turn around and suppress the caster.","From this aspect, the person who created this fist technique must be an extremely domineering and confident existence. When I throw a punch, there would be no one that could match me in this world!","Ling Han did the same. With a battle cry, the Demonic Monkey Fists attacked randomly. It was as if he had transformed into a ruthless Primitive Age Demonic Monkey that wanted to crush everything.","He threw punch after punch, experiencing the shockwaves of the punches. “You’re underestimating me!” Qian Senlai roared. He unleashed his full battle prowess, and as his Spiritual Power surged, his hands became incredibly bright. The silvery brilliance seemed capable of blinding.","Boom, boom, boom! He continued to exchange blows with Ling Han. In terms of fighting spirit, as a top prodigy, Ling Han naturally wouldn’t lose to anyone.","If you want a head-on clash, then go ahead. There was absolutely no way I would cower.","This was exactly what Ling Han wanted. He needed pressure to force himself to break through.","The greater the pressure, the more motivated he would be.","Luo Xi’s expression became more and more solemn. Though Ling Han had not advanced into Celestial Path yet, and accidents could happen when he leaped over the Celestial Gate, what if his battle prowess would not be damaged when he leaped over the Celestial Gate?","This would be a powerful opponent.","Strange, when had such a young prodigy appeared in Peaceful Splendor County?","Ling Han gradually gained appreciation. In the first place, he had already grasped Frequency Attack, and knew the principles behind it. However, he was presently accumulating power on his side, and only needed a change.","“This way!”","He shot out two punches like lightning. The power in front was slightly slower, and the power behind caught up to the surge of power in front, forming a wave-like pattern.","Peng!","In this exchange of blows, Ling Han couldn’t help but stumble backwards. On the other hand, Qian Senlai did not retreat a single step at all, and was completely on the upper hand.","On the surface, it looked like Ling Han had suffered a loss, but he was actually smiling.","This was because his two attacks had formed its own Frequency Attack, greatly increasing their might. However, the accumulation of power from his two punches was naturally unable to contend against Qian Senlai’s full strength. Thus, he was at a disadvantage.","Again!","He threw three punches, one power after another, like a wave.","Peng, peng, peng! Ling Han clashed with Qian Senlai again. This time, he was still at a disadvantage, but his situation had already improved slightly.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and the power of four surges of power joined forces.","Five layers, six layers, seven layers... as Ling Han’s attacks became fiercer and fiercer, he gradually turned the tables, and was no longer inferior to Qian Senlai at all.","Qian Senlai roared in fury. He thought that he had the upper hand and would soon win, but Ling Han was too tenacious, forcefully erasing his disadvantage. His attacks became even more rapid, wanting to kill Ling Han in a single stroke.","But on the sidelines, Luo Xi felt a slight chill all over his body as he watched.","As an observer, he could see clearly. Previously, Ling Han had been testing out a technique or something, and because he was unfamiliar with it, he had suddenly fallen into a disadvantage. However, now that he had mastered it, he had turned the situation around.","The matter was very simple, but the significance behind this was too terrifying.","-In such an intense battle, Ling Han actually managed to test out a new technique?","What kind of confidence was this, and what kind of comprehension ability was this?","He had a feeling that Peaceful Splendor County was already destined to have an incredibly dazzling rookie.","Ling Han laughed loudly. He had already completed the transformation, converting the Frequency Attack into one that had himself as a focus.","Come.","He threw another punch, and his fist vibrated madly at a frequency that was hard to catch with the naked eye. Instantly, he shot out seventy overlapping layers of power.","The limit of the Demonic Monkey Fists was 108 overlapping layers of power, and he was still far from reaching the limit.","This wasn’t a simple superimposition of 70 layers of power, but rather a specific frequency formed from wave after wave.","Peng!","Qian Senlai faced this attack head-on, yet his expression changed drastically. He involuntarily stumbled back a few steps.","On the other hand, Ling Han was completely unscathed.","It was clear that Ling Han was already at an advantage in this situation.","Qian Senlai could not believe this. He stared blankly at Ling Han, his heart completely in a daze.","How was this possible? How was this possible?"]},{"number":3612,"title":"Chapter 3612: Defeating Prodigies","paragraphs":["Chapter 3612: Defeating Prodigies","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Qian Senlai, let me deal with him!” Luo Xi walked out.","“Get lost! I didn’t lose!” Qian Senlai was unwilling to accept this.","“Still haven’t lost?” Luo Xi shook his head, “You are not even willing to admit the gap between you and your opponent. In future, I would really be ashamed to be associated with you.”","Qian Senlai was furious. In truth, he was only at a slight disadvantage. Previously, it wasn’t like Ling Han hadn’t been at a disadvantage before. Why was it that he would lose just because he was forced a few more steps back?","He was defiant, and stepped forward to battle fiercely with Ling Han again.","However, Ling Han had already completely adapted to the new Frequency Attack. He discovered that this was the correct way to use the Demonic Monkey Fists.","That was because the Demonic Monkeythat had created this fist technique — it was very possibly the Ancestral King that Brother Monkey had spoken of. That was a great emperor that was invincible in this world, and had once ruled over an era on his own. Such a domineering character, what need was there for him to care about the techniques and attacks that the other party used?","There was no need!","I threw a punch, and naturally am invincible.","Thus, when Ling Han transformed his Demonic Monkey Fists, it became even more proficient for him to channel the Demonic Monkey Fists. Similarly 70 layers of power stacked together, but it was obvious that his current Frequency Attack was more powerful.","Qian Senlai was truly no match. Although he wasn’t much inferior to Ling Han, he was still slightly inferior. He was being suppressed by Ling Han, even if he could hold on for long enough.","He was a prodigy, after all, so he still cared about his pride. In the end, with a furious roar, he retreated from the battle.","He was done fighting.","Luo Xi walked forward and said, “You’re now qualified to tell me your name!”","These words were naturally directed at Ling Han. With his status as a Foundation Building Tier cultivator, this was not considered going too far.","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “If you want to fight, then go ahead. Why are you spouting so much nonsense?”","He charged over on his own volition, unleashing the Demonic Monkey Fists and barraging it madly.","Now, there was no need for him to grasp the rhythm of the other’s attack first. He completely focused on himself. That was very comfortable, and a domineering aura was also growing in his heart.","T don’t care if you’re a human or a demon. I don’t care how strong you are. I’ll deal with you with a single punch.’","‘Can’t deal with him with one punch? Then I’ll deal with him with two punches.’","Luo Xi was exasperated and was forced to parry.","He had a card up his sleeve. Previously, he had not just watched from the sidelines for nothing. He had already thought of a strategy, but when it really came to it, he discovered that it was a completely different matter. The strategy that he had come up with was completely useless.","He was also being suppressed by Ling Han. No matter what he did, he couldn’t reverse his disadvantage, and could only defend passively.","“Haha, Luo Xi, aren’t you very arrogant?” Qian Senlai laughed loudly. He was a Luo Xi’s rival, and he hadn’t won. Of course, he didn’t want Luo Xi to have the upper hand.","Luo Xi gritted his teeth and unleashed one secret technique after another. He wanted to turn the tables around, but the value of secret techniques did not lie in the number, but rather quality. For example, in the case of the Demonic Monkey Fists, it possessed astonishing might, so one fist technique would be enough to suppress the world. What need was there for other fist techniques?","No matter what he did, he was still unable to reverse his disadvantage.","After exchanging a hundred moves, he had no choice but to withdraw from the battle. If they continued fighting, he would not be able to gain the slightest advantage either.","Though his rival had lost, Qian Senlai was not the slightest bit happy.","Two great elites of the Foundation Building Tier, and prodigies of the younger generation of Peaceful Splendor County at that, were actually defeated by an unknown rookie.","How could they endure this?","They exchanged looks. Were they still going to spar?","The two of them shook their heads at the same time. They couldn’t even win against a Mystery Realm Tier-level martial artist, so how could they still have the face to spar?","Let’s go, what was the point of staying?","The two of them treaded on the waves at the same time. Even if their cultivation level was suppressed to Mystery Realm Tier, there was naturally no problem for them to tread on the waves.","Ling Han smiled, and sat down in a cross-legged position, allowing himself and the Essence Nurturing Gourd to absorb some fresh air.","A night passed, and the sun rose. Gentle sunlight shone down, but Ling Han did not feel the slightest bit of warmth. This Cold Water Lake was really too cold.","After a night, his Spiritual Power had mostly recovered. He had Tang Yun’er also come out to cultivate. The little loli was too lazy, and without urging, she was not willing to cultivate properly at all.","Strange, why would the abilities of the Calabash Brothers increase so rapidly as long as they grew normally?","Er, they had sprouted from a gourd vine.","Ling Han had not used up all his Fire Origin Stones, but if he used them here, the effects would be greatly reduced.","Water and fire restrained each other?","He didn’t waste them and put away the Fire Origin Stones. Since the Extreme Flame Valley had the Fire Origin Stones, would there be Ice Origin Stones here?","After he finished cultivating, he dived to the bottom of the lake and continued to hunt.","This time, his efficiency dropped drastically. Even with the help of seven babies, he wouldn’t be able to gather enough essence of water without one or two years.","To say nothing of Ling Han, the news of their battle with Ling Han still leaked out after Luo Xi and Qian Senlai left.","The entire Peaceful Splendor County was in an uproar. Since when had such a prodigy appeared?","Though it was only a Mystery Realm Tier, to be able to defeat a super genius like Luo Xi and Qian Senlai, just how freakish would he have to be?","All of a sudden, Ling Han, the mysterious prodigy, became extremely popular.","Among the younger generation of Peaceful Splendor County, too outstanding prodigies had been selected based on a combination of cultivation level, battle prowess, battle merits, potential, and so on. Now, Luo Xi and Qian Senlai, prodigies ranked eighth and ninth respectively, had been defeated, causing those ranked below them to feel indignant. That was because they had not even seen Ling Han in person, and were already thought to be inferior to Ling Han.","There were many young and impetuous people, and they all set out, heading towards the Cold Water Lake. They wanted to personally defeat Ling Han and prove their reputation.","On the other side, when the Pang Clan and Lei Clan received this news, they immediately concluded that this person was Ling Han.","—How could there be so many prodigies in this world? Ling Han had just appeared, and now another mysterious elite had appeared?","Moreover, this mysterious prodigy had definitely gone to the Cold Water Lake to gather the essence of water. Who else could it be but Ling Han?","“This brat must be eliminated!” The higher-ups of the Lei Clan issued a command.","“At all costs,” the ancestor of the Pang Clan personally commanded.","Once the two great forces of Core Formation Tier-level became serious, the power they could make use of was also astonishingly powerful. They adapted to the situation, and very soon, devised a strategy to deal with Ling Han’s situation.","This time, they would make this boy disappear completely.","The elites from the two clans set off, bringing with them the treasures that they had paid an exorbitant price to obtain, heading towards the Cold Water Lake.","Cold Water Lake.","Ling Han had already stayed here for ten days, and his gains were still very little. It was completely incomparable to Extreme Flame Valley.","He felt rueful. It was no wonder that even though everyone knew that there was such a good thing like the Five Elements Karmic Pill, there were extremely few people who were really willing to concoct it. Just look at this Cold Water Lake; it was difficult.","However, no matter how difficult it was, Ling Han wouldn’t give up. He had an obsession with perfection. He clearly knew that it was best to do this. Even if he was just a little bit away from perfection, he would still be unwilling to give up.","It was precisely because of this that he had become the most powerful Heavenly Venerable Tier elite.","On this day, he resurfaced and climbed onto an ice floe to rest.","This piece of floating ice was very small, not much bigger than an ordinary house.","‘Hmm?’","He looked into the distance, and saw a figure walking over on the waves at an extremely fast speed.","Xiu, this person had also discovered Ling Han’s presence. With a flash, he had already landed on the floating ice.","“Are you the mysterious person who defeated Luo Xi and Qian Senlai?” the person asked. He was dressed in golden robes, and he appeared especially haughty.."]},{"number":3613,"title":"Chapter 3613: Greatly renowned","paragraphs":["Chapter 3613: Greatly renowned","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","What kind of definite statement was this?","Ling Han shook his head. He was who he was. Did he need to rely on Luo Xi and Qian Senlai to make a name for himself?","“What is it? Do you want to be the third person to be defeated by me?” he asked calmly, not bothering to explain.","“Wrong, I’m here to defeat you and prove that I am the strongest in Mystery Realm Tier!” the golden-robed person said.","Ling Han scoffed. Even if he was really defeated, it didn’t mean anything, because he was only an Enlightenment Tier.","Why did everyone think that he was a Mystery Realm Tier?","Boom!","The golden-robed figure had already launched an attack. He shot out a kick. Whoosh! A gust of wind whistled through the air, with black-colored energy entwined around it. It was as if this energy had transformed into black metal.","Ling Han was startled at first, and thought that the other had also mastered the Destructive Energy. He even got a shock from it, but he immediately came to his senses. That was not the Destructive Energy, but rather the Energy of Metal. It was only manifested in a black colour.","He threw a punch, directly using the Frequency Attack of seventy overlapping layers of power.","Peng, it was only a single strike, and the golden-robed man was sent flying. With a plop, he fell into the lake waters.","“Huh? Why is he so weak?” Ling Han murmured to himself. Compared to Luo Xi and Qian Senlai, this person’s strength was far inferior.","The golden-robed figure leaped out and stepped on the water’s surface.","Yi, he could actually stand on the waves?","Ling Han took a closer look. Oh, so it turned out that the golden-robed figure’s feet had been rapidly stomping all this while, and only then did it provide enough power for him to stay afloat on the surface of the water.","The golden-robed man’s face was flushed red. He had naturally heard Ling Han’s words.","He was ranked thirty-fourth in Peaceful Splendor County, and his name was Pei Guan. Although the ranking didn’t represent absolute strength, there was actually only a gap of a few places. It was definitely impossible for battle prowess that was ranked tenth to fall to the rank of thirtieth or fortieth.","Thus, he was far inferior to Luo Xi and Qian Senlai. He couldn’t even withstand a single strike from Ling Han.","Of course, it was not that he was too weak, but rather that after Ling Han modified Frequency Attack, his battle prowess had become even stronger.","He was extremely embarrassed.","He had clearly come to defeat Ling Han, and afterwards, he could boast that his battle prowess in the Mystery Realm Tier had even surpassed Luo Xi and Qian Senlai, but what was the result?","Terrible!","He did not make another move. This gap was really too wide. He was no match at all, so how was he supposed to fight?","He turned around to flee.","“Wait!” Yet Ling Han blocked him, “Do you think this is a shop you are visiting? You can come and go as you please?”","“What are you going to do?” the golden-robed person asked.","“Rob you!” Ling Han said with a smile.","The golden-robed man couldn’t help but feel speechless. ‘Aren’t you a prodigy? Why are you suddenly going to become a thief?’","He wanted to break out of the siege, but how could he be a match for Ling Han? He was apprehended in a few moves.","Ling Han fished out his Spatial Spirit Tool, but seeing that the golden silk robes he was wearing was not too bad, he forcibly removed it as well.","This wasn’t a Battle Armor, but its material was extraordinary. It could provide a very good defense.","It would be a waste not to take it.","“You are welcome to visit again,” Ling Han said with a smile. He had always welcomed wealth-delivering boys. “Oh, that’s right. Tell the others that if they want to challenge me, prepare the essence of water. Otherwise, they’ll inevitably be robbed by me.”","Pei Guan left in shame and anger. His skills were inferior. It was one thing for him to lose, but he had actually been robbed completely. How could he endure this?","Originally, he had not wanted to reveal the scandal of his defeat, but the figure that had fled in such a sorry state had been spotted. Naturally, the truth had been pieced together, and then publicized it widely.","There was a Wide Star Vine here, so distance wasn’t a problem at all. Very soon, the news spread throughout Peaceful Splendor County.","Since the scandal had been exposed, Pei Guan simply revealed Ling Han’s request. He now had an idea. He couldn’t allow himself to suffer such humiliation alone. If there were more people, he wouldn’t stand out.","And even more truths were dug out. As it turned out, this mysterious person’s name was Ling Han, and had once defeated Zhang Qihua when he was in Extreme Flame Valley, and even killed Lei Jiujun.","When these two pieces of news spread out, Peaceful Splendor County erupted in an absolute commotion.","This person was too awesome, wasn’t he? Could it be that he was really invincible in Mystery Realm Tier?","When the news spread out, it instantly attracted even more people to look for Ling Han. Even among those top-notch prodigies ranked in the top seven, there were a few that announced that they might be going to meet Ling Han.","Ling Han’s place became very lively, and he would be challenged from time to time.","Some people really did bring the essence of water. For this kind of people, after Ling Han defeated them, he would let them off the hook after collecting the essence of water, but if they did not bring the essence of water and came to fight, then sorry, they would be directly beaten to the ground and robbed.","The more people that were defeated, the greater Ling Han’s reputation became. He vaguely gained the title of being top in Mystery Realm Tier.","In this manner, even Ge Tong, Sang Xing, Yan Leshui and the others could no longer sit still. They were ranked in the top five of the younger generation of Peaceful Splendor County. Originally, they would not deign to lower themselves to the level of a Mystery Realm Tier cultivator, but now, everyone was comparing them to Ling Han, and thought that they would definitely be inferior to Ling Han in Mystery Realm Tier.","Otherwise, why wouldn’t they challenge Ling Han?","It was obvious that they were afraid of losing.","Xing Taichu, who was ranked sixth, was the first to step out, saying that he was going to suppress Ling Han.","In the end, two days later, news spread out that he had been defeated by Ling Han. Not only had his Spatial Spirit Tool been snatched, even his undergarments had been stripped completely, and he had shamefully had the experience of running around naked.","—Who asked him not to bring the essence of water?","Subsequently, Yang Cheng, who was ranked fifth, also moved, and similarly suffered a terrible defeat. Then, it was Li Mingxu, who was ranked fourth, and it was still inevitable that he would suffer a terrible defeat.","Ge Tong, Sang Xing, and Yan Leshui were under immense pressure. If they lost again, it would be equivalent to saying that the younger generation of Peaceful Peace County had lost to Ling Han in Mystery Realm Tier.","Under such pressure, they treasured their reputation even more, and were unwilling to make a move easily.","Ge Tong, for example, had announced that he disdained from fighting with Ling Han at all.","Who was he?","As an elite of Heavenly Dao Foundation, why would he lower himself to have a “fair” battle with a Mystery Realm Tier?","There was no such thing as a fair battle in the cultivation world. There was only the survival of the fittest.","Thus, it was impossible for him to go to the Cold Water Lake. However, if Ling Han dared to appear in front of him, he wouldn’t mind casually suppressing him.","Sang Xing and Yan Leshui also said similar words. So what if they defeated Ling Han? So what if he really was invincible in Mystery Realm Tier?","They were Foundation Building elites, so their target was naturally not the prodigies of Peaceful Splendor County, but rather the top prodigies of the other counties.","In the blink of an eye, Ling Han had already been in the Cold Water Lake for one and a half months.","On this day, he once again came out of the lake for a breath of fresh air, but right at this moment, xiu, a stone the size of a millstone suddenly smashed over from ahead of him. This was not the end. Another stone shot over from behind him, sandwiching him between them.","This kind of attack was naturally nothing, and could be dodged with a leap through the air.","But when Ling Han leaped up, these two rocks actually seemed to have a life of their own, drawing an arc in the air as they continued to pursue him.","This had far exceeded Ling Han’s expectations. With a bang, he was instantly hit by two rocks.."]},{"number":3614,"title":"Chapter 3614: Killing move","paragraphs":["Chapter 3614: Killing move","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, though these two rocks would automatically pursue their target, the impact was not all that strong. Ling Han’s whole body shook, and he felt as if he was about to spit out a mouthful of blood, but that was the extent of it.","The cultivation of his physique was really too tough. It could be claimed that he was invincible in Mystery Realm Tier, and the battle prowess here was limited to Mystery Realm Tier, so it only made him spit out a mouthful of blood.","Who was attacking him?","Ling Han was furious. He didn’t mind sparring with others as long as there was enough essence of water, but now someone actually sneak attacked him?","Damn it!","He wanted to push aside the rocks and search for the culprit, but these two rocks... were actually magnets that were stuck tightly together.","This was definitely no ordinary magnet. The magnetism was astonishingly strong, and he actually couldn’t push the rocks aside.","Peng, the rocks fell, and smashed into the ice.","Theoretically speaking, this block of ice should have been extremely sturdy and couldn’t have been shattered. However, the magnets interacted with each other, creating a powerful heat energy that rapidly melted the ice.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple figures flew over.","“Hahaha, Ling Han, you didn’t expect this, did you?” There were a total of seven people, and they all smirked coldly.","“You killed a prized son of our Lei Clan, and think you can go unpunished?”","“Even if you hide here, we can still apprehend you!”","Ling Han’s heart clenched. As it turned out, it was again members of the Lei Clan and the Pang Clan. He smirked coldly, “As a dignified force of Core Formation Tier, you actually only know how to use such underhanded tricks?”","“Don’t waste your breath on him. Hurry up and capture him. Otherwise, he’ll sink,” someone urged.","“All right!” Someone walked over, wanting to grab the magnets.","Ling Han definitely couldn’t allow him to succeed. Otherwise, once he left Cold Water Lake, he would definitely die.","Weng, he activated the barrage of murderous aura and spat out a golden sword that slashed towards that person.","That person was completely unprepared. Ling Han was already trapped between two magnets, so how could he still have the spare energy to attack him?","Under the barrage of the murderous aura, his expression faltered. Then, he was sliced by the golden sword, and his vitality was directly destroyed.","A dignified Foundation Building elite was killed just like that.","The others were all taken aback. They had not thought that Ling Han would still be able to insta-kill an elite of Foundation Building Tier in such a situation. This was practically as easy as slicing weeds.","Peng, the magnets melted the ice, and instantly fell into the water, bringing Ling Han down rapidly.","No one dared to approach. With a precedent, who would dare to court death?","Thus, the six of them could only watch helplessly as Ling Han sank into the water.","After a long while, they finally came to their senses, and their faces were slightly flushed.","They actually didn’t dare to make a move against a minor character in Mystery Realm Tier?","This was too humiliating!","“However, since this brat has sunk to the bottom of the lake, he’s definitely going to die,” someone said sheepishly.","“En.” The others all nodded in agreement.","“That is a Green Red Magnet that has been dyed with the blood of elites. It is not something that that brat can break free from at all.”","“Thus, he would either freeze to death, suffocate to death, or be crushed to death when he is finally exhausted. There is definitely no fourth possibility.”","“Just to be safe, we had best go down and take a look.”","“All right.”","The six of them went into the water one after another, wrapping themselves in flame energy to resist the coldness. They sped up, and soon caught up to the two magnets that were almost joined together. They could very clearly see that they were presently sinking rapidly with Ling Han in tow.","But after only a while, they did not follow any further. That was because they had already dived very deep into the water, and the water pressure was becoming more and more terrifying. If they continued to dive in, their bodies would be crushed by the pressure.","It couldn’t be helped. In this place, they could only unleash the full strength of Mystery Realm Tier.","Thus, they all stopped, and watched as Ling Han and the two magnets sank deeper and deeper, right until they disappeared into the darkness.","They began to float up, leaping out of the water one after another, and stood on the floating ice.","“He’s dead for sure.” The six of them nodded. This time, there was no longer any possibility for Ling Han to survive.","Inside the lake.","Ling Han was thinking of countermeasures. The suction force of these two magnets was really too terrifying. He couldn’t struggle free at all, and he was also unable to enter into the Essence Nurturing Gourd. He really couldn’t advance or retreat.","Not only that, but he also needed to resist the crushing power of the magnets, and communicate with the energy of flames. Otherwise, he would freeze to death before he could even be crushed to death.","More importantly, this was also the bottom of the lake. If he didn’t have any air, one hour would be his limit.","Could it be that he could only choose between being crushed to death, freezing to death, or suffocating to death?","The magnets continued to sink. Thoughts streaked through Ling Han’s mind. He had to escape as soon as possible. Otherwise, he would have to face an even more serious problem — the water pressure.","Destructive Energy!","This was the only solution that Ling Han could think of.","He definitely had to succeed.","Because his Spiritual Power was limited, he dispersed the flame energy, then channeled Destruction Energy. Instantly, his hands and feet were entwined with black-colored energy. Under the powerful destructive power, his shoes instantly turned into nothing.","Ling Han pressed his hands into the magnets, but to his disappointment, there was actually no change to the magnets at all.","It was ineffective?","No, it was possible that the material of the magnet itself was more shocking, so it was not something that could be destroyed in a few moves.","He could not give up.","Ling Han channeled the Destructive Energy continuously. Now, he could only take a gamble. If he didn’t shatter the magnets, he wouldn’t be able to escape death.","The magnets sank rapidly. This thing was abnormally heavy, and sank very, very quickly.","The water pressure approached madly, and Ling Han felt as if every part of his body was being crushed. His skin instantly shattered, and blood seeped out, leaving behind a long line of blood that streaked straight towards the bottom of the lake.","Thankfully, Ling Han had cultivated to the true pinnacle of each cultivation level. His physique was incredibly tough, and he could withstand the pressure when it reached his bones.","He was still sinking, blood seeping from his eyes, nose, and ears.","Right at this moment, he discovered that there was a slight movement of his arms and legs.","Part of the magnet... had been destroyed.","Ling Han’s spirit was greatly energized, and he hurriedly continued to work hard.","Water pressure, compression, and extreme coldness. Ling Han had to face three major problems at the same time. If it was another person, any one of these problems would be fatal, but he managed to withstand them.","Seventh Change allowed his Qi and blood to be extremely vigorous, and there was definitely no problem for him to resist the ice for a short period of time.","Sinking, sinking, sinking. Shattering, shattering, shattering.","Ling Han was competing with time. If he really went too deep into the water, it was possible that he wouldn’t even have the strength to swim upwards.","His range of movement became larger and larger, and the water pressure also became more and more terrifying. All of a sudden, Ling Han felt his body tremble, and then he collapsed at an angle.","He had reached the bottom of the lake.","Ling Han came to a sudden realization. It was too dark here, and he wouldn’t be able to see anything without activating his eye technique. However, after stepping into the mud, he naturally came to his senses.","The water pressure here was too terrifying. Ling Han felt as if even his bones were trembling, and even after Seventh Change, his blood and Qi was close to being unable to maintain his vitality. His vitality was rapidly declining.","Ling Han still didn’t give up. For someone like him, even if he was about to take his last breath, he would definitely be resisting.","Destructive Energy rolled out, and Ling Han released a soundless roar as he made his final attempt.","Crack! A crisp sound was heard from the magnet.."]},{"number":3615,"title":"Chapter 3615: Palace at the bottom of the lake","paragraphs":["Chapter 3615: Palace at the bottom of the lake","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The magnet was about to break.","Ling Han hurriedly mustered up his remaining strength to increase the strength of the Destructive Energy.","His spiritual power was already close to exhaustion. If he still couldn’t break through the magnets, then he really had no other ideas.","In fact, he was already channeling too much energy at this moment, and he felt like his head was exploding.","It was loosening, loosening, loosening. Ling Han struggled strongly, and his whole body immediately floated upwards. Meanwhile, the two magnets had joined together, but if one pulled hard now, he would discover that the magnets were very easily separated.","Because the structure inside had been severely damaged by the destructive energy, the magnetism was naturally not strong.","Ling Han couldn’t hold on any longer, and hurriedly entered into the Essence Nurturing Gourd. The instant he entered, he saw a flash of light in the distance.","How could there be light at such depths at the bottom of the lake?","With this vague thought in mind, Ling Han immediately passed out after entering the gourd. Vaguely, he seemed to hear Tang Yun’er calling out, ‘Damn Ling Han, why are you in such a miserable state? Don’t faint, or else who will cook for me...’","This damn child only knew how to eat. He would definitely deal with her when he returned.","He finally fainted.","After sleeping for who knew how long, Ling Han was finally awoken by a feeling of suffocation.","“Ling Han, what are you playing at?!” Tang Yun’er said through gritted teeth. “You committed suicide by jumping into the lake, but what does that have to do with me? Why do you insist on taking me with you?”","She had gone out for a while previously, yet was almost crushed into pulp by the water pressure. Thankfully, she still had a rare treasure on her, which took effect in time, allowing her to escape back into the gourd.","However, though the space inside the gourd wasn’t small, it couldn’t withstand the breathing of two people who were only expending the air without any replenishing of the air content. The air content in the gourd was getting lower and lower.","She still didn’t know how to conserve and hold her breath, and Ling Han didn’t know after he had fainted, so he expended most of the air.","Ling Han snickered, and said, “Don’t be anxious. I’ve almost recovered, so I’ll bring you out now.”","His physique was really tough. He had only slept like this, and his external injuries had mostly recovered, and his Spiritual Power had also recovered slightly. However, if he wanted to return to his prime condition, he still had to return to the shore.","“You’d better hurry up, or I’ll become a ghost from dying of suffocation!” Tang Yun’er stuck out her tongue. “If I die, I’ll hang behind you every day to scare you!”","Ling Han chuckled. He exited the gourd, and was just about to float upwards, when he suddenly recalled the glimpse of light he had seen when he had entered the gourd.","He stopped... there should still be enough time for him to look around for it.","The water pressure was astonishing, but Ling Han had already withstood it for so long previously. Furthermore, it was under the pressure of the magnets. Now, he was naturally slightly more relaxed, mainly because his physique had been cultivated too toughly, and was too comprehensive.","Otherwise, even if someone cultivated Seventh Extreme, his internal organs wouldn’t be able to withstand such pressure, and his heart would explode.","After circling around the lake, Ling Han indeed managed to spot that streak of light again.","He hurriedly swam towards that place.","Though he could not unleash the speed that he should have in the lake, with enough strength, it was convenient no matter where he was. With a tap of his foot on the bottom of the lake, a massive power instantly exploded, pushing him forwards like a swordfish.","However, there weren’t even any living beings of the Water Element at the bottom of the lake. This place could crush all existences of Mystery Realm Tier.","As Ling Han neared, the streak of light became larger and larger, gradually revealing its true appearance.","Ling Han couldn’t help but look surprised. That was actually a palace!","There was actually a palace at the bottom of the Cold Water Lake?","He soon arrived within the vicinity, and saw that the whole palace was enshrouded in a screen of light. He tried to stretch out his hand to touch it, and shockingly discovered that this screen of light was actually like dirt, and his hand had squeezed inside just like that.","Ling Han’s curiosity was really too great. He practically did not hesitate, and his whole person squeezed in as well.","After taking a step, he suddenly felt his body become lighter.","The water pressure had disappeared.","Yi, this was an empty space. There was not even a drop of water here.","Ling Han was astonished. He knew just how terrifying the water pressure was, yet the light screen that he could easily pass through was actually able to block it?","This was filled with contradiction.","“Ah, I’m about to suffocate to death!” Tang Yun’er came out of the gourd, breathing heavily.","After entering into this space, the Essence Nurturing Gourd naturally replenished the air content, letting the little loli know that she had “already” left the bottom of the lake.","“Yi?” She swept an eye over the surroundings, and couldn’t help but reveal a curious expression. That was because there was an ocean all around them, and ahead of them was a massive palace. This scene was something that she had never expected.","“Ling Han, where have you kidnapped me to?”","Ling Han tapped her lightly on the head, “No one kidnapped you.”","“As if,” the little girl mumbled.","Since he was already here, he had to go and take a look no matter what.","At present, they were in the plaza in front of the palace. Each brick was like white jade, bright enough to reflect one’s reflection, and could more or less be used like a mirror.","Tang Yun’er took one step, and she almost slipped. This instantly piqued her interest, and she began to slide on ice.","“Come play!” she giggled.","No matter how mischievous she was, she was still a child.","Ling Han smiled, and strode towards the palace gates.","One step, two steps, three steps... After taking a few steps, Ling Han couldn’t help but stop in shock. This was because the palace gates weren’t the slightest bit closer.","He turned around to take a look, and discovered that he had not advanced the slightest bit.","What the hell was this?","Ling Han stared fixedly at his feet, then continued walking. One step, two steps, three steps, his steps were normal. When he turned around to look again, he still hadn’t taken a single step.","But wasn’t the little girl ice-skating?","Hold on.","Ling Han walked around the outer circle of the palace. As expected, he immediately felt a change in perspective.","Yi, they could only circle around, and could not approach?","Ling Han circled the palace once, but no matter which direction he walked towards the palace gates, he was unable to advance the slightest bit.","He thought for a moment, then came to a position directly opposite the palace gates. He decided to just forge his way ahead from here.","“Ling Han, this place is so strange,” the little loli said. “It’s definitely been set up with a formation. However, it’s too brilliant, and I can’t find a trace of it at all.”","Ling Han expressed his agreement. He activated his eye technique, but couldn’t see any traces of formations.","It could only be said that the person who had set up this formation was too brilliant.","Since that was the case, Ling Han decided to walk forwards single-mindedly.","Worse come to worst, he would just have to waste some time, but there might be an astonishing opportunity inside — just by how strange this plaza was.","He began to walk, but if he used the little loli beside him as a reference, he did not move the slightest bit.","Imminent Skyline activated, and it was the same. His body could only be seen to be trembling, but his position did not change in the slightest.","Ling Han stopped. The burden from Imminent Skyline was too heavy, and he couldn’t hold on for much longer.","He was simply advancing at a normal pace, his gaze sharp.","Half a day later, Tang Yun’er finally cried out that she was hungry.","Ling Han threw out food for her to heat up, which made the little girl very displeased, complaining that Ling Han was committing child abuse.","Ling Han had a feeling that this might be a test.."]},{"number":3616,"title":"Chapter 3616: Difficult to Advance an Inch","paragraphs":["Chapter 3616: Difficult to Advance an Inch","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han trusted his own judgement. This was a test of mind and willpower. If one wasn’t firm enough, they could only look at the “Palace” and sigh in helplessness.","He exploited some of the fruits of the little loli’s labour, and began to eat ravenously, his feet not stopping in the slightest.","Tang Yun’er was naturally enraged by this, and she almost charged over to fight him to the death.","Thankfully, the little loli was still reasonable.","However, she thought that Ling Han’s actions were only futile. Since he had only been going around in circles, how could he possibly break through the formation?","“Sigh, I met an idiot!” She shrugged. As she licked her candy, she watched Ling Han’s performance.","Ling Han did not take it to heart. He only persisted in his initial judgement, and followed his own heart.","A day passed very quickly. Though the sun could not be seen here, with the existence of the optical computer, they naturally knew when the sun would rise.","Ling Han even stopped cultivating. He was determined to get through this place.","Ling Han, you’re the number one idiot in the world.” The little loli didn’t admire Ling Han’s tenacity at all. Instead, she made sarcastic remarks.","Ling Han merely chuckled. After walking for an entire day, his body was also a little tired, but he showed no signs of stopping.","In the blink of an eye, another day had passed.","The little girl was extremely displeased. Why did she have to be responsible for cooking for herself and Ling Han?","I’m still a baby, all right?","However, Ling Han had completely become a slacker. What could she do? She couldn’t starve to death, right?","“Damn Lmg Han, damn Ling Han, I’m going to make a paper effigy of you and stab you every day,” Tang Yun’er muttered?.","Three days, four days!","After travelling for four consecutive days without any sleep or rest, even if Ling Han’s physique was tough, he still felt weary, and had an urge to fall asleep. But if he collapsed now, wouldn’t all his previous efforts be in vain?","“Ling Han, you are really one-track-minded. Could it be that you have not considered the fact that this kind of action is completely futile? Then the time you waste would only increase further and further!” The little loli could not bear it.","It was too boring. There was nothing to do here, and she was already about to throw up from looking at the same scenery all the time.","If it wasn’t for the fact that she couldn’t withstand the water pressure, she would have long since gone ashore by herself.","Six days, seven days, eight days. Even if he wasn’t fighting, and was merely running, Ling Han was still as tired as a dog. His breathing was like a bellows, and all the clothes on his body had long since been drenched in sweat. His hair was also dripping wet and stuck together.","The soles of his shoes had long since been torn, and there were also many blisters on the soles of his feet. There was even blood, and it could be said that he looked extremely miserable.","Even so, Ling Han’s eyes were still bright, and his willpower was firm.","In truth, his body had already reached its limits, and now, he was completely relying on willpower to hold on.","Lmg Han gritted his teeth, and his feet stepped out due to inertia. He could no longer feel anything.","Actually, Ling Han also knew that this could possibly be a wasted effort, but after running for three days, he used this as a kind of training.","This was a test of willpower. Without the pressure of life and death, how far could he last?","He was sure that after this tempering, his willpower would become much stronger. Furthermore, stimulating all the power in his body would also be greatly beneficial to his cultivation.","He had been climbing to the limit all this while, and wasn’t this also a kind of limit?","Running like this consumed less stamina and mystical power, but after running for nine days, Ling Han’s stamina and mystical power were completely exhausted. If an enemy really came now, they could easily kill him.","Unfortunately, who could go down to the bottom of the lake like this?","If he really descended, then it would probably have to be a supreme elite like Venerate Tier or even a super mighty being like a Saint in fact. Then, even if Ling Han was in his prime condition, he would not be able to match a single glance from the Saint.","He was relaxed and threw all his cares away, exhausting himself completely. Without physical power, without mystical power, and even Spiritual Power was completely exhausted, Ling Han was really moving with a tenacious willpower now. He no longer had any way to stimulate movement techniques, and could only rely on his two legs to move mechanically.","In the beginning, the little girl was still laughing at him, but afterwards, she kept her mouth shut.","Even if she thought that Ling Han was wasting his life, seeing his tenacious willpower, she could only feel admiration.","This kind of person was deserving of respect.","“Goodness, though this guy is not some Divine Physique or Celestial Seed, this willpower is really too terrifying,” the little loli thought. “How did he manage to cultivate such a powerful battle prowess, and added with this willpower, it would be difficult not to become a great elite.”","Ling Han’s steps became slower and slower. His willpower was indeed tough, but he was still a body of flesh and blood, after all. He would still be restricted by his body. While the limits were indeed to be broken, there was still an end to it.","He was going to reach the end now. Step by step, he was as slow as a tortoise crawling.","However, right at this moment, Tang Yun’er’s mouth suddenly gaped open. She was incredibly surprised to see that Ling Han was approaching the palace step by step!","‘F*ck! Is this really possible?’","Previously, whether Ling Han was running or walking, he was still standing where he was, but now, he was actually approaching the palace.","He had really done it!","The owner of this palace must also be a simple-minded idiot,” the little loli said with absolute certainty.","Ling Han, on the other hand, didn’t feel anything at all. His mind was completely blank, and there was only one thought in his mind, and that was to g°> go, go.","The plaza was very big, but it was only about three hundred meters or so. Ling Han’s speed was very slow. Every step he took was like a tortoise, but in the end, he was still endlessly approaching.","After about half an hour, Ling Han arrived at the entrance of the palace. At this time, there was really no further to go. Ling Han suddenly came to his senses. As it turned out, he had already walked over.","He relaxed internally, and instantly fell forwards. Hu, he released a snore, and instantly fell asleep.","Just as he collapsed, with a creak, the doors of the palace automatically opened.","Lmg Han! Lmg Han!” The little loli called out from afar. She had no way to get there, and she had no interest in running for ten days to meet up with Ling Han. After so long, this guy would have already gotten up.","-She did not believe that Ling Han would die. This guy’vitality was like a tenacious cockroach.","After sleeping for a day and a night, Ling Han finally woke up.","‘Ow, ow, ow!’","He couldn’t help but grit his teeth in pain. It was as if his whole body was falling apart. The pain was indescribable.","However, his vitality was extraordinarily vigorous, and was at least much stronger than before.","He took out some medicine and treated himself. Then, he turned to look at the little loli behind him, and shouted, “You wait there, I’ll go in and take a look.” “Even if you don’t tell me, I don’t plan to go in either.” The little loli licked the toffee, looking very proud.","p***","Ling Han turned around and walked into the palace.","So cold!","Lmg Han couldn’t help but shiver. He hurriedly activated the power of flames, yet discovered that this was completely useless.","This coldness did not originate from his physical body, but rather... from his soul. It was as if he had entered into the underworld."]},{"number":3617,"title":"Chapter 3617: Ghosts","paragraphs":["Chapter 3617: Ghosts","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Hiss, this place is too strange!” Ling Han gritted his teeth. Was this really a palace, and not a large tomb?","“However, it wasn’t easy for me to come in. How can I be willing to leave without taking a look around?”","Ling Han didn’t stop walking. The palace was huge, and it measured about 30 meters in height. It appeared extremely imposing.","The floor tiles were still as bright as before, but there was no special effect this time, causing Ling Han to remain where he was.","This place was extraordinarily spacious. Aside from multiple thick bronze pillars, there was nothing else.","Ling Han observed the bronze pillar. It should have existed for many years, and had already rusted. It was mottled, but he could still clearly see that there were originally patterns engraved on the pillar, but what exactly they were, he could no longer distinguish.","Who had this palace once belonged to, and why had it appeared here?","The outer circle of the palace was protected by a light screen, which was obviously deliberate. Then what was the purpose of the palace’s existence?","It was naturally impossible for Ling Han to understand. He shook his head, and continued to walk forwards. Who knew if he would be able to find the answer in the depths of the palace.","“Could it be that someone reached this place before me and ransacked this place completely?”","“If that’s really the case, should I dig out the floor tiles outside? No matter what, I have to have some gains, right?”","Ling Han thought, not feeling the slightest bit apologetic.","’Hmm?’","An incomparable feeling of apprehension suddenly rose up in his heart. Abruptly, he turned to look to his left, and saw that there was actually a black Qi seeping out of the crack between two floor tiles, exuding an indescribable evil.","What the hell was this?","Ling Han had a feeling that he definitely couldn’t be touched by this thing, or he would definitely be consigned to eternal damnation.","Black Qi continuously surged out. There was a large mass, and after about ten seconds, it seemed to have completely emerged. This black Qi began to surge, and then took the form of a human figure.","Hey, hey, hey, what the hell was this?","The human-shaped black Qi became more and more realistic, forming eyes, nose, mouth, and so on.","This was actually an old woman. Her figure was stooped, and she looked old and frail.","Had he really seen a ghost?","Ling Han didn’t think that humans could turn into a cloud of smoke. Moreover, the old woman’s eyes were far too abnormal. There were no eyeballs at all, and they were only pitch-black.","Was there really ghosts in this world?","Ling Han asked himself again. Previously, he definitely didn’t believe in the existence of vengeful ghosts, but now, this perception was being shattered.","The old woman set her eyes on Ling Han. Her dark eye sockets were like bottomless abysses, causing Ling Han to lose his wits at first sight. He was completely unable to extricate himself.","Very strong, very strong. This old woman was definitely Celestial Path-level, and in fact... was not inferior to Brother Monkey!","Hiss, what kind of existence was Brother Monkey?","Minor Advanced Tier, a great elite of Sect Master-level!","But the old woman that had popped out of nowhere was actually this kind of existence?","He had to be seeing things. Though this was the Moonlight Planet, and its overall level of cultivation was far superior to the Celestial Sea Planet, it shouldn’t be so freakish, right?","What could he do? Ling Han was covered in cold sweat. If a great elite at the level of Sect Master wanted to harm him, how could he possibly block it? No matter what he did, it would be useless.","However, with Ling Han’s personality, how could he just sit by and wait for death?","The old woman suddenly opened her mouth, and a terrifying scene appeared. When she opened her mouth, her whole face was gone, turning into a bloody mouth. Then, she pounced towards Ling Han.","He was going to be in trouble!","Xiu, right at this moment, a bronze pillar suddenly lit up, and struck the old woman, instantly sending the old woman backwards.","Ling Han saw very clearly that there was a hole on the old woman’s left shoulder, and he could clearly see through the hole to the scene behind her.","A single pillar of light had pierced a hole in an existence of Sect Master-level?","Ling Han felt his head go numb. Just what kind of place had he entered? This was too dreamlike, wasn’t it?","The old woman released a sharp cry. It was clearly soundless, but Ling Han felt a sharp pain in his mind, as if it was about to burst.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The bronze pillar shot out another pillar of light. This time, it was not just one, but three, and they all shot towards the old woman.","This pillar of light was practically indestructible. As the three pillars of light surged past, three holes appeared on the old woman’s body.","That sharp cry was not soundwaves, but rather the barrage of divine sense.","Ling Han felt apprehensive. This palace seemed to be used to suppress the old woman, and thankfully, that was the case. Otherwise, if a Sect Master-level existence,launched an attack, how could he block it?","The bronze pillars continued to shoot out pillars of light. Even though they were already covered with rust, and it was unknown how long they had existed for, their might was truly extraordinary. In just a few strikes, the Sect Master-level old woman was blasted full of holes, and turned back into smoke. After being struck by a few more pillars of light, she completely dissipated.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief, feeling a layer of cold sweat on his back.","It had been too dangerous just now. In front of a Sect Master elite, he was so fragile that he did not have the slightest ability to protect himself.","He looked at the bronze pillars again. They were clearly rusted, but they still had such might, easily killing a being on the level of Sect Master?","Furthermore, just what in the world was that old woman that the black smoke had taken form in?","Ling Han stared at the bronze pillar, his eyes burning with desire. If he could carry one back, then wouldn’t he be able to sweep aside the whole Celestial Sea Planet?","Carrying one away... it shouldn’t be a big deal, right? There were bronze pillars everywhere here.","It was a wonderful idea, but Ling Han couldn’t move the bronze pillar at all. It seemed to have been forged from Divine Metal, and was incredibly sturdy.","This was something that could kill a Sect Master-level existence, so what was his little bit of power worth?","Sigh!","Ling Han sighed. He had really entered into a mountain of treasures, yet could only sigh in vain.","He strode forward, his heart filled with anticipation. The bronze pillar was so powerful, so if he could discover any treasure, it would definitely be extremely shocking.","After walking for a while, Ling Han once again felt a strong sense of apprehension.","Could it be that it... had come again?","He looked behind him, and to no avail, a mass of black smoke came out of the crack in the floor tiles.","In an instant, the black smoke took human form.","This time, it wasn’t the old woman. Instead, it was a middle-aged man. He was clearly a vengeful ghost, yet it was as if he were an elite that could suppress the world. His aura was domineering, and it was incredibly terrifying.","This was another Sect Master-level being. In fact, he was slightly stronger than the old woman from before.","Ling Han was stunned. Just how many vengeful ghosts were there beneath this palace? Furthermore, they were all Sect Master-level. This was too shocking, wasn’t it?","However, so what if this vengeful ghost was at the level of Sect Master? The bronze pillar lit up, and it was very quickly slashed into ashes.","Ling Han was no longer worried. This palace was probably here to suppress the vengeful ghosts. The bronze pillar was too strong, killing one after another.","He passed through the front hall, and a garden appeared ahead of him, but now all the plants had wilted.","Ling Han saw that there were a great many Celestial Plants here. Some of their grade had even reached six stars, but now, they had lost all their divine brilliance, and were as dead as could be.","Too bad, too unfortunate.","Ling Han shook his head as he continued to walk forward. There were too many Celestial medicines here, yet they had all wilted.","Who would be so wasteful!","After taking a few more steps, a fountain appeared in front of them, but the fountain was no longer spewing out. There was still some water in the pool, and there were also a few water balls. They were clearly a ball of water, but had not split apart.."]},{"number":3618,"title":"Chapter 3618: Imperial Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 3618: Imperial Palace","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. ‘F*ck! This was Water Element Crystal!’","Just how difficult was this thing to forge?","Even with Ling Han’s strength, and with the help of the seven babies, it would take him several years to get even one.","However, there were quite a few here, one, two, three, four, five... there were a total of six water balls, which meant six Water Element Crystals.","Success!","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel pleasantly surprised. He didn’t expect that the Water Element Crystal that gave him a headache would be obtained in such a way.","He hurriedly put away the Water Element Crystals. He had taken all six. It was fine even if he didn’t need so many; he could still sell them.","Just for these six Water Element Crystals, this trip was already worth it.","Yet Ling Han was even more expectant. Would there be anything good in the palace hall that he entered later?","He no longer set his eyes on those wilted Celestial medicines, and quickly entered into the palace hall that lay further inside.","Come, use a treasure to smash him to death. He did not mind.","It was the same for the second half of the palace hall. The majestic bronze pillars stood tall, existing for who knew how long, and would also exist eternally.","Black smoke billowed out, and vengeful ghosts took form again.","The bronze pillar lit up and easily destroyed them.","Ling Han couldn’t even be bothered to look at them now. In any case, once the pillar of light blasted them, the vengeful ghosts would definitely have no way out.","The palace was huge, but there would eventually be an end to it.","However, before he could reach the end, he saw a person standing in front of him.","It was only a back view, but it was like a sun in the dark universe, incredibly dazzling, concealing everything else.","He felt like all the blood in his body was boiling, and an incredibly powerful reverence rose up in his heart. He wanted to kneel down and worship.","Was this an Ancestral King? Only a great emperor that ruled over the ages would have such might, right?","He... was he still alive?","Ling Han forcefully suppressed the fear in his heart. This was a gap in level of being. The other was much, much stronger than him, and he wasn’t even qualified to compare. However, Ling Han could admit that he was weak, but mentally, he would definitely not bow his head.","Gritting his teeth, he forced himself not to kneel.","“Senior...” he said in a trembling voice. He wasn’t afraid, but he couldn’t control his muscles.","The other party acted as if he had not heard him. He was still standing tall, dressed all in white, as divine as a celestial.","Was he going to ignore him, or was he dead?","Ling Han felt that the other’s condition was a little strange. The flame of life of an existence like this should be burning fiercely, and astonishingly energetic, but now, though he was dazzling, he lacked vitality.","If he was still alive, that would be even more terrifying. A single thought would be able to destroy heaven and earth, right?","Ling Han barely managed to move his body. He could not approach. If he went even the slightest bit closer, his skin would be torn apart.","This was not a misconception, because he had tried it. He had only moved slightly, and blood was already gushing out explosively from his body. Furthermore, if he continued to advance even the slightest bit further, he was sure that his physical body would explode.","So what if his physique had been the result of cultivating Seventh Extreme and Seven Inscriptions? In front of such a being, it was completely trash.","Was this really an Ancestral King?","Ling Han shuffled to the other side. Though the distance between him and the white-robed person was not close, he could still see the latter’s face from this angle.","This was a middle-aged man who looked to be only in his forties. He was incredibly handsome, and even with his eyes closed, he still had an indescribable domineering aura, as if he was the center of the world, and there was no one else but him.","However, this was really a dead man, without any signs of life.","Hiss, even a dead man was so powerful. It was impossible to get close to him, as he could forcefully explode.","Right at this moment, the corners of that person’s lips curled up slightly, and he actually revealed a smile.","‘F*ck! I’ve seen a ghost! No, he has come back to life!’","Ling Han got a scare, but the white-robed person was dispersing into thin air. His body was like dust, dispersing layer by layer, returning to the heaven and earth.","A voice rang out in Ling Han’s mind. It was like a bell, but also like how great dao was being passed down at the beginning of the universe.","“My name is Wu Qingxu. In pursuit of the path of becoming an Emperor, I have expended great effort, and found the past temporary residence of Great Emperor Wu Ya. The more I find out about the merits of Great Emperor Wu Ya, the more impressed I am. Thus, I have decided to stay here to stand guard here and guard the Great Emperor’s spirit.”","“Though I have not become an Emperor, I have no regrets.”","Ling Han was transfixed with shock. This white-robed person wasn’t an Ancestral King. Instead, he wanted to become an Ancestral King—the Ancestral King was also known as the Great Emperor and the Holy Emperor. He wasn’t an emperor like Chen Fengyan, but rather a cultivation emperor who could suppress all the elites in the world.","However, with such great aspirations, and furthermore, this Wu Qingxu himself was an incredibly powerful existence, yet because he had come into contact with the life experiences of Great Emperor Wu Ya, he had given up the idea of becoming an Emperor, and was willing to guard his spirit.","Venerate Tier, Saint Tier?","Perhaps he was a Saint. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been qualified to pursue the path of becoming an Emperor.","This was an exaggeration. Was the brilliance of a Great Emperor so dazzling, that even a Saint would give up the decision to become an Emperor?","—Though even if Wu Qingxu did not give up, the possibility of him becoming an Emperor was also endlessly close to zero.","Just what had this Great Emperor Wu Ya done when he was alive, that would actually cause a Saint to be able to endure eternal loneliness in such a damn place, and live a life of loneliness?","“The reason why the Great Emperor has set up this palace is to suppress an evil eye in the heaven and earth, preventing ghosts from appearing and wreaking havoc in the world.”","“However, even the Great Emperor is no match for the vicissitudes of time. When I came here, it has already been hundreds of millions of years since the Great Emperor left behind his temporary residence all those years ago. Even the imperial seals have already begun to wear away.”","“I have used my whole life’s effort, and just barely managed to strengthen the imperial seals. I should be able to preserve them for another ten million years.”","“Those who come later, the fact that you can come here means that your willpower, mind, and potential are all excellent. In future, there is a chance that you can become a Saint.”","“If you become a Saint, I hope that you can come here again to strengthen the imperial seals.”","“The Great Emperor left behind an opportunity here. Because I am determined to guard his spirit here for the rest of my life, I did not take it, and left it for your use.”","Wu Qingxu’s voice weakened, and after saying a few more words, he finally disappeared.","Ling Han was speechless for a long time. He was filled with admiration for Wu Qingxu.","There were only a few Saints in the world, and there were pitifully few of them. Aside from the Ancestral King, they were the strongest. And in the case of the Ancestral King, only one could appear in a single era. Thus, Saints were equivalent to standing at the pinnacle of the world.","Yet this kind of elite was willing to stand guard here. Firstly, it was due to his admiration of Great Emperor Wu Ya, and secondly, it was to suppress the Evil Eye. How could this kind of magnanimity not cause others to feel deep veneration for him?","Wu Qingxu had completely turned into nothing. He had used all his power to strengthen the imperial seals, and now that his obsession had disappeared, his whole person had also completely disappeared.","Now that he was gone, his Dao had also disappeared, so the pressure was naturally gone.","Ling Han instantly came back to his senses. He couldn’t help but feel rueful. There would always be people doing great deeds in this world, and those who came later could only admire them.","However, if it was him, he would not choose to do the same thing as Wu Qingxu. Instead, he would work hard to become an Ancestral King, charge into the Evil Eye, and resolve the problem once and for all.","Of course, even Great Emperor Wu Ya had only left behind a palace to suppress it, so this Evil Eye would definitely be incredibly difficult to get rid of.","Ling Han walked forwards. Great Emperor Wu Ya was broad-minded, and left behind an incredibly valuable treasure for those who came later.","Ahead of him, on a stone table, there was a dark golden metal that was no bigger than the size of a fist. Streaks of Primal Chaos aura hung down, each strand incredibly heavy, comparable to a star. There was also lightning flashing, as if it could split open the heavens and earth.."]},{"number":3619,"title":"Chapter 3619: Origin Gold","paragraphs":["Chapter 3619: Origin Gold","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This was definitely not an exaggeration.","That was because this was Origin Gold, a supreme precious material used only by the Ancestral King!","After every Ancestral King achieved Dao, they would seek out Origin Gold, and forge their own unique weapon, which was called an Imperial Weapon or Monarch Weapon or Ancestral Weapon.","Origin Gold was the general name for this kind of precious material. There were actually many types, such as Celestial Tears Green Gold, Limitless Black Iron, and Earth Black Source Qi, but every kind of ingredient was incredibly rare. In fact, there was only one such ingredient in this world.","Even if it was the Ancestral King, it was possible that he would not be able to obtain a single piece of Origin Gold even if he spent his whole life. This was not due to insufficient strength, but rather a problem of luck.","However, Great Emperor Wu Ya obtained two pieces of Origin Gold for himself. One was obtained in his early years, and was forged into the Extreme Dao Sword, an Imperial Weapon. The other was obtained in his later years, and was no longer forged into an Imperial Weapon. Instead, it was left here, to be bestowed on those who were fated in future generations.","In reality, there were also differences in quality among different types of Origin Gold. It was just that this difference was extremely small, and this Origin Gold could be ranked in the top ten among all the types of Origin Gold.","—There was no specific ranking for the top ten. They were all extremely valuable.","This piece of Origin Gold was called Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning.","According to legends, this was created in the Primal Chaos, and had been forged countless years by the Divine Lightning in the pool of lightning of heaven and earth, and only then did it form into a piece that was the size of a fist.","There was no need to worry about not having enough. Once the Origin Gold was forged into a tool, it could be enlarged and shrunk at will. It was no problem at all. The difference was that the larger the original size of the Origin Gold, the stronger the power would be correspondingly after it was forged into a tool.","However, the Origin Gold of heaven and earth was really too rare. Every time it appeared, it was about the size of a fist, and it was difficult to see any difference.","Ling Han’s heart thumped against his chest. He was only at the Enlightenment Tier and hadn’t even advanced to the Celestial Path yet, yet he had already obtained a piece of Origin Gold that could be forged into the Ancestral King’s personal weapon.","Til take it!’","Ling Han walked over, and according to the technique that Wu Qingxu had taught him, he put away the Origin Gold and stored it into his Spatial Spirit Tool.","This was only the raw Origin Gold, and had not been forged into a weapon. Otherwise, it could not have been so easily retrieved by him, and if it had been personally forged by the Ancestral King, then once it showed its might, a sliver of aura would be enough to shake a Saint to the point that his whole body would crack, and his Dao would be destroyed, and he would die.","The Ancestral Weapon represented, in a certain sense, an Ancestral King. An Ancestral King had a limited lifespan, but the Ancestral Weapon would last for eternity.","Even if he put away the Origin Gold, Ling Han still felt like he was in a dream.","This gain was so great that he could not believe it.","“Who would believe that I haven’t even set foot on the Celestial Path yet, and already possess a piece of Origin Gold?” Ling Han murmured. “This kind of treatment, even an Ancestral King, his son, or his daughter would not be qualified to enjoy.”","Origin Gold was too rare. Even the strongest Ancestral King in the world would only be able to obtain a single piece of Origin Gold in their lifetime, and some would not even be able to obtain it.","Great Emperor Wu Ya’s luck was nature-defying.","Aside from the Origin Gold, there was also a jade bottle on the table, which was half-filled with water.","That was Natural Dao Water; what was it used for?","To resist an environment of extreme flames.","Before the Origin Gold was forged into a weapon, it was incredibly sturdy. Even if all the Saints in the world worked together, they would not be able to knock off a single corner. They would have to go to the place where the Heavenly Dao Flames was burning.","The Heavenly Dao Flame could burn Saints to death. If Ling Han went at this time, that would be equivalent to seeking death. However, as long as he ingested the Natural Dao Water, he would be able to restrain the Heavenly Dao Flame, and complete the tempering and forging of the Origin Gold.","Heavenly Emperor Wu Ya was very thoughtful. Not only did he deliver the Origin Gold, he had even prepared the ingredients needed to forge the Origin Gold. This Ancestral Weapon definitely had to be forged person, infused with a sliver of divine sense, so that the wielder and tool would be connected, and could command it according to his will.","“Please don’t worry, senior. Since I have obtained this great opportunity, I will also bear the corresponding responsibility. In future, when I have cultivated and attained great dao, I will definitely eradicate this Evil Eye, and get rid of any future trouble.”","Ling Han said solemnly. He had made a dao oath, and would definitely fulfill it.","He bowed towards the end of the palace hall. This was to thank Great Emperor Wu Ya for actually leaving behind a piece of Origin Gold for him. This inter-generational favor was really too heavy.","Ling Han turned around and quickly returned to the garden. He then exited the front hall and arrived at the plaza.","In the distance, the little loli was sitting on the ground in boredom, not even licking the candy. She had probably eaten too much, and lost her appetite.","Ling Han returned, and when he arrived at the edge of the plaza, he easily walked over. He didn’t need to walk for another ten days.","“Come on, let’s go back,” he said.","“Any gains?” The little loli’s eyes widened. She was also a curious child.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and took out a Water Element Crystal.","“Yi, there’s actually Water Element Crystals inside?” Tang Yun’er’s expression was filled with shock. However, she immediately gave an ‘oh’, and said, “This is the Cold Water Lake, so it’s not strange for there to be a Water Element Crystal inside the palace. It’s not a waste of your ten days of travel.”","Ling Han gave a ‘ha’, drew the little loli into the Essence Nurturing Gourd, and prepared to leave.","He did not say anything about the Origin Gold. It was not that he did not trust the little loli, but rather that the Origin Gold was really too valuable. Tang Yun’er may not have any devious thoughts about it, but what if she let the cat out of the bag, and others found out?","This was a treasure that even Saints would be tempted by. Even if they did not have the means of an Ancestral King, and could not forge it into an Ancestral Weapon, a Saint could still forge it into a Saint Tool. It was enough to be invincible among Saints.","The less people knew about such a secret, the better.","Ling Han took a deep breath, then stepped out of the light screen. Instantly, an endless pressure assaulted him, causing even his bones to crackle.","He left.","He quickly floated upwards, and after about ten minutes, a white colour appeared above him.","They were about to reach the peak.","With a splash, Ling Han broke through the water’s surface. It didn’t matter that there was no floating ice. He had already been inspired. His feet quickly stepped on the water’s surface, providing him with buoyancy, allowing him to stand on the water’s surface.","Ling Han determined the direction, and quickly set off.","In only half an hour, he arrived at the shore. Ling Han disguised himself and waited to meet up with the babies.","Coincidentally, three days later would be the agreed time to meet.","Aside from cultivating, Ling Han was also searching for a place where the Heavenly Dao Flame could be found.","There was none on the Moonlight Planet. He had to go to the super large planet, a place that could help an Ancestral King ascend Dao.","Ling Han made some queries of the little loli, and coincidentally, she came from such a great planet.","The problem was, Tang Yun’er didn’t want to return at all.","“I’m not in a hurry either. I’m only at the Enlightenment Tier right now, so even with the help of the Natural Dao Water, it’ll still be difficult for me to escape death if I enter the land of Heavenly Dao Flames. No matter what, I have to advance into the Celestial Path first.”","“All right, I will now calmly concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill, and break through to Celestial Path. I will just pretend that I did not obtain the Origin Gold.”","Three days later, the babies returned one after another. When they found out that Ling Han had already obtained the Water Element Crystal they were naturally happy for him, and this also freed them from their labour. They did not have to search for Water Element creatures every day, which was extremely boring.","“Father, where are we going now?” Second Baby asked.","“We’re going to collect some interest,” Ling Han said calmly.","He had almost been killed by the Pang Clan and Lei Clan, and this vengeance had to be avenged — though it was also because of them that he had obtained the Origin Gold, that was a different matter.."]},{"number":3620,"title":"Chapter 3620: Plan to screw others over","paragraphs":["Chapter 3620: Plan to screw others over","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“How do you plan on getting your revenge?” Tang Yun’er asked. “Let me make things clear first. Don’t expect me to help you. Handsome Brother isn’t cute at","all!”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I don’t need your help!”","“Yi, you really think you can match a force of the Core Formation Tier?” The little loli appeared very surprised.","Under the suppression of absolute strength, no matter what method Ling Han used, there was no way he could match the Lei Clan and the Pang Clan.","Ling Han wagged his finger, “Little girl, don’t just think about fighting and killing all day long. For someone as smart as me, how could it be that I can only charge up and fight head-on?”","Tang Yun’er instantly looked excited, “Then should we go and start a fire?” Hearing the word ’fire’, the seven babies became excited at the same time. This would be very fun.","Ling Han was speechless. What was going on with kids nowadays?","He shook his head, “I am not going to set a fire.”","“Then how are you going to get your revenge?” Tang Yun’er asked in confusion. Ling Han smiled, took out a Water Element Crystal, and said with a smile, ‘Til sell this Water Element Crystal to the Pang Clan.”","“Handsome Brother, Uncle, has your brain gone muddled?” Tang Yun’er stretched out her small hand and placed it on Ling Han’s forehead. “Strange, it’s not hot. How did he have such a bad fever that it turned him into an idiot?” Ling Han pushed her hand aside in irritation, and asked, “What are you doing?” “Uncle, the Pang Clan originally wanted the Five Elements Crystals to concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill, yet you yourself are delivering the Water Element Crystal to their doorstep. Isn’t that helping them?” Tang Yun’er looked at him as if he were an idiot. “Uncle, the blow you suffered was too heavy.","You’ve gone stupid, haven’t you?”","Ling Han shook his head and said, “The so-called prodigy from the Pang Clan wants to reach the peak, so the Pang Clan definitely won’t reject this Water","Element Crystal.”","“It’S over!” The little loli grabbed her head. This Handsome Brother had already gone mad.","The seven children finally came to their senses. They had been following Ling Han for a very long time, so they naturally had a deep understanding of Ling Han’s personality.","“Father, are you planning to tamper with this Water Element Crystal?” Eldest Baby asked.","The Second Baby clapped her hands, and said, “When the Pang Clan gathers the Five Elements Crystals and refines them into the Five Elements Karmic Pill, it will be ingested by that idiot from the Pang Clan. Not only will they be unable to push away the shackles in their bodies, but they’ll also be in big trouble. -When Father reveals his identity, the Pang Clan will definitely be angered to death if they find out that they were tricked by Father,” the invisible Sixth Baby said.","“Father is indeed good at screwing people over!” the proud Third Baby concluded.","Ling Han laughed loudly. That was indeed what he was thinking.","Tang Yun’er felt extremely gloomy. Her intelligence was even inferior to a baby’s now? How was she supposed to be the big sister of these babies in the future?","“Ling Han, how are you going to do something to the Water Element Crystal? Do you think that the members of the Pang Clan don’t know to examine it?” she said, dampening his enthusiasm.","This was a problem.","Ling Han nodded, and said, “I already have an idea, but I don’t know if it’ll work.”","He wanted to inject Destructive Energy into the Water Element Crystal, but with his own willpower enveloping it, it would not immediately explode, right until when they were concocting the Five Elements Karmic Pill. Destructive Energy would surge out, and directly destroy the alchemical pill.","Of course, it would be even better if he could give some fake medicine to that prodigy from the Pang Clan.","in the next few days, Ling Han studied the Water Element Crystal as he rushed to the ancestral grounds of the Pang Clan. What kind of method should he use? This Water Element Crystal was no different from a drop of water, but the condensing power was very strong, so it would not shatter. However, it was not appropriate to shatter it either. Once it was broken, though it could still condense, it would lose a large amount of essence, which would affect the effects of the pill.","Have some essence disperse?","No, this could be seen clearly from the outside. If he did something like this, the Pang Clan would definitely discover it.","“Or can I concoct a drop of medicine that can perfectly fuse with the Water Element Crystal?”","Thoughts streaked through Ling Han’s mind. Injecting Destructive Energy into it was his final move. He would only take this step if all other methods were useless.","He began to rummage through his information. With his skill as a Grandmaster of alchemy, there was still hope that he could concoct such a medicinal potion.","Thus, he stopped in a small city for two days, and successfully concocted a drop of liquid.","“Condensation Fluid can extend the time taken to concoct alchemical pills. It’s originally used in alchemy, but adding Condensation Fluid in inappropriate situations will ruin the effects of alchemy.”","“I used another three methods to fuse it together with the Water Element Crystal. Even if it is cut open and studied carefully, without profound alchemy abilities, it would be impossible to tell.”","“Hehe, this is a lesson for you all. Don’t ever offend an alchemist.","A satisfied smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. He had already fused the Condensation Fluid into the Water Element Crystal. Next, he would have to deal with how he was going to sell it to the Pang Clan.","This was incredibly simple.","Ling Han arrived at Azure Spirit City. This was where the ancestral grounds of the Pang Clan were located, and in this Azure Spirit City, the Pang Clan was also the absolute ruler.","After changing his appearance, Ling Han went to the local auction house, took out that Water Element Crystal, and expressed that he wanted to auction it off. This naturally caused a great commotion on the auction house’s side. That was the Water Element Crystal. An ordinary Mystery Realm Tier would have to spend several hundred years to condense it, and they would have to ensure that they did not die. They could only obtain it if they stayed in Cold Water Lake and did not come out. How valuable was that?","Elites above Celestial Path naturally did not take it to heart at all, but to Mystery Realm Tiers, this was incredibly precious. It could open even more shackles, and allow one to rush up to the limits of the mortal level.","Especially for prodigies, this was indescribably precious. Unfortunately, there was only one Water Element Crystal. If there were other Five Elements Crystals, then if they were sold together, the price could be raised even higher.","The auction house immediately announced that they would begin the auction as soon as possible, using this Water Element Crystal as the climax item. Ling Han waited in the city for two days, and someone from the Pang Clan came to look for him.","This was a middle-aged man. He directly barged into the courtyard that Ling Han had reserved, his expression filled with arrogance.","■’Brat, I heard that you are auctioning a Water Element Crystal.” He looked down on Ling Han, “Go and cancel the auction. I want it.” Ling Han had long since drawn the seven babies and Tang Yun’er into the Essence Nurturing Gourd to avoid exposing his identity. He deliberately looked confused, and said, “Sir, if you need the Water Element Crystal, you can go and participate in the auction. As long as you have enough wealth, you can naturally purchase it.”","“So you don’t want to sell it to me?” the middle-aged man asked coldly. Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I’ve already handed it over to the auction house for auction. If it’s suddenly canceled, won’t I become a person who goes back on his word?”","“Do you know who I am?” the middle-aged man asked coldly.","■You must be a dog of the Pang Clan. Otherwise, why would you be so arrogant?’ Ling Han thought to himself, but a dazed expression appeared on his face, “Who are you?”","“My name is Pang Li, that Pang from the Pang Clan,” the middle-aged man said proudly.","Ling Han smirked coldly in his mind. This was merely a Mystery Realm Tier, so what was there to be arrogant about?","However, this made sense. Even if the Pang Clan was a force of Core Formation Tier, elites of the Celestial Path were not so common that they could be found all over the place. Most of the clansmen would still be cultivators of the mortal level.","He smiled and said, “So you’re a member of the Pang Clan. Sorry for the disrespect. However, I’ll still say the same thing. I can’t be a person who goes back on my word..”"]},{"number":3621,"title":"Chapter 3621: Forcefully seizing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3621: Forcefully seizing","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You ” Pang Li was enraged, and he was just about to attack. However, he immediately suppressed his anger and said, “Brat, do you have to complicate a simple matter?”","Ling Han pretended to be a hothead, “What is it? I’m not selling, so could it be that you guys want to snatch it by force?”","Pang Lili laughed loudly, “No, why would our Pang Clan do something like robbery?”","At least, in the Azure Spirit City, they wouldn’t. Although this was their territory, on the surface, they had to be even more just. Otherwise, who would come to the Azure Spirit City to do business?","“Then what do you guys want to do?” Ling Han asked.","Pang Li chuckled, “You will know when the time comes! Who asked you to be so stupid? In future, you will regret it. If only you had agreed to my request","today.”","“I don’t believe it!” Ling Han said resolutely, the image of a foolish young man vivid and lifelike.","Pang Li humphed and strode off.","Another day later, the auction began.","Ling Han naturally participated as well. If there was anything good, he too wanted to join in.","For those below Celestial Path, the common currency was jade seeds, and for Celestial Path elites, the common currency was Dao Stone.","Ling Han could only sigh helplessly. Though he had once possessed three, he had spent them all on the war colossus.","However, there was nothing good that was being sold. He just watched the excitement.","in the end, the Water Element Crystal was the climax item as expected.","“The base price is too jade seeds,” the auctioneer said.","too jade seeds?","A cold smirk appeared at the comers of Ling Han’s lips. In his previous exchange with the auction house, the latter had said that the starting price would be measured in Dao Stones.","Though this was for Mystery Realm Tier, its significance was too extraordinary, so it could completely be auctioned off at a price measured in","Dao Stones.","Now, not only had it been switched to jade seeds, but the starting price was only a hundred jade seeds at that?","Hehe, needless to say, it was definitely the Pang Clan that was behind this.","If Ling Han really wanted to auction off this Water Element Crystal, he would definitely explode at this moment. However, he merely sneered at this moment. ‘Pang Clan, Pang Clan, you think you’ve gained an advantage now, but you’ll know later just how great a loss you’ve suffered!","-The Pang Clan had begun to concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill, and this definitely meant that they had already obtained the other four types of Element Crystal. Then, the result of the concoction would be wasting all five portions of ingredients. In fact, it would even cause who knew what kind of consequences for that prodigy from the Pang Clan who would be consuming it.","Even he was slightly expectant.","“100 jade seeds.” Someone raised their plaque.","“The bid is at too jade seeds. Is there anyone who would like to make a higher bid?” the auctioneer called out loudly. “Is there anyone?","“too jade seeds once, too jade seeds twice, too jade seeds three times, sold!”","The auctioneer made the final decision.","The climax item was auctioned off for the “high price” of too jade seeds?","Wasn’t this the biggest joke in the world?","Even if Ling Han knew that the Pang Clan was shameless, he still detested the way they treated him.","It was no wonder that the Pang Clan was getting weaker and weaker with each generation. With such a narrow-minded mindset, what great things could happen?","Ling Han left “infuriated”. When he arrived outside the auction house, he saw that Pang Li was already waiting for him.","“Young man, do you regret it now?” Pang Li laughed loudly, extremely proud of himself.","Ling Han gritted his teeth, and said, “You people have gone too far. Aren’t you afraid of drawing public indignation?”","-What are you saying? Firstly, we didn’t snatch it, and secondly, we didn’t steal it. How could we possibly cause public indignation?” Pang Li smiled, and said,","“Are you dissatisfied?”","Ling Han humphed before turning around to leave.","“Wait” Pang Li said. Shua! He tossed a bag over, and said, “This is your too jade seeds’. Don’t forget to take it. Then, get out of Azure Spirit City and never come","back again!”","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t pick it up. Right now, he was playing the role of a naive and stubborn youth.","“Hahahaha!” Behind him, Pang Li’s arrogant laughter was heard. After walking far away, Ling Han finally smiled. The mine had already been buried, but who knew when it would explode.","At that time, who knew what kind of expressions Pang Li and the Pang Clan would have.","Hehe.","Ling Han’s next stop was the Ironwood Forest.","Among the lands of Five Elements, this was a place that could nurture Wood Element Crystals.","Three days later, Ling Han finally arrived at his destination. Ling Han pondered for a moment. Should he ask the seven babies for help? That was because it was possible that they would expose his identity. But upon further thought, the babies had not died in the first place, so what was so strange about them coming here?","Moreover, even if the Pang Clan and Lei Clan knew that he had not died yet, so what? Worse come to worst, they could send someone over again. What need was there for him to be afraid?","After suffering a loss once, he couldn’t fall for it a second time. Moreover, the situation in the Ironwood Forest was different.","Ling Han still disguised himself as Can Ye, and acted separately from the seven children. Now, he had to concentrate on fighting the monsters. If he could avoid trouble, it was best to avoid trouble.","The Ironwood Forest was extraordinarily huge, and was more than ten times the size of the Cold Water Lake. However, taking into account the fact that the Cold Water Lake was a three-dimensional space, and had a depth of more than thirty thousand meters, if this was taken into account, the Cold Water Lake wasn’t small at all.","Ling Han and the children split up, agreeing to meet once every five days.","Ling Han drew the little loli into the gourd. This little girl was the easiest to expose Ling Han’s identity.","Regarding this, Tang Yun’er naturally protested. However, she couldn’t withstand Ling Han’s brute force, and she was forcefully stuffed into the gourd. Ling Han strode forwards. He would first gather essence of Wood, then fuse it into the Wood Crystal Element.","As for the essence of Wood, it naturally came from Wood Element creatures. The majority of them were Tree Men that could run, jump and kill. Usually, when they stuck their roots into the ground, they would look like a very ordinary tree.","However, if it wanted to make a move, or if it was attacked, it would pull out its roots, and in an instant, it was no longer an ordinary tree, Aside from that, there were also Demonic Beasts that had yet to develop intelligence in the forest, and this was also a great threat. Additionally, there were also fellow travellers that had come to collect the essence of Wood. In truth, these fellow travellers were the ones that he had to guard against the most.","Ling Han activated his eye technique, and with a single glance, he could clearly see whether it was an ordinary tree or a Tree Man.","After walking for a long time, he finally discovered his first target.","This was a large tree that was as tall as 90 meters, and the trunk of the tree was so wide that it would take five to six adults to wrap their arms around it. Ling Han saw the majestic life essence, which was incompatible with the surrounding trees.","Ling Han didn’t immediately attack. Instead, he walked over and sat down. However, though he looked relaxed, his divine sense had long since spread out. He “saw” that one of the branches of this great tree was slowly stretching over. When it was close to him, it suddenly sped up, as fast as lightning, wanting to entangle him tightly.","Ling Han immediately leaped up, dodging the large tree’s attack.","Boom, at this time, the great tree no longer put on any pretences. It dug itself out of the ground, and its body instantly grew another thirty over meters tall.","Ling Han took the initiative to attack the large tree. Frequency Attack was activated, and as he threw a punch, 70 layers of power stacked together.","The Tree Man hurriedly waved its branches to parry. Peng, it was only a single strike, and this branch was rapidly disintegrating, and the damage was even spreading towards its main body. Pa, pa, pa! Its main body continuously released explosive sounds, and was shattered into pieces.","Ling Han’s current destructive power was too terrifying. With just a single punch, he had blasted the Tree Man into dozens of pieces.","“Is this the true might of the Demonic Monkey Fists?” Ling Han mused.."]},{"number":3622,"title":"Chapter 3622: Throwing Fruits at you","paragraphs":["Chapter 3622: Throwing Fruits at you","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","The Tree Man crumbled, and near its roots, there was a ray of light. Upon a closer look, that was actually a drop of green liquid, pitifully small.","Essence of Wood.","Ling Han put away the essence of Wood, and continued to search for new Tree","Men.","At first, he had thought that since the Tree Man was a plant-type, they would have an indifferent nature. Thus, he did not attack directly, because killing him for no reason was not in line with Ling Han’s way of doing things.","But now that the Tree Man was so fierce, Ling Han would be able to kill him without any psychological burden.","He searched for a new Tree Man, and then attacked without any reservations.","After half a day, he had gained quite a lot, but this efficiency was still no match for when he had been in Extreme Flame Valley, but was much better than his experiences at the Cold Water Lake. However, the he had encountered a fortuitous encounter at the Cold Water Lake, and he had only spent a total of two months there.","In this case, it might take four months, or even slightly longer.","Ling Han could only hope that he would be able to encounter a Tree Man King, and gain a lot all at once.","The next day, when the sun had just risen, Ling Han first dragged the little loli out to cultivate together, then went to eat.","This just happened to be one of the nodal points for his cultivation. This time, he opened another nine apertures, and took another step further on the path of cultivation.","Ling Han continued to move. Fighting monsters was naturally an extremely boring task, but there was nothing he could do about it. For the sake of becoming stronger in the future, he had to be able to bear the weariness and loneliness.","“Brat, stop right there!” Not long after he left, someone called out to him.","The other was a middle-aged man in his forties. He held a saber in his hand, and looked very fierce.","“Hand over the essence of Wood, or die!” The man waved the saber in his hand.","A strange smile appeared on Ling Han’s face, and he said, “You truly want to","rob me?”","“Less nonsense, ah—”","After a while, the middle-aged man cried. That damn brat, not only did he turn around and rob him completely, he even stripped him of all his clothes, and hung him from a tree. If anyone passed by, they would be able to admire his little c*ck.","How humiliating.","Ling Han decided to rob others as well. This was the only way to quickly make a fortune.","Moreover, the reason why they were fighting Tree Men here was because they were hired by the Pang Clan.","He started to get busy. When he saw Tree Men, he would fight Tree Men, and when he saw cultivators, he would rob them. Sometimes, he would even have to fight Demonic Beasts. Life was truly colorful.","In the blink of an eye, 20 days had passed. While Ling Han had obtained a great many essence of Wood, he had also pushed the number of apertures he had opened up to 63.","He traversed through the forest, searching for prey.","‘Hmm?’","He made a discovery. There was an incredibly tall giant tree ahead of him. It was probably at least three hundred meters tall. It had spread out its massive crown, and even in this forest, it stood out like a swan among chickens.","‘Tree Man King?’","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel overjoyed. There really was such a being.","“Don’t even think about it!” A cold voice rang out.","Ling Han turned his head, and saw that not too far to his right, there was presently a young man standing with his sword behind his back. His hands were crossed behind his back, filled with the air of showing off.","Though Ling Han was also very fond of showing off, he was naturally displeased to see others show off.","“Did you grow this tree?” Ling Han asked.","“Don’t be flippant,” the sword-bearing man said calmly. “This is a thousand-year-old tree, and it’s not something you can deal with. Don’t seek death! Obediently watch from the sidelines. When I kill this thousand-year-old locust tree and take away the tree heart, you’ll naturally be able to obtain the essence of Wood.”","Yi, he was quite caring.","Ling Han looked at the large tree in disbelief. This was actually an old monster that was 1000 years old?","He smiled and said, “Since he’s already lived for a thousand years, it’s clear that he’s extremely skilled at staying alive. You mightn’t be able to deal with him.” “Humph, you don’t have to worry about that!” The sword-bearing man strode towards the thousand-year-old locust tree. He drew his sword, and naturally, a powerful aura circulated, which was very extraordinary.","Xiu!","Right at this moment, a black shadow actually smashed over from the locust tree, striking out at the sword-bearing man.","Ling Han looked closely. That was a fruit.","Was the old locust tree trying to make the first move?","The sword-bearing man naturally saw it as well. He drew his sword. Shua, sword light swept past, and that fruit was sliced into two halves. However, this was only the beginning. Boom, the two halves of the fruit actually exploded abruptly.","Under the violent surge of energy, the sword-bearing man was instantly sent flying, coughing up copious amounts of blood.","F*** what was this, an Explosion Fruit?","Ling Han couldn’t help but think of the Ethereal Peak. The vegetable fields there also had these fruits that would explode. Watermelons, loofahs, and grapes had all become deadly weapons with great destructive power.","He had not thought that he would encounter it here again.","If this really was a thousand-year-old locust tree, then it could be imagined what kind of fatal move it would have developed.","“Zhi, zhi, zhi, zhi!” On the trunk of the old locust tree, a purple-coloured squirrel appeared. Its two small front paws were holding onto a fruit, and it was currently barking downwards, looking very furious.","Yi, could it be that the fruit just now had been thrown by this squirrel?","Hold on.","Ling Han was a little confused. Wasn’t this a locust tree? What was a squirrel like you doing on a locust tree? You are not eating pine nuts; have you changed your diet?","Xiu, the purple squirrel raised its two small paws high, then smashed them downwards. That fruit was then thrown again towards the sword-bearing man. After suffering a loss once, the sword-bearing man naturally would not repeat the same mistake. He hurriedly leaped up, and dodged this toss.","Boom!","The fruit crashed onto the ground, instantly creating a huge explosion. A terrifying energy surged madly, and even Ling Han, who was standing very far away, was affected.","“Zhi, zhi, zhi, zhi!” The purple squirrel jumped up and down, as if to say, ‘This is my territory, so don’t even think of taking it over.","Was this thrower added with the Explosion Fruit the reason why the old locust tree could live for more than a thousand years without being knocked down?","The sword-bearing man humphed. He attacked again, his figure darting like a dragon.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The little squirrel continued to smash the fruits, but not one of them hit him. Just as he was about to climb up the tree, a terrifying scene appeared. At least a hundred fruits were thrown out at the same time.","This was practically a rain of fruits, densely packed together, and there was no way to dodge at all.","The sword-bearing man hurriedly turned around and retreated rapidly. Hong, hong, hong! The fruits exploded, forming a brilliant storm of energy. On the tree, small squirrels popped out, one after another. Upon counting, there were at least over a hundred of them.","Just now, it was them that had smashed the fruits together, forcing the man with the sword to retreat.","However, aside from the first one, the others all had grey fur, which made that purple-coloured squirrel appear very conspicuous.","Could this be some kind of foreign species?","“Say, urn, do you need help?” Ling Han asked the sword-bearing man.","“No need!” the man said through gritted teeth.","“Then we will both act alone.” Ling Han naturally wouldn’t listen to him. He dashed out and charged towards the old locust tree.","“I already said, watch from the sidelines!” the sword-bearing man shouted loudly, and set off in rapid pursuit of Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and brandished a fist at the man.","Boom! Bursts of devastating power surged into the surroundings. The man was shocked. He had not thought that Ling Han’s power would actually be so strong. He shot out a flash of Sword Qi to disperse it. Pu, his sword technique was actually quite brilliant, forcibly splitting apart the power of his fist.","However, Ling Han had already dashed ahead of him.."]},{"number":3623,"title":"Chapter 3623: Thousand-year-old locust tree","paragraphs":["Chapter 3623: Thousand-year-old locust tree","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The small squirrels also launched attacks at Ling Han, and countless fruits smashed towards him.","Ling Han moved. His hands danced, and a gentle force instantly caught hold of the fruit. Then, he threw it diagonally outwards. Hong, hong, hong, the sounds of a great explosion rose and fell, but not a single fruit exploded near Ling Han.","The sword-bearing man’s eyes involuntarily twitched. Ling Han looked to be having an easy time, but his control over power needed to be perfect to the extreme. Only then would he be able to hold the fruit with gentle power. Otherwise, if there was the slightest mistake, the fruit would immediately explode.","To be able to control his power to such a perfect extent, this person was practically a monster.","He hurriedly pulled himself together and followed suit.","Ling Han was already nearing the tree. With a leap, his feet stepped on the tree. Xiu, xiu, xiu, he rushed towards the crown of the tree.","“Zhi, zhi, zhi, zhi!” The little squirrels became anxious, and they all threw the fruits even faster.","Ling Han continuously delivered palm strikes, and gentle power surged, “sending” the fruits away one after another.","“Where are you throwing them?” Below them, the roar of the man with the sword on his back was heard. A few fruits that Ling Han had neutralized were thrown towards him.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh loudly, “Sorry, I didn’t do it on purpose.”","‘I think you did it on purpose.’","The sword-bearing man’s heart was filled with gloom. He could confirm that Ling Han definitely had the ability to control the direction of the fruits he threw out, yet there were a few that were flying towards him. It must have been deliberate on his part.","However, he didn’t have any evidence to accuse Ling Han.","Furthermore, who asked him to follow behind Ling Han?","Actually, he could circle around to the other side of the tree, but that way, he would definitely have to sustain even more fruit attacks, unlike now, when Ling Han had drawn all the firepower. He only had to take note of the fruits that Ling Han had “accidentally” thrown over.","It was naturally very simple for him to make his choice.","Ling Han was already close to the crown of the tree. With a creak, all the squirrels scattered like birds.","He couldn’t help but be stunned. Weren’t you all fierce just now? Why are you cowering now?","Ling Han stood on a branch. Though this was only a branch, it was still incredibly thick. The little squirrels had already fled without a trace. Towards these cowards, Ling Han had no interest in pursuing them.","Xiu, the sword-bearing man also leaped up. He looked at Ling Han with a very complicated gaze.","At first, he had even looked down on Ling Han, but in the blink of an eye, he had to depend on Ling Han’s power to reach the tree, which made him feel slightly embarrassed.","To think that he was a Foundation Building elite.","“I owe you a favor,” he said. He paused, then continued, “My name is Shen Hanyun.”","Ling Han did not even turn his head, and merely nodded.","He felt that it was strange. If there was only the fruit-smashing attacks of the army of squirrels, though this might was very strong, could it protect the old locust tree and allow it to live for more than a thousand years?","Boom, right at this moment, the trunk of the tree suddenly trembled greatly. A massive force surged out, forcefully shaking Ling Han off the trunk of the tree. What was going on?","Ling Han wasn’t the only one. Shen Hanyun was also sent flying off the tree.","Peng, peng!","The two of them fell onto the ground. Thankfully, with their strength, they would not be injured even if they fell from a height of three hundred meters.","Neither of them was angered by this, and merely stared dumbly ahead of them.","—That old locust tree had already been uprooted from the ground, its colossal crown actually twisting and deforming. Innumerable branches entwined around each other, forming a dozen or so incredibly thick arms.","“Zhi, zhi, zhi, zhi!” The little squirrels poked their heads out from between the leaves, all of them very excited. The old tree was showing its might. Now, it could destroy all the invaders.","Boom, the old tree moved, swatting out two massive arms, which struck towards Ling Han and Shen Hanyun respectively.","Ling Han, on the other hand, was relieved.","The reason why the old locust tree could last for a thousand years was because it itself also had powerful strength, and not just relying on the help of the little squirrels. And with this move from it, it meant that it was revealing its trump card.","Ling Han raised his fist and clashed with the old locust tree.","Peng! With a single strike, Ling Han was instantly smashed into the ground.","Meanwhile, Shen Hanyun delivered a slash with his sword. Boom! Flames flickered, and this was a great threat to the Tree Man, causing the old tree to retract its arm in time. However, as the force of the blow swept past, it formed a powerful hurricane, and forcibly extinguished the high-level flame energy.","“Goodness, this Lord Tree’s power is really profound.” Ling Han popped out of the ground. Though he was no match for the old locust tree’s power, he himself was also powerful. This blow only caused his blood to boil slightly, and was far from being enough to wound him.","Shua, shua, shua! The old locust tree shook its body, and instantly, several hundred fruits fell at the same time, as if it was raining, extremely densely.","“Run!” Shen Hanyun cried out, and hurriedly leaped out of the way.","If his cultivation level had not been suppressed, then no matter how strong the old locust tree was, he would be able to easily kill it with a single strike.","But now, he had to be careful, or it was possible that he would lose his life here.","Ling Han didn’t dare to face it head-on. The explosive damage of these fruits was far more terrifying than the direct bombardment of the old tree.","The two of them dodged, and had just dodged aside, when the old locust tree delivered another two palm strikes.","Yi, this old tree’s attacks were actually quite organized.","“Do you think I’m afraid of you!” Ling Han humphed. He stimulated the Destructive Energy. In any case, Shen Hanyun wouldn’t be able to see the situation on his side when the black mass of palm strikes shot over.","Peng!","With a palm strike, Ling Han disappeared again. He was forcefully smacked into the ground.","However, it was only an instant, and the old locust tree retreated continuously. Its leaves trembled madly, and a considerable number even fell off, as if it had suffered a great injury.","A hole had shockingly appeared in the “palm” that it had struck Ling Han’s with, and with this as the centre, the surrounding leaves all turned yellow and withered.","Destructive Energy was too terrifying. Even this thousand-year-old locust tree couldn’t withstand it.","Shen Hanyun was dumbfounded. What was going on here? Why had Ling Han suddenly become so powerful?","Ling Han pressed his advantage. The Heavenly Pattern Jade was already unleashed. Its weight was completely compressed, and xiu, he shot it out.","Fourteen times the speed of sound.","The old locust tree’s defenses were extremely high. This kind of creature all had similar characteristics, and that was they could withstand extremely strong attacks. In fact, it would not harm them much at all. The best method to deal with them was firstly, to cut them apart with a sharp weapon, and secondly, to burn them with raging flames.","However, the heavens were just. While they gave the Tree Men extremely high defenses, they also gave them the disadvantage of being slow.","Even if it was a thousand-year-old locust tree, its speed was not all that impressive. At the very least, it could not possibly dodge an attack at fourteen times the speed of sound.","Xiu, the Heavenly Pattern Jade shot over. The old locust tree could only form its branches into an arm to parry this incoming strike. Peng, peng, peng! However, it could not block it. One arm, two, three, it smashed a hole forcefully into over a dozen arms. Under the tremendous ripping power of the Heavenly Pattern Jade, it had even forcefully severed these “arms”.","Thanks to the obstruction of these “arms”, however, the momentum of the Heavenly Pattern Jade was finally used up.","The strength of the Tree Man’s defenses was clear for all to see.","Ling Han was also surprised. He had actually failed to kill him with a single strike?","Then let’s do it again. He charged out, using the Demonic Monkey Fists and the Frequency Attack with 70 overlapping layers of power.."]},{"number":3624,"title":"Chapter 3624: Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 3624: Deal","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","The old locust tree was indeed very strong. It was a creature of Wood Element, and its natural defenses were strong. Furthermore, it had lived for as long as a thousand years. Though it could not break through to Celestial Path, in Mystery Realm Tier, it should be considered top tier.","in front of it, to say nothing of one-star geniuses, perhaps even two-star geniuses wouldn’t be able to get any advantage.","However, the problem was that Ling Han was a prodigy who had surpassed four stars.","Moreover, he had too many techniques. Heavenly Pattern Jade, Destructive Energy, Frequency Attack Attack, any one of them would be enough to elevate one’s battle prowess greatly.","Now, all of this was used by one person. How terrifying was that?","The old locust tree couldn’t hold on any longer, and broke into a run. On the treetop, those small squirrels were also squeaking, and some were even covering their eyes with their tiny paws.","This human was too terrifying. How could there be such a monster?","Shen Hanyun was also a little dazed. Ling Han had suddenly become so powerful, which was completely beyond his imagination.","However, his reaction was also very fast, and he immediately intercepted the great locust tree.","He definitely had to obtain the Thousand Year Tree Heart.","Shua, sword light swept past, and he went all out.","The old locust tree was clearly very afraid of Ling Han, and actually chose to take Shen Hanyun’s attack head-on. It was not willing to stop, and ran as fast as it could.","Pu the sword light slashed onto the old locust tree’s body. Its powerful defense was immediately displayed. This blow had left a deep mark on its body, but to its thick trunk, this deep mark was completely insignificant.","Shen Hanyun roared in fury, and slashed repeatedly with his sword, sending out a powerful attack.","“Leopard Stab!”","The Sword Qi shot out, and actually turned into a black panther that struck out at the old locust tree. However, after this strike was delivered, Shen Hanyun’s face had also become completely pale.","This move placed too much of a burden on him.","It should be known that even if he recovered to the cultivation level of Foundation Building Tier, he would only be able to use this attack a few times, what more when it was used in Mystery Realm Tier. This caused his internal organs to be boiling, and the pain was indescribable.","However, the might of this attack could not be underestimated either. The black panther was like a Primitive Age monster, and the impact actually cause the old locust tree to stumble and fall to the ground.","Ling Han caught up with him, and the Demonic Monkey Fists attacked him again.","However, this time, he didn’t use Destructive Energy.","This was already enough. Just how powerful were the repeated attacks compounded by 70 overlapping layers of power? With a single strike, the leaves of the old locust tree fell like rain, but of course, there were also fruits, which fell off one after another.","This was still quite dangerous, and possessed great destructive power. Even Ling Han had to dodge, not daring to take it head-on with his physique.","It really wasn’t worth it.","Shen Hanyun was not idle either. He continued to attack from the sidelines. With each sword strike, the might could not be underestimated, and caused considerable trouble for the great locust tree.","After several dozen moves, the large locust tree finally couldn’t hold on any longer, and was blasted into two halves.","“Zhil” The tree full of little squirrels instantly scrambled, and only after they had fled to a safe place did they turn around, glaring furiously at Ling Han and Shen Hanyun, especially that purple-coloured squirrel, whose facial expression was extraordinarily pronounced.","Shen Hanyun took a deep breath, and said, “Though I know that this is going too far, I still have to say, I need the Thousand Year Tree Heart!”","“You didn’t come for the Thousand Year Tree Heart, did you? Instead, you came for the Wood Crystal Element, right?” he paused for a moment before","continuing.","Ling Han nodded, “That’s right.”","“That makes things easier,” Shen Hanyun said. “I’ll use a Wood Element Crystal to trade with you.”","“En?” Ling Han was surprised. The other actually had a Wood Element Crystal?","Was this for real?","Shen Hanyun explained, “This is not the first time I have come to the Ironwood Forest. The last time I came, I had killed a great many Wood Element creatures, and gathered a considerable amount of essence of Wood. Added with the fact that I robbed others, there were a few people who had a considerable amount of essence of Wood on them, and I collected them all, which just happened to be enough to form a Wood Element Crystal.” Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “Fine, I’ll trade.","“However, I didn’t bring the Wood Element Crystal with me. You need to go back with me,” Shen Hanyun continued.","No matter what, a trip would not need a few months’ time, so it was still worth it.","“All right,” Ling Han said with a nod. If he went back on his word, he could still make Tang Yun’er appear. With the power of the Battle Armor, this little girl was capable of matching Foundation Building Tier elites.","Shen Hanyun was overjoyed, and hurriedly went to dig out the tree heart.","The thousand-year-old locust had boundless life force, and its tree heart also had powerful life energy. It was an extremely good tonic.","Of course, this could only nourish a mortal body. Otherwise, Shen Hanyun would definitely not be the only one who had set his eyes on the thousand-year-old locust tree.","They arrived at the outskirts of the forest, and after waiting for two days, the babies returned one after another. When they found out that Ling Han had quickly obtained a Wood Element Crystal, they were all very surprised.","This father of theirs was really too lucky, wasn’t he?","To be on the safe side, Ling Han had Sixth Baby stay in the forest to safeguard the essence of Wood, so that their trip would not be wasted, and their previous efforts would not be wasted.","One couldn’t be unguarded against others. In any case, Shen Hanyun couldn’t see Sixth Baby anyway, so it wouldn’t cause any awkwardness.","They left the Ironwood Forest, and headed towards Shen Hanyun’s hometown. Though Shen Hanyun was in the Foundation Building Tier, and had extraordinary battle prowess, he kept a very low profile, and was not very well-known.","His hometown was Zhang Clan Town, and the reason why he had done everything he could to obtain the Thousand Year Tree Heart was so that he could save someone.","“A woman?” Tang Yun’er immediately asked. She was a mischievous child. -She had been released by Ling Han when Shen Hanyun was not paying attention, acting as if she had gone out to fight Wood Element creatures like the seven toddlers.","Shen Hanyun nodded. He was a little reticent, and did not like to talk.","“You like her?” the little girl asked again.","Shen Hanyun did not answer, but a gentle expression appeared on his face.","That must be the case.","Ling Han couldn’t help but look at him in a new light. He had never thought that this quiet person would actually have a gentle side to him.","After arriving at the Zhang Clan Town, Shen Hanyun brought them to an elegant courtyard.","“Fangyue! Fangyue!” Shen Hanyun called out, but no one answered.","This courtyard was only so big. Shen Hanyun searched through the rooms one by one, and his expression couldn’t help but become cold.","He had not found her.","“Brother Ling, this is your Wood Element Crystal.” He threw a green orb filled with life energy at Ling Han. This thing had been hidden in the courtyard all","this while.","Ling Han accepted it, but didn’t examine it closely. He put it away first, then said, “Go out and find someone to ask around.”","“M-hm,” Shen Hanyun replied with a nod. He was also flustered because this matter concerned him personally..","They asked the neighbors about the situation, and soon found out the whereabouts of that Miss Fangyue.","—She had gone to the Sunken Sand Valley.","Ling Han had initially thought that Miss Fangyue had been kidnapped by some evil tyrant. Afterward, it would be Shen Hanyun showing off his might, killing the evil tyrant, and rescuing his lover. He had never imagined that she would actually enter the Sunken Sand Valley on her own.","This place was very dangerous. There were many quicksand pits, and if one accidentally stepped on them, he would immediately sink in. The sand would cover him, and there was no way he could escape alive.","Thus, it was extremely dangerous for even Mystery Realm Tiers to enter.","They hurriedly rushed to the Sunken Sand Valley. With so many people, it would be easier to find her.","The location wasn’t far, and they arrived very quickly. Then, they moved separately. There were not many people here, so if they encountered a young girl, it would definitely be Zhao Fangyue, Miss Zhao.","Ling Han walked for a while, and soon saw a woman in green sitting on a rock ahead of him.."]},{"number":3625,"title":"Chapter 3625: Love triangle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3625: Love triangle","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Was this Zhao Fangyue, Miss Zhao?","Ung Han shouted, and as he gathered everyone over, he asked, “Miss Zhao?”","The woman turned around, revealing an exquisite face. However, it was a little too pale, without a trace of blood.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “I am Shen Hanyun’s friend. He has already obtained the Thousand Year Tree Heart. Your illness can be cured, and there is no need for you to have any lingering thoughts of death.”","Unexpectedly, this Miss Zhao actually did not have the slightest bit of joy. She merely cast a cold look at Ling Han, and then turned her face away, staring dumbly ahead of her.","Yi, could it be that it was the brain that had been injured?","Ling Han stroked his chin, appearing slightly surprised. There was something off with this reaction. Shouldn’t she be extremely happy now that she knew that her illness could be cured?","Was there something that he didn’t know?","Ling Han didn’t say anything either. In any case, the signal had already been sent, so he could just wait for Shen Hanyun to come.","In a short while, a figure flew over.","Ling Han was filled with envy. Foundation Building Tier cultivators could soar through the air, and this unrestrained and free feeling made his heart itch endlessly.","Fortunately, he wasn’t far from reaching the Foundation Building Tier. “Fangyue!” Shen Hanyun descended, and an expression of relief appeared on his face. He quickly walked over, and said softly, “The mountain winds here are strong, and you are not in good health. It would be best for you to return quickly.”","“Shen Hanyun, how many times have I told you? Don’t interfere with my matters!” Zhao Fangyue said coldly.","This was definitely not the tone that a lover would speak with.","Ling Han was astonished, yet he didn’t say anything. He had only come to collect the Wood Element Crystal, so he didn’t need to be concerned about other matters.","After a while, the little loli and the six babies also ran over.","“What’s going on?” Tang Yun’er’s expression was filled with curiosity. Her gossipy nature was clearly already burning fiercely.","Just how young was she? You already have the potential to become a chatterbox?","“See for yourself,” Ling Han said in a low voice.","On the other side, Shen Hanyun was coaxing Zhao Fangyue, but Zhao Fangyue wouldn’t listen no matter what. Instead, her attitude became worse and worse, almost chasing him away with a sword.","“AU right, I’ll leave. Don’t get agitated.” Shen Hanyun compromised. He took out the thousand-year Tree Heart, which was stored in a jade box, “This is a thousand-year Tree Heart, which can treat your chronic illness. I’ll leave it here.”","With that said, he signalled Ling Han and the others with his eyes, and left quietly.","Ling Han, Tang Yun’er, and the others were all a little stunned, but did not ask Instead, they followed him out of the valley. When they had exited the valley, Shen Hanyun took the initiative to explain.","It was a fact that he liked Zhao Fangyue, but that Miss Zhao did not like him.","A few years ago, before Shen Hanyue had even advanced into the Foundation Building Tier, he had travelled the world with his sword, and coincidentally encountered Zhao Fangyue and another man, Ma Teng. They felt like old friends at first sight, and very soon, they became good friends.","A melodramatic plot developed.. He and Ma Teng had both fallen in love with Zhao Fangyue, and Zhao Fangyue was in love with Ma Teng. However, this did not ruin the friendship between the three of them, and they continued to adventure and ajourney together.","Not too long after, a disease erupted in Zhao Fangyue’s body, and Shen Hanyun and Ma Teng went all over the world to find Spiritual Herbs for her.","They had heard that there might be a thousand-year-old treasured ginseng in the Sunken Sand Valley, so they had come to try their luck. In the end, their luck was ridiculously bad. Not only had they not obtained the thousand-year-old treasured ginseng, but Ma Teng had instead sunk into the quicksand, and his life force had been swallowed.","After this matter, Zhao Fangyue settled down in the vicinity of the Sunken Sand Valley, commemorating her beloved. Meanwhile, Shen Hanyun was still searching for treasured medicines everywhere, which led to the matter of entering the Ironwood Forest twice.","“So you have a one-sided love,” Tang Yun’er said frankly.","This damn child, did she even know how to speak properly? Weren’t you just rubbing salt into his wounds?","Ling Han hurriedly pulled the little loli over, laughed loudly, and asked,","“Brother Shen, what do you plan to do next?”","Shen Hanyun was a little dazed. Previously, he only had one goal in his life, and that was to find the Spiritual Herb and save Zhao Fangyue. Now that this goal was accomplished, there was only emptiness left in his heart.","She didn’t love him, so there was no way that she would be with him.","He was speechless. After a while, his eyes gradually became firm.","“I want to continue to travel the world, and become an outstanding swordsman,” he said.","This had always been his dream. It was only because of Zhao Fangyue’s sudden illness that he had been running around all these years. Now, he had finally let go of his romantic feelings, and regained his lofty aspirations.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He could clearly see that Shen Hanyun had not truly let go of Zhao Fangyue. It was only now that he needed another goal for himself to persevere. Otherwise, it was possible that he would become a walking corpse. “Brother Ling, how many Five Elements Crystals are you still missing?” Shen Hanyun suddenly asked.","Ling Han was a little surprised. ‘Why are you so concerned about this?’","However, he still answered, “Metal and Earth.”","Alright, I’ll help you gather these two types of essences first,” Shen Hanyun nodded.","“This makes me a little awkward,” Ling Han said with a smile. He naturally hoped that a powerful helper could shorten the time for him to obtain the Five Elements Crystals, but Shen Hanyun didn’t owe him anything now.","Shen Hanyun smiled, but his smile was completely devoid of humor, “I have nothing else to do now. Furthermore, I also need to change my mood.” He had not walked out of this unrequited romance, so he needed to do something else to divert his longing.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","Because Sixth Baby was still in Ironwood Forest, Ling Han found an excuse to split up with Shen Hanyun. They would meet back at the Golden Desert.","The Golden Desert was the land of Metal among the lands of Five Elements.","Ling Han and his group first arrived at the Ironwood Forest, and brought Sixth","Baby with them. Then, they flew towards the Golden Desert.","Fortunately, the little loli didn’t smash anyone this time. The two times previously had given Ling Han a psychological trauma.","Golden Desert did not mean that there was gold everywhere in the desert, but rather that the colour of this sand was the same as gold. At a glance, it seemed to be paved with golden sand, so bright that it could blind one’s eyes.","This desert was very large, and incredibly hot. There were very few plants that could grow and have live here. Thus, those who would come here were basically here for the essence of Metal. After collecting enough, they would be able to fuse it into a Metal Element Crystal.","Father, will you make us work for nothing again this time?” the babies all asked.","They had already wasted time twice in a row.","Ling Han didn’t know either. He stroked his chin, and said, “Probably not.”","His luck was not that good either, that he would always be able to get a fortuitous encounter.","“Alright, then we will trust Father again.” The babies nodded one after another.","They moved separately, and agreed to meet back here once every five days.","Ling Han still brought the problematic little loli with him as he walked into the desert. They had only taken a few steps, when they felt their mouths go dry. Not long after, a fire scorpion crawled out from a crack between the rocks and launched a sneak attack at Ling Han and Tang Yun’er.","The ending was naturally very tragic. It had been stomped to death by Ling Han.","Yet Ling Han gritted his teeth. This scorpion’s shell was so hard, that even his foot was slightly numb."]},{"number":3626,"title":"Chapter 3626: Legend of the Divine Temple","paragraphs":["Chapter 3626: Legend of the Divine Temple","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The outer shell of this scorpion was made of metal, so it was especially sturdy.","Even Ling Han felt his foot go numb.","The scorpion died, leaving behind a little bit of the essence of Metal.","That was a speck of golden sand, but it was much brighter than the sand in the desert. Even if it was thrown into the sand, it would still stand out like a swan in a flock of chickens, and was very conspicuous.","Ling Han put away this essence of Metal, and continued onwards.","He returned to an extremely boring life of fighting monsters. Every day, he would be searching for Metal Element creatures, killing them, and then obtain the essence of Metal, working hard for the sake of becoming stronger in future.","In the blink of an eye, ten days had passed.","Ling Han’s cultivation progress was very fast. He encountered another node, and after crossing over, he opened another nine apertures.","Now, the number of apertures he had opened had reached 72.","In truth, most people broke through to Mystery Realm Tier in the second stage. Those who broke through in the first stage and the third stage belonged to the minority, and those who could open the Hidden Apertures were even rarer.","“The progress is a little slow. If that’s the case, when I concoct the Five","Elements Karmic Pill, I probably would not have cultivated Mystery Realm Tier","to the pinnacle level yet.”","In reality, it wasn’t that Ling Han’s cultivation speed was slow, but rather that he was obtaining the Five Elements Crystals too quickly. One had to realize that it would take at least several hundred years for ordinary people to gather the Five Elements Crystals with their own efforts.","And as for him?","It hadn’t even been half a year, and he already had three Five Elements Crystals in his hands. With such a comparison, his cultivation speed naturally seemed slow.","This was really a happy and annoying feeling.","Several days later, he encountered a group of people who were also gathering the essence of Metal. At first, he had been eating, but these people demanded that he hand over the essence of Metal as soon as they came up. Ling Han naturally would not be reserved. Instead, he robbed them completely, and even learned of a legend from their mouths.","“In the depths of the golden desert, there is a Divine Temple, and there is a supreme great opportunity hidden within.”","These people were professionals in collecting the essence of Metal, because there would always be forces that wanted to concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill for the sake of their descendants. In the various locations of the Five Elements, it was very easy to encounter people who collected the essence of the Five Elements.","This time, the essence of Metal that they had obtained had all been sold to the Pang Clan. Furthermore, they still had another goal, and that was to find that Divine Temple, and from then onwards, cast off their lowly status, and rise above others.","However, the Divine Temple only existed in legends. Some people swore that they had seen it, but even more people had never seen it before.","Moreover, everyone knew that signs of mirages could appear in the desert. Who knew what those people were looking at?","In this group, there was one person who claimed to have seen that Divine Temple, and it was also because of his insistence that everyone kept chasing after that Divine Temple ambitiously, though they had already spent more than thirty years here.","Ling Han only listened for the moment. His main target was naturally the Five Elements Karmic Pill. He wanted to perfect his foundations and advance to the peak of martial arts.","He spared these people, and continued to eat.","The little loli was curious, and asked, “Ling Han, do you think we’ll find the Divine Temple?”","“Rumors spread easily. The trustability for this matter can’t exceed 10%,” Ling Han said.","“Yi, Handsome Brother, you are really too lacking in optimism.” Tang Yun’er shook her head, “You should believe that with me here, your luck will definitely be heaven-defying.”","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “Just like how you’ve hit people a few times?” Tang Yun’er was instantly embarrassed. Then, she argued, “Do you know the law of conservation of luck? If you’re too lucky, it’s inevitable that you’ll have some bad luck. That’s how you can be so lucky again.”","“Hehe.”","Somewhere in the desert.","“Your Imperial Highness, we have already searched here for several dozen days, and have almost used up all the water and food. Should we leave for now, and go out to replenish our supplies first?” An old man in grey robes asked respectfully.","There were a total of eight of them, and they were all wearing cloaks on their heads, appearing very mysterious. However, they were presently eating, so they still showed their faces.","There was a young man and seven old men. The young man looked to be in his twenties, and had a sturdy build. He had broad eyebrows and bright eyes. Though he was only sitting there, he had a captivating aura. The seven old men all had different appearances, but they were all led by the young man, appearing to be very reverent.","Because this young man was the heir of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, his status was astonishing.","On the surface, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was a Sect Master Tier-level force, but there was still an old Venerate Tier overseeing it. Thus, the Majestic Empire was able to rule over a galaxy, and the force was astonishingly large. Furthermore, such a large force was also extremely careful in selecting heirs.","In order to ensure that their leader was definitely the most outstanding, every member of the Imperial Family, after showing enough natural talent, could become an Imperial Prince. However, once their cultivation level could not keep up, or if they had made some great mistake, their title as an Imperial Prince would be revoked, and they would never be able to become an Imperial Prince again.","Thus, there were around a hundred heirs to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, and their ages varied. There were old heirs that were over a thousand years old, and there were also those like this young man, who were only in their twenties.","His name was Meng Yangcheng, and he was currently ranked 97th among the Imperial Princes. This was a very low ranking, but taking into account his age, it could be said that his future was limitless.","“That’s right, Your Imperial Highness. The Divine Temple is only hearsay, so who knows if it exists or not.” Another old man advised, “Your Imperial Highness, you are too precious, so why don’t you have us search for it in your place? If we really discover the Divine Temple, it would not be too late to inform Your Imperial Highness.”","Meng Yangcheng humphed, and said, “What do you guys know? At that time, the Divine Temple retreated into the Golden Desert on its own volition. After so many years, it has only been witnessed by a limited number of people. That is because it itself is active! By the time you guys inform me, it would already be too late.”","The seven old men were all surprised. Could it be that the legend of the Divine Temple was actually true?","Meng Yangcheng opened his mouth, and did not plan to stop talking. He continued, “30,000 years ago, the Buddhist Race wanted to teach Dao here, and our Empire naturally would not allow that. The Buddhist Race specializes in bewitching people. If everyone became their believer, would this galaxy still be ruled by the surname of Meng?”","“Great Ancestor Emperor mobilized all the elites to engage in a fierce war with the Buddhist Race. Though we successfully defeated them, we could not completely destroy them. The surviving dregs steered the Divine Temple and entered into the Golden Desert.”","“The so-called Divine Temple is their means of traversing the galaxy. In itself, it is a powerful Spirit Tool. However, the Great Ancestor Emperor has confirmed that even if the surviving dregs have fled into the desert, they are all severely injured, and would soon die completely.”","“However, it was also because of that battle that the Great Ancestor Emperor was severely injured, so he could only pass on the throne and enter seclusion to heal his injuries.”","“Otherwise, with this invasion of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, we wouldn’t be in such a passive situation, losing a considerable number of resources!”","Meng Yangcheng said, his expression slightly dark.","The seven elders didn’t dare to reply, and they were internally stunned. As it turned out, the legend of the Divine Temple was not only true, but also involved the Great Ancestor Emperor, who was also that Venerate Tier.","And if Ling Han were here, he would be able to deduce some things.","For example, why didn’t the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire send someone to the Celestial Sea Planet to take a look at the formation seals—they were being invaded by another Majestic Empire, and were currently in a terrible state. How could they have the energy to care about a prison?"]},{"number":3627,"title":"Chapter 3627: Discovered","paragraphs":["Chapter 3627: Discovered","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Your Imperial Highness, since the Divine Temple is left behind by dregs of the Buddhist Race, if you insist on searching for it, it would be extremely disadvantageous for Your Imperial Highness if it is reported by the other Imperial Princes,” an elder advised.","Meng Yangcheng smiled faintly, “If I can find the Divine Temple, that would be a great merit.”","The seven old men all looked curious, but Meng Yangcheng didn’t explain further.","Because in the Divine Temple, there was the inheritance of the Buddhist Race, and what kind of existence was the Buddhist Race?","In the past, there had been an Ancestral King, and he had ruled over an era. Just how astonishing was the inheritance of the Buddhist Race? Even if the inheritance in the Divine Temple was definitely not complete, and there was only a portion, it was still enough to tempt even Saints.","In the past, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had strictly sealed off the news, because they did not want to alert the Saints. However, the old Emperor was severely injured, and was unable to suppress the heaven and earth of the Golden Desert. He could only look on helplessly, and let things drag out until now.","Meng Yangcheng was extremely confident. He would definitely be able to find the Divine Temple, because no one knew that he had even secretly learnt the Buddhist Race’s cultivation technique. Though it was only superficial, after entering into the Golden Desert, the cultivation technique and the Divine Temple would resonate.","Thus, he would definitely be able to find it.","Ling Han fought monsters every day, being blown by the strong winds, and being assailed by yellow sand. After more than a month, it was as if he had become a completely different person. With a casual jump, he could shake off 1kg of sand from himself.","He was already numb, and practically wanted to throw up.","Thankfully, the amount of essence of Metal in his possession was also steadily increasing. He was sure that with another half a month’s time, he would be able to fuse the Metal Element Crystal..","“At least for the next ten years, I’ll stay away from deserts.”","After such a long time, Ling Han opened another 18 apertures, and the total number had reached as many as 90.","“Yi, Handsome Brother, are my eyes playing tricks on me, or is there really a temple ahead?” Tang Yun’er suddenly said.","Ling Han was walking like a walking corpse, and when he heard this, he raised his head, only to see that a grand temple with golden walls had really appeared ahead of him. It was incredibly majestic.","He glanced at it, and was still numb. “Just a mirage, ignore it.”","“But it looks quite real,” Tang Yun’er said.","“Heh.” Ling Han didn’t react at all.","“Let’s go!” The little loli pulled Ling Han and walked towards the large temple.","However, even though the large temple was just ahead of them, after walking for less than half a day, they did not see it coming any closer at all.","“Is it really a desert mirage?” The little loli was bored out of her mind, “I’m about to die from fury, I’m done playing!” She wormed into the Essence Nurturing Gourd. Though the space inside would also be affected by the outside world, and would be a little hot and dry, it was many times better than the outside world.","Ling Han didn’t react at all. Now, he would only erupt with killing intent when he encountered Metal Element creatures.","“An... ma...”","All of a sudden, a sound rang out by Ling Han’s ear, reaching directly into his divine sense. It was like a loud and sobering bell, causing him to immediately awaken from his muddleheaded state.","This was a Buddhist chant.","Ling Han’s feet paused, and he looked ahead. Involuntarily, he couldn’t help but look stunned. Could it be that this wasn’t a desert mirage, but a real large temple?","The legendary Divine Temple?","No way, what kind of luck did he have? This was his first time entering into the Golden Desert, and it had only been a little over a month, and he had actually encountered a Divine Temple that a great many people would never be able to encounter in their whole lives?","If they had only seen it with their eyes, it could still be a desert mirage, but if they heard the chanting in their ears, it would be a different story.","Ling Han used the Imminent Skyline Technique, but after his figure moved, he discovered that not only had the distance between him and the Divine Temple not shortened, it had instead become larger.","What the hell was this?","He activated his eye technique and carefully observed the surroundings. He couldn’t help but give an ‘oh’.","That was indeed a Divine Temple, but under the refraction of light, and added with the fact that theDivine Temple itself was somewhat mysterious, it caused an illusion to appear.","If they were aiming for the Divine Temple, they would never be able to reach it in this lifetime.","“What the Buddhist Race often talks about is that the sea of suffering is boundless, and it is difficult to cross to the other shore.”","“Now, this desert is a sea of suffering, and the Divine Temple is the other shore. How am I supposed to cross it?”","Ling Han’s eyeslit up. If it were anyone else, they really wouldn’t be able to do anything. However, he was different. Not only had he obtained an eye technique, but he was also a Grandmaster of formations, and using the two together, Ling Han could unravel the power of heaven and earth.","He began to move. He was no longer walking in a straight line, but was instead continuously changing the direction of his advance.","The Divine Temple was gradually approaching, and the sound of Buddhist chants was getting louder and louder. In fact, one could even see multiple Buddhas appear on the Divine Temple, casting amazing techniques that could redeem the world and expiate the dead.","After walking for a whole half an hour, Ling Han finally arrived in front of the Divine Temple.","It was clear that this Divine Temple was only 300 meters tall, but Ling Han felt like he was incomparably tiny as he stood underneath the Divine Temple. This Divine Temple seemed to be the center of the universe, indescribably majestic.","He could see very clearly that on the murals of the Divine Temple, there were multiple Arhats of Fury, as well as Bodhisattvas with dignified appearances, and there were also smiling Buddhas.","“Hmm?”","Ling Han suddenly turned his head, and saw that there was a group of eight people approaching from behind.","Strange, there was actually someone that could come here?","They also have an eye technique, and they have also mastered formation techniques?","However, Ling Han didn’t know that Meng Yangcheng was even more stunned than Ling Han.","He had relied on the Buddhist Race’s cultivation technique to resonate with the Divine Temple, and only then was he able to avoid being confused and come here. However, what did Ling Han rely on?","“Who are you?” Meng Yangcheng asked. His tone was calm, but his words had the arrogance of a command. It could not be helped. His identity was clear for all to see.","Ling Han merely smiled faintly. Did he need to pay him any heed? Did he need to care?","“My lord is asking you a question!” an elder immediately rebuked.","Ling Han still didn’t answer. He only showed his fists. The attitudes of these people made him extremely displeased. Thus, if you don’t like it, come fight me.","“The matter of the Divine Temple is very important.” Meng Yangcheng thought for a moment, “Kill him, kill him to keep the secret.”","“Yes, Your Imperial Highness!” The seven old men all obeyed solemnly.","Yi, Your Imperial Highness?","There was only one Majestic Empire on the Moonlight Planet. Was this guy the Imperial Prince of the Azure Dragon Empire?","An old man leaped out, and charged towards Ling Han. The other old men were all watching, obviously filled with confidence in that person.","Ling Han’s killing intent also rose. ‘You guys want to kill me? Then I’ll kill you guys first.’","He directly used his body as a weapon, and crashed towards that old man.","Peng!","Ling Han was like a cannonball, completely ignoring the old man’s defenses as he forcefully crashed into his arms. Then, the old man screamed in pain as his body was sent flying, falling onto the ground on his behind.","Meng Yangcheng and the others were shocked, because the old man’s chest had suddenly caved in, as if there was a washbasin embedded in it.","This was too terrifying, wasn’t it? With just a crash, he had injured a Celestial Path elite to this extent?","Of course, this place had a suppression effect on cultivation level, but this was still an extremely terrifying thing.","“Attack together!” The remaining six elders all paled in shock, and hurriedly charged out."]},{"number":3628,"title":"Chapter 3628: Combined Formation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3628: Combined Formation","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, what use was this?","Ling Han charged over, unleashing a murderous aura. The six elders were all affected, and they all wore dazed expressions.","“Humph!” Meng Yangchengmoved, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Ling Han threw a punch to block this attack. This naturally had an effect on his attack. Another punch shot out, and though it sent the six old men flying, it ultimately did not cause any damage.","“I never thought that your battle prowess would actually be so astonishing!” Meng Yangcheng humphed, his face filled with wariness.","In the outside world, he could easily stomp Ling Han to death. However, in this place, where his cultivation level was limited, he could only unleash the battle prowess of a Mystery Realm Tier. He didn’t have the slightest bit of confidence.","Ling Han didn’t reply, instead replying with a powerful attack.","He would never show mercy to those who were bore him malicious intent.","Meng Yangcheng no longer sat by and watched, and also joined the battle. Furthermore, he was the main force. He took out a sword. The green blade exuded a terrifying murderous aura, possessing an indescribable might.","This was the precious treasure of the Azure Dragon Empire, the Azure Dragon Sword... a replica of the Azure Dragon Sword. It belonged to the category of standard Spirit Tool, and would be equipped by the majority of heirs.","Even though it was a replica, it was far more powerful than a Spirit Tool of the same level.","Shua, the sword swept out, and the image of the Azure Dragon appeared. It bared its fangs and brandished its claws, its aura soaring to the heavens.","The six old men cooperated. They didn’t attack Ling Han, but rather walked with strange steps, supplementing surge after surge of power to Meng Yangcheng.","This was a formation?","Ling Han was surprised. This was really amazing. Combining the power of seven people together, and then unleashed by one person, the might was far stronger than the combined power of seven people.","The Azure Dragon roared as the Sword Qi slashed over.","‘Do you think I’m afraid of you?’","Ling Han humphed and threw a punch. 70 layers of power stacked together, and it was a Frequency Attack at that.","Peng, the force of the punch landed on the Sword Qi. The projection of the Azure Dragon trembled slightly, and instantly shattered.","“What!” Meng Yangcheng’s expression changed drastically. The seven of them working together were actually still unable to suppress Ling Han. Just how freakish was this guy’s battle prowess?","Two-star genius... or even three-star genius?","If he had known that Ling Han was only an Enlightenment Tier, he would definitely have guessed that Ling Han was a four-star genius, or even five-star genius!","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and blasted the Demonic Monkey Fists towards Meng Yangcheng.","“You are too arrogant!” Meng Yangcheng exclaimed lightly. His present battle prowess was not inferior to Ling Han.","Hong, his right hand shot out Sword Qi, while his left hand formed into a palm, and struck out repeatedly at Ling Han.","The two of them exchanged blows. After obtaining the power boost from the six people, Meng Yangcheng’s power was actually far superior to Ling Han’s. However, Ling Han had grasped Frequency Attack, and could attack the strong while he himself was weak, but was not the slightest bit weaker.","At this moment, the two of them were in a deadlock.","Actually, it was very simple to defeat Meng Yangcheng. As long as he killed those six old men, he would no longer have the power boost, and his battle prowess would naturally decline.","However, Meng Yangcheng obviously knew this as well. He protected the six old men very well. This was a little like an eagle catching chicks. Ling Han was an eagle, the six old men were chicks, and Meng Yang Cheng was the mother of the chicks.","This scene was very funny. If the little loli appeared at this time, her eyes would definitely light up and say that she wanted to play with them.","Meng Yangcheng was also speechless, and even a little embarrassed.","He was the heir of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, and his status was extremely high. However, a mere Mystery Realm Tier was actually capable of fighting him to a tie, which made him feel humiliated.","Thankfully, there were not many people here that could get close, so there was no need to worry that this matter would be exposed.","His killing intent grew even stronger. This Ling Han was so strong, yet he was still able to come here, which made him see him as a great threat.","Could it be that this was a member of the Buddhist Race that was competing with him for the great opportunity?","“Die!” he shouted loudly. He suddenly took a deep breath, and it was as if his whole person had been blown up. He actually swelled up, and turned into a giant that was as tall as thirty meters.","Boom, he delivered another strike, and Sword Qi that was as thick as a great tree slashed over, its might skyrocketing.","Yi, what secret technique was this?","Meng Yangcheng’s battle prowess increased explosively, but the six old men all looked ashen, their vitality greatly depleted.","They all complained incessantly, because to use such a powerful move, they would have to extract the power of seven people, and only then would they barely be able to do so. But now that one person was gone, the burden on each of them would be greatly increased, so they naturally could not bear it.","But there was nothing that could be done. Meng Yangcheng was completely the core of this secret technique, and he had the complete initiative. As long as he did not stop, the six of them would only be continuously absorbed.","Thus, they only had one thought, and that was Meng Yangcheng had to kill Ling Han as soon as possible. Otherwise, they would be in deep trouble.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Meng Yangcheng was incomparably fierce. After enlarging, his power increased greatly. Even Ling Han’s Frequency Attack couldn’t completely dissipate his offensive.","He had completely taken the initiative, his sword and palm extremely domineering.","Ling Han was completely capable of stalling for time. Behind this kind of strength, he would definitely be killing the goose that lay the golden egg, the six old men. However, how could someone like him be willing to use this kind of method to win?","How could it be that he could not win in a head-on confrontation?","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and the barrage of murderous aura surged towards Meng Yangcheng.","Even in his current state, Meng Yangcheng was still affected, and paused slightly. However, it was only for an instant. He immediately recovered, but it was inevitable that a flaw had appeared.","‘Come!’","Ling Han used the Three Styles of the God of War. Instantly, it was as if the heaven and earth were centered around him, and boundless energy converged.","He shot out a palm strike, and energy surged out.","Meng Yangcheng revealed an expression of fear, but there was already no way for him to dodge. He could only grit his teeth and face Ling Han head-on. Boom!","He and Ling Han clashed in close-quarter combat, and felt Ling Han’s power surge towards him in an extremely terrifying manner.","He had finally withstood this attack, but he was immediately shocked, because Ling Han had delivered a second attack.","How was this possible?","How could he use such a violent attack twice in a row?","‘Is your power unlimited? Is your body forged from Divine Metal? Aren’t you afraid of shattering?’","There was nothing else that could be done. He could only grit his teeth and continue the barrage. With a bang, he felt like his body was about to collapse, and the six old men behind him all spat out blood. They were one and the same, and a loss to one would mean a loss to all of them.","However, this was not the end.","The Three Styles of the God of War naturally had a total of three moves.","Ling Han gave a loud shout, and delivered his third attack.","This time, he couldn’t withstand it.","Meng Yangcheng thought. He made a prompt decision, cutting his losses and directly dispersing this impact, allowing the six old men behind him to bear it.","He was the core of this formation, and also the guide. Of course, he could do this.","Peng!","The surging power surged past, and the expressions of the six old men changed drastically. This was a destructive power.","“Your Imperial Highness!” They released cries of despair, but Meng Yangcheng completely ignored them.","Peng, peng, peng, peng! The six of them were all shattered by the terrifying power.","“Pu—” Meng Yangcheng also spat out a mouthful of blood. He no longer wanted to continue fighting, and turned around and left.","Ling Han chased after him for a few steps, and felt his chest boil violently. He stopped, and did not pursue him any further."]},{"number":3629,"title":"Chapter 3629: Six Characters Bright King Curse","paragraphs":["Chapter 3629: Six Characters Bright King Curse","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The might of the Three Styles of the God of War was too strong, but precisely because of this, the burden on Ling Han was also incredibly great. Previously, he had only used it once, and had not used it again.","Even if he was already an Enlightenment Tier, it was still a great pressure for him to use.","It was only after a few breaths that Ling Han’s blood and Qi calmed down. His physique was too tough, and after a few moments of rest, he had more or less recovered. However, he was still unable to immediately channel the Three Styles of the God of War. That would be asking for his own suffering, or even courting death.","At this time, Meng Yangcheng had already disappeared, so Ling Han didn’t pursue him. Even if he used the Imminent Skyline, it was useless. With Meng Yangcheng’s intelligence, he probably wouldn’t walk a straight line.","Ling Han let the little loli out.","“Yi, the Divine Temple?” Tang Yun’er was surprised. Then, she pointed at Ling Han, “Damn Handsome Brother, didn’t you say that was a desert mirage?”","‘Tve already brought you in, so why are you complaining so much?” Ling Han said with a smile.","The little loli pouted, but she was immediately attracted by the Divine Temple. Let s go, let’s go in and take a look. I’m so curious!”","Ling Han was also slightly curious, and the two of them walked towards the door.","The large temple was incredibly majestic, its golden walls brilliant, but it was obvious that it had suffered great damage. There were multiple cracks on the walls. Some seemed to be sword marks, some were saber marks, and some seemed to have been clawed out with bare hands.","If Meng Yangcheng was here, he would know that these marks of damage were left behind by the great battle all those years ago.","Tens of thousands of years ago, the Buddhist Race had used this temple as a stronghold to advance all the way, and only when the old Emperor moved was their advance stopped.","The doors to the Divine Temple were closed, but the doors themselves had been damaged, revealing a massive hole that they could easily worm through. The two of them entered, “An... Ma... Ni...?” The chanting sounded again.","“Yi, this is the Six Figures Bright King Curse!” The little loli immediately called out, her face filled with shock.","“What Bright King Curse, Ghost King Curse?” Ling Han grabbed the little loli. “This is one of the ultimate techniques of the Buddhist Race. The Nine Figures of Truth are capable of suppressing all enemies in the world, while the Six Characters Bright King Curse is capable of eliminating evil and enlightening the mind.” The little loli chattered, like a little sparrow, “You have to know that the Buddhist Race is most skilled in dealing with ghosts and evil beasts. Furthermore, they are also very skilled in eliminating internal demons.”","“If you learn this Six Characters Bright King Curse, you basically won’t have to worry about being disturbed by evil beasts in the future, and you won’t have to worry about having internal demons either.”","“Sh*tty Handsome Brother, do you know that after advancing into Celestial Path, every increase in cultivation level would mean being disturbed by an internal demon? Heavenly Dao tests the heart, and there is a possibility of becoming a demon at the slightest provocation?”","“However, if you have learnt the Six Figures Bright King Curse, the chances of becoming a demon will be ninety percent lesser!”","“In this world, who knows how many people want to learn the Six Characters Bright King Curse.”","Only then did Ling Han’s heart stir, and he said, “Isn’t that simple? Wouldn’t it be fine if we just listened for a while?”","The little loli rolled her eyes, “The six words are ‘An’, ‘Ma’, ‘Ni’, ‘Pei’, Mi’, and ’Ku’. Everyone knows this, but to simply say that these six words are the Bright King Curse, that would be too easy, wouldn’t it?”","There’s a secret to this, and it also requires a combination of Buddhist cultivation techniques.”","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’, “That so-called Imperial Highness should also have come for the Six Characters Bright King Curse, so this place should have the inheritance of the Buddhist Race.”","“Let’s hurry up and find it,” the little loli said excitedly. “If I can learn it, then Maternal Grandfather, Paternal Grandfather and the others will definitely praise me!”","Ling Han nodded. He had never been one to enjoy the benefits alone. Since the little loli could also come here, it meant that she was fated with Buddhism... en, he was already beginning to imagine how the little loli would look like if she shaved her head.","The temple was not dark. There were multiple stone Buddhas inside, and every Buddha was glowing, their postures different.","The two of them arrived at the end of the temple, and saw that there was a giant Buddha sitting there. It was as tall as thirty meters, and had a crystalline golden body. It looked majestic, and the sound of chanting was precisely coming from here. It could be claimed to be a divine miracle.","In front of the giant Buddha, there were twelve mats, which were divided into two rows, one in front and one at the back, and there were six mats in each row.","And now, there were five people sitting cross-legged on these twelve mats. Some were tall, some were short, and the shortest was only the size of a thumb, while the tallest was like a meter tall Guardian Deity.","Ling Han had already examined them with his eye technique. These five people were all corpses, but although they were dead, they still had a kind of might. They should have been very powerful when they were alive.","These five people were all dressed in Buddhist robes, and should be people from the Buddhist Race.","The Buddhist Race was a general name. As long as one believed in Buddhism, they could be called a member of the Buddhist Race. Thus, these five people ’ clearly came from different races, yet could belong to the Buddhist Race.","These five people were definitely not Saints. Though there was still lingering power after their deaths, it was not so strong that they could not be approached. Ling Han circled around the five of them once, and discovered that there were obvious injuries on their bodies. Their religious robes had been pierced, and they were all fatally wounded.","So strange. They didn’t think of a way to treat their injuries, or find a place to rest in peace, but actually sat cross-legged on a mat?","“Where’s the inheritance? Where’s the inheritance?” The little loli spun around m circles. She didn’t have the slightest interest in dead people and the Buddha statue.","The two of them searched everywhere, but even after searching the entire temple, they did not find anything that looked like an inheritance.","“Sigh, what a waste of effort.” Tang Yun’er shrugged her shoulders, and said, “Perhaps these people knew that they would definitely die, so they destroyed the inheritance.”","This was indeed possible.","They were unwilling to give up. They searched for another day, but still came up empty-handed.","“The Divine Temple legends are all lies.” The little loli pouted. “It’s extremely immoral to lie to children!”","The two of them exited the Divine Temple. There was a small plaza outside, and there was a Bodhi Tree growing there. However, it had long since wilted, and there was even half of it missing, making for a very desolate sight.","The Bodhi Tree was the spiritual totem of the Buddhist Race. According to legends, the Buddhist Ancestor comprehended Dao underneath the Bodhi Tree.","A thought suddenly flashed through Ling Han’s mind. Could this Bodhi Tree be the true inheritance?","No one made it a rule that the inheritance had to be carried out inside the temple.","Ling Han walked over and began to study the Bodhi Tree.","“Handsome Brother, you’re really smart!” Tang Yun’er ran over as well. She naturally knew of the legend of the Bodhi Tree.","The two of them studied it together, but no matter how they observed, this was a dead Bodhi Tree.","“Let’s go.” Tang Yun’er was obviously an impatient person. Moreover, she was only a few years old.","“Don’t be impatient,” Ling Han said.","“Boring.” The little loli took out some candy and began licking it.","Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position. Since Buddha had comprehended Dao underneath the Bodhi Tree, would he be able to pass on the Dao of Buddha underneath the Bodhi Tree?","He sat down, but nothing happened.","There was no enlightenment, nor was there a harsh warning. There was nothing.","“Handsome Brother, don’t waste time,” the little loli said from the side.","“Let’s wait for a while longer,” Ling Han said.","The day passed, and night fell. The golden moon hung high in the sky, casting a gentle light.","The little loli had already fallen into a deep slumber. She had no worries, so she could naturally eat and sleep leisurely.","Was he really unable to obtain the inheritance?","Ling Han thought internally. He decided that if there was still no change by tomorrow morning, he would leave.","When the moon reached the middle of the sky, a sudden change took place.."]},{"number":3630,"title":"Chapter 3630: Technique taught with the leaves falling","paragraphs":["Chapter 3630: Technique taught with the leaves falling","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At first, the Bodhi Tree had already wilted, and in fact, even half of its crown had been sliced off. However, when the moon reached the middle of the sky, it began to regrow under the nourishment of the moonlight, and the crown that had disappeared reappeared.","“An... Ma... Ni... Ba... Mi... Gu...”","The Six Characters Bright King Curse sounded continuously. A breeze blew over, and the Bodhi Tree vibrated slightly. The leaves rustled, producing a pleasant sound.","Ling Han hurriedly patted the little loli’s head, waking her up.","“What are you doing? I want to sleep!” Tang Yun’er stretched lazily, her eyes hazy, her expression filled with bitterness and deep hatred.","What she hated the most was being woken up when she was sleeping soundly. She would be upset even if it was her own mother waking her up.","“Idiot, you don’t want the inheritance of the Buddhist Race?” Ling Han called out.","Ah! The little loli was quick-witted, and immediately lost her sleepiness.","Her eyes widened, and she naturally saw this amazing scene as well.","“Where’s the inheritance?” she asked.","“Don’t speak, just watch carefully.”","The Bodhi Tree swayed continuously, and after an unknown amount of time, a monk in a Buddhist robe suddenly appeared. He sat cross-legged under the Bodhi Tree, and his head was completely bald. However, there was actually a halo of light around him.","“Having sprouted a Buddhist ring, this is a great elite of the Buddhist Race!” The little loli knew what was what, and immediately whispered.","Is it that person?” Ling Han asked. He was naturally referring to the Ancestral Buddha, the Ancestral King who had founded the Buddhist Race’s territory, invincible in this world for an era.","The little loli shook her head, “Impossible. If Ancestral Buddha left a shadow, then his aura would be extremely terrifying. We couldn’t possibly be so close. This should be a Bodhisattva.”","According to the hierarchy of the Buddhist Race, Ancestral Buddha represented the Ancestral King, the Buddha represented the Saint, the Bodhisattva represented the Venerate Tier, and the Arhat represented the Sect Master, so this was a Venerate Tier.","Even on the Moonlight Planet, this was still a top-notch great elite.","Ling Han couldn’t help but widen his eyes in shock. Would this Bodhisattva teach him the Six Characters Bright King Curse?","However, what disappointed the two of them was that this monk was only sitting cross-legged and cultivating. What inheritance was there?","Had he waited for nothing again?","Ling Han was unwilling to give up. After a long while, xiu, a leaf fell.","The Bodhi Tree had long since withered to death, so how could it have leaves?","Ling Han stretched out a hand. Coincidentally, the tree leaf landed near him, and he easily caught it in his hand.","Instantly, an indescribable power surged violently inside Ling Han’s body, turning into a majestic voice that was chanting something. It seemed like a song, but also seemed like a chant.","Ling Han’s heart clenched. Could this be the inheritance of the Buddhist Race?","He hurriedly focused on capturing every single word, but they were extremely vague, and it was extremely difficult to capture them.","After half a day, he finally grasped one word — An.","An of the Six Characters Bright King Curse.","This was the Six Characters Bright King Curse?","Ling Han opened his mouth, “An!”","Boom! An indescribable power surged out, bright and clear, and thought-provoking. In fact, one could even see the glow of Buddha.","Ling, Ling Han, have you learnt the Six Characters Bright King Curse?” The little loll got a scare. Though she could also shout the word “An”, without a special cultivation technique to coordinate with it, this was only an ordinary word, and did not have any special effects.","Ling Han wanted to capture it again, but the leaf in his hand had already turned into shards of light, not leaving a single bit behind.","The power in his body disappeared, and the majestic voice also disappeared.","Ling Han was astonished. Had he really learnt a single word?","He recalled, and then came to a realization. As it turned out, the process of capturing sound was the process of cultivation. The fact that he could hear the word “an” meant that he had successfully grasped the cultivation technique. This kind of teaching was really amazing.","Ling Han explained to the little loli, making the little loli excited.","“Ling Han, the next leaf is mine!” she emphasized.","Ling Han chuckled before turning around to leave.","He also needed to stabilize himself. Though he could recite the word “An”, he was not very proficient, and needed to practice hard.","Furthermore, there were too many details that needed to be studied.","The little loli waited for the second leaf to fall, while Ling Han was perfecting his “An” chant.","However, Tang Yun’er waited for an entire night without any results. When the sun rose on the second day, the strange phenomenon disappeared, and the Bodhi Tree became wilted and shriveled again. What leaf was left?","“I’m about to die from fury. I didn’t sleep all night!” the little loli shouted in anger.","Meanwhile, Ling Han faced the rising sun and started to cultivate. He had to speed up his cultivation and advance into the Mystery Realm Tier as soon as possible.","Ling Han and Tang Yun’er naturally wouldn’t leave since they hadn’t obtained the Six Characters Bright King Curse yet. They would rest during the day, and wait for night to come for a fierce battle.","However, Ling Han only slept for four hours, and he was already energetic. He once again studied the “An” chant. Even though there was only one word, combined with the cultivation technique, there were all kinds of changes’.","It could suppress evil, it could clear one’s mind, and it was profound and deep. After a whole day, Ling Han couldn’t contain his joy. The Six Characters Bright King Curse was indeed worthy of being the ultimate technique of the Buddhist Race. Its significance was extremely great. Using it to shout at himself would allow his spirit to become even more stable.","This was natural. His own spirit was not stable enough, so how could he speak of suppressing evil and expelling the demons?","At night, the moon hung high in the sky, and the strange phenomenon reappeared. The Bodhi Tree shone brilliantly again, and all the wilted leaves instantly grew out, adorning the entire tree. Not long after, that Bodhisattva appeared again, comprehending Dao underneath the Bodhi Tree.","Because he had grasped an “An” character, he naturally understood a portion of dharma. Ling Han instantly saw through even more.","That Bodhisattva’s comprehension was not completely unchanged.","The leaves of the Bodhi Tree dimmed and glowed, and there was a mysterious rhythm to it.","He grasped this rhythm, and couldn’t help but immerse himself in it. Vaguely, he discovered that there was Buddhist chanting in his mind, which was thought-provoking, and made him acknowledge it from the spiritual level. He wanted to submit, and from now onwards, it was his duty to expiate evil.","Ling Han suddenly faltered, and couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat.","This Buddhist technique was too terrifying. He had only comprehended it for a short while, and he was actually immersed in it. His spirit was bewitched, and he wanted to convert into Buddhism.","Was this the power of the Ancestral King? This was practically besieging cities and plundering land without spilling blood. Once he unleashed his dharma, everyone under the heavens would be enlightened.","Ling Han hurriedly guarded his mind. He was only interested in the Six Characters Bright King Curse, but definitely did not want to become a member of the Buddhist Race, and be restricted by the rules of the Buddhist Race.","The night passed, and Ling Han’s understanding of the “An” character increased slightly. However, the little loli had waited for nothing the entire night, because no leaves of the Bodhi Tree had fallen at all. She was so angry that she directly jumped up, wanting to pluck it herself. In the end, a massive power descended, causing her to fall solidly.","Little Toffee, I think you’re destined to have no chance with Buddhism,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“I don’t believe it, I don’t believe it!” The little loli placed her hands on her hips, her face filled with fury.","Why was it that such a stupid uncle could learn it, but she, an intelligent child, couldn’t?","The two of them continued to stay here determinedly. At night, Ling Han grasped the rhythm of the Bodhi Tree leaves and comprehended their amazing techniques. Meanwhile, the little loli stared at the top of her head, waiting for the leaves to fall.."]},{"number":3631,"title":"Chapter 3631: Rolling Stone Wasteland","paragraphs":["Chapter 3631: Rolling Stone Wasteland","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Day after day, time passed very quickly.","After nine days, Ling Han had completely mastered the “An” chant. He opened his mouth to chant, and the sound of Buddha was vast and mighty. If one didn’t look at him, they would think that this was a bald monk.","Ling Han was very satisfied, but the little loli was depressed to the extreme. There was still no second leaf that fell from the tree.","Damn it, she was being bullied here.","However, by the tenth day, Ling Han still hadn’t been able to derive anything from the Bodhi Tree. Repeating it again and again, it was only the elaboration of the “An” chant.","This was an inheritance of only one character?","Ling Han pondered for a moment before coming to a sudden realization. The Bodhi Tree had already wilted and been destroyed, and the inheritance had also been destroyed. It was already extremely fortunate that he had been able to learn a complete “An” character.","He related this deduction to Tang Yun’er, and the little loli was naturally very disappointed.","“Handsome Brother, then pass it on to me,” she said.","Ling Han shook his head. It wasn’t that he didn’t want to teach her, but rather that he couldn’t.","Otherwise, the Buddhist Race didn’t need the Bodhi Inheritance or whatnot. Wouldn’t it be much simpler to just pass it on by word of mouth? You see, he had waited here for nine days, and only then did he learna single chant of An. This efficiency was really too low.","“Forget it, I’m not going to learn anymore.” Tang Yun’er was peeved, and she was extremely unhappy.","If it was any other adult, they would definitely continue to stay. Even if they only obtained the An character, it was a supreme secret technique.","But who asked this little loli to only be six or seven years old?","How could a six- or seven-year-old child consider so much? She would definitely be throwing a tantrum.","“You really don’t want to learn anymore?” Ling Han asked.","“No!” Tang Yun’er shook her head, her attitude resolute.","“If you don’t want to learn, then don’t.” Ling Han originally wanted her to stay here, while he himself went to get the essence of Metal. In any case, the little girl wouldn’t be of much help.","The two of them left, and began their journey of fighting monsters again.","A few days later, they reunited with the seven babies.","“Father, you’ve disappeared for several days. Did you have another fortuitous encounter? Did the essence of Metal we gathered go to waste again?” Fourth Baby asked.","Ling Han smiled and said, “How’s that possible? I did have a fortuitous encounter, but I didn’t obtain the Metal Element Crystal.”","He related the matter of obtaining the Six Characters Bright King Curse, which also surprised the babies.","“Father, could it be that you have the bloodline of the Buddhist Race?” Third Baby bit her finger and said. “Otherwise, why would the Bodhi Tree recognize you and cast down leaves?”","“Yi, is there something like that?”","Tang Yun’er’s eyes widened, and she instantly felt extremely displeased. As it turned out, she had really gone to all this trouble for nothing?","Ling Han shook his head. He definitely didn’t have any relationship with the baldies. Moreover, he said, “Isn’t the Buddhist Race a collective name? What bloodline would there be?”","“Father, you don’t know about this, do you?” Eldest Baby shook her head, “The Buddhist Race also has a bloodline, but it is not birthing children in the traditional sense, but rather there is speaking of reincarnation of the great elites of the Buddhist Race. Some infants are born proficient in Buddhism, and will definitely become great elites of the Buddhist Race.”","“Father, are you a reincarnated Buddha?” Second Baby stroked Ling Han’s head, and said, “Father, if you convert to Buddhist Race one day, you’ll lose your hair.”","“While it’s still here, let’s hurry up and look at it,” Fifth Baby said with a smile.","“En!” The other children nodded respectively.","Ling Han’s expression was dark, “I won’t become a monk!”","He had many wives and children, so how could he become a monk?","Tang Yun’er interjected in an untimely manner, “Actually, the Buddhist Race also has the branch of the Delightful Buddha. Marriage is not forbidden, and there is no need to cut your hair either.”","“Get lost,” Ling Han said in displeasure. ‘If you don’t speak, I won’t treat you as a mute.’","“Hahahaha!” The children and the little loli all laughed.","They continued to fight monsters, collecting the essence of Metal. Ling Han and Shen Hanyun met, and after another half a month, they finally gathered enough essence of Metal, fusing it into a Metal Element Crystal.","Finally, he was missing one out of five. He was close to completing his mission.","“Next stop, the Rolling Stone Wasteland!”","They set out, heading towards the last location of the Five Elements. This took some time, and after five days, they finally arrived at their destination.","Since it was a desolate plain, it was naturally a barren land. This place was covered with scorched earth, and there were few plants. However, thankfully, it was not as hot as the Golden Desert, and there were also rivers surging, so there was no need to worry about dying of thirst here.","Everyone still moved separately, and agreed to meet up once every five days. For example, if anyone’s luck was off the charts and directly collected the Earth Element Crystal, the mission would be completed.","However, after only two days, Ling Han began his seclusion.","He could break through again.","After cultivating in seclusion for half a day, Ling Han opened nine more apertures. Now, he was only nine aperture away from the end of the Enlightenment Tier. Of course, this didn’t take into account Hidden Apertures.","Tang Yun’er soon became bored. She hid into the gourd and snored loudly.","Ling Han was also very bored, but there was nothing he could do. This was for his own benefit.","He advanced, searching for Earth Element creatures.","There were many, all of them made up of round rocks. There were no joints at all, yet they could be attached together, which was very amazing. However, their strength was only so-so. With Ling Han’s current battle prowess, he could easily deal with them with a single finger.","Unless he encountered a Stone King, he would be able to sweep aside all obstacles with his eyes closed.","All of a sudden, goosebumps rose all over his body, and he felt a strong sense of danger assault him.","He suddenly turned around, only to see a person striding over from the front.","This was an energetic and handsome young man. His appearance was practically perfect, and there was not the slightest flaw to be found. He was dressed all in white, and carried a sword on his back. His black hair fell over his shoulders, glossy and ink blank.","What Ling Han cared about was naturally not his appearance, but rather the aura that this person was exuding.","It was as sharp as a sword, and incredibly terrifying.","This kind of aura was something that even Hong Tianbu couldn’t compare to. En, Hong Tianbu could only compare to him after he opened the Eye of the Primordial Beast.","“I’ve finally found you,” the person in white said with a smile.","Ling Han also smiled faintly, “I don’t think I recognize you. Thank you for your hard work. I’m really embarrassed.”","The white-robed person faltered, then laughed loudly, “You are more interesting than I had imagined.”","“I have always been a humorous person.” Ling Han shrugged.","Yet the white-robed man withdrew his smile, and said, “My name is He San.”","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’. What He San and He Si? He did not recognize them at all.","He San was surprised. The other party actually did not change at all after hearing his name? That’s right, this person definitely did not know his identity.","He did not explain either. There was no need to waste this time.","“I’ll kill you,” he said.","Ling Han nodded, “I don’t have any friends here either. You have especially come to find me, and I can also guess that you have come to kill me. Let me think. Firstly, the Pang and Lei Clans should not be able to get a prodigy like you to come here, and secondly, they too think that I am dead, and would not expend so much effort.”","He paused, then continued, “So, you should be one of His Imperial Highness’s men, right?”","He San smiled, “He is still unable to command me. However, an heir of our Empire was almost killed by you, and you ruined a great matter of his. Since I now know, I naturally have to make this trip.”","“You, commit suicide..”"]},{"number":3632,"title":"Chapter 3632: Battling He San","paragraphs":["Chapter 3632: Battling He San","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","‘Commit suicide.’","Ling Han felt as if he had heard many people say this before. He had always felt that it was very foolish.","Of course, when He San said this, he naturally did not think that he was an idiot. He was only showing off.","This person was qualified to show off.","Ling Han chuckled and said, “There are many people who want to kill me, but you see, I’m still alive and well. So, you still have to work hard.” “Cheeky mouth!” He San moved, and delivered a palm strike towards Ling Han.","Boom, with a palm strike, winds and clouds rose.","This was indeed a super genius. He himself should be a three-star genius. Furthermore, after advancing into the Celestial Path, he was now suppressed to Mystery Realm Tier. No matter what, he could still retain some battle prowess.","Thus, in the case of Mystery Realm Tier elites, He San could be considered a four-star genius.","This naturally couldn’t compare to Ling Han. He was a 4.5-star genius, or even close to five-star genius. However, his disadvantage was his cultivation level. After all, Ling Han was only at the Enlightenment Tier.","■Come, let’s battle it out then.’","Ling Han clenched a fist, and greeted He San’s attack.","Boom, their attacks clashed, and Ling Han couldn’t help but somersault, retreating continuously.","“Yi?” He San looked surprised, “You actually managed to block a palm strike","from me?”","With how prodigious he was, this attack should have easily killed Ling Han.","“NO wonder Meng Yangcheng was forced to flee by himself. You do indeed have some abilities.” He nodded, and gave Ling Han a considerably high assessment.","Meng Yangcheng?","That so-called Imperial Highness?","Ling Han stopped. At present, he was practically capable of sweeping aside all Mystery Realm Tiers, but against a three-star genius, it was still a bit difficult, what more when the present He San might not only be just a three-star genius.","He stretched his arms and legs, and said, “Aren’t you afraid of being attacked out of your wits by me?”","He San’s expression darkened, “To be able to survive a single move from me, you can indeed be proud, but to act arrogant in front of me, that is a great mistake!”","He moved again. This time, it was no longer a simple palm strike. Instead, he stimulated a high-level energy, which turned into a green light that blasted towards Ling Han.","Ling Han was unafraid as he approached. Though he was no match in terms of raw power, battle prowess was not completely dependent on power.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them continued to exchange blows. Ling Han first used the Lightning Fist, but he was completely outmatched by his opponent. Very soon, he was completely suppressed.","A Mystery Realm Tier who had the battle prowess of a four-star genius was nothing to joke about.","He San smirked coldly, “Nothing more than this!","Ling Han did not speak. In response, he used the Demonic Monkey Fists, instantly, his aura changed immediately, filled with ruthlessness. Even if the heavens wanted to suppress him, he would still be able to turn the heavens upside down with a single punch.","He San couldn’t help but feel shocked. It was as if he could see a Demonic Monkey from the ancient times wreaking havoc. That aura was enough to make him feel slightly apprehensive.","His eyes lit up. “Such a good fist technique would be too much of a waste on you!”","He also unleashed a technique, and it was as if he had transformed into a giant python that continued to entwine around Ling Han, yearning to kill him. This technique was actually inferior to the Demonic Monkey Fists, but there was no helping it. He San had the complete advantage in power, compensating for the inferiority of the technique itself, and had even turned the tables around to suppress Ling Han.","Ling Han’s expression was calm. He was still far from reaching the point of exhaustion.","70 overlapping layers of power, Frequency Attack...","He threw another punch, greeting He San’s entanglement.","Peng, He San was instantly sent backwards.","“Yi, you have actually grasped this kind of secret technique!” He San smiled instead, filled with emotion. The other’s power was much weaker than his, yet he had relied on a technique to make up for it.","He was overjoyed because he already saw the Demonic Monkey Fists as his","own.","He also used his ultimate technique. With a tap of his finger, boundless light shone, and even the sun seemed to have lost its brilliance.","Shattering Yang Finger!","Ling Han greeted the attack with the frequency of 70 overlapping layers of power, but with a single strike, he was forcefully sent backwards. He felt that even the bones in his fists were trembling, as if they were about to shatter.","Hiss, the power of this attack was really terrifying.","Ling Han’s bones had undergone seven temperings, and could be considered the strongest under Celestial Path, but a single strike almost broke his bones. The might of this Shattering Yang Finger could be considered terrifying.","However, He San was even more stunned than Ling Han. He naturally knew how powerful the Shattering Yang Finger was, but it actually only caused Ling Han’s fist to bleed, but did not shatter it.","What kind of f*cking bones do you have!","Again!","He tapped out another finger, and a brilliant light shone.","Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. Although his bones could withstand this attack, it would still cause him injury. He didn’t have a masochistic inclination. Thus, he unleashed a murderous aura attack.","So what if it was He San? He only felt an indescribable murderous aura grab at his heart, making it difficult for him to even breathe.","However, he was a three-star genius, after all, and had long since crossed over into Celestial Path. Immediately, his mind focused, and mystical power channelled through his body, expelling this fear from his body.","However, in this manner, it was inevitable that a flaw would appear in his attack. Ling Han caught hold of it, and not only did he dodge this blow from him, he even threw a punch back at him, forcing him to dodge, in this exchange... it could be said that the two of them were evenly matched.","He San’s expression was dark. Who was he?","As one of the top three prodigies in the younger generation of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire; he wasn’t someone that any random person could compare to at all.","He had actually been forced into a tie by an unknown person. How could he accept this?","He roared loudly, and his offensive became even more rapid.","He had grasped a great many amazing techniques, and channelled them out continuously, their might astonishing.","Ling Han mainly used his murderous aura and Demonic Monkey Fists to greet this attack, but He San was getting serious. After all, he had a major tier suppression in terms of cultivation level. This was a shortcoming that Ling Han couldn’t get around, causing Ling Han to completely fall into a disadvantage and be in a perilous situation.","in terms of battle prowess at the same cultivation level, the current He San was really not much inferior, so he naturally had the complete advantage.","“Die!” He San delivered a palm strike. Flames blazed, but they were dark blue in colour.","Ling Han instinctively felt a chill. This blue flame was a high-level energy, and had great destructive power. He could not take it head-on.","He retreated, but opened his mouth and spat out a golden sword.","“YP” He San had never imagined that Ling Han would have this move. He hurriedly tilted his head to dodge this blow, but the blade of the sword still sliced off a few strands of his hair.","His expression became increasingly livid. The dignified He San had actually lost a few strands of his hair to a nameless nobody?","“If you can survive, this will be enough to make your name resound throughout the world,” he said balefully, his killing intent even stronger.","This was a prodigy that could threaten him, and he had to be killed.","Ling Han smirked coldly. With a shake of his fists, he had already wrapped the Destructive Energy around himself.","Come, who would be afraid of whom?","Boom! He brandished his fists as he charged forward.","This time, it was He San’s turn to be stunned. He also instinctively felt a sense of danger. This black energy was filled with destructive power, and definitely could not be taken head-on.","He retreated, grabbing rapidly with both hands as he did so. How could a supreme prodigy simply take a beating without fighting back?","The air on either side of him was forcefully grabbed by him, forming an astonishing pressure, causing Ling Han’s figure to involuntarily slow down. In fact, the pressure was so great that his face was slightly pale.."]},{"number":3633,"title":"Chapter 3633 - Run","paragraphs":["Run","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He San smirked coldly. This was also a secret technique, and it was incredibly difficult to cultivate. Even if he publicized the secret scroll, there would not be more than three people that could grasp it.","He took advantage of the opening to counterattack, and shot out a kick, which turned into a powerful surge of Qi that looked like a True Dragon.","Ling Han shattered the air with his Destructive Energy, instantly regaining his freedom.","He activated the Eighteen Claws of the Golden Eagle, and his body soared into the sky like an eagle. Regardless of whether you were a primordial wild elephant or a wild bull, you were still only his hunting target.","He San was unafraid. The only thing that he didn’t dare to come into contact with was the Destructive Energy. So what if it was the Eighteen Claws of the Golden Eagle? He had a celestial technique that could rival it.","The two of them battled fiercely, and Ling Han was still at a disadvantage.","The suppression of the cultivation level of a major tier was really too helpless. And if anyone knew the true cultivation level of the two of them, they would definitely think that Ling Han had won.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, Ling Han was completely capable of beating He San up.","Unfortunately, how could there be a truly fair battle in this world?","If He San found out that Ling Han was actually only an Enlightenment Tier, his killing intent would definitely be even hotter, and he would kill Ling Han at all costs.","This kind of person was too freakish. Just being alive was enough to make one feel flustered. He was practically a nightmare for prodigies.","Ling Han had no choice but to admit that the other was indeed powerful. He was no match for him when he was at a cultivation level weaker than him by a major tier. However, how could he be someone who would give up so easily? His hands formed a strange pose.","Instantly, a frightening aura exuded from his body, as if he had suddenly become the centre of heaven and earth.","He San couldn’t help but feel shocked. Although Ling Han hadn’t made a move yet, he already felt a coldness as if a storm was about to come.","The impact of this one strike was bound to be earth-shattering.","He didn’t dare to be careless, and faced it with seriousness.","Boom, Ling Han unleashed the Three Styles of the God of War. He formed his hands into palms and delivered a palm strike at He San.","The power of heaven and earth surged, all of which was absorbed by his body. Then, acting as a medium, it blasted out majestically.","Even He San was shocked, his eyes flickering. Though he had already had a high estimate of this move, he still felt apprehensive when this move was used.","He roared loudly, and also channeled his strongest ultimate technique to clash head-on with Ling Han.","He was He San, and he was definitely not inferior to anyone!","Boom!","In this exchange, Ling Han was still outmatched, and stumbled back. However, he immediately pulled himself together, and blasted out the second move of the Three Styles of God of War.","He was truly like a god of war, his whole body suffused with blood and Qi, as if he had just fought a bloody battle.","He charged over with this powerful move, as if he could crush everything.","He San did not back down either. He still sent out a heavy palm strike, greeting Ling Han’s attack.","Boom, the two of them exchanged another blow. This time, Ling Han was not at a disadvantage at all, and tied with He San.","The Three Styles of the God of War borrowed the power of heaven and earth, and each style was stronger than the last.","Ling Han forcefully suppressed the boiling sensation in his chest as he unleashed the third strike.","“Do you think I’m afraid of you!” He San roared in fury, greeting the incoming attack with a palm strike.","This was the ultimate technique that he had mastered, the Ultimate Mountain Palm, and was also his strongest technique at present.","Boom!","In this clash, He San was instantly sent flying heavily.","The Three Styles of the God of War was extremely powerful.","However, this was also Ling Han’s limit.","The blood in his body was extremely chaotic, and he was also experiencing waves of agonizing pain. He was already unable to use the Three Styles of the God of War a second time.","Though He San had been sent flying, his face was only slightly pale, and he had not sustained any serious injury. He smirked coldly, “Though this set of techniques of yours is powerful, and has increased your battle prowess by at least tenfold, the burden it places on you is at least a hundredfold.”","“Can you cast the next move?”","Ling Han had almost used all of his ultimate moves, and the only powerful killer move he had yet to use was the Heavenly Pattern Jade.","However, this was only a one-time thing. If he failed to defeat his opponent, and instead fell into the latter’s hands, he would suffer a great loss.","Let’s go.","He no longer hesitated. Using the Imminent Skyline, he covered a distance of 50 kilometers with a single step.","“Don’t even think about leaving!” He San hurriedly gave chase, but Ling Han took another step forwards, and instantly threw him off his tail. When he had taken a few more steps, it was already impossible to determine which direction Ling Han had gone.","He frowned. Though this opponent was not as freakish as himself, he was just barely qualified to be his opponent. After all, his cultivation level had descended from Celestial Path, and had a certain advantage.","If his opponent’s cultivation level was completely the same as his, perhaps he really could pose a threat to him.","Thus, he definitely had to get rid of this person.","It was clear that he was here to harvest the essence of Earth. His motive was very clear, and that was for the sake of obtaining the Five Elements Karmic Pill. Thus, before he had gathered enough essence of Earth, it was impossible for him to leave. Otherwise, all his previous efforts would be wasted.","“I will definitely find you and kill you!” He San said in a low voice, his tone baleful.","After Ling Han cast the Imminent Skyline a few times, he finally switched to a normal speed.","He was extremely displeased. This time, he was being suppressed in all aspects.","It couldn’t be helped. His opponent’s cultivation level was now one major tier higher than his, and he was a three-star genius. Of course, he was just that powerful.","“Even if I open the Hidden Apertures, it would still be impossible for me to be a match for him, unless... I advance into Mystery Realm Tier!”","Ling Han frowned. Opening the Hidden Apertures wasn’t like the Sixth Change or Seventh Change, where the improvement was so fierce. This was only paving the way for the future. The more Hidden Apertures opened, the faster the rate of cultivation would be in the future, but for the improvement of battle prowess?","With more leaps in level of being, breaking through more barriers, battle prowess would definitely become stronger, but there shouldn’t be any qualitative improvement.","After running far enough, Ling Han’s body had mostly recovered. In terms of the toughness of his physique, He San was far from being able to compare to him.","He continued to fight monsters. He would remember this debt from He San first.","However, only two days later, He San caught up to him, and immediately launched an attack. It was as if he was determined to kill him.","This time, Ling Han didn’t linger in battle. Instead, he directly used Imminent Skyline and left.","There was no need to argue with He San now. His priority was to obtain the Earth Element Crystal, and from there, concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill, so that he could break through all the shackles in his body.","He only had to advance into Mystery Realm Tier, and in a real battle of equals, let’s see how he would beat up this b@stard.","Though He San was powerful, he did not have any good strategy against a godly skill like the Imminent Skyline. He could only watch helplessly as Ling Han fled, and then set off in pursuit again.","He wanted to rely on his advantage of having a high cultivation level and accumulation of power to forcefully exhaust Ling Han to death.","He seemed to have a unique method. This time, only a day later, he found Ling Han again, and began a mad barrage of attacks.","However, though his tracking technique was awesome, it was still unable to do anything against Ling Han’s Imminent Skyline.","For ten consecutive days, Ling Han was found eight times by He San, so he did not even have a moment of peace when he was fighting monsters.","However, under such high pressure, his cultivation level was also rapidly increasing.","He quickly opened the last nine apertures, reaching the publicly acknowledged limit of the Enlightenment Tier.","After opening 108 apertures, one could break through again. No matter where one was, this could be considered a prodigy. The majority of people had already opened 72 apertures, and no longer had the potential to charge forwards.","However, Ling Han knew that his path as an Enlightenment Tier elite had only truly begun at this moment.","He San, just give me more pressure, so that I can complete my breakthrough.."]},{"number":3634,"title":"Chapter 3634 - Hunted all the way","paragraphs":["Hunted all the way","Translator: Henyee Translations , Editor. Henyee Translations","He San pursued him all the way.","He was one of the few prodigies of the younger generation of the Azure Dragon Empire. It could also be said that he was one of the most outstanding prodigies of this generation on the entire Moonlight Planet. Since he had made up his mind to kill Ling Han, he definitely wouldn’t give up so easily.","His repeated failures only strengthened his killing intent, and the pace of his pursuit did not slow down in the slightest.","Ling Han had to even choose a time to break through. He had to do it immediately after throwing He San off his tail. Otherwise, as time passed, the latter would definitely follow his tracks.","The opening of Hidden Apertures was extremely difficult, because the average person could only reach the level of 72 apertures, and reaching 108 apertures was already commendable.","“One hundred and eight is a minor cycle.","“Then, would the total number of apertures be 360, totalling to a complete","cycle?”","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He had spent close to a year to open all 108 apertures, so if he really opened all 360 apertures, wouldn’t that take another two years?","However, no matter how long it took, if there was a target of perfection, he had to achieve perfection.","Thus, it just so happened that there was such a super elite hunting him down, which could give him pressure on the line between life and death. He naturally did not want to miss out on such an opportunity.","Ling Han continued to fight monsters. Now, he was only missing the essence of Earth To say nothing of the fact that only He San was hunting him, even if a hundred He San joined forces, he would still stay here until he obtained the","Earth Element Crystal.","Seven days later, Ling Han suddenly experienced appreciation.","He stopped, and directly flopped onto the ground.","Boom! The elevation of the level of being began with such ferocity.","Ling Han ingested a Treasured Fruit of Life, then began to break through the shackles in his body.","Pa, pa, pa! One after another, the restrictions crumbled, and one aperture quietly opened. It could communicate with the heaven and earth, and could allow the mystical power to surge.","The first of the Hidden Apertures!","This was only the beginning. Not too long after, the second Hidden Aperture also opened, and then the third, advancing like a hot knife through butter.","Half an hour later, he had already opened nine Hidden Apertures. When he thought that this breakthrough was about to end, he discovered that the leap in level of being was still extremely turbulent.","He could continue?","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t stop. After ingesting another Treasured Fruit of","Life, his breakthrough was still ongoing.","The tenth Hidden Aperture, the eleventh Hidden Aperture... after opening nine more Hidden Apertures, the breakthrough finally stopped.","Ling Han was astonished. He had actually unlocked eighteen apertures this time?","Going by that logic, he would probably only need about half a year’s time, and would be able to open all the apertures of a complete cycle in his body.","Of course, that was if there were a total of 360 major apertures.","Weng, a terrifying killing intent blazed.","He San was here again!","This time, Ling Han didn’t flee. Instead, he faced him head-on. Moreover, his first move was the Three Styles of the God of War.","He had unlocked several Hidden Apertures. Had his battle prowess soared?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","After exchanging three moves, Ling Han turned around and fled. He unleashed Imminent Skyline and rapidly fled into the distance.","He was still no match for He San. Though he had unlocked a few Hidden Apertures, and his abilities had improved, there was no qualitative change in his abilities. Thus, after three moves, Ling Han fled.","-At this moment, He San was naturally very depressed. Ling Han, who had been running off the moment he saw him, actually dared to make a move? Furthermore, if you want to fight, so be it. Why had you only exchanged three moves?","These three moves stunned him slightly. The Three Styles of the God of War was too powerful, completely suppressing him. However, just as he was about to counterattack, Ling Han fled.","You actually f****** ran away!","He was filled with anger, and with a battle cry, he once again began his pursuit.","The chase was still ongoing, and Ling Han didn’t flee once he was caught up to. instead, he used the Three Styles of the God of War to counterattack. He would first exchange three moves, then use the Imminent Skyhne to flee.","After a few times, the anger that He San had accumulated was already off the charts.","Was there anyone like you?","From the very beginning, he had used three powerful moves, blasting him so hard that he could only defend passively, and when he was about to begin his counterattack, Ling Han ran off again, making him unable to use his full power and unable to vent his anger.","Damn it, how infuriating.","10 days later, Ling Han broke through again. He opened another 18 Hidden Apertures.","This time, he exchanged another three moves with He San. He felt that his abilities had improved again, but he was still no match for He San.","-Without a qualitative change, he should not be able to get the upper hand. Revenge was a dish best served cold. Moreover, he didn’t need to serve it too cold at that.","There was more and more essence of Earth in his possession, but being hunted down by He San like this, he did not consider reuniting with the babies, because once his relationship with the babies was exposed, the seven babies could possibly become factors that He San would use to threaten him.","He naturally wouldn’t place his children in danger. He didn’t even go to meet Shen Hanyun. Instead, he left a message at the agreed-upon meeting place, briefly explaining the situation.","Ten days, one month, three months!","Time continued to pass. He San’s willpower was astonishing, and he continued to follow behind Ling Han. It was as if he wouldn’t leave this place until he killed Ling Han.","Ling Han was also filled with anger at this. They were complete strangers, yet he had actually pursued him for half a year?","Was there such a great enmity between them?","just you wait, when he has advanced into the Mystery Realm Tier, we’ll call all debts in.","Though Ling Han was displeased, He San did not seem to be any better off either.","It should be known that when the two of them encountered each other afterwards, it was Ling Han who had used the Three Styles of the God of War to launch an attack, forcing him to only be able to protect himself at the beginning. Then, after the three moves, he would flee.","This was just like how a woman in a brothel would receive guests, but in the end she would encounter someone who was too fast. She had not gotten enough of the fun yet, and the latter actually did not pay even after he was done playing. He simply grabbed his pants and fled.","He was getting angrier and angrier, determined to crush Ling Han into dust. After so many days, Ling Han’s strength had also steadily increased. The number of apertures he had opened had already reached as many as 324.","He was very confident that the total number of apertures should be 360, which was just the number for a complete cycle.","■Soon, soon,’ he thought.","He now broke through about once every ten days, and opened eighteen Hidden Apertures. Going by that calculation, he would only need to break through two more times, and he would be able to reach the pinnacle of Enlightenment Tier. It had to be admitted that He San had a lot of credit for this. Without him coercing Ling Han like this, giving Ling Han enough motivation, it was definitely impossible for him to reach such heights in such a short period of time.","Just as he was thinking this, He San appeared again. This time, he directly struck out with his sword. He did not want to repeat the fate of being ruthlessly attacked by Ling Han right from the get go.","However, it was useless.","The moment Ling Han’s Three Styles of the God of War appeared, it immediately forced He San to defend with all his might.","However, when He San caught his breath, Ling Han had already used Imminent Skyline and disappeared.","He San couldn’t help but feel an urge rise up in him. Why not just forget about it? It was practically impossible to kill Ling Han here, so he had best stand guard outside. At that time, with his Cauldron Forging Tier strength, wouldn’t killing Ling Han be a piece of cake?","However, he immediately shook his head. If he submitted to such thoughts, it would definitely leave a flaw in his mind. In future, if he wanted to break through to the peak stage of martial arts, there would be hidden dangers.","He gave chase, and continued his pursuit.."]},{"number":3635,"title":"Chapter 3635 - Battle of Willpower","paragraphs":["Battle of Willpower","Translator: Henyee Translations ] Editor: Henyee Translations","He San pursued him all the way. This time, he spared no expense. It seemed like he had used some kind of secret technique. Ling Han was completely unable to throw him off his tail. At most, he would be able to immediately catch up to him in half an hour.","It was as if He San had also realized that though Ling Han had always been no match for him, his battle prowess was steadily increasing.","This was too terrifying, wasn’t it? If the other party was allowed to grow endlessly like that, wouldn’t he be able to stand shoulder to shoulder with him?","Though the other’s strength was still far inferior, there would eventually come a day like this.","Thus, he also became ruthless, determined to kill Ling Han.","Ling Han naturally didn’t have the time to fight monsters anymore. Moreover, he probably didn’t need them anymore. With the seven kids and Shen Hanyun, he definitely had enough essence of Earth. He only needed to fuse them together to form an Earth Element Crystal.","Under He San’s forceful suppression, Ling Han didn’t even have the time to cultivate his mystical power. His physical power was still fine, and his recovery ability was strong, so he didn’t have to worry about exhausting it at all. However, it was a different story for his mystical power.","Now, he was only expending it and not replenishing it.. If he only relied on ingesting some alchemical pills, how could they compensate for his expenditure?","In these two days, Ling Han’s condition had become extremely poor. Even if he had opened up his meridians far wider than the average person, he still couldn’t bear such expenditure. Thankfully, he was a Grandmaster Alchemist, and the effects of the alchemical pill that he concocted were far better than the alchemical pills concocted by an ordinary alchemist, and that was why he could continue to hold on.","However, he couldn’t bear it, and He San didn’t seem to be any better.","Why hadn’t he used this secret technique before?","It was precisely because he had expended too much energy that he had not used it all this while. Now, he had made his decision. He would kill Ling Han at all costs, but that did not mean that his expenditure would suddenly decrease.","After channeling for two consecutive days, he had almost reached his limit. His body was covered in sweat, and even his hair was sticking together. He was no longer as carefree as before.","Now, rather than calling it a contest of battle prowess between the two of them, it would be better to call it a test of willpower.","They were both close to reaching the limits of their physical bodies. Whoever could last longer would be able to grasp an advantage.","He San truly deserved the name of a supreme prodigy. His willpower was incredibly strong, and he continued to pursue Ling Han relentlessly. He believed that he would definitely be able to last longer than Ling Han.","And in terms of willpower, who had Ling Han feared before?","Five days, seven days, nine days!","On the tenth day, the two of them had actually reached their limits. It was clear that the other was right ahead of them, but they still had to take a few breaths before they could rush over.","At this time, the toughness of Ling Han’s physique showed its effects.","Although his mystical power was close to drying up, and he could only squeeze out a little bit of it from alchemical pills, his physical power was still abundant.","At least, he still retained 30% of his power.","He was preparing to counterattack. As long as He San’s mystical power was expended completely, then if they both used their physical power, he could insta-kill He San 10,000 times.","It was about time.","Ling Han suddenly stopped, turned around, and stared at He San.","“You’re not running anymore?” He San asked, panting heavily, trying his best","to keep his tone as normal as possible.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Haven’t you always wanted to spar with me? I’ll oblige you!”","He strode forwards, and charged towards He San.","“Humph, do you think I don’t know what you’re thinking?” He San sneered. He delivered a palm strike, and a resplendent light flickered.","He had retained some power.","“Go!” Ling Han waved his hand, and xiu, Heavenly Pattern Jade flew out.","His stance of wanting to fight He San head-on was simply a pretense. The true killer move was the Heavenly Pattern Jade.","The Heavenly Pattern Jade instantly soared to ten times the speed of sound.","It couldn’t be helped. Ling Han’s mystical power had expended too much, so the might of this attack was also considerably inferior.","“Spiritual Power Spirit Tool?” He San was startled, but he immediately recognized it. His expression changed drastically, and he hurriedly dodged. However, if he had dodged at the first instant, he might have been able to dodge, but to dodge when the Heavenly Pattern Jade had already smashed out?","It was too late!","After all, he wasn’t in his prime right now. Even ten times the speed of sound was enough to kill him.","Peng, the Heavenly Pattern Jade hit He San, but circles of golden seals surged out from He San’s body, turning into something like a golden bell, protecting him within.","A pained expression instantly appeared on He San’s face. This was a Talisman Weapon that he had been bestowed with by an elite of his Sect. When he suffered an irresolvable attack, it would automatically activate. It was a treasure that could save his life.","This had already been used three times when he had ventured into ancient sites, and had also saved his life three times. He had never thought that when he was hunting down a Mystery Realm Tier cultivator, he would actually use it again.","However, this didn’t matter. He could obtain a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool. In the long term, it was definitely no less important than Talisman Weapon. Ling Han was also surprised. He had not thought that He San would actually have such a life-saving item.","Again!","He gave it his all as well. He activated the Imminent Skyline and charged towards He San. At the same time, he also stimulated the Destructive Energy. Not only did it wrap around his hands, the 300 plus apertures in his body also shot out at the same time.","He was like a porcupine now.","Peng! He crashed over.. This human cannonball was even faster than Heavenly Pattern Jade. He San naturally couldn’t dodge it, and he was instantly hit head-on.","If he was still in his prime condition, then with his battle prowess and the strength of Ling Han, the counterattack he launched would be enough to severely injure or even kill Ling Han, but now, he was sent flying from the impact, and the Destructive Energy was madly stabbing towards him. Weng, another circle of golden seals flickered, turning into a golden bell that protected He San.","‘F*ck! There’s more!’","Ling Han couldn’t help but curse. His mystical power was already exhausted, and he couldn’t use the Imminent Skyline again.","However, He San’s scalp became even more numb. Now that he had used up another chance to save his life, the Talisman Weapon’s energy was completely exhausted, and it turned into dust, no longer able to protect him.","He was extremely depressed. He had really gone out for wool and come back shorn. Not only had he not managed to kill Ling Han and snatch the Spiritual Power Spirit Tool, he had instead expended two life-saving chances. However, he turned around and fled without hesitation. If Ling Han unleashed another set of attacks like that, he definitely wouldn’t be able to withstand it.","It could not be helped. His present state was too poor.","Ling Han didn’t give chase. He couldn’t chase him at all.","Pa, he flopped onto the ground, and hurriedly took out alchemical pills which he ingested madly.","However, he had ingested too many alchemical pills these past few days, and a powerful immunity had developed in his body. The effects were minimal. Fortunately, he didn’t encounter any enemies. On the second day, when the sun rose, Ling Han hurriedly cultivated his mystical power and recovered it.","Half an hour later, Ling Han felt refreshed, and returned to his prime condition.","However, he had recovered, and He San was probably just about recovered as well. Later, he would definitely charge over to find him.","He was just about to stand up, when his expression changed drastically. F***, he was actually about to break through. The leap in level of being was already surging towards him.","Should he immediately break through, or suppress his cultivation for the moment?","Ling Han pondered for a moment before deciding to break through. If he advanced another step further, he would reach the peak stage of the Enlightenment Tier, and he would be able to break through to Mystery Realm Tier. Moreover, once he advanced into the Mystery Realm Tier, would he still need to fear He San?","Ling Han broke through. Boom, the shackles in his body were instantly shattered, one after another. The great battle of these ten days had completely squeezed out all his potential, allowing him to welcome the present burst of power.","But right at this moment, an oppressive coldness approached. The lingering He San had come again.."]},{"number":3636,"title":"Chapter 3636 - Careless","paragraphs":["Careless","Translator. Henyee Translations 1 Editor: Henyee Translations","He San would definitely not spare Ling Han.","In terms of reputation, since he said he wanted to kill Ling Han, he definitely had to do it. Otherwise, wouldn’t that ruin his reputation as the strongest of the younger generation of the Azure Dragon Empire?","From a profitable point of view, Ling Han had mastered many astonishing precious techniques, as well as Spiritual Power Spirit Tools like the Heavenly Pattern Jade. He naturally wanted to obtain this, and this would have to be done by killing Ling Han first.","Added with the fact that he had also expended two life-saving chances on Ling Han, this naturally made him want to take Ling Han down even more.","Otherwise, it would be too much of a loss for him.","Thus, after he recovered, he immediately ran back.","“Die!” He San attacked with his sword, and Sword Qi exploded. Xiu, xiu, xiu, the whole sky was filled with Sword Qi, like a rainstorm.","Without any hesitation, Ling Han immediately turned around and fled.","He was at a crucial moment of breaking through, so how could he have the time to fight He San?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! He used the Imminent Skyline a few times in a row, and under the violent tremors, his body instantly boiled.","Originally, he could have withstood it, but now that he was breaking through, his body was undergoing an earth-shattering change in the first place. With such an impact, he instantly felt extremely terrible, and spat out a mouthful of blood.","Again!","Ling Han’s expression revealed a hint of madness. Instead, he used this kind of shockwave to break through the Hidden Apertures. Pa, he actually succeeded. One of the apertures suddenly opened up.","Very good, there were still fifteen left.","But right at this moment, He San had already caught up. “Motherf*cker, who’s afraid of who!” Ling Han didn’t flee. He couldn’t use the Imminent Skyline for the time being, and he had no way to flee either. He charged at He San, activating the Three Styles of the God of War.","Faced with this three styles of celestial technique, although He San had suffered countless times, he was still unable to suppress it. He could only retreat continuously, not daring to face it head-on.","One Style, two Styles, three Styles, and finally, three Styles had passed.","Yet He San was taken aback. Why was Ling Han fighting so slowly this time?","“Not good!” Realization suddenly dawned on him. He had been tricked.","Unfortunately, his reaction was too slow.","Ling Han used Imminent Skyline and instantly left.","The reason why he channelled the Three Styles of the God of War extremely slowly was to stabilize the boiling in his body, so that he could once again use the Imminent Skyline.","“Pu!”","Ling Han spat out another mouthful of blood. Though he had delayed for a while, whether it was Imminent Skyline or the Three Styles of the God of War, they both placed a huge burden on his body, so how could he possibly truly recover?","However, at this moment, he became even more frenzied, and his eyes had already turned blood red.","“Open! Open! Open! Open!” he roared.","Pa, pa, several more shackles in his body were broken through consecutively, and he had also opened two apertures in a single go.","There were another... thirteen apertures to go.","In just a short while, He San came again.","He was like a lingering ghost!","Ling Han sighed internally. If He San was really a lingering ghost, that would be great. He could use the Six Characters Bright King Curse to force him to retreat. Without hesitation, he rushed forwards again, pulling out the stance of the Three Styles of the God of War.","‘Do you f*cking know any other moves?’","He San mocked internally, as he hurriedly retreated.","However, he discovered that Ling Han hadn’t used the Three Styles of the God","of War at all. He had only put on an act.","He had been tricked.","He San called out internally. True, Ling Han had just used the Three Styles of the God of War, so how could he possibly channel it a second time so quickly?","He flew into a humiliated rage, and hurriedly charged towards Ling Han. Ling Han humphed, and drew out the shard of the tombstone, which he threw at He San.","Boom, this brick was instantly enshrouded in layers of Yin Qi, as if there were vengeful ghosts that would not disperse.","F***, why had it mutated?","Ling Han was also taken aback. He hadn’t used the fragment of the tombstone since he came to the Moonlight Planet, nor had he taken it out. Who would’ve thought that there would be such a huge change?","Could it be that it was possible that the tomb was buried here, and the shard had been stolen from here, and that was why it had mutated?","Yin Qi soared sky-high, an astonishing sight.","He San’s expression also changed drastically. He hurriedly ran back, and only when he had ran out of the area covered by Yin Qi, did he stop. He looked at Ling Han, and said, “You are really seeking death. You actually dare to use something with such dense Yin Qi!”","“Now, there is no need for me to move. You would be enshrouded in Yin Qi, and die without any illness.”","This wasn’t an exaggeration. After being struck by the “brick”, anyone would be embroiled in misfortune and be extremely unlucky. Even Hong Tianbu, who had great fortune, couldn’t avoid it. He had been unlucky for a good few months.","At present, Ling Han was completely entwined in Yin Qi. Then, it would not be a matter of bad luck, but rather death.","“Then you can just wait slowly!” Ling Han completely ignored the Yin Qi, and began to break through again.","Pa, pa, pa! The shackles in his body shattered one after another, and the Hidden Apertures were also rapidly opening one after another.","Five, seven, nine... fifteen!","There were only three left.","However, at this time, Ling Han’s advancement slowed down, as if he was powerless to continue.","This was obviously because he had been disturbed by He San, and had not been able to focus on breaking through, which led to such consequences.","Ling Han didn’t know if he would still have the chance to open the remaining three apertures after missing this opportunity. Thus, he definitely had to “revive”.","Break!","He stimulated the dimensions in his body, and millions and millions of living beings released their Spiritual Power at the same time, forming a driving force.","Pa, the sixteenth aperture opened... After a while, pa, the seventeenth aperture opened.","There was only one left.","But even if Ling Han was already working so hard, there would eventually come a time when manpower was exhausted. His life force was beginning to decline, and his breakthrough was about to end.","No way!","A frenzied expression appeared on Ling Han’s face. He opened his mouth, and took the initiative to absorb the Yin Qi.","He needed energy now, and he needed help. Who cared what it was? It was fine as long as it could help him push open another aperture.","“Idiot!” He San shook his head. He had really never seen such an idiot. Was he complaining that he was not dying fast enough?","However, after the Yin Qi was stimulated like this, it became increasingly violent, boiling like boiling water. Even He San could not see clearly. All he could see was a lifeless black gas.","Yin Qi entered his body, and Ling Han shivered. This was not just the coldness of his body, but also a kind of desolation in his soul, making him feel as if he was about to die.","Break!","Yet Ling Han did not care, and stimulated this energy, once again activating the leap in level of being that was about to calm down.","Boom, he had randomly messed around, and actually succeeded.","Pa, pa, pa! Another three shackles were shattered, and the eighteenth aperture was also penetrated.","A shocking scene appeared. All of Ling Han’s apertures lit up at the same time, like a sky filled with stars.","At this moment, it was as if he had cultivated some kind of Divine Physique, in just an instant, all the major apertures of a complete cycle had dimmed, and temporarily returned to being ordinary, just waiting to explode.","Boom! It was as if the heaven and earth had been enraged. Bursts of thunder rang out, and lightning flashed past, as if it wanted to kill a certain treasonous person.","No matter how heavy the Yin Qi was, it would not be able to withstand the fury of this heaven and earth. In an instant, all the Yin Qi had been dispersed.","He San finally saw Ling Han again, and couldn’t help but smirk coldly. Though this brat seemed to be very lucky, and even the heavens were helping him, it was already too late. He had absorbed too much Yin Qi, and even the air of death was exuding from him.","Was there still any hope for him?"]},{"number":3637,"title":"Chapter 3637 - Wondrous Buddhist Race Technique","paragraphs":["Wondrous Buddhist Race Technique","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“How foolish. You are seeking your own death.” He San waved his sleeve, though he was slightly puzzled.","Why had Ling Han not fled this time, but rather fought him to the death time and time again? Otherwise, Ling Han wouldn’t have needed to use that evil weapon with overflowing Yin Qi, causing him to be enshrouded in Yin Qi, and seek his own death.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and said, “What you think is just what you think.”","Was this a tongue twister?","He San did not make a move. By now, there was already no need for him to make a move. Ling Han’s body was enshrouded in Yin Qi, and the time of his death was drawing near.","Yet Ling Han stretched out a hand, and shouted at himself, “An!”","Boom, the Buddhist chant was vast and mighty, and thought-provoking.","The Six Characters Bright King Curse could suppress evil, and could kill evil spirits. It was used to subdue evil beasts and transcend dead souls.","As he spat out this word, a black-colored aura of death instantly surged out of Ling Han’s palm. Then, it turned into ash, as if it had been annihilated.","“This is a Buddhist Race technique to exorcise the dead!” He San blurted out, “You are a Buddhist Race being!”","‘F*ck you, you’re the one who is a bald monk!’","Ling Han thought, but ignored him completely. Instead, he continued to shout at his hands, “An!”","Boom, another ball of black Qi was forced out by him.","“An!” “An!” “An!” “An!” “An!”","As Ling Han continued to shout, puffs of black Qi were forced out and then annihilated.","The corner of He San’s mouth twitched slightly. Why was it that every time you f* *** ** speak, it was only the word “An”? Wasn’t the Six Characters Bright King Curse supposed to have six true words? What about the other five? Have you eaten them all?","In truth, Ling Han also wanted to use the complete Six Characters Bright King Curse; why was it six characters? That was definitely because it had to be used as a complete set to be able to maximize its might. If it was just ‘An’, the effects of expelling evil would definitely be limited.","But what could he do? He only knew the word ‘An’.","“An!” “An!” “An!” “An!”","He continued to shout.","‘An’ your sister!","He San couldn’t take it anymore. With a loud roar, he charged towards Ling Han. Now, the aura of death was all inside Ling Han’s body, and whatever was spat out would also be immediately annihilated. It could no longer injure him.","With a thought from Ling Han, the apertures of a complete cycle lit up at the same time, like the stars that filled the skies, forming a screen of light around his body.","Peng!","He San’s attack arrived, yet was blocked by the starlight.","“What?” He San faltered for a moment. What kind of freakish defense was this? It was too terrifying, wasn’t it? He roared loudly, and blue energy activated. It finally broke through the defense of the starlight screen, and continued to attack Ling Han.","However, there was enough time for Ling Han to retreat. He didn’t counterattack, and he simply shouted at himself, “An!”","The most important thing now was to expel the aura of death. This was fatal. He could already feel that the vitality of his internal organs had greatly decreased, and were presently depleting. If he did not quickly force it out, there would be a great problem.","He San gave chase again, but this time, Ling Han didn’t use the starlight screen. Instead, he used Imminent Skyline to retreat.","It wasn’t that Ling Han didn’t want to use it, but that after it was shattered, there was no way to reform it at the first instant, and there was a cooldown period.","Fortunately, it didn’t take long. When He San caught up again, Ling Han’s apertures of a complete cycle lit up again, forming a screen of starlight.","Peng!","He San’s attack arrived, yet was unable to penetrate through his defenses.","—He had to use blue-coloured energy, and only then would he be able to damage the light screen made up of stars.","That was a little like Destructive Energy, though it was slightly inferior in quality. However, it was still extraordinary. However, this was also the problem. This energy was too powerful, and it placed a heavy burden on He San, preventing him from channeling it for a long time.","Peng, peng, peng! There was no blue-coloured energy, and He San only managed to shatter the light screen after firing a total of seventeen times. However, this also gave Ling Han enough time to recover, and he once again used Imminent Skyline.","“An!” “An!” “An!” “An!”","The black Qi in his body was continuously expelled, and his condition was also improving. At first, his whole face was so dark that it could barely be seen, but now, not only had it returned to white, it had also become rosy.","Not too long after, he would be able to return to a state of perfection.","He San was extremely depressed. Why did Ling Han suddenly have an incomparably powerful defensive technique?","No, this definitely wasn’t an ordinary secret technique, but rather a Mystical Power. Otherwise, it definitely wouldn’t be so powerful.","But why hadn’t Ling Han cast it earlier?","Could it be that he had just mastered it?","To be hunted to the point of exhaustion, then explode, and awaken a Mystical Power?","He San really wanted to slap himself. If that was really the case, wasn’t he the most foolish person in the world?","“Die! Die! Die!” He brandished his sword, his eyes bloodshot, looking like he had gone mad.","After Ling Han shouted “An” a few more times, the aura of death in his body was completely expelled. He laughed loudly, “He San, we’ll call it a day. See how I beat you up the next time we meet!”","He channelled the Imminent Skyline consecutively, and after completely throwing He San off his tail, he then walked quickly. In this way, it would take He San at least half an hour to catch up to him.","Ling Han was filled with confidence. He had already unlocked the apertures of a complete cycle. Now, he only had to take another step further, and he would advance into the Mystery Realm Tier, and in a battle of equal cultivation levels, who would be a match for him?","He only needed a few days now.","Ling Han continued to cultivate the last step of this cultivation level. After his level of being had increased, his meridians could expand a little more. As long as he completed this step, he would be considered to have reached the true end of the Enlightenment Tier.","He San, just you wait.","Ling Han didn’t gather any more essence of Earth. There was only one thing he needed to do these few days, and that was to perfect his cultivation of Enlightenment Tier to perfection.","He tried his best to conceal his tracks, using the hide of the Void Beast to conceal himself. This was very effective. As expected, He San could no longer find him.","One day, two days, three days. Every morning, Ling Han would extract the power of heaven and earth from the heaven and earth, and his meridians would continuously expand, breaking through to the pinnacle level.","When he was cultivating, his own aura naturally could not be concealed, but it was only for half an hour. Even with good luck, He San had only caught up to him after Ling Han finished cultivating, and he had easily thrown him off his tail.","Nine days later, Ling Han couldn’t advance any further.","The meridians had already expanded to the extreme, and the major apertures of a complete cycle had also been completely opened—the appearance of the Starlight Screen made him realize that he had cultivated Enlightenment Tier to the extreme, and that was also how Mystical Powers like Eye Technique and Sword of Metal had appeared.","Which also meant that he had now cultivated Enlightenment Tier to perfection.","In that case, he would begin his attempt to break through to Mystery Realm Tier.","Theoretically speaking, Mystery Realm Tier wasn’t too difficult.","What was Mystery Realm Tier?","It was to find a Mystery Realm in his body, and use it to store mystical power. This would be the source of his future energy.","—If he still used his meridians as a storehouse for mystical power, then after he advanced into Celestial Path, wouldn’t the might of his attack be earth-shattering and instantly exhaust all his mystical power?","Then wouldn’t that mean that there was no meaning to the expansion of meridians?","Of course not. The wider the meridian network expanded, the stronger the power of the attack would naturally be.","In other words, the width of the meridian network determined the explosive power of the cultivator, and the size of the Mystery Realms determined the endurance of the cultivator.","Both were equally important.."]},{"number":3638,"title":"Chapter 3638 - Ling Han’s Mystery Realm","paragraphs":["Ling Han’s Mystery Realm","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Thus, Ling Han definitely had to choose carefully which part of his body it was better to develop into a Mystery Realm.","There was only one chance, and once it was decided, after breaking through into Mystery Realm Tier, his was something that couldn’t be changed. Was it the Dantian that the majority would choose?","Dantian was the Sea of Qi, and it could become an independent space, storing a large amount of mystical power. It was not a bad choice.","Or the mind, which could similarly be opened up into an independent space. Dantian?","Ling Han shook his head. This was the choice of the masses, and if he wanted to become the strongest, he definitely could not walk the path of the masses. Then what about his mind?","He couldn’t either. That was where his divine sense was located. If he placed his divine sense together with his mystical power, who knew what would happen.","But with these two options gone, what other choice did he have?","No matter which part it was, it was impossible to create an independent space, just like how the meridians in his body had a limited space.","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He had already had an idea, but didn’t know if he could successfully execute it.","He had great ambitions. He wanted to cultivate to a height that there would never be a second person that could reach.","—Using the dimensions in his body as a Mystery Realm!","Just how many dimensions did he have in his body? And just how large was this space?","If he could develop all these dimensions into Mystery Realms, then he really wouldn’t have to worry about not having enough power to continue.","Who could compete with him?","Most importantly, this was a path that no one had ever walked before. He had to carefully explore it, and there was not the slightest precedent that he could learn from.","However, this was definitely the path of the strongest that he wanted to pursue, so Ling Han could not possibly shrink back.","“Come!”","He sat down in a cross-legged position. At present, he needed an absolutely quiet environment, because he did not know how much time he would need to complete his breakthrough.","Thankfully, he had the Void Beast hide wrapped around him. As long as he did not begin his true breakthrough, the heaven and earth would not resonate with him, so his aura naturally would not leak out. If He San found him again, that would definitely be him being extremely unlucky.","Ling Han calmly thought about transforming the dimensions in his body into Mystery Realms. This was only an idea, but as for how to implement it, it was definitely not something that could be done with mere thought.","He first simulated it, and after confirming that it could work, he finally began. Weng, the leap of level of being began, and Ling Han underwent the final great upgrade of the mortal level.","Next, though he could also break through the shackles, that was only cultivation of a minor level, and could not be compared to breaking through to a major tier.","It had begun.","Ling Han stimulated the dimensions in his body. He naturally chose the transcendent dimensions as the first to be opened to become Mystery Realms.","The dimensional passageway had long since formed, and this was a ready-made one. There was no need for Ling Han to construct it. However, the problem was how to open a passageway so that mystical power could circulate. Fortunately, Ling Han had done some experiments before, moving the living beings and objects out of his body. Though they were all crushed into dust by the power of heaven and earth of this world, it still allowed him to accumulate experience.","How he had come out in the past was how he was going to enter now. Furthermore, he had to open up a stable passageway. It was impossible that whenever he unleashed his might, he would have mystical power come out as if it was toothpaste. Then, what was the point of continuing the battle? Thus, to Ling Han, the key question was how to open this passageway. This sounded simple, but connecting the dimensions and meridians was definitely not something that could be done with just a few words.","Ling Han began to experiment, constructing a passageway. However, once the surging energy surged, this passageway was destroyed.","Again, it was still very quickly destroyed.","Again, again, again.","Ling Han made endless attempts. Though each attempt ended in failure, he could learn from it every time, improve and improve.","It was unknown how many times he had failed. When Ling Han was a little numb, a new passageway was constructed, and mystical power surged. Yi, there was no damage?","Ling Han also came to his senses after a while. He had initially planned to construct a new passageway.","Boom, it was as if the mystical power in the meridians had found its owner, and they all surged towards this transcendent dimension.","In the future, the meridian system would no longer be responsible for storing mystical power. It would only provide mystical power for the circulation of power. This would undoubtedly increase Ling Han’s battle prowess greatly. However, the improvement of level of being wasn’t over yet.","Ling Han continued to open a new passageway to communicate with the dimensions.","His speed was very fast, because this did not involve opening up a Mystery Realm, and he only needed to build bridges, right until he broke through to Celestial Path.","After such a long time, he had a very high chance of constructing a passageway for all the dimensions in his body, turning them into a storage for his mystical power.","The heaven and earth immediately sensed it again, and a large number of dark clouds gathered. Thunder rumbled, and lightning flashed closely.","Ling Han ignored it completely, and merely tried his best to construct a passageway in his body.","too, 1OOO, 10,000. Half a day passed, and Ling Han’s level of being finally stopped. Meanwhile, he had also constructed more than 73,000 passageways, connecting to the same number of dimensions.","In terms of the maximum amount of mystical power that could be stored he could probably compare to the level of mystical power of Sect Masters or even Venerate Tiers, right?","There was no end to Mystery Realm Tier. In the future, as the cultivation level increased, the space created could still continue to expand, but no matter how much it expanded, could it compare to a freak like Ling Han?","He could also expand his dimensions, transforming the low-level dimensions mto medium-level dimensions, high-level dimensions, and even transcendent dimensions.","Of course, the problem now was not increasing the level of dimensions, but rather how to fill up the existing dimensions.","Previously, the mystical power stored in his meridians couldn’t even fill the first dimension, making Ling Han feel extremely hungry. This naturally wasn’t because he wanted to eat, but because he needed to store more mystical power. He was sure that this feeling of hunger would accompany him for a very, very long time, because his Mystery Realms were really too, too big.","Moreover, as his level of being increased each time, he would construct more passageways, and his hunger would also increase.","Ai, Ling Han sighed. Others were worrying about the Mystery Realm not being big enough, but he was actually worried that the Mystery Realm was so big that It couldn’t be filled even when he rushed up to the Foundation Building Tier or even Cauldron Forging Tier. What kind of blissful worry was this?","“My current strength... has changed drastically!”","Ling Han stood up, and with a casual wave of his hands and feet, it was as if he could destroy the heavens and earth.","This was the ultimate power of a mortal.","As for He San?","Come, come, come. Let’s see how he will defeat this guy.","Ling Han wasn’t disappointed. Without the Void Beast hide to conceal his aura, He San quickly found him.","He looked coldly at Ling Han, his killing intent solidifying.","“Why aren’t you attacking or running?” he asked.","Previously, whenever Ling Han had been caught up to by him, he would either turn around and run, or he would rush up, fire three moves and run again. He had never been as calm as he was now.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “I want to give you a good beating, so how can I run?”","“Hahahaha!” He San laughed loudly, “What a joke. If it was not for the fact that you have mastered a godly escape technique, you would have long since been buried half a year ago.”","“Come!” Ling Han crooked a finger at him.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, he was invincible!"]},{"number":3639,"title":"Chapter 3639 - Crushed","paragraphs":["Crushed","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He San was a little uncertain.","In his impression, Ling Han was definitely not the type to be forcefully stubborn. This person was incredibly slippery, and if he couldn’t win, he would run, without any hesitation at all.","Now, he did not run, nor did he use any tricks. He looked like he wanted to confront him head-on, which confused him.","Could it be that he was up to something?","“Do you really dare to fight me?” He San asked calmly.","“Today, I’ll make you kneel and admit defeat,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Cheeky mouth!” He San humphed, and charged towards Ling Han. The longsword in his hand flew out in a slash.","The sword swept past, and Sword Qi soared into the skies.","It had to be admitted that He San was indeed very powerful. If he was still a Mystery Realm Tier, he would definitely be one of the top elites. He was a three-star genius. And now, he had been suppressed back to this level from Cauldron Forging Tier, so his battle prowess could only be stronger.","He was almost comparable to a four-star genius of Mystery Realm Tier, and that was enough to sweep aside all obstacles in this cultivation level.","The problem was that Ling Han had already surpassed a four-star genius. After opening 360 apertures, it was equivalent to him breaking through another limit, and advancing into Mystery Realm Tier on this basis, what level would his battle prowess reach?","Ling Han stepped forwards, his iron fists swinging out, enshrouded in the power of Metal.","Peng!","The fist crashed into the sword, and instantly, a massive ball of light burst out. It was like a meteor had crashed into it, creating a massive explosion, and a figure was sent flying out of the explosion even faster than the transmission of energy.","It was He San.","This wasn’t the first time he had been sent flying by Ling Han. He had faced the Three Styles of the God of War head-on, and the result was that he had been sent flying.","But that would have to be the Three Styles of the God of War. With all his might, Ling Han could only channel the Three Styles of the God of War once, and could not possibly use it consecutively.","But now, Ling Han had only thrown a simple punch.","Peng, He San fell onto the ground. He immediately got back to his feet. He was not injured, but the expression on his face was as if he had seen a ghost.","He was actually no match for the power of Ling Han’s punch?","That wasn’t the Three Styles of the God of War.","How was this possible!","“What’s impossible?” Ling Han said calmly. “In a battle of equals, I’m invincible!”","He San couldn’t figure out why Ling Han had suddenly become so much stronger. This was completely illogical! Even if Ling Han had advanced into Celestial Path, he would still be suppressed by the heaven and earth here, and once again be struck down to Mystery Realm Tier.","This battle prowess would still increase, but it would definitely be limited, and would not be too exaggerated.","However, now that Ling Han’s battle prowess had increased, it was more than ten times stronger than before.","This was completely unrealistic.","“Are you shocked? Are you surprised?” With a tap of Ling Han’s foot, he had already caught up to He San, and shot out another punch.","He San sent out a palm strike in response, but the moment the fist and palm came into contact, he was sent flying. He was like a child that was clashing head-on with a sturdy man. The gap was incredibly wide.","Ling Han chased after him again, his iron fists striking out continuously.","Peng, peng, peng! He San could only stay on the defensive, continuously retreating and being sent flying.","“Heaven Shadow Sword!” He San roared loudly. As the sword swept past, blue-coloured energy surged, forming a frightening destructive power. Finally, Ling Han was forced back a single step, and he was able to catch his breath.","He used his sword to support himself, breathing heavily.","How was this possible? How was this possible?","Now that he had used his ultimate move, he was actually only able to force Ling Han to stop for a short while? Just like how Ling Han had used the Three Styles of the God of War previously, he looked mighty on the surface, but in truth, he was only strong on the outside but weak on the inside.","A thought suddenly occurred to him, and he exclaimed in shock, “You have indeed broken through, but it is not Celestial Path that you have broken through, but rather Mystery Realm Tier!”","Now, everything could be explained.","Ling Han couldn’t help but scoff, “You finally realized?”","He San was speechless. Only now did he know that Ling Han wasn’t boasting at all when he said that he was invincible among his peers, but rather he was really that powerful.","Even if Ling Han had clearly explained at that time, he would definitely not have believed that Ling Han could just barely stand against him when he was only in the Enlightenment Tier.","There was someone in this world that was more freakish than him, and had surpassed him by so much at that? Wasn’t that a joke?","But now, there was no need for Ling Han to say anything. He had realized it on his own.","This really was a supreme freak.","Were they still going to fight?","He San didn’t think that he had any chance of winning. In the Enlightenment Tier, Ling Han was almost capable of contending against him, and now, he had advanced to a new level, and his abilities had undergone an earth-shattering leap.","Get out, get out of this place. He was in the Cauldron Forging Tier, so no matter how freakish Ling Han was, so what? As long as there was no restriction from heaven and earth, even if Ling Han was a 10-star prodigy, he would still be able to suppress Ling Han with a single finger.","With this in mind, he instantly decided to retreat.","“You want to leave? That’s impossible.” Ling Han shook his head. If you had made up your mind to flee early on, it would have been fine. Now that you’re right at my doorstep, you still want to leave?","Hehe.","“I admit that your natural talent can also be ranked in the upper echelons of the universe, but if you want to detain me—”","Peng!","He San was just about to say a few words to keep up appearances. He could not allow his prestige to be weakened, but he had not even finished his words, when he was sent flying.","Ling Han turned his neck and exercised his shoulders. Just now, it was he who had sent He San flying with Imminent Skyline. With how tough his physique was, this kind of collision was completely no big deal.","But He San was in trouble.","With how fast the Imminent Skyline was, even if Ling Han’s own weight was only over 50kg, the destructive power of such a high-speed collision was still incredibly terrifying.","At least two of his bones had been broken, and his face was extremely pale.","He San’s face was filled with fury. He had never been treated like this before. He had not even finished his words, when he was interrupted, and in such a crude manner at that.","But... there was nothing he could do.","Though this method was simple and violent, its might was extremely domineering, and that was to use brute strength to crush and forcefully take advantage of its opponent.","He San roared in fury, and brandished his sword in attack.","Ling Han raised his fist and threw a punch.","Under the overwhelming power, the sword in He San’s hand instantly slipped out of his grip.","He retreated continuously, while blood continued to drip from his right hand. That attack just now had caused the web between his thumb and forefinger to split open.","Ling Han strode forwards. He opened up the major apertures of a complete cycle, forming the very brilliant Starlight Screen.","He San appeared slightly despondent, “How could you possibly be so powerful? This is impossible! This is impossible!”","Although he understood that Ling Han’s breakthrough this time was into Mystery Realm Tier, causing his battle prowess to soar, he still couldn’t understand how a Mystery Realm Tier could be as strong as this.","Was this a four-star genius?","No, he was now comparable to a four-star genius of Mystery Realm Tier. Even if he was slightly inferior, he wouldn’t be too far off. A four-star genius definitely wouldn’t be able to thrash him so easily.","Five, five-star genius!","He was extremely jealous. To say nothing of a five-star genius, even four-star geniuses only existed in legends. He, a three-star genius, could never hope to catch up, yet now he actually discovered that he had actually encountered a five-star genius.","“Nothing is impossible!” Ling Han threw a punch. He didn’t need to use any secret technique at all, and one punch was enough.","Peng!","He San tried his best to disperse it. He had used a powerful move, but the result was only just neutralizing it.","His powerful move was actually only capable of dispersing a casual punch from the other?","“Who in the world are you?” He San asked through gritted teeth. “You’re definitely not from Moonlight Planet.. There’s definitely no such person as you!”"]},{"number":3640,"title":"Chapter 3640 - Substitution Seal","paragraphs":["Substitution Seal","Translator: Henyee Translations","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “When you wanted to kill me, you didn’t care who I was. Now that I’ve turned around to kill you, there’s no need for you to know who I am.”","Humph, if it was not here, I would be able to crush you with one hand!” He San said through gritted teeth.","Hahahaha.” Ling Han laughed loudly, his expression filled with contempt, “I am a descendant of the Great Emperor, and have innumerable rare treasures on me. If we really battle in the outside world, I will take out my Ancestral Weapon, and even if a Saint came, I would be able to kill him.”","F***, wasn’t it just boasting? Who wouldn’t know how to do it?","He San’s whole person trembled. A descendant of a Great Emperor, and he even had an Ancestral Weapon with him. Just how terrifying was that existence? Aside from the Ancestral Kings, Saints were invincible. However, against the Imperial Weapon and Ancestral Weapon, they could only bow their heads in submission.","This young man was actually the descendant of an Ancestral King?","No wonder he was so freakish!","Ling Han spluttered in laughter again. He shook his head, and said, “I was just joking with you. I’m destined to become an emperor, so why would I need to rely on the blessings of an Ancestral King?”","He San couldn’t help but inhale sharply. ‘You really dare to say it.’","Although cultivators who didn’t want to become Ancestral Kings weren’t good cultivators, everyone knew themselves well. Even prodigies such as He San knew that the limit of their lifetime achievements could just possibly be Sect Master-level.","To become a Venerate Tier elite?","Unless he had heaven-defying good fortune and obtained a heaven-defying opportunity. Otherwise, in these many years, why was there only a single Venerate Tier on Moonlight Planet?","Thus, Saints were even rarer. Any Saint would be able to sweep aside all opposition in the universe, and if a Great Emperor did not appear, who would be able to match him?","Yet Ling Han actually confidently declared that he wanted to become an Emperor. Wasn’t this the biggest joke in the world?","No matter how freakish you were, you would only have a one in ten thousand chance of becoming a Saint, what more becoming an Emperor.","“What a joke!” he said coldly.","“Whether it’s a joke or not, you’ll know in the future, but you won’t be able to see this day!” Ling Han charged out again, throwing a punch. It was very ordinary, but seemed capable of destroying the heavens and destroying the earth.","He San parried, but every time he took a blow, he would be throwing up blood endlessly. He was no match for Ling Han at all.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, Ling Han was invincible!","He San could only draw out the blue energy to match it, but this was too exhausting on him. In a few moments, he was panting heavily.","Ling Han also lost his patience. Originally, He San could have been his whetstone, but now that he had advanced into Mystery Realm Tier, his once powerful opponent could not even withstand a single blow. It was not enough for him to go all out at all.","He would kill him!","He channeled the Destructive Energy, wrapping it around his fists as he faced He San’s blue energy head-on.","This was a clash between two high-level energies. Boom, the fist and the sword clashed, and He San was sent flying. The blue-coloured energy instantly crumbled, and Destructive Energy wreaked havoc.","They were both high-level energies, but there were also qualitative differences. It could only be said that they were of a higher level than mystical power, but there were also rankings among high-level energies.","Boom, under the sweeping attack of Destructive Energy, He San instantly disappeared without a trace.","“So cleanly?” Ling Han was surprised. With He San’s strength, the Destructive Energy should not have blasted him into oblivion with a single strike.","“Hmm?”","Lmg Han looked up at the sky. Two pieces of paper seals fell, and even Destructive Energy didn’t damage them. Instead, it was as if they had only become like this after it had ignited itself.","“Substitution Seal? Ten Thousand Mile Escape Talisman?”","He summoned Tang Yun’er. When the little loll saw these two pieces of broken talisman paper, she immediately called out.","Hearing the name, Ling Han understood. Not only had He San not died, he had even fled.","—The Substitution Seal had saved He San from being killed by the destructive energy, and the Ten Thousand Mile Escape Talisman had instantly sent him tens of thousands of miles away.","Sigh, when there was an elite backing him up, there were a lot of benefits. Previously, he still had a Talisman Weapon to block a fatal attack.","Ling Han felt slightly regretful. This should be a fat sheep. If he could capture him, he would definitely be able to make a fortune.","“Handsome Brother, have you finally defeated that guy?” the little loli asked.","Ling Han nodded with a smile, “Yes.”","Then we can finally leave this godforsaken place, right?” The little loli’s mouth was crooked. What had they eaten these few months? She couldn’t bear it.","“M-hm.”","Ling Han arrived at the agreed upon location. After two days, the seven children and Shen Hanyun came over.","Everyone gathered the essence of Earth together, not only fusing together to form an Earth Element Crystal, but there was also surplus enough for half of another Earth Element Crystal.","Unfortunately, everyone was about to throw up at this place, so they naturally had no interest in fighting anymore – aside from Shen Hanyun. He expressed that he had nothing to do anyways, and wanted to continue killing monsters with the remaining essence of Earth, right until he managed to gather enough to form another Earth Element Crystal.","Ling Han knew that this guy wanted to find something for him to do. Otherwise, if he lost the purpose of his life, he would only be at a loss.","He patted Shen Hanyun’s shoulder, then took his leave.","After leaving the Rolling Stone Wasteland, the little loli summoned the shuttle, and the two of them boarded it. Xiu, it instantly tore through the air and left. ’ This is farewell for now, Moonlight Planet.","Ling Han turned around to look. He thought to himself, ‘It won’t be long before I return here again. At that time, I’ll completely settle accounts with the Pang Clan and the Lei Clan, and if I encounter He San, I won’t mind stepping on him.’ Xiu, the shuttle was extremely fast, and soon entered into the galaxy, beginning to traverse through the nodes of space.","Once, twice, thrice, and after about two months, they finally returned to Celestial Sea Planet.","More than a year had passed since their separation.","“Be careful, don’t crash into anyone again!” Ling Han warned in advance. This little loli was completely a destructive character.","“I know.” The little loli nodded, but looking at her fanatical expression, she was obviously just brushing Ling Han off.","As expected, she steered the shuttle and landed, aiming directly at a sect. Boom, after she crashed into a mountain peak, this mountain peak crumbled forcefully. Countless bits of rubble fell, and dust and sand filled the air, enshrouding an area of several dozen km.","Taking advantage of the chaos, Ling Han hurriedly grabbed the little loli and ran.","Thankfully, this sect was not allied with the Dark North Nation, so he would just treat it as teaching them a lesson.","After spending another three days, Ling Han finally returned to the Imperial Capital.","“Yo, we haven’t seen each other for over a year, and you’ve become even more beautiful,” Ling Han said with a smile after entering the Foreign Affairs Department and seeing Princess Bixiao.","If there was any change in the Foreign Affairs Department, it was that it was much quieter. To say nothing of the fact that it was deserted, it was actually not that much stronger either.","True, now that the forces that should have submitted had also surrendered, the","Foreign Affairs Department was naturally useless.","Princess Bixiao was indeed even more radiant, elegant and lively. It was not that her appearance had changed, but as she had walked further on the Celestial Path, her bearing had naturally become lively and pure.","Upon seeing her, everyone’s first reaction was that she was a celestial maiden descending from the heavens.","Princess Bixiao couldn’t help but be rendered speechless. Now, only Ling Han would dare to speak so glibly to her, but more importantly, this guy did not have the slightest bit of evil thoughts. He was completely teasing her, so she couldn’t get angry even if she wanted to.","“You’ve finally returned. The situation in the Imperial Capital has changed drastically again,” she said.."]},{"number":3641,"title":"Chapter 3641 - Imperial Banquet","paragraphs":["Imperial Banquet","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, “Let me catch my breath first. Also, no matter what happens, I have more important things to do first.”","And that naturally was to concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill. Otherwise, why would he have gone out on a trip in the first place?","Of course, he had reaped huge rewards from this trip. He had obtained a piece of Origin Gold, and this was a good fortune that even Saints did not have. There was also the Buddhist Race’s Six Characters Bright King Curse. Even if it was only a single word, it was still a supreme precious technique.","He first went to concoct the Five Elements Karmic Pill. It was not difficult to concoct, but the difficulty lay in gathering the ingredients. With Ling Han’s abilities as a Grandmaster Alchemist, there was naturally no problem in concocting it.","He constructed a formation, stimulating the flames of heaven and earth, and began to concoct the alchemical pill.","Half a day later, the Five Elements Karmic Pill was completed.","There was only one, and it was a mixture of five colours, yet it formed a perfect balance.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all, immediately ingesting the alchemical pill.","At the beginning, the medicinal effects did not take effect. Everything was normal, but very soon, a turbulent change took place. It was clear that his level of being had not advanced, but the shackles were automatically shattering.","It was as if heaven and earth had moved, unleashing his potential.","This process lasted for about an hour, unlocking 10% of the shackles on Ling Han’s body, and this was not what made Ling Han the happiest.","Because with the help of this alchemical pill, Ling Han could completely see the shackles in his body.","Previously, he could only sense the shackles when his level of being was soaring, but it was also seeing one shackle after another, and he had not looked at them from a holistic perspective.","In truth, he did not know how many shackles there were in his body at all. It was like he was running blindfolded, and only knew that he was advancing, but he did not have the slightest impression of how far away the end point was.","But now, he could see how many shackles there were in his body. In future, he would have a direction, and a goal. If these shackles were not broken, he would definitely not break through to Celestial Path.","“I... don’t feel anything.” Ling Han exercised his limbs, but didn’t feel any improvement in his abilities. It was still the same as before.","“Father, unlocking the shackles will only decrease the obstruction of climbing the mountain in the future. It won’t make you immediately become stronger,” Second Baby said.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He was only sighing. In truth, he was already capable of sweeping aside all opposition in Mystery Realm Tier and being invincible within this cultivation level.","Only then did he meet up with Princess Bixiao, and find out about the current situation.","Reality surprised him, because aside from Tang Yun’er and Niu Jianhua, there were actually a great many extraterrestrial visitors that had descended. They were all the descendants of great elites. Their elders had predicted that the Celestial Sea Planet was about to awaken, and there would be great opportunities, so they sent their own descendants over to see if they could gain some glory.","In terms of star level, the grade of the Celestial Sea Planet definitely couldn’t be considered high, but the heaven and eart had just awakened, so there would definitely be a great many thousand-year-old treasured medicines appearing. There were some that even Sect Master-level elites were tempted by, so it was naturally necessary for them to make a trip.","However, the treasure troves had already been allocated cleanly, and there was no news of any Celestial Plants appearing. Hence, a great many extraterrestrial outsiders settled down in the Imperial Capital. After all, this place was prosperous.","“Now, from the Eldest Imperial Prince to the Thirteenth Imperial Prince, all of them have leaped over the Celestial Gate and become Foundation Building Tier elites,” Princess Bixiao said. “You must be careful. Though His Majesty is protecting you, those people are His Majesty’s own children, after all. Even if they really killed you, His Majesty would not punish them harshly.”","In a one-on-one battle, she was unafraid of even the Eldest Imperial Prince, who was born with a Divine Physique. However, if it was a battle of one against thirteen, even if she could match them, it was inevitable that she would be careless. It was impossible that she would be able to protect Ling Han completely.","Ling Han nodded. Right now, the pressure on him was still quite heavy. After all, if he wasn’t a Foundation Building cultivator, he would only be a mortal in the end.","“As long as all the shackles are unlocked, I will begin to break through to Celestial Path.”","Ling Han thought. He was sure that by that time, he would have accumulated enough mystical power to leap over the Celestial Gate.","Next, he began to live a low-key life. He stayed in his room all day and cultivated for a while. Most of his time was spent on the practice of the An character. This Buddhist Race technique was truly extensive and profound. It was clearly just a single word, yet it could produce all kinds of changes.","He discovered that he was still far from grasping the true meaning of this word.","After the little loli and the pervert pig met, they actually hit it off at first sight, and began to plan something in collusion. Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to care about them either. He only said that it was fine if they wanted to cause damage, but they definitely had to target bad people.","For example, the Seventh Imperial Prince.","A few days later, Princess Bixiao came to look for him.","“Empress Ma, Imperial Consort Lin and the others have joined forces to host a banquet, and have also given two invitations to the Foreign Affairs Department,” this princess of the Demon Race said.","“They’re still in the mood to host a banquet at a time like this?” Ling Han took the invitation and opened it. The words were very limited, just clearly expressing an invitation the banquet tomorrow night at Jiuhua Palace in the Imperial Palace.","“The Eldest Imperial Prince and the others have broken through to Celestial Path, and this is naturally a grand event for the Imperial Family. However, His Majesty has not appeared all this while, and no one else has had the chance to bring this up. Now, the Thirteenth Prince has also broken through a month ago, and the empress and noblewomen could no longer bear it,” Princess Bixiao said.","“When a mother hosts a celebratory feast for her son, even if His Majesty knows, it would not be appropriate to reprimand her.”","Princess Bixiao paused for a moment before asking, “Are you going?”","“Of course I’m going,” Ling Han said with a smile.","According to Princess Bixiao, Ling Han had best not show himself. When he advanced into Celestial Path, even if he was outnumbered, with his freakish talent, it would not be a problem for him to carve out a bloody path to escape.","But now, no matter how invincible you are in Mystery Realm Tier, you are still mortal. How could mortals fight against celestials?","“Then you had best keep a low profile, and not give the Eldest Imperial Prince and the others the chance to flip out,” she said solemnly.","“Don’t I have you to protect me?” Ling Han teased.","“Do you think I’m your bodyguard?” Princess Bixiao asked in irritation.","Ling Han chuckled upon hearing this. He didn’t have any ulterior motives toward this princess of the Demon Race, so he knew when to stop. He didn’t tease her any further, lest something “happen”.","Moreover, the empress and the others were about to come out. If they saw that Ling Han had courted a girl outside, they would definitely be jealous.","When Tang Yun’er found out, she also shouted that she wanted to go to the Imperial Palace. Naturally, she was suppressed by Ling Han. This little devil only knew how to cause damage, and if she went, who knew what kind of calamity would be caused.","The little loli was naturally very displeased, pouting and sulking.","“There, just obediently stay at home.” Ling Han tossed the perverted pig over to the little loli.","Pa, in a fit of pique, the little loli pushed with both hands, and threw out the perverted pig that had been thrown at her.","“Gu!” The perverted pig screamed. Who had it offended?","On the evening of the second day, Ling Han and Princess Bixiao arrived at the entrance. To attend the Imperial Banquet, they naturally had to travel by car. If they ran over on foot, that would really be laughable.","Today, Princess Bixiao was wearing light makeup. She was already extremely enchanting to begin with, and now, she was even more dazzling, causing Ling Han to whistle involuntarily.","“I say, are you planning to steal the limelight from the main characters?” he asked, smiling.","Princess Bixiao rolled her eyes at him.. ‘A girl will dress herself up for him who loves her, understand?’"]},{"number":3642,"title":"Chapter 3642 - Forced Marriage","paragraphs":["Forced Marriage","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Although martial arts had recovered, and modern technology could no longer contend with martial artists, there were still some things that were very practical.","For example, a car.","Ling Han and Princess Bixiao sat in an extended car, which was very eye-catching. However, the speed was really too slow, and it took them more than 40 minutes to finally arrive within the vicinity of the Imperial Palace. Originally, this place was a restricted area, and the driver could not go any further, but this time, Ling Han and the princess both had invitations, so he told the driver to continue driving.","At the entrance to the Imperial Palace, they were stopped, and only after carefully examining their invitations, were they allowed to pass.","The driver was extremely excited. It was naturally impossible for him to enter into the Imperial Palace, but now, not only had he entered, he had even driven his car in, making him feel as if he was in a dream.","Very quickly, the car arrived at Jiuhua Palace.","The driver refused to accept the money no matter what, and said, “Milord and lady, it’s all thanks to you that I had the chance to enter the Imperial Palace and realize my lifelong dream. How can I still accept your money?”","With these words, Ling Han and Princess Bixiao didn’t insist any longer. They alighted from the car.","It wasn’t time for the banquet yet, but there was already a sea of people here.","Obviously, the empress and the Imperial Consorts had invited a great many people this time. The Foreign Affairs Department only had two invitations, and that was because the Imperial Princes and the Foreign Affairs Department did not have a good relationship with the Foreign Affairs Department, so they had only given two invitations to be polite.","By the looks of it, all the clans in the Imperial Capital, large and small, had been invited. However, a great many people were not qualified to enter into the palace, so they could only join in on the excitement outside.","But for these people, being able to enter into the Imperial Palace was already a great honour.","Not only were there clans from the Imperial Capital, but there were also sects and forces that had submitted to the Dark North Nation. The empress had sent an invitation, so who would dare to take it lightly?","This was the wife of a Spirit Transformation True Lord. No matter what, they had to give her some face.","Thus, today was really a day when everyone revolved around the main characters.","Ling Han and Princess Bixiao were extremely low-key, and they didn’t greet anyone. However, Princess Bixiao was far too beautiful, and she immediately became the focus of everyone’s attention upon disembarking from the car. They all stared at her without blinking.","Even now, there was still an extremely limited number of newly advanced Celestial Path elites, and as for females, only Princess Bixiao was one of them. Even if she was not very beautiful, she would still gain a great deal of attention, what more when she was breathtakingly beautiful.","The two of them couldn’t keep a low profile even if they wanted to. The crowds discussed spiritedly, and the news of the arrival of the two Chiefs of the Foreign Affairs Department quickly spread out.","Ling Han didn’t mind. So be it if it was known. If he was afraid of trouble, he wouldn’t have come either.","After entering the hall, the two of them found their own seats. However, what was infuriating was that not only were their seats not together, but Ling Han, the Chief of the Department, actually fell far behind Princess Bixiao.","Was this in accordance with the rules?","Ling Han stroked his chin and said, “His Majesty personally bestowed you the title of Princess. Thus, it’s reasonable to place you in front.”","Princess Bixiao frowned and said, “This is clearly a show of strength for you. They want to embarrass you, and you’re just going to tolerate it?”","This was not in line with Ling Han’s personality.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Look at what you’re saying. Am I the kind of person who would take revenge for the smallest grievance?”","Princess Bixiao did not speak, but her eyes were filled with certainty.","“It’s fine. Believe me, I’ve been cultivating my temperament recently. As long as others don’t step on top of me, I can’t be bothered,” Ling Han said with a smile. Though Princess Bixiao did not quite believe it, she did not say anything. She went ahead.","She was exquisitely beautiful, and now that she had advanced into Celestial Path, her bearing was also ethereal and captivating. Naturally, she was immediately revered by the masses. All the Imperial Princes gathered around her, trying their best to curry her favour.","To say nothing else, merely the fact that she was the first person to advance into Celestial Path after the awakening of heaven and earth made her worthy of marrying.","It was not just the Imperial Princes. The extraterrestrial visitors were also very interested in Princess Bixiao. They were completely unafraid of those Imperial Princes, and similarly approached to cotton up to her.","When it was seven o’clock, the sky was already completely dark, and the guests had all arrived. Empress Ma and the other Imperial Consorts all came out, and a dead silence instantly fell.","Though their strength was very ordinary, they were the wives and concubines of a Spirit Transformation True Lord, so they naturally had to be respected. After a few words from the noblewomen, the banquet began.","Ling Han merely ate with his head lowered. He couldn’t be bothered to lower himself to the level of these women. Speaking of which, they were all his juniors, so he couldn’t bring himself to argue with them.","Of course, the prerequisite was that they did not trifle with him.","With Chen Fengyan suppressing them, the atmosphere was extremely harmonious. Everyone was complimenting the Eldest Imperial Prince and the others, praising them as giants among men, and saying that their future achievements wouldn’t be inferior to Chen Fengyan’s.","Ling Han almost wanted to sleep upon hearing this. As he saw it, aside from the Eldest Imperial Prince, who still had some future prospects, the other Imperial Princes were all mediocre. At most, they would only advance into the Cauldron Forging Tier.","“Bixiao!” Empress Ma suddenly changed the topic to Princess Bixiao, “It has already been two years since you came to the Imperial Capital, right?”","“That’s right,” Princess Bixiao said gently, though she could smack that noble lady who was seated high up in the main seat to death with a single wave of her hand.","Empress Ma nodded, and continued, “Then after so much time has passed, you had best think carefully. Which Imperial Prince are you going to marry?” Yi, was this a forced marriage?","When the Demon Race princess entered into the Imperial Capital, she had come with the mission of marriage. She was going to marry a certain Imperial Prince, but it was up to her to decide who she would marry.","Now, Empress Ma was forcing her in public, forcing Princess Bixiao to make a choice.","Everyone was paying attention, and the Eldest Imperial Prince and the others all looked proud. A few of them were even looking at Ling Han with provoking eyes.","—What right do you think you have to sit here?","It was to let you see this scene with your own eyes.","No matter what choice Princess Bixiao made, it would still be benefiting them. She would marry an Imperial Prince, and would have no chance with Ling Han.","Ling Han remained calm and collected. He wanted to see how Princess Bixiao would choose. Worse come to worst, he would reveal his identity as Chen Fengyan’s uncle, and slap them one after another.","Princess Bixiao smiled faintly, and said, “Bixiao is presently prioritizing cultivating. Furthermore, after Your Imperial Highnesses have advanced into Celestial Path, your lifespans would be at least in the thousands, so there is absolutely no need for you to be anxious.”","“How could that be allowed!” Empress Ma shook her head, “As the saying goes, one should get married and start their career, and only after they have married, would they be able to rest easy. Bixiao, could it be that you think that there is not a single Imperial Prince that is worthy of you?”","These words were very harsh.","“Empress Ma, you’ve gone too far with your words!” A young man suddenly stood up, “I think Lady Bixiao’s words are reasonable. As cultivators, we should set aside our romantic affairs and pursue that supreme great dao.”","His name was Zhu Sen, and he was an extraterrestrial visitor. He himself was an elite of the Foundation Building Tier, and his grandfather was also a Spirit Transformation True Lord. Thus, there was no need for him to revere Empress Ma.","“That’s right.” Another young man stood up, holding a wine cup in his hand, appearing extremely casual, “Furthermore, the matter of marriage still has to depend on the wishes of both parties. What meaning is there to force them to be together?”","His name was Zhou Yang, and he was also an extraterrestrial visitor. His background wasn’t inferior to Zhu Sen’s.."]},{"number":3643,"title":"Chapter 3643 - All the Imperial Princes were defeated","paragraphs":["All the Imperial Princes were defeated","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Empress Ma’s expression was slightly ugly.","She was using this banquet to force a marriage from Princess Bixiao, and was definitely going to force her to express her stand. She had not thought that two extraterrestrial visitors would actually interfere.","What did this have to do with them?","She knew that Zhu Sen and Zhou Yang had definitely taken a fancy to Princess Bixiao, and that was why they were “speaking up for justice”. However, there was nothing she could do. Their background was not the slightest bit inferior to hers, so what could she use to suppress them?","Moreover, the Celestial Sea Planet’s situation was very delicate at this moment. Although Chen Fengyan could withstand the pressure of the other four Spirit Transformation True Lords, what about a few more?","Thus, Empress Ma didn’t dare to be stubborn and help Chen Fengyan make another powerful enemy.","Her words were stifled, and she could not speak at all.","When Imperial Consort Liu saw this, she hurriedly continued, “Alright, well talk about Bixiao later. Today is the Imperial Princes’ big day. Come, let’s drink.”","“Congratulations, Imperial Princes, for leaping over the Celestial Gate and becoming Foundation Building elites!”","“Having stepped onto the Celestial Path, one can pursue the great dao!”","“This is the fortune of our Empire.”","Everyone was boot-licking. However, those extraterrestrial visitors all looked disdainful.","They were really a group of ignorant boors. Was it worth being so excited about having stepped onto the Celestial Path?","On their planet, wouldn’t it be a matter of course to become a Foundation Building cultivator? With the background of Spirit Transformation Tier-level, it would be strange if they couldn’t step onto the Celestial Path.","It could not be helped. This planet had just awakened, so it was very normal for cultivation to be wilted. If it was not for the fact that the prison had been opened ahead of time, extraterrestrial visitors like them would be able to sweep aside all opposition and be invincible.","The Eldest Imperial Prince and the others were all glowing with happiness. Today was the day that they would reach the pinnacle of their lives. This was the Celestial Path, a height that they could only look up to in the past.","Now that they had set foot, they would be able to reach the apex in the future. With a father who was a Spirit Transformation True Lord, sheltering them from the elements and snatching opportunities for them, their future prospects would be limitless.","“I’m Zhou Yang, and I’ve just formed my Heavenly Dao Foundation. However, I’m willing to seal my cultivation level to Human Dao Foundation. I’d like to ask for some guidance from the Imperial Princes,” a disharmonious voice suddenly said.","The extraterrestrial visitor, Zhou Yang, stood up once more, provoking the Eldest Imperial Prince and the others.","Should they accept it or not?","They definitely had to accept the challenge. The other party had already called them out, and he had also said that he would seal his cultivation level. If they still didn’t dare to accept the challenge, what face would the Imperial Family have?","The expressions of Empress Ma, Imperial Consort Liu and the others were all dark. These outsiders were really not giving them any face. Previously, they had spoken up for Princess Bixiao, and now, they were issuing a challenge to the Imperial Princes. To publicly embarrass them like this was really going too far.","However, he had a very powerful background, and it was not appropriate for the Dark North Nation to make any more powerful enemies, so they really could not afford to offend him.","To say the least, even if they wanted to suppress him, there was nothing they could do.","Zhou Yang was a Heavenly Dao Foundation elite, but how many elites were there in the Imperial Family?","Could it be that he still had to ask the sects that had submitted to them to make a move?","That would really be hilarious. The Imperial Family was really too weak.","Thus, after the Imperial Princes exchanged looks, the Thirteenth Imperial Prince was the first to step out, and say, “Then please provide guidance.”","Zhou Yang showed a hint of mockery, “Please.”","The two of them exchanged blows, and in only ten moves, the Thirteenth Prince was suppressed.","“Young Master Zhou, what meaning is there to suppress others with your cultivation level?” a courtier said. He had received instructions from Empress Ma. Otherwise, how could a mere Inscription Tier cultivator like him dare to challenge a Foundation Building elite?","Zhou Yang did not speak, and merely sent out a palm strike towards the Tenth Imperial Prince.","Boom, a frightening power surged out, and the Tenth Imperial Prince was completely unable to match it, and was instantly sent flying.","This was his answer.","You see, if I displayed the strength of Heavenly Dao Foundation, I would be as strong as this.","Furthermore, he had made an example of the Tenth Imperial Prince to display his true battle prowess. Just how much contempt was he showing?","So what if they were from the Imperial Family? He was completely unafraid. ‘You guys aren’t Chen Fengyan!’","Everyone was rendered speechless. Indeed, Zhou Yang hadn’t won the battle against the Thirteenth Prince with his cultivation level. Instead, it was because his battle prowess was far too powerful.","“Allow me to spar with you,” the Ninth Prince said as he walked over. His body was astonishingly sturdy, and it was as if he were a vicious bear.","“Make your move,” Zhou Yang said calmly.","The Ninth Prince moved, yet he was defeated after only 10 exchanges.","That made it two consecutive losses.","The Seventh Imperial Prince also stepped out, and said, “Brother Zhou’s strength is truly extraordinary. Let me spar with you.”","He was skilled in Spiritual Power, and after advancing into Celestial Path, this had been fully developed, making him confident that even against the Eldest Imperial Prince, who was born with a Divine Physique, he would not lose.","The Seventh Imperial Prince moved. With a thought, xiu, xiu, xiu, innumerable short swords instantly shot out from his body, and shot towards Zhou Yang like a barrage of arrows.","“Yi, what a powerful Spiritual Power!” Zhou Yang showed a hint of seriousness. The attacks of Spiritual Power elites were surprising, and could be delivered from any angle, catching others off guard.","However, he was fearless. How strong could the battle prowess of a person from a place that was lagging behind in martial arts be?","The Seventh Imperial Prince was not too bad. At one point, he had managed to exchange a few blows with Zhou Yang, but just when everyone was cheering for him, thinking that he could win back some face for the Dark North Nation, Zhou Yang suddenly exploded, and defeated the Seventh Imperial Prince in a few moves.","Ling Han could see very clearly that the Seventh Imperial Prince had actually lost because he did not have a good Spiritual Power Spirit Tool.","If the Seventh Imperial Prince possessed the Heavenly Pattern Jade, it was guaranteed that Zhou Yang would be a hundred times more troubled, and it would be difficult to say who would emerge victorious.","But once the Seventh Imperial Prince was defeated, aside from the Eldest Imperial Prince, the other Imperial Princes all gave up any thoughts of making a move.","They had competed internally before, and the Seventh Imperial Prince’s battle prowess was only inferior to the Eldest Imperial Prince.","All of a sudden, everyone’s eyes were focused on the Eldest Imperial Prince.","The Eldest Imperial Prince had no choice but to move. The pride of the Imperial Family and the pride of the Dark North Nation were all on his shoulders. He had to defend this stage.","However, he wasn’t confident at all. His opponent was truly powerful, so much so that even with his innate Divine Physique, he had absolutely no chance of winning.","The two of them battled, and it wasn’t long before the Eldest Imperial Prince unleashed his full power. He even activated his natural Mystical Power, causing countless shards of green light to descend from the sky. Their might was tremendous.","“Yi, this is Mystical Power?” Zhou Yang knew what was good for him, and he said in surprise, “I never thought that you would actually have an Innate Divine Physique!”","Innate Divine Physiques were too rare. At least, he wasn’t one of them.","Even if the Eldest Imperial Prince was only a ninth grade Innate Divine Physique, he was still incredibly powerful. Once the Mystical Power was used, he instantly gained the upper hand.","Everyone cheered loudly, finally regaining their momentum.","However, the extraterrestrial visitors were all extremely calm. An Innate Divine Physique was indeed powerful, but after advancing into Celestial Path, those who used Divine Stones to build their foundations were not the slightest bit weak. Some top grade Divine Stones were even comparable to the second grade Divine Physiques.","As expected, Zhou Yang very quickly began his counterattack, and used a celestial technique. It was extraordinarily powerful, and managed to block the Eldest Imperial Prince’s Mystical Power.","The Mystical Power was indeed powerful, but it could not be channelled endlessly. This had a strong burden on the body, and could only be used as a powerful move.","Thus, once the Eldest Imperial Prince’s burst of power had passed, he immediately fell into a predicament of being on the back foot. Very soon, he was defeated.","At this point, the army of Imperial Princes was completely annihilated.","A proud expression appeared on Zhou Yang’s face, and he said, “Is there any other Imperial Prince that wants to spar with me?”","Everyone was silent. Their skills were inferior, so it would only be more humiliating if they tried to put on airs.","“Hahaha!” Those extraterrestrial visitors laughed loudly, filled with disdain.","This primitive land could not even withstand a single blow.","The faces of the ministers of the Dark North Nation were all burning hot. They were being slapped in the face like this in their own court; they couldn’t bear it!","But there was nothing that could be done. Who asked that the battle prowess of the Imperial Princes were indeed inferior?","Was there anyone, ah, was there anyone that could step out and deliver a harsh beating on these guys? How could it be that they could not find a single true prodigy in such a colossal planet and such a large country?","It was a shame that Hong Tianbu had betrayed them. Otherwise, he would definitely have been able to turn the tide.","“A battle at the same cultivation level?” Amidst this silence, a lazy voice rang out, “Let me teach you a lesson!”"]},{"number":3644,"title":"Chapter 3644 - Nine Battles, Nine Victories","paragraphs":["Nine Battles, Nine Victories","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Someone still jumped out at this time?","Everyone turned to look at the source of the voice, and their hearts all jolted.","So it was this guy.","...The two prodigies of the Imperial Capital, aside from Hong Tianbu, there was also Ling Han!","Faced with multiple pairs of eyes, Ling Han was still slowly eating, as if those bold words just now had not come from his mouth.","Zhou Yang sneered, and said, “A mere Mystery Realm Tier is worthy of fighting me?”","Ling Han was unmoved, and said calmly, “Come, suppress your cultivation level to the Mystery Realm Tier. I will defeat you within ten moves, and if I need one more move, I will make an exception and take you as my godson.” F* * *, how could this guy be so mean?","Zhou Yang couldn’t help but fly into a rage, “Ant, are you seeking death?”","“Do you dare? Just say the word,” Ling Han provoked.","“I don’t dare?” Zhou Yang shook his head, and said, “I’m just disdainful.”","Ling Han pondered for a moment before retrieving the Heavenly Pattern Jade and shaking it. “I’ll use it as a wager. Whoever can defeat me at the same cultivation level can take this item away.”","“A Spiritual Power Spirit Tool!”","“Heavenly Pattern Jade!”","Zhou Yang, Zhu Sen, and the others all exclaimed in shock, looking envious.","They naturally knew what was what. Spiritual Power Spirit Tools were extremely rare, so even though it was only Two Star material, they were still tempted. In fact, even elites of the Core Formation Tier would treat them as treasures.","“I’ll go!”","“I’ll fight you!”","“No, I’ll go!”","Zhou Yang and the others were all in a rush to call out. They all wanted to exchange blows with Ling Han. How could a prodigy exist in a backward place like Celestial Sea Planet?","Thus, whoever made the first move would be able to obtain the Heavenly Pattern Jade.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “It’s easy to challenge me. Show me a treasure of equal value.”","Hold on, when did it become challenging you?","Didn’t you f****** jump out on your own volition?","However, the Heavenly Pattern Jade was too valuable, so they had no time to bother about this.","“I have a three-hundred-year-old yellow ginseng here. It is very nutritious to the blood and Qi, and can save one’s life at crucial moments,” Zhou Yang was the first to say. He took out a ginseng, and placed it on the table.","“All right, let’s battle.” Ling Han nodded.","Zhou Yang walked over, suppressing his cultivation level as he did so. The Celestial Path aura immediately disappeared.","Now, he was only Mystery Realm Tier-level.","Ling Han clasped his hands behind his back and said, “Those who want to challenge me, line up. You must bring out something good. If there is nothing good, I will not accept a challenge.”","F***, you are really too conceited, aren’t you? We haven’t even fought, and you think that you have defeated Zhou Yang?","As the person involved, Zhou Yang was naturally the most furious. In this primitive place, someone actually dared to look down on him like this?","He humphed, “How preposterous!”","Zhou Yang leaped forwards with a single step, and he immediately charged toward Ling Han. He was already impatient, and he wanted to defeat Ling Han to avoid being annoyed.","Facts talked louder than words.","“I’ll let you have the first ten moves.” Ling Han parried casually, only defending and not attacking.","Zhou Yang didn’t know Ling Han’s strength, so he simply thought that Ling Han couldn’t fight back at all. However, Ling Han was still stubbornly refusing to admit defeat. He humphed, and his attacks became even more rapid.","After only a few moves, Ling Han was sure that Zhou Yang should be a one-star genius. However, now that he had suppressed his cultivation level to the Mystery Realm Tier, Zhou Yang’s battle prowess was close to two stars, which was very extraordinary.","It was no wonder that he could defeat all the Imperial Princes. Even the Eldest Imperial Prince, who was born with a Divine Physique, was no match for him. A one-star genius was indeed very strong, and added with the fact that he had grasped a profound celestial technique, even the Eldest Imperial Prince was no match for him.","Seeing that Ling Han was only defending and not attacking, everyone also felt that it was normal.","He was an extraterrestrial visitor. Didn’t he see that even the Eldest Imperial Prince and the others had been defeated? Then what was so strange about Ling Han being outmatched?","However, you were so high-profile just now, and now you have been slapped in the face. Doesn’t that hurt?","This was also a humiliation to the Dark North Nation.","If Ling Han unleashed his might, he would be able to insta-kill Zhou Yang with a single move. However, if he did that, who would dare make a bet with him?","Wouldn’t that mean that there was no profit to be earned?","Thus, Ling Han’s action was naturally a long-term plan to catch a big fish.","—If the seven babies were here, with their understanding of Ling Han, they would definitely have long since known that Ling Han had begun to play tricks.","After several hundred exchanges, Ling Han finally started to unleash his might, defeating Zhou Yang with a slight advantage.","“Thanks.” Ling Han walked over and picked up the three-hundred-year-old yellow ginseng. He then wore an arrogant expression as he said, “Is there anyone else? Is there anyone else who can fight? What extraterrestrial visitor? He can’t even withstand a single blow.”","Hearing these words, Zhu Sen and the others were all enraged. This brat was really too arrogant, wasn’t he? He had only narrowly defeated Zhou Yang with a single move, and that was completely luck. What was there to be proud of?","“Everyone, step aside. I’ll deal with this brat.” A man in black walked out. He took out a piece of green metal and placed it on the table, “This is one star material, Tragic Green Metal. Is it enough?”","One Star ingredients naturally couldn’t compare to Two Star ingredients. Moreover, the Heavenly Pattern Jade was a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool at that, which was far more valuable than ordinary Two Star ingredients.","Ling Han didn’t mind. In any case, it was just earning some extra income.","“Not enough, but it doesn’t matter. In any case, you will definitely lose,” Ling Han said challengingly.","“You are really quite arrogant.” The man in black rushed over, and launched a fierce offensive.","Ling Han was still the same as before. He didn’t win with a single strike. Instead, he continued to battle with his opponent, giving the others the illusion that their strength was more or less equal.","After several hundred exchanges like this, Ling Han finally strengthened his offensive, defeating the man in black.","Two consecutive wins!","This time, everyone had a whole new respect for Ling Han.","In terms of the first battle, Ling Han had only been lucky. The two consecutive wins were enough to prove that was not the case.","This was not a stroke of luck.","Ling Han put away the Tragic Green Metal as well, “Sigh, can’t you send out a decent opponent? Sigh, they’re not even enough for me to fight.”","This was too arrogant, too arrogant.","“You’re nothing but a pawn from a backward place. Where do you get such arrogance from?” Another extraterrestrial visitor stepped out. He put down an alchemical pill, “This is the Three Transformations Pill, a Pseudo One Star alchemical pill. It can stimulate the evolution of level of being, and is greatly beneficial to you.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel disappointed. Although the effects of the Three Transformations Pill were what he needed, he had already ingested the Five Elements Karmic Pill. There was actually no meaning to ingesting an alchemical pill with a similar effect.","Otherwise, wouldn’t it be better to concoct two Five Elements Karmic Pills?","Forget it. If he didn’t use it himself, he could give it to others.","“Barely.” Ling Han waved his hand.","‘F*ck! You’re starting to look down on me?’","“Come battle.”","The battle began, and Ling Han still followed the old rules. He dragged out the battle for 300 moves before finally defeating his opponent.","Three consecutive wins.","Ling Han became more and more arrogant. To him, attracting animosity was really too easy. He only needed to act as he was.","One after another, extraterrestrial visitors leaped out. They could not bear this provocation; it was too infuriating.","One person came, and one person lost. There was no one that could defeat Ling Han.","Nine battles, nine victories.","This time, those extraterrestrial visitors were all dumbfounded. Nine battles, nine victories. Though they had all barely won, it was enough to illustrate the problem.","Ling Han was very, very strong, though he was very arrogant, causing others to grit their teeth in hatred.","“Anyone else?” Ling Han said with a smile. He swept his gaze around, but no one answered. Now, everyone had to consider whether they were stronger than the previous nine people. Otherwise, if they went up, they would only be delivering a defeat, and be humiliated in vain.","“I’ll go.” After a long time, Zhu Sen walked out.."]},{"number":3645,"title":"Chapter 3645 - Just a single punch","paragraphs":["Just a single punch","Translator: Henyee Translations I Editor: Henyee Translations","This should be the last one.","Ling Han sighed internally. No one was an idiot, especially those extraterrestrial visitors that had been sent here. All of them were descendants of their clans, the prized sons of their sects, and all of them were extremely intelligent.","He had fought nine battles and claimed nine victories. Though these were all very “difficult” victories, they would still be seen through.","-Pretending to be a pig to eat a tiger, and deliberately setting a trap.","“There’s only one?” Ling Han deliberately looked around, “I don’t mind if you guys have a few more, five then. How about all of you attack together?” No one answered.","“Ten?” Ling Han relaxed the conditions again. “I’ll fight ten by myself. If I lose, you guys leave the treasures behind. If you win, you can take the Heavenly Pattern Jade.”","Instantly, a few people were itching to give it a try, but in the end, no one responded.","Sigh, what a bunch of cowards. They were scared just like that.","“Even with ten of you, you wouldn’t dare; I really overestimated you guys!” Ling Han shook his head, his expression filled with mockery.","Seeing how arrogant he was, while the extraterrestrial visitors almost exploded in anger, the people from the Dark North Nation were all indescribably excited. This was what it meant to be f****** p ud!","Sure enough, the title of the Twin Prodigies of the Imperial Capital wasn’t for nothing.","It was fine even if Hong Tianbu left. They still had Ling Han, who could sweep aside all opponents at the same cultivation level.","However, the expressions of Empress Ma, the other consorts, the Eldest Imperial Prince and the others were all extremely unfriendly. The enmity between them and Ling Han had become very serious, so they naturally could not bear to see Ling Han act so mighty.","It was fine whoever could redeem the pride of the Dark North Nation for Ling Han, but it definitely couldn’t be Ling Han. Instead of having him redeem the pride of the Dark North Nation, it would be better to lose face.","“Brat, you still haven’t defeated me yet!” Zhu Sen said calmly. He was filled with confidence in himself. If Ling Han’s abilities were the same as what he had previously displayed, his chances of victory were assured.","Ling Han crooked a finger. Zhu Sen took out a One Star Celestial medicine. He was quite satisfied with that. After advancing into Celestial Path, he would begin concocting Celestial pills, and naturally needed Celestial medicines as the main ingredient.","“Brat, you are too arrogant!”","“He’s just lucky and won by a narrow margin. What’s there to be proud of?”","“If Brother Zhu makes a move, you will definitely lose.”","The extraterrestrial visitors all called out. Originally, there had not been any relations between them, but now, they were united against a common enemy. Zhu Sen was brimming with confidence as he strode toward Ling Han. Boom! Fiery flames erupted from his body, and it was as if they were heaven-reaching flames.","Yi?","Ling Han was stunned for a moment. If he used Spiritual Power to communicate with high-level energy, it would only be able to entwine the high-level energy around his hands and feet. At most, he would still have the opened apertures, so mystical power would be released from the apertures, and his whole person would be like a porcupine.","The current Zhu Sen was completely different. His whole person was wrapped in flames, yet did not hurt him in the slightest.","Realization dawned on him. Zhu Sen was an Innate Divine Physique.","“Mystical Power of Flames,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Zhu Sen said proudly, “I am an eighth grade Divine Physique!”","Even though it was only eighth grade, the Innate Divine Physique was extremely rare. Even if only a ninth grade Divine Physique appeared, it would still alert the heaven and earth. Thunder would rumble, and an eighth grade Innate Divine Physique would definitely be even more powerful.","No wonder he dared to step out and issue a challenge even though he clearly knew that Ling Han was a wolf in sheep’s clothing.","The Innate Divine Physique was stronger when encountering others.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and said, “So what if you have an Innate Divine Physique? I can defeat you with a single punch!”","Arrogant!” Zhu Sen said with a cold chuckle. He leaped over like a god of flames.","Ling Han was finally getting serious. Boom! The apertures of a complete cycle lit up at the same time, forming a screen of light around him. Then, he threw a punch at Zhu Sen.","With his current strength, he had already used a Mystical Power, so what need was there for him to use other techniques?","The flames surged over, yet they were completely unable to penetrate the starlight Screen. However, Ling Han’s fist was unstoppable, and a terrifying power surged. Peng! It was like a great mountain was crushing down, penetrating Zhu Sen’s defenses and striking his chest.","Then, Zhu Sen was sent flying.","“Ah!” Zhu Sen roared in fury. His body was in midair, but a terrifying aura was surging within his body. That was the Celestial Path-level oppressive might that could crush mortals.","He released the suppression of his cultivation level, and became an elite of Heavenly Dao Foundation again.","This was too despicable. A native from a backward place had actually sent him flying with a single punch.","Humiliating, this was too humiliating!","There was complete silence.","Though everyone had already guessed that Ling Han had been screwing others over all this while, deliberately making it seem as if he was locked in a stalemate with his opponent, and his motive was to trick them into making a bet with him, they had never imagined that once he went all out, Ling Han would be as strong as this.","An eighth grade Innate Divine Physique! Moreover, he had used the Mystical","Power, yet he had actually been sent flying with a single punch!","-If Zhu Sen had not released his Foundation Building cultivation level in time,","this punch would have been enough to half-kill him.","He was too strong.","How could there be such a powerful Mystery Realm Tier?","If Ling Han advanced into Celestial Path, just how powerful would he be?","That’s right. There were indeed a great many prodigies that had disappeared among the masses after leaping over the Celestial Gate, but there were a great many prodigies that had maintained their standards, and continued to be freakish. And with Ling Han’s present standards, even if he had been slightly weaker when leaping over the Celestial Gate, half of a hundred feet tall tree was still much taller than a ten feet tall tree.","This kind of freak... just the thought of it was terrifying.","He should just kill him to get rid of future trouble.","All of a sudden, practically all the extraterrestrial visitors were filled with killing intent, as they all stared at Ling Han.","Princess Bixiao was extremely anxious. Though her battle prowess was extraordinary, she would only be able to block one or two cultivators of the same cultivation level, at most. After advancing into Celestial Path, the gap among prodigies had actually shrunk. Furthermore, among these extraterrestrial visitors, which one of them was mediocre?","Meanwhile, the Imperial Princes all smiled slightly. It was not appropriate for them to make a move on Ling Han, but there was no rule that stated that if others made a move on Ling Han, they would still have to step out and resolve the matter.","Die, this kind of prodigy that would steal their limelight.","They didn’t care. In any case, their old man was a Spirit Transformation True Lord, so how could it be that the Dark North Nation needed a Mystery Realm Tier to support it?","Ling Han stood proudly, a faint smile on his face, appearing extremely calm.","He wasn’t confident in his own strength, but he was confident that Chen Fengyan definitely wouldn’t allow outsiders to behave atrociously in the Imperial Capital. Moreover, he was his uncle!","As expected, the great formation of the Imperial Capital was activated. A light figure took human form, and said calmly, “Cultivators of Celestial Path are not allowed to make a move on mortals. Anyone who disobeys will be killed!” His voice wasn’t loud, yet it was filled with a domineering aura. Even heaven and earth had to obey his commands!","Zhu Sen was just about to attack, yet he forcefully suppressed his urge.","This shadowy figure was far too powerful, so much so that even he felt apprehensive.","Formation Spirit?","No, it wasn’t that simple. It shpould be a combination of a Formation Spirit and the will of a Spirit Transformation True Lord.","“Greetings, True Lord Chen!” The extraterrestrial visitors all clasped their hands in greeting, their expressions solemn.","This was a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and even in the universe, this was considered a great elite. Who dared to disrespect him?","This wasn’t something like Empress Ma, only someone related to Chen Fengyan. Instead, it was a True Lord that was manifesting his intent, and it was as if they were facing Chen Fengyan.","The shadowy figure raised a hand, “You all have come to search for fated opportunities. I have the capacity to accommodate the whole world, and will not do anything to you, but if you harm my citizens, I will not spare you.” “Yes.” The extraterrestrial visitors all obeyed. No one dared to talk back to a Spirit Transformation True Lord. That would be courting death.."]},{"number":3646,"title":"Chapter 3646 - Envoy from the Holy Land","paragraphs":["Envoy from the Holy Land","Translator: Henyee Translations ] Editor: Henyee Translations","After the light-person finished speaking, his body turned into bits of light that disappeared without a trace.","What was this Chen Fengyan doing all day? Why did he always send his doppelganger or mental projection to do things? It was almost impossible to see his true self.","Could it be that he was about to break through to the fourth pinnacle level, and wanted to become a great elite of Sect Master-level?","It was possible. Thus, he was very tolerant now, because as long as he became a","Sect Master level, how could the likes of the Primordial True Lord and others be able to withstand a single strike from him?","The conflict that was about to happen was resolved, but the atmosphere could no longer go back to how it had once been. The extraterrestrial visitors all had ugly expressions. They were actually suppressed by a Mystery Realm Tier, which made them feel suffocated.","But in a battle of equal cultivation levels, they were really no match.","“Hmph, what’s the point of a Mystery Realm Tier being invincible among his peers?”","“That’s right. When they leaped over the Celestial Gate, how many prodigies","had died?”","“You can only show off a little now. After he advances into the Celestial Path, in a battle of equal cultivation levels, I will be able to kill him easily.","“Foundation Building Tier is the starting point of cultivation. It’s completely meaningless to compare to the mortal level.","Not long after, these extraterrestrial visitors all became excited on their own, and belittled Ling Han without caring about the facts.","This was very infuriating. They were clearly outmatched in a battle of equal cultivation levels, yet still turned around to mock him.","Ling Han didn’t say anything. He simply retrieved the treasures that he had just won and placed them on the table.","Instantly, those extraterrestrial visitors were rendered speechless.","These stakes were their humiliation, and also Ling Han’s battle merits. What else could they say?","The banquet continued, but everyone lost interest.","The extraterrestrial visitors all hoped that the banquet would end quickly, so that they could leave, while the subjects of the Dark North Nation were discussing Ling Han spiritedly. As expected, His Majesty still thought very highly of this young prodigy. Should they find a chance to stuff some women of marriageable age into the Foreign Affairs Department?","The main characters of this banquet were obviously the Eldest Imperial Prince and the others, but now, everyone was thinking of Ling Han. It was just that different people had different feelings.","Empress Ma saw this, and also felt that it was meaningless for the banquet to continue. She stood up, and was just about to announce the end of the banquet.","However, right at this moment, boom! A meteor suddenly streaked across the","sky.","Yi, it looked so familiar.","Not good, it was the little loli Tang Yun’er, who had crashed over with the shuttle.","Ling Han was just about to use the Imminent Skyline to leave, when he discovered that the meteor had actually braked abruptly, and stopped in midair in an incredibly bizarre manner. It was only about 30 meters above their heads.","It wasn’t Tang Yun’er.","Ling Han thought to himself. Firstly, the little loli didn’t have such good skills that she could stop just like that. Secondly, the shuttle looked different.","“Very good. With so many people here, it can also save me a lot of time.” A voice was heard from within the shuttle, “I am an envoy from the Holy Land of Metal Element, and have especially come for the Metal Element Fruit Gathering that is held in a year’s time.”","“Holy Land of Metal Element!”","“Metal Element Fruit Gathering!”","All of a sudden, the extraterrestrial visitors became incredibly excited. They naturally knew what the words “Holy Land of Metal Element” represented.","A Holy Land, only those forces that had produced Saints would be qualified to be called a Holy Land.","The shuttle slowly stopped, and a middle-aged man walked out from within. His expression was extraordinarily proud. Thinking about it, it made sense. Coming from a force of Saint-level, it was understandable that he was extremely proud.","“Greetings, rniord!” The extraterrestrial visitors all bowed in greeting, their faces all smiles.","Seeing their expressions, no matter how stupid the people from the Dark North Nation were, they knew that the Holy Land of Metal Element was extremely awesome, and this Metal Element Fruit Gathering was probably also extremely grand, and they would be able to obtain great benefits.","The middle-aged man wore a reserved expression. Although he was only at the Foundation Building Tier, with his background, even elites at the Core Formation Tier would treat him with utmost respect.","He was very pleased with the treatment he was receiving, yet deliberately kept a straight face, and said calmly, “I have been commanded to come here to find prodigies, and bestow them the qualifications to participate in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering. I had not thought that there would be so many prodigies in this declining land.”","“Lord, you may not know, but I am not from the Celestial Sea Planet. I am from the Flying Rain Sect of the Crimson Alchemy Planet.”","“I’m from the Nine Sinking Sect of Setting Sun Planet.”","Everyone introduced themselves, one after another. They hurriedly drew a clear dividing line between themselves and the Celestial Sea Planet. They had no wish to be thought of as natives of a backward place.","“So that’s how it is.” The middle-aged man nodded. His name was Wan Ziping, and after being sucked up to like crazy, he naturally announced his name. Being called Lord Wan repeatedly, he felt even more pleased.","“Never mind. I am commanded to search for prodigies. I don’t care about background, as long as they are talented enough.”","“Come, everyone, step forwards one by one. As long as you place your hand on the shuttle, this Spirit Tool will automatically judge whether you are qualified to go to the Holy Land of Metal Element.","He was a little overbearing, but the Holy Land and Fruit Gathering that he had thrown out had struck them dizzy. Even Empress Ma and the Eldest Imperial Prince did not step forwards to stop him. Instead, they first sent someone to investigate the situation.","After learning of the background of the Holy Land of Metal Element, they all inhaled sharply.","Saint!","What kind of lofty existence was this? There was no need for him to make a move at all. A single thought was enough to make the Celestial Sea Planet crumble.","Of course, having a Saint appear and having a Saint present were two completely different matters. However, even if the Holy Land of Metal Element no longer had Saints, who could compare to their background?","There was definitely a Saint Tool suppressing the Holy Land, and even if a Venerate Tier cultivator went, they would only be seeking death.","Everyone obediently queued up. Not one of them dared to shout loudly, fearing that they would be disqualified.","“Those below Celestial Path don’t have to join in on the excitement,” Wan Ziping said. He pulled a person out of the group, his expression filled with disdain.","What, the lowest requirement to qualify was Foundation Building Tier?","This was enough to eliminate 99°/° of the people here.","Meanwhile, the extraterrestrial visitors all wore cold smirks. What kind of place did he think the Holy Land of Metal Element was? Did he think that just anyone had the right to go there?","Quite a number of people’s eyes flew towards Ling Han. So what if you are freakish?","Without reaching the Foundation Building Tier, one wouldn’t even be qualified to undergo the test!","Haha, he could only watch wide-eyed as the great opportunity flew away. He must be feeling very terrible.","The test was in progress, and those who passed would be enshrouded by a ray of light, which would leave behind a mark. This was the qualification for participation in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering.","Those who had passed naturally looked pleased, while those who had not looked livid.","judging by the current situation, if one wanted to pass, they would have to be a one-star genius.","Princess Bixiao walked over, curtsied to Wan Ziping, and said, “Bixiao pays respects to Lord Wan.”","Wan Ziping’s eyes involuntarily lit up. This kind of beauty was really rare. Even in the Holy Daughter, merely in terms of beauty, she could be ranked among the Holy Daughters.","He couldn’t help but become gentle, and asked, “What is it?","“Bixiao earnestly requests for an exception, Lord,” Princess Bixiao said. She pointed at Ling Han, and continued, “This is Ling Han, and he’s currently Mystery Realm Tier, and he’s invincible against those at the same cultivation level. Moreover, he’s only a step away from reaching the Celestial Path. One year is enough for him to reach the Foundation Building Tier.","“You want me to make an exception for him and grant him the right?” Wan Ziping asked.","“Yes.” Princess Bixiao curtsied.","Wan Ziping couldn’t help but laugh loudly, “A mere backward place, and someone actually dares to boast that he is invincible among his peers? Rules are rules.. Without reaching the Foundation Building Tier, what right do you have to go to the Holy Land?”"]},{"number":3647,"title":"Chapter 3647 - Another way","paragraphs":["Another way","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“That’s right. What right does a mere Mystery Realm Tier have to be on the same level as us?” Zhou Yang and the others immediately began to mock and ridicule him. The few people who had lost to Ling Han were all one-star geniuses. They all passed the test and obtained a spot.","This comparison was very stark. They had stood out from the rest, but Ling Han was not even qualified to take part in the test. Hehe.","Princess Bixiao still wanted to say something, yet Wan Ziping waved her off, expressing clear refusal.","Ling Han walked over, smiled, and said, “No need to waste your breath on him.”","“But, the Metal Element Fruit Gathering is really very important,” Princess Bixiao said anxiously. “Don’t be rash! I’ve asked around just now, and the Holy Land of Metal Element will hold a Metal Element Fruit Gathering every twenty years. Not only will supreme celestial techniques be taught, but there will also be celestial fruits that the Holy Land of Metal Element has been keeping in their treasure chamber.”","“If you can attend the Metal Element Fruit Gathering, it would be enough to save you a hundred years, or even several hundred years of cultivation time.”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I didn’t say I wasn’t going.”","Princess Bixiao was stunned. ‘You’re not even qualified to participate in the test, so how are you supposed to go?’","“Don’t worry. We don’t necessarily need to depend on him to go to the Holy Land of Metal Element.” Ling Han smiled, and said, “Alright, don’t worry about my matters. It’s like you are my wife.”","“You still have a glib tongue!” Princess Bixiao stomped her feet in anger.","Everyone was tested, one after another, and even the Eldest Imperial Prince and the others were no exception.","Holy Land, what kind of place was that!","However, the Eldest Imperial Prince passed, the Seventh Imperial Prince also passed, and the other Imperial Princes were mercilessly dismissed.","“Three days later, head to these coordinates. The Holy Land will activate a large-scale formation to teleport all of you over,” Wan Ziping said, announcing a set of coordinates. Then, he sneered, “Those who have not passed the test need not waste time. There are no marks on your bodies. After the formation is activated, you will be crushed to death.”","“I’ll only say it once. If you guys don’t believe me, you’re courting death.”","“I still have to find other prodigies. I’m leaving.”","Wan Ziping once again entered into the shuttle. Xiu, he tore through the air and left.","“Hahahaha!” The extraterrestrial visitors laughed loudly. They had practically all passed the test, and those that could be sent here were naturally prodigy-level. As they looked at Ling Han, their expressions were filled with mockery.","What use would it be if you were invincible in Mystery Realm Tier?","Weren’t you very arrogant just now? Now, just try and continue acting arrogant.","Ling Han looked at them coldly, and there was only one saying in his mind: vile characters who have attained success.","He naturally had to attend the Metal Element Fruit Gathering. However, he wouldn’t go through Wan Ziping. Instead, he would go directly.","One year’s time was enough for him to advance into Celestial Path, and directly explode on the planet of the Holy Land of Metal Element. How could such a prodigy not be extended an olive branch to the Holy Land of Metal Element?","‘Heh, when the time comes, I’ll still beat you guys until you call me grandpa.’","Zhou Yang and the others all prepared to set out. The Eldest and the Seventh Imperial Princes did the same. This was a Holu Land! If they could cultivate a Saint -level technique, then even if they couldn’t become Saints in the future, what about Venerate Tier, Sect Master, and so on? They could at least aspire to that.","This temptation was too great, and no one could resist. They all moved out, fearing that they would be delayed by something. If they could not go to the Holy Land of Metal Element, wouldn’t that be a great loss?","Princess Bixiao naturally passed the test as well, and received a place. She and Ling Han returned to the Foreign Affairs Department, and did not speak on their way back. She was still angry at Ling Han for missing out on such a great opportunity.","Ling Han merely smiled. Even if he really missed this opportunity, he would not feel much heartache either, because he had even obtained the Origin Gold. That was something that even Saints would be envious of.","En, going to a great planet like the Holy Land of Metal Element, there should be Heavenly Dao Flames, right?","He could use this opportunity to refine the Imperial Weapon.","On the second day, Princess Bixiao set out. Time was limited, and she had to hurry.","“Without me here, you must be careful,” she warned. “The Second and the Third Imperial Princes are all in Foundation Building Tier. You are no match for them, so you must not act rashly.”","“Alright, alright, I’m not an idiot,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Princess Bixiao gave him some more instructions before leaving.","A few days later, news came. Wan Ziping had already left the Celestial Sea Planet and gone to other planets. He had also gone to the Primordial Sect, the Nine Spirits Sect, and the other great Spirit Transformation True Lord-level Sects, issuing some entry slots.","Including Hong Tianbu, the few prodigies that could be counted had all left Celestial Sea Planet. They were directly brought to the Holy Land of Metal Element by a large formation.","The galaxy projection could transmigrate through space. This was a Saint’s technique.","The Celestial Sea Planet instantly fell silent. The numerous prodigies left one after another, causing this newly revived planet to lose a great deal of its vitality.","Ling Han stayed true to his heart. He cultivated diligently every day, and on the other hand, he was also searching for pill recipes above Celestial Path. Once he had stepped onto the Celestial Path, he would begin concocting Celestial pills to assist in martial arts.","The Celestial Sea Planet’s path of cultivation had been severed before, and even if heaven and earth revived now, most of the information had already been destroyed. What Ling Han could find was considerably limited.","He hadn’t found the pill recipes, but he had obtained an ancient book that was related to alchemy. It introduced Celestial medicines.","This was quite useful. If he didn’t even know how to recognize herbs, how could he concoct alchemical pills?","This book introduced the medicinal effects of various Celestial medicines, which clashed with certain attributes of Celestial medicines, how they merged, and about the environment of their growth, whether these celestial medicines preferred a cold or warm environment, and so on. It was very comprehensive.","Ling Han was enthralled, and he was already deducing in his mind which medicinal ingredients he should combine with which medicinal ingredients and what effects they could produce.","Of course, he would never forget his daily cultivation when the sun rose. Now that the apertures all over his body had opened when he was cultivating, absorbing the power of heaven and earth together would greatly increase his cultivation speed.","The number of apertures that an Enlightenment Tier cultivator opened was directly related to the future prospects of a cultivator.","Even if Ling Han didn’t have any special cultivation technique, his cultivation speed was still several times faster than the normal Mystery Realm Tier. Combined with Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique, and the supplementary cultivation technique, his cultivation speed could be dozens or even hundreds of times faster than others.","Every few days, he would be able to welcome an upgrade to his level of being, unlocking a few shackles. Two months later, Ling Han calculated that he still had 78 shackles that he had yet to shatter.","This result was extremely shocking. One had to realize that ordinary Mystery Realm Tiers would only be able to unlock 10% of the shackles on their bodies at most. The potential of this was imaginable. At most, they would only be able to advance to the Foundation Building Tier and would not have the power to advance any further..","Only prodigies could unlock more than half of the shackles, but reaching 90% could practically be considered a flawless physique.","And in Ling Han’s case, the shackles he had unlocked had already surpassed 99%. Looking at the world, there were probably not many that could compare to him, but he naturally would not be satisfied just like that. He had to pursue absolute perfection.","However, the fewer the remaining shackles, the slower the improvement of this level of being would be. Previously, it could be unlocked once every six to seven days, and now, it would need half a month.","Going by this calculation, even though there were only 78 shackles left, it was very likely that he would need seven to eight years to break through them.","This was like how the difficulty of raising one’s score from zero to one point could not be compared with the difficulty of raising one’s score from 99 to 100. The further one progressed, the slower their progress would be.","Ling Han believed that he would definitely be able to break through all the shackles in his body, but this time... was too long.","Right at this moment, the Imperial Family released a huge piece of news.."]},{"number":3648,"title":"Chapter 3648 - Obtaining a spot by defeating Ling Han","paragraphs":["Obtaining a spot by defeating Ling Han","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Cleansing Pool was about to open.","What was the Cleansing Pool?","This was an extremely great opportunity for mortal tier cultivators. It could provide them with astonishing energy, helping the cultivator to activate the evolution of the level of being.","Every planet had a Cleansing Pool, and the difference was that the higher the level of the planet, the better the effects of the Cleansing Pool.","However, the effects of the Celestial Sea Planet’s Cleansing Pool would definitely not be inferior to the other great planets.","Why?","This was because the Cleansing Pool of other planets would open once every ten years after accumulating energy. However, how much energy had the Celestial Sea Planet’s Cleansing Pool accumulated this time?","More than two thousand years!","Two thousand years couldn’t compare to ten years of savings?","Of course, not everyone could enter into the Cleansing Pool. First, one had to reach the Mystery Realm Tier. Otherwise, when the majestic energy surged into the body, the body would not be able to bear it at all, and would directly explode.","And even if one had advanced into the Mystery Realm Tier, they would still have to use their abilities to earn the right to enter the Cleansing Pool. After all, there was a limit to the energy in the Cleansing Pool. Once there were too many people, no one would be able to get much.","Chen Fengyan had appeared long ago, and he had planned for many years. This was evident from the fact that he had built the Imperial Capital here. He already had a plan in mind.","Thus, something as valuable as the Cleansing Pool was naturally under the control of Chen Fengyan. After all, he had once been the crown prince of this planet, so what did he not know?","However, one of the 10 spots had already been directly assigned to Ling Han.","No one was unconvinced. Ling Han’s strength had come from battle, and this was publicly acknowledged.","Thus, everyone set their eyes on the remaining nine spots, and began a martial arts tournament.","The tournament continued for seven days, and just when the top nine were about to be decided, another shocking piece of news spread out.","The four Spirit Transformation True Lords came together to ask Chen Fengyan to leave two spots for each of their forces.","The Cleansing Pool could only accommodate ten people, and now eight were being sent by the four great True Lords, so wouldn’t there only be two spots left for the Dark North Nation?","Everyone was naturally unconvinced. This was the wealth of the Dark North Nation, so what right did they have to take it out to share?","However, none of them could interfere. Only a Spirit Transformation True Lord was qualified to make a decision.","Ling Han didn’t know what Chen Fengyan and the others were discussing. In any case, the five True Lords had reached a consensus to battle.","The most important thing for cultivators was naturally their abilities. This was very normal. However, the people fighting this time wasn’t Chen Fengyan and the others, but rather the Mystery Realm Tiers.","Chen Fengyan had announced that if they wanted to enter into the Cleansing Pool, they could do so. They only had to defeat Ling Han. If they defeated him once, one person could enter, and if they defeated him 10 times, 10 people could enter.","When Ling Han found out, he was naturally unconcerned. He was invincible among his peers, and could do as he liked.","Since Chen Fengyan had already made his decision, the four True Lords had no choice but to accept. This was because Chen Fengyan had already said that the Cleansing Pool was only reserved for the most outstanding youths. If they couldn’t even defeat Ling Han, it would be a waste even if they entered.","Ling Han was depressed. He was clearly invincible in Mystery Realm Tier. Why did he seem to have become a benchmark for judging strength?","Was there really a Mystery Realm Tier that could defeat him in this world?","To say nothing of defeat, was there anyone that could fight him to a tie?","However, he was on opposing sides from the four True Lords. Moreover, he was Chen Fengyan’s subject, so he had to support him at this moment.","It wasn’t long before the four True Lords each sent ten young prodigies into the Imperial Capital. They were all Mystery Realm Tiers.","Ling Han, on the other hand, was a little surprised. So many Mystery Realm Tier prodigies?","He did not believe that it was so coincidental. No one had managed to advance into Celestial Path before Wan Ziping had arrived. They must have deliberately suppressed their cultivation level, wanting to wait for this great opportunity of the Cleansing Pool.","The four great elites had been trapped on the Celestial Sea Planet for over 2000 years, so they definitely had a good understanding of the Celestial Sea Planet.","If they wanted a battle, so be it. Who would be afraid of who?","Three days later, the great battle began, and innumerable spectators watched.","Ling Han leaped onto the martial arts ring, and said directly, “There’s no need to compete one by one. Come on up onto the martial arts ring. I’m in a hurry. After I defeat all of you, I’ll go back and eat.”","Those Mystery Realm Tiers were all enraged. ‘You’re too arrogant, aren’t you? So condescending?’","They were all prodigies, so it would only be them that would ask others to attack them together.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Still reserved? All right, then I’ll do it!”","He leaped out, and began to attack those forty people.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","In just three punches, he had sent seven people flying, showing his invincible bearing.","“Ling Han!” “Ling Han!” “Ling Han!” “Ling Han!”","The spectators were all shouting loudly, their emotions instantly ignited, and they became incredibly crazy.","“This brat is practically a freak!”","“How could he be so strong?”","“Let’s work together! Let’s work together to deal with him!”","The remaining 30 or so people hurriedly gathered together. Members of their own sects stood together, forming three small teams that launched a counterattack against Ling Han.","However, what use was this?","Ling Han’s strength in Mystery Realm Tier had reached the extent of crushing all his peers. There was no need for him to use his full strength at all. With a punch, someone would definitely be sent flying, losing their battle prowess.","The entire process took less than a minute. Aside from Ling Han, only four other people were still standing.","Previously, they had not made a move, not because they had been frightened, but rather in disdain. All of them had crossed their arms over their chests, appearing to be extremely arrogant.","“A bunch of weaklings indeed do not have the right to enjoy the Cleansing Pool,” a white-robed man said. His eyes were like lightning, and his aura began to surge out in an incredibly powerful manner.","“Hehe, it’s good to have fewer people. We can gain more benefits,” another young man in blue said with a smile. He was a little sloppy, but there was no denying his strength.","“Agreed,” the only woman in red said. She was as beautiful as peach blossoms, and indescribably charming, but she was definitely not just a pretty face.","“However, let’s deal with this brat first,” the last black-robed man said, pointing at Ling Han.","“All right.” The white-robed man and the others nodded at the same time.","“Who’s going?” the woman in red asked.","“I—” the black-robed man said with a smile, and strode out.","Peng!","With a flash, the black-robed man had disappeared, and in his place, Ling Han was standing where he had been just now.","He was sent flying.","In the distance, the black-robed man was hanging from a large tree. His limbs were drooping, as if all the bones in his body had been broken.","Ling Han exercised his muscles and bones, and asked calmly, “What did you guys say again?”","The red-clothed woman and the others were all astounded. This was a f****** monster. With a single crash, he had caused him to lose all his battle prowess. This speed, this physique, this was completely inhuman!","“You.” Ling Han pointed at the white-robed man. Using the Imminent Skyline, he had already crashed into the white-robed man. Xiu, the white-robed man was also sent flying. After drawing an arc in the air, he fell onto the ground with a pa, already unconscious.","The woman in red and the young man in blue couldn’t help but take a few steps back involuntarily. Ling Han’s attack could be said to be extremely simple. It was just a collision, and they could take it head-on with speed and physique, but sometimes, the simpler the attack, the more unsolvable it was.","What could they do?","The two of them hurriedly ignited their battle prowess completely. High-level energy entwined around their hands, and the apertures all over their bodies were also releasing mystical power, which was similarly enshrouded in high-level energy.","They refused to believe that Ling Han would still dare to face them head-on.","Peng, in the next instant, the red-clothed woman was also sent flying.."]},{"number":3649,"title":"Chapter 3649 - Cleansing Pool","paragraphs":["Cleansing Pool","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The young man in blue looked at Ling Han as if he was looking at a monster.","Ling Han’s body was enveloped by the Starlight Screen. This awakened Mystical Power possessed astonishing defenses. Even though the woman in red had tried her best just then, she still hadn’t been able to break through his defenses. She had been sent flying.","The young man in blue was about to go crazy. How could there be such a freakish person? He was invincible just by charging around like a bull.","He hurriedly spread out his body, thinking, ‘If I was in a state of high-speed movement, how would you be able to crash into me?’","Xiu, xiu, xiu! His speed was extremely fast, and at close to seven times the speed of sound, the whole martial arts arena was filled with sonic booms, like endless thunder.","Yet Ling Han had absolutely no intention of making a move. He drew out a chair and sat down, as he munched on sunflower seeds.","’F*ck! Do you think I’m a sideshow?’","The young man in blue exploded in fury, yet did not dare slow down in the slightest. He had already witnessed the explosive speed and impact of Ling Han’s attacks. Ling Han was definitely not someone that he could contend against.","‘But why don’t you make your move! 1","The blue-robed young man felt extremely terrible. He was running around like an idiot, but his opponent was just sitting there as if he was watching a show. In comparison, wasn’t he like a clown?","On the spectators’ seats, the spectators were also stunned, their expressions strange.","The previous battle had ended too quickly. Ling Han was invincible, sending one person or even a few people flying with a single punch. Under his collision, even stronger prodigies could only lose in grievance, which made them feel very satisfied. It was too fast, and they had not managed to catch sight of it, and could not recall it.","But now? The battle had dragged on, but it was really too boring.","Just to watch a person run off like he was in heat?","“Fight!” someone shouted.","“Hurry up and make your move. Aren’t you very strong? Hurry up and make your move!” Many people shouted at the blue-robed young man.","The young man in blue roamed around for a while longer. He knew that he could not drag things on like this.","Ling Han remained silent, not expending the slightest bit of energy. If this continued, it would definitely be disadvantageous to him.","He raised his hand and delivered a palm strike, which transformed into a gust of energy that slashed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Finally know to make your move?”","He launched a counterattack. As he threw a punch, the apertures all over his body shot out bursts of energy that blotted out the sky and covered the earth as they shot towards the young man in blue.","The young man in blue greeted the attack, but it was only a flash of energy, and he was shaken to the point that his whole body was trembling violently.","He couldn’t help but feel stunned. With his strength, it was actually so difficult for him to take on one of the energy released from Ling Han’s apertures?","Just what kind of colossal power gap was this?","Ling Han moved. His speed was even faster, and no matter how the young man in blue dodged, it was useless. Very soon, Ling Han caught up to him, and sent him flying with a punch.","At this point, all the challengers had been defeated.","The spectators were all cheering. This was their Imperial City’s twin prodigies — no, there were no more twin prodigies now. There was only the one and only prodigy, Ling Han!","Ling Han smiled at his surroundings before turning around to leave.","This kind of battle merit was indeed impressive, but in his eyes, it was only so. What he pursued was the strongest. Being invincible in Mystery Realm Tier did not mean anything.","He was anticipating the Cleansing Pool that would be opening in a few days.","The four Spirit Transformation True Lords left helplessly. They were people who cared about their pride. Chen Fengyan had given them a chance to compete fairly, but their disciples were incompetent, so who could they blame?","Peace had temporarily returned to the Imperial Capital, and Ling Han had been adjusting his condition these few days, reaching his peak.","Four days later, the Cleansing Pool opened.","This was actually within the range of the Imperial Palace. It was located underground, and after Ling Han and the other nine Mystery Realm Tier entered the Imperial Palace, they arrived at the foot of a mountain and entered a cave. They walked all the way downwards, and after walking for a long time, the path ahead of them finally became clear, revealing a massive karst cave.","In this karst cave, there was also an irregularly shaped pool. One end was connected to the cave wall, and at the bottom of this pool, there was a green lotus that had just poked out of the water’s surface.","“Enter the pool on your own. You all have three days, and after three days, I will inform you to leave.” Zhu Qi, the chief eunuch, said, “Do not harm that azure lotus, or else... you will have to bear the consequences.”","After saying this, Zhu Qi turned around and left.","Ling Han and the others didn’t stand on ceremony and didn’t greet each other either. They all walked into the pool.","Time was limited, so they definitely couldn’t waste it.","Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position. The warm waters of the pool enveloped him, and he immediately discovered that the life force in his body was surging, as if he was about to immediately break through.","Pa, a shackle was instantly removed.","There were only 77 left.","As expected of the Cleansing Pool, its effects were immediately apparent.","Ling Han continued to absorb the energy in the pool waters. His life force surged, and in a short while, his life force evolved again.","Pa, pa, pa! The shackles shattered one after another.","70, 60, 50... there were fewer and fewer remaining shackles.","Merely a day later, there were only three shackles left in Ling Han’s body.","However, at this time, even with the help of the Cleansing Pool, Ling Han’s level of being evolution had also entered a complete stagnation.","There were only three shackles left. For anyone, this was already perfect enough, but for Ling Han, three shackles was the same as one shackle or a hundred shackles. It was still flawed.","They definitely had to be broken.","Open,open,open!","Ling Han roared internally, pushing the energy in his body with all his might. He also used the Power of Dimensions, which was extremely important on his path of cultivation. He had broken through all pinnacle levels with its aid.","Pa, the first shackle was blasted open. Ling Han was neither happy nor sad. He mustered up the remaining power to launch another attack. Pa, the second shackle was shattered.","However, by this time, the Power of Dimension in his body had already begun to decline.","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. The Cleansing Pool was already ineffective on him. Now that he had used up the Power of Dimension, how was he supposed to break through the final barrier?","No, with the help of the Cleansing Pool, he was already powerless, so what other chances would he have in the future?","Perhaps there was, but he needed to accumulate power for ten years, fifty years, or even longer, before he could break through the final barrier in one go.","He couldn’t wait that long.","He had to take advantage of this opportunity to succeed in a single stroke.","Ling Han’s blood boiled, pushing his condition to its strongest state.","‘Hmm?’","The other nine opened their eyes and looked towards him.","‘What’s going on? Why is your blood boiling when you’re cultivating? Are you trying to get into a fight?’","Boom, it was as if a tsunami had risen up in Ling Han’s body, the power of life surging.","Pa, the last shackle was also blasted open.","He was flawless.","Ling Han broke into a smile. Now, if he accumulated some more mystical power, he would be able to break through to Celestial Path.","Yi?","He was astounded, because the energy from the Cleansing Pool was still surging into his body. There was no way to stimulate the evolution of his level of being, yet it had turned into mystical power, endlessly surging into his body.","His meridians were incredibly wide, automatically guiding a large amount of energy into the dimensions inside his body.","If it was any other Mystery Realm Tier, after absorbing it for an hour or so, they would definitely have reached satiation from a state of exhaustion of all mystical power. However, what was Ling Han’s appetite?","There were countless dimensions in his body, and the space to store mystical power could be said to be close to unlimited, so how could it be filled to the brim?","It didn’t matter if he couldn’t fill it up, but the hunger that had been entangling him all this while was beginning to weaken.."]},{"number":3650,"title":"Chapter 3650 - Leaping over the Celestial Gate","paragraphs":["Leaping over the Celestial Gate","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This kind of hunger was not fatal, but it would not go away, and he would always feel uncomfortable.","Now, a large amount of mystical power was endlessly filling into the dimensions inside his body, naturally making Ling Han feel like he was finally going to eat something.","The Cleansing Pool had only opened after waiting for more than 2000 years. Just how powerful was its accumulation?","Ling Han remained calm and collected, silently making a fortune.","A day passed, and seven of Ling Han’s dimensions had been filled up. During this period of time, he had also used the power of the Cleansing Pool to connect to all the dimensions in his body.","This was a small matter. He only needed to pull the strings, and there was no need to open up a space.","However, Ling Han was also unable to absorb the slightest bit of energy. It was very simple. The energy in the Cleansing Pool had already been exhausted.","This was too terrifying. It had only been a little over a day, and the Cleansing Pool had already dried up?","The other nine stood up in confusion. What was going on here? Wasn’t it agreed that they could cultivate here for three days? It hadn’t even been a day and a half yet.","“What’s going on?”","“Why can’t I absorb any energy?”","“Me too.”","“The same.”","The nine of them all wore blank expressions. Ling Han also stood up, joining the ranks of “I’m also very confused”.","None of them were willing to give up, and continued to sit in the pool waters, waiting for the Cleansing Pool to glow with a “second spring”, but no matter how much they waited, the pool waters were the same. There was no more energy supply.","Three days had passed, and the chief eunuch, Zhu Qi, appeared, leading everyone out.","Everyone hurriedly asked about the situation, but Zhu Qi had never entered the Cleansing Pool before, so he naturally couldn’t answer. He only said that he would report this to His Majesty.","After returning to the Foreign Affairs Department, Ling Han began his final preparations. He was going to leap over the Celestial Gate and step onto the Celestial Path.","Ling Han gave himself three days to examine himself again. After taking this step, he would have left the mortal level and in the future, and it would be impossible for him to make up for the shortcomings of the mortal level.","Of course, if he could obtain the Saintly medicine, he would be able to compensate a little, but Saintly medicine? Heh.","Three days passed, and Ling Han no longer hesitated. He began to break through to Celestial Path.","In the current world, without the power of Celestial Path, it was difficult to travel anywhere.","The first step of Celestial Path, Foundation Building Tier.","However, the reason why the Celestial Path was so difficult to advance into was because this first step actually contained two steps. The first was to leap over the Celestial Gate, and the second was to build the Celestial Foundation.","Ling Han didn’t know how long his breakthrough would take, nor did he know if anyone would cause trouble for him during this process. Moreover, he didn’t know if he would cause any great commotion, so he didn’t break through in the Foreign Affairs Department. Instead, he arrived in a forest.","This was still within the boundaries of the Imperial Capital, so there was no need to worry that outsider cultivators would behave atrociously here, and Ling Han also chose a very hidden place.","He released his spirit, and he was only left with blankness. Then, he began to stimulate the great improvement of his level of being.","From mortal to Celestial, this was a qualitative change, and the gap was boundless.","Thus, Ling Han didn’t feel the bottleneck in his cultivation level loosen for a long time.","He was not in a rush. This was very normal. It would not be strange for an ordinary person to be stuck for eight to ten years, or even hundreds of years.","Although he hadn’t been a Mystery Realm Tier for a long time, this cultivation level was very special in the first place. There were two main points, and that was to shatter as many shackles as possible and accumulate enough mystical power. Otherwise, it wouldn’t even be enough to leap over the Celestial Gate.","For Ling Han, the shackles in his body had been fully unlocked, and the level of being in his body had already reached the pinnacle of the mortal level. As for the reserves of mystical power in his body, it had indeed been a weakness in the past, but after entering into the Cleansing Pool, he had already completed this portion.","Thus, he was already fully qualified to attempt breaking through to the Foundation Building Tier.","Ling Han accumulated appreciation, preparing for the impending explosion.","To his surprise, this moment had not come for a long time.","Two days, three days, four days... Ling Han was already feeling hungry. This time, it wasn’t that his mystical power hadn’t been filled, but that he was truly hungry.","He endured it, and did not destroy the mental state that he had painstakingly formed. Once it was destroyed, all his previous efforts would be wasted.","With his current cultivation level, not drinking water for ten days, and not eating for twenty days would not be a problem.","Five days, six days, seven days, hong, a drastic change suddenly took place in Ling Han’s body. The power of life exploded, and every cell was trembling, as if they were about to explode.","‘It’s here, it’s here, it’s here!’","Ling Han only felt his body tremble. It was as if his soul had exited his body and flown into the galaxy, instantly traversing an endless distance.","Where was this?","He finally stopped, and saw that his surroundings were pitch-black, and ahead of him was a massive bronze door.","The bronze door was three hundred meters tall and mottled all over, covered with veined patterns, as if it had experienced too many years.","This was... the Celestial Gate!","Ling Han was astonished. Right now, he was definitely in a soul state. However, was there truly such a place in the galaxy? Did a Celestial Gate exist?","He was not in a rush to leap. Instead, he walked closer, wanting to take a good look at this bronze door.","However, a force instantly repelled him. It was too powerful, and was not something that Ling Han could contend against at all, so he could not approach.","Ling Han focused his gaze, wanting to see clearly. However, no matter how hard he tried, he was still unable to see the veined patterns on the door. It was as if there was an invisible power blurring his vision.","He tried to activate his eye technique, but he was only a spirit form now, so how could he possibly use it?","He watched for a very long time, and only then did he reluctantly give up.","Forget it, he had best just directly leap over the Celestial Gate.","—If this was known to others, they would definitely find it inconceivable. Why are you so curious? Don’t you think that you should be doing proper business?","Ling Han leaped with all his might. In his spiritual soul state, he was very special, and was far taller than usual. Thus, the Celestial Gate that was 300 meters tall was easily leaped over by him.","Yi, then I am now a Celestial, and can build a Celestial Foundation?","He had not even finished this thought, when Ling Han felt that power come again, dragging him as he continued to soar through the dark galaxy.","After who knew how long, he appeared in a new place.","It was still dark all around them, but another door had appeared ahead of them.","After circling around for half a day, he had returned to the original spot?","No, the door ahead of him was not only 1500 meters tall, it was also white and silver in colour.","First, it was bronze, then it was silver. Could it be that there was a gold door after this?","Ling Han recalled what Princess Bixiao had said. She had crossed two Celestial Gates, but at the time, she had not explained in detail. If he had known earlier, he should have investigated in more detail.","Who cares? He would just continue to leap.","Ling Han still wanted to carefully observe this silver door first, but there was also a force stopping him from doing so.","Sigh!","Ling Han leaped over, easily crossing over this silver Celestial Gate.","However, his soul had not returned, when his soul was once again grabbed by a powerful force, and roamed through the galaxy.","When he stopped, a Celestial Gate appeared in front of him. Ling Han only gave an “oh”, and wasn’t so surprised.","Could it be that the higher one’s talent, the more Celestial Gates one could cross, and then the stronger one’s abilities would be?","However, Ling Han decided to try to get closer first. After discovering that he couldn’t, he would leap over. In any case, this wouldn’t take much time.","The golden Celestial Gate was unfathomably tall, but Ling Han still barely managed to leap over with a leap.","It should be about time, right? It should be time for his soul to return, right?","However... he did not.."]},{"number":3651,"title":"Chapter 3651 - Breaking through","paragraphs":["Breaking through","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han didn’t know that every time he leaped over a Celestial Gate, heaven and earth would exert a power on him, causing his soul to become much stronger.","Leaping three times over a Celestial Gate, and his Spiritual Power had become at least a hundred times stronger.","The leaves of the trees in the entire forest fluttered. Sha, sha, sha! The leaves collided, creating a strange sound.","Meanwhile, Ling Han was completely confused. His soul was once again dragged up, soaring through the boundless galaxy","He couldn’t help but curse. First, it was a bronze Celestial Gate, then a silver Celestial Gate, and then it was a golden Celestial Gate. Next, would there be a purple Celestial Gate, crimson Celestial Gate, green Celestial Gate?","Just as his thoughts were running wild, his soul had already stopped.","Yi?","There was indeed another Celestial Gate ahead of him, but it was not tall or majestic at all. Instead, it was an incomplete door. That was a stone door, and the upper half had already been corroded and weathered. It could not be more than six meters tall, and looked like a damaged wall that was standing there. Ling Han thought that this was a stone door because that was his first impression, but the upper half was already gone.","Yi, why were the first three Celestial Gates completely unscathed, while this one was damaged?","After the Golden Celestial Gate, shouldn’t it be a Celestial Gate of Divine Metal, or a Celestial Gate of Origin Gold?","‘A stone door?’","Ling Han was filled with curiosity. He walked over, and initially thought that he would immediately be expelled, but when he got close enough, he still did not feel any power pushing him over.","Ah?","Since there was no obstruction, Ling Han naturally placed his hand on the stone door. Instantly, a primitive aura flooded over, letting him know that this stone door should be incredibly ancient.","Perhaps it was as ancient as this galaxy, or perhaps it had already existed before this galaxy had been created.","However, why was it damaged?","Being the fourth Celestial Gate, shouldn’t it be immortal and indestructible?","Lmg Han rubbed it for a while, but there were no veined patterns on the stone door. It was only ancient and aged, and nothing could be seen.","Forget it, he had best just directly leap over the Celestial Gate.","Ling Han leaped lightly over the stone door. There was no difficulty or pressure at all.","However, there was also no change.","There was no power to pull him away, nor did was he sent back. He was just standing here awkwardly like this.","F***, what was this?","Lmg Han frowned. This wasn’t right. Moreover, the fourth Celestial Gate was too easy to leap over, wasn’t it? Previously, when he had leaped over the Golden Celestial Gate, though he had also leaped over it, he had only barely managed to leap over it even if he had used all his power.","This stone door had already been destroyed, so its true height shouldn’t be just a few meters. Thus, his leap didn’t count?","But it had nothing to do with him. It was your business to destroy it, so why should I bear this responsibility?","Lmg Han grumbled in his mind. However, there was nowhere he could vent his grievances at this moment, so he could only come up with another plan.","He strode forwards. After taking a few steps, he walked towards the stone door, wanting to push it open and pass through.","This was an unconscious action, but when he pushed open the stone door, a force stopped him. He felt that the stone door was incredibly heavy, and he had only pushed it open a little.","Lmg Han, on the other hand, smiled. There was a chance.","He pushed with all his might, inch by inch, inch by inch, but before he had even reached half a foot, the power increased greatly. Peng, it forced his hands back, and the stone door closed tightly again.","‘Do you think I’m afraid of you?’","Ling Han came to his senses, and once again began to push open the doors.","It was still the same. After pushing Ling Han away for less than half a foot, that power suddenly soared, wanting to push Ling Han back.","Lmg Han channeled his full power and forcefully withstood the attack. However, this power was also endless, and did not dissipate. Instead, it was resisting him, and was slowly increasing. It still wanted to push him back.","Half an inch, half an inch, Ling Han slowly retreated.","He couldn’t help but frown. His Spiritual Power was only this powerful, so there was no way he could unleash it again.","It would be great if he could use mystical power.","Hold on, why couldn’t he?","Could it be that it was because he was a soul?","Let’s give it a try.","Ling Han made a comeback, and with a loud roar, channelled power madly. Boom, a miraculous scene appeared. He exploded with even stronger power. Mystical power... could be used!","He aggressively advanced, breaking through half a foot of distance, but the more he pushed open the door, the stronger the force of the counter rebuke would be, and very soon, he was pushed back.","Since that was the case.","Ling Han used the Demonic Monkey Fists, channeled Destructive Energy, and stacked 100 overlapping layers of power to form Frequency Attack.","-After advancing into Mystery Realm Tier, Ling Han’s mastery of the Demonic Monkey Fists had naturally improved further.","Boom, the stone door suddenly opened.","Ling Han smiled, and strode through. However, he immediately discovered that though the stone door had opened, there seemed to be an invisible barrier blocking him. It was not as sturdy as the stone door, but was incredibly elastic. Furthermore, it was pressing down on him from all directions, and he was still unable to pass through.","Boom!","However, though the power of his punch was domineering, his head, torso, and legs were all bearing the force, causing him to be extremely unbalanced in the force of the blow. He stumbled and landed solidly on the ground.","Even though he was a soul, he still felt pain.","The repulsive force assaulted him from all directions. How could he block it?","No, that’s not right. Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He was a soul now, and since he was a soul, why was he stuck in human form?","Ling Han laughed loudly, and his body suddenly changed shape, leaving behind only his head. Then, two arms grew out of his head, waving his fists as he charged towards the stone door.","‘Open!’","Peng, peng, peng! Ling Han swung his fists rapidly. With Destructive Energy and Demonic Monkey Fists, he was extremely domineering, forcefully opening up a path.","He charged into the stone door for about five meters, but there was still a force stopping him.","Now, he could clearly see that there was a layer of light on the stone door, which had a strong flexibility and elasticity. Now, he had pushed it back five meters, and the compressive power had also reached the peak, wanting to bounce him back by force.","If he wanted to pass through the stone door, he would have to break through this light screen.","Break, break, break! Ling Han roared in his mind as he swung his fists even more rapidly. Destructive Energy smashed into the barrier of light.","This light screen was a little terrifying. Just how powerful was Destructive Energy? Yet, it was actually unable to succeed time and time again.","Lmg Han was completely unconcerned. There was only one thought left in his mind, and that was to deliver a punch.","If one punch couldn’t deal with it, then two punches. If two punches couldn’t deal with it, then ten punches, a hundred punches, a thousand punches...","Ka, ka, ka! Multiple white lines appeared on the screen of light, as dense as a spider’s web.","He was about to break through!","However, the more this was the case, the greater the resistance created by the light screen was. In fact, it even looked like it was about to push Ling Han back. Though it was only a sliver, a few white lines immediately disappeared.","Clearly, the light screen had been repaired.","Ling Han roared in fury, his fists raining down like rain. The speed far exceeded his limits.","He was a soul, and would not be restricted by the body.","Ka, ka, ka! More and more white lines appeared, and finally, with a bang, the light screen shattered.","Ling Han stumbled through the stone door.","Success!","Ling Han hadn’t come back to his senses yet, when a massive power began to drag him downwards rapidly. Right at this moment, he suddenly saw a figure appear, appearing where he had previously been.","The other party had also discovered Ling Han’s presence, and looked towards him. However, the dragging force was too strong, and Ling Han’s speed was too fast. Neither of them seemed to have seen how the other looked like.","Ling Han’s heart clenched. Aside from him, there was actually another person that could come to the fourth Celestial Gate!","He had not even finished the thought, when it was as if his soul had become weightless, and rapidly fell. Then, in the forest, Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open.."]},{"number":3652,"title":"Chapter 3652 - Building the Celestial Foundation","paragraphs":["Building the Celestial Foundation","Translator. Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han opened his eyes, and two pillars of light instantly shot out from his eyes. Pa, pa, pa! The surrounding trees immediately crumbled.","This was not because he had cultivated some Mystical Power, but rather because after he had leaped over the Celestial Gate, his Spiritual Power and mystical power had both improved astonishingly, and he was still unable to adapt to his present power. With a sweep of his gaze, he had broken down the trees.","He had leaped over the Celestial Gate, yet had yet to reach the Foundation Building Tier. Right now, he could be considered a Pseudo Celestial Path elite.","However, at this moment, Ling Han naturally wouldn’t give up halfway.","He continued to build his Celestial Foundation.","Doubt flashed through his mind. Why was there a damaged Celestial Gate? He had never heard of this before. Could it be that it had appeared because he had cultivated the mortal level to perfection?","However, he also saw another person appear in front of the stone door. Could it be that someone had also cultivated the mortal level to perfection?","Was this possible?","He could cultivate a flawless body because countless dimensions had nurtured in his body. How could it be that this kind of good fortune would happen to a second person?","Let’s not think about this first. If he had the chance to encounter “that person-","in the future, he would get to know him better.","However, there was a sea of people, so where was he supposed to find him? En, that must be a supreme prodigy, so hewould just have to search in this direction.","Ling Han began to build his Celestial Foundation. He didn’t use the Foundation Building Divine Stone, since he already knew that it was formed from the blood of a Great Emperor. If he wanted to walk out his own path to become an Emperor, he couldn’t walk the same path as the other.","Moreover, he had previously been immersed in the Sea of True Blood, so the benefits he had received were far superior to any Foundation Building Divine Stone.","What foundation should I build?","Ling Han buried a belief in invincibility, a fighting spirit that would never be defeated, and used it as the foundation of the Celestial Path. Then, he wrapped it with his Spiritual Power, and nourished it with his mystical power, continuously strengthening it.","He thought of the Stone Celestial Gate, and couldn’t help but have a thought. He intentionally shaped it into that shape. Even the material was the same, possessing the rough veined patterns of stone.","That’s right, there was also the primitive aura.","Kuang, right at this moment, a sudden clap of thunder suddenly sounded in the heaven and earth. Dark clouds rolled out, densely gathered above the mountains and forests. Flashes of light intertwined, as if they could strike down at any moment.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel shocked. He imitated the Stone Celestial Gate to construct the foundation stone of the Celestial Path, and it actually made heaven and earth furious?","F***, where had this Stone Celestial Gate come from? The heaven and earth actually considered it a taboo?","But the more this was the case, the more determined Ling Han was to do it.","If he were to build a Celestial Foundation like this, he would definitely be incredibly powerful.","■Come, so what if the heavens are furious? If you have the ability, strike down","the lightning.’","Kuang, the lightning really struck down. Just a few meters away from Ling Han, a large tree was instantly severed, and crashed towards him.","Ling Han casually waved his hand, and this broken tree was sent flying.","Are you trying to scare me!","He continued to construct his Celestial Foundation. Kuang, kuang, kuang! The thunder became even louder, and more lightning struck down, but not a single bolt struck him.","The heaven’s calamity descended from the skies, only striking great evils. Ling","Han had nothing to do with that.","Heavenly Dao was merciless, letting all things perish or emerge of themselves, so how could it now treat him with prejudice?","However, right at this moment, a bolt of purple lightning suddenly struck down, directly sinking into Ling Han’s mind.","The purple lightning took the form of a human figure that was filled with dignity. He shouted loudly, “How dare you, you actually dare to oppose the heaven and earth. Without any respect or fear, this god will come and kill you!’ Shua, the purple figure charged over at an incredibly fast speed.","It was an internal demon.","Ling Han immediately thought. It was not that this world did not have heaven’s calamity, but it did not mean destroying a person physically, but rather destroying a person’s soul.","The internal demons would cause chaos, and cause one to become a demon. Thus, the Heavenly Dao would have a reason to send down a heaven’s calamity to eliminate them.","And Ling Han’s internal demon was even more direct. It was not going to disturb him, but rather directly destroy his spirit. Without his divine sense, his physical body would be an empty shell. No matter how awesome his Celestial Foundation was, what was the use?","The internal demon attacked, wanting to penetrate Ling Han’s mind and strike his spirit.","“An!” Ling Han suddenly spoke up. Weng, the sound of Buddha boomed out. Crack! Cracks instantly appeared on the purple figure’s body, but there was only one crack.","“An!” Ling Han roared again. His voice was like a deep and thought-provoking bell.","Ka, another crack appeared on the purple figure.","Ling Han charged over, unleashing an intense battle.","Peng, peng, peng! He naturally had to rely on his Spiritual Power to sever his internal demons. This mystical power wouldn’t be of much use.","The internal demon was extremely powerful. This was not the internal demon tribulation that Ling Han had formed after cultivating the Celestial Foundation. Instead, it was because the Celestial Foundation that he wanted to build was too extraordinary. The heaven and earth had descended the internal demon tribulation ahead of time to prevent him from being so “treasonous”. However, Ling Han had mastered the Six Characters Bright King Curse, which was specifically used to kill evil and subdue internal demons. Even if there was only one word, it was still very effective.","Two more cracks appeared on the internal demon’s body, and its battle prowess naturally fell drastically. It was completely suppressed by Ling Han.","“An!” “An!” “An!” “An!” “An!”","Ling Han shouted repeatedly, and more and more cracks appeared on the internal demon. Finally, it shattered with a bang.","As expected, the Buddhist Race specialized in subduing internal demons. Just the An character alone was already so awesome, so if it was complete with six all six characters, just how powerful would it be?","Ling Han was completely unconcerned, and continued to construct the Celestial Foundation.","Kuang! Another bolt of purple lightning struck down, manifesting in Ling Han’s mind and launching an attack.","Ling Han shook his head. The Six Characters Bright King Curse continued to be shouted out, and the internal demonic entity couldn’t threaten him at all.","He was multitasking. This time, he was only suppressing the internal demon in his heart but not disintegrating it. On the other side, he was speeding up the process of building the Celestial Foundation. Obviously, if he did not interrupt or complete it, this internal demon from this heaven’s calamity would have no end.","Fight, fight, fight! Ling Han remained calm and confident.","A day later, the Celestial Foundation was completed!","The Foundation of Human Dao was only the size of a fist, yet it exuded a grand and majestic aura. There was also a sense of a primitive aura, as if this was the cornerstone of heaven and earth when it was first created, and could support heaven and earth.","In the skies, the dark clouds dispersed. The heaven and earth could no longer stop him, so the tribulation clouds naturally could only disperse.","However, the dark clouds had not dispersed completely, but in the next instant, the dark clouds gathered again.","‘Heaven’s calamity again?","This naturally was not to stop Ling Han from building his Celestial Foundation, but rather because he had successfully built his Foundation, and the heaven and earth would send down a punishment of tribulation. This was a routine matter.","However, in comparison, this internal demon was too weak. Ling Han only shouted ten consecutive times of the An character, and the internal demon was completely resolved.","Ling Han was just about to stand up, when he suddenly realized that all the apertures in his body had been opened. The power of heaven and earth surged towards him, greatly boosting his mystical power. It was the same even for Spiritual Power.","Only after taking this step would he truly step out of the mortal level. Ling Han hurriedly sat down and channeled the Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique, absorbing the benefits with all his might.","The Mystery Realms created by other Foundation Building Tiers wouldn’t be very big. Perhaps they would be filled up in a short while, but Ling Han’s Mystery Realms were like bottomless pits. No matter how the power of heaven and earth was stuffed into his hands, he would take them all.","Unfortunately, only half a day had passed, and peace returned to heaven and earth.","“What level has my strength reached now?” Ling Han stroked his chin in anticipation.","However, the most important thing now was not to be curious about his own strength, but to release the empress and the others!"]},{"number":3653,"title":"Chapter 3653 - Heavenly Venerable Tier elites appear","paragraphs":["Heavenly Venerable Tier elites appear","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was filled with anticipation. He would be able to release those Heavenly Venerates in his body once he had stepped onto the Celestial Path. This was something that he had always guessed.","Now that he had finally become a Foundation Building cultivator, he was also nervous about whether he could succeed or not.","For this day, he had long since prepared himself.","A long time ago, he had already set his eyes on a Heavenly Venerable Tier elite. He was an extremely evil person, and should have died long ago. However, Ling Han had imprisoned him and not killed him all this while just for the sake of performing an experiment now.","This was a First Tier Heavenly Venerate.","With a thought, he forcibly extracted the other from his body.","“Ah-” This Heavenly Venerable Tier elite screamed in agony. Passing through the inner world was no joke. There was an incredibly strong resistance, and even with his physique, he could not bear it.","However, how could Ling Han care? He forcefully pushed him out.","Pa, that Heavenly Venerable Tier elite fell onto the ground, all his clothes completely damaged. He had withstood the massive pressure to pass through the passageway of the “Two Realms”, but his clothes could not. Furthermore, the suppression of this heaven and earth on him was too great. At present, he was like an infant bom prematurely, incredibly weak.","He was indeed weak, but in the end, he had stiU come out safely.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief. He had succeeded.","“Where is this?” the Heavenly Venerable Tier elite asked in a stuttering voice. He couldn’t open his eyes, and he only knew that he had lost all of his divine power. He was as fragile as an infant.","In truth, he was like an infant bom prematurely at that.","“And who are you?” the Heavenly Venerable Tier elite continued to ask. Ling","Han’s strength terrified him. He was a Heavenly Venerable Tier elite, yet he had actually been captured here for no reason.","“You don’t need to know. Just die.” Ling Han shot out a punch, and the Destructive Energy swept past. That Heavenly Venerable Tier elite was immediately annihilated.","The reason why he hadn’t killed him, but rather directly erased him was because Ling Han still wanted to release the empress and the others later.","They had reunited after such a long time, yet there was a corpse that was an eyesore. How troublesome would that be?","Ling Han communicated with the empress and the others, telling them to make preparations.","“Husband, we are already prepared.”","“Ling Han, Niu really wants to see you!”","The women were all eager to give it a try.","Ling Han nodded. He first fetched the empress, who was the strongest among the women.","Even if he was in charge of his world, Ling Han had no way to directly elevate others to Heavenly Venerable Tier-level. He could only try his best to make things as convenient as possible, and it was the same for those who had advanced into Heavenly Venerable Tier-level. They would have to comprehend appreciation on their own.","Ling Han could only rapidly make them Celestial Kings. With a single thought, he could make a mortal become a Ninth Heaven Celestial King. Furthermore, there were no aftereffects, and the price was that he would have to expend a portion of his power.","After all, only two years had passed, and now, with the passing of time, even if the empress received special treatment from Ling Han, she had only reached Sixth Tier.","Sixth Tier Heavenly Venerates were already very strong, and even First Tier Heavenly Venerates could safely come out, so what more a Sixth Tier Heavenly Venerate?","However, Ling Han was still a little nervous at this moment, and he carefully escorted the empress out.","In just a short while, the empress “appeared”.","Ling Han hurriedly drew out a blanket that he had long since prepared, and draped it over the empress. Though there were no outsiders here, the empress’s body was extraordinarily weak compared to this heaven and earth. It was very easy for her to catch a cold.","“Ling Ling Han!” the empress stammered. She tried her best to open her eyes, and only after glancing at Ling Han did she finally close them and rest in peace.","With Ling Han by her side, even if she came to this new world, she would be extremely at ease.","Ling Han also breathed a sigh of relief, and began to guide Hu Niu out.","“Niu is here!”","Pa, Hu Niu was Hu Niu. Even if she was as weak as a newborn, she still called out happily.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. Then, among his beautiful wives, there was actually no third wife that had reached the Heavenly Venerable Tier.","It could not be helped. Aside from the empress and Hu Niu, the other women’s natural talent was not all that impressive. Though he had opened the back door for them, how could two years’ time be enough?","Thankfully, as long as they were inside Ling Han’s body, that was another world. There was another set of Regulations, and as long as they had become Celestial Kings, everyone would not have to worry about their lifespans and Immortal’s Calamity.","Thus, as long as Ling Han didn’t die, the people in his body wouldn’t have to worry about their lifespans.","Ling Han continued to let them go. Lin Luo, Zhou Heng, the Karmic Life Heavenly Venerable, the large black dog, and so on all came out of his body as long as they had reached Heavenly Venerable Tier.","Actually, this was a weakening effect on him. After all, every person that came out of the entity would mean one less supply of Spiritual Power, but Ling Han naturally wouldn’t care.","All of a sudden, several hundred people had appeared in the forest. Thankfully, Ling Han had prepared enough clothes. Otherwise, it would have been so much ‘fun’.","Ling Han wrapped them up with the Essence Nurturing Gourd, but the internal space was limited, and one time wasn’t enough, so he could only come back and pack them up a few more times.","He bought a large courtyard, and placed everyone inside.","Four days later, Lin Luo and the other former Seventh Tier Heavenly Venerates were the first to be able to get out of bed. They had also obtained the cultivation techniques that Ling Han had prepared for them, alchemical pills, and support formations. They had already begun to cultivate.","With their talent, it wouldn’t be long before they could step into the Blood Transformation Tier. The help that Ling Han could provide them now was really too great.","A Seventh Tier Heavenly Venerate needed only four days to recover, a Sixth Tier needed six days, a Fifth Tier needed eight days, and a Fourth Tier needed eleven days. In short, the weaker they were, the later they would be able to get out of bed.","After more than 20 days, everyone finally recovered.","After so many days, Ling Han was naturally familiar with his current cultivation level.","His strength had undergone an earthshaking change.","Firstly, it was Spiritual Power. Though being able to release everyone out of the inner world was already the most direct reflection, if used in battle, he could already instantly compress the Heavenly Pattern Jade into a few grams.","There was completely no need to instill mystical power into it. The moment Spiritual Power moved, it could be shot out at 30 times the speed of sound. Probably, killing a Heavenly Dao Foundation cultivator would only need a single strike, and it was not impossible for a Heavenly Dao Foundation cultivator to be killed instantly either.","As for the details, it would still have to depend on actual battle.","On the other hand, his Spiritual Power was finally strong enough to form a connection with the Heavenly Pattern Jade. In other words, unless he was much stronger than his Spiritual Power, no one else would be able to use the Heavenly Pattern Jade even if he obtained it.","Secondly, his mystical power was strong enough, and his level of being also had a qualitative change. It could already withstand the burden of channelling a celestial technique.","At present, he could channel the Imminent Skyline for a long time, about an hour or so. Only then would his body become so hot that it was about to burn, and he would not be able to continue.","However, he could only channel the Three Styles of the God of War once. Of course, the might of these three styles was also terrifyingly powerful. The power of the Demonic Monkey Fists had also reached one hundred and eight layers. This was the limit, and there was no way to increase it further. The Eye Technique could also be maintained for a long time, and only after continuously activating for half a day would his eyes feel dry.","In short, his improvement was much, much too great.","“I really want to fight with Hong Tianbu,” Ling Han murmured. However, he stiU needed to take care of the others, so he didn’t have the energy to play around for the time being.","He had already made up his mind. When they could stand on their own two feet, he would seek out the Second Prince and the others, and give them a good beating.","However, after advancing into Celestial Path, that supplementary cultivation technique of his became useless. It was also the same for the Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique. It seemed Uke they were not suitable for Celestial Path.","There were pros and cons. However, in comparison, these cons could be ignored."]},{"number":3654,"title":"Chapter 3654 - A perfect match","paragraphs":["A perfect match","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Ling Han, play with Niu!” Hu Niu jumped over, a youthful smile on her face.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and pulled this beautiful wife that had not grown up into his arms, “Wait a few more days, and I will give you a few children to play with.”","“Sure, sure.” Hu Niu giggled. Others were seizing the time to understand this world’ but she did not feel the slightest bit of nervousness. It was as if as long as Ling Han was here, everything was enough.","She had no ambitions, and would act as she pleased, taking things as they","came.","Another few days later, everyone was equipped with the ability to walk freely, and Lin Luo and the others, who had started cultivating the earliest, had already reached the peak stage of Meridian Opening Tier. They only had to open all their Meridians, and they would be able to step into Blood Transformation Tier in a perfect state.","Ling Han believed that these people were all prodigies. After all, they had been accumulated by Genesis World for who knew how many years. Although they didn’t have an inner world inside them, so they couldn’t step onto the Seventh Change, Seventh Extreme, and so on, it wasn’t difficult for them to become three-star geniuses.","Everyone discussed for a while. Lin Luo and the others all expressed that they would stay temporarily in the Imperial Capital. This planet had just awakened, and for beginners like them, it was a paradise. After they set foot on Celestial Path, it would not be too late for them to go to the other great planets.","Ling Xi, Ling Jianxue and the other children also expressed their desire to train on the Celestial Sea Planet first, so they would not accompany Ling Han to the Holy Land of Metal Element.","What were they going to do? Just stand by and watch?","Ling Han had already prepared enough alchemical pills for everyone, and added with the accumulation from selling alchemical pills previously, his wealth was extraordinarily abundant. It was completely no problem for him to supply these people.","Moreover, with the awakening of heaven and earth, Treasured Fruits of Life also appeared one after another. At least, for those below the Celestial Path, they weren’t all that valuable. They could be bought as long as one could pay.","After resolving this most important matter, Ling Han decided to set out for the Holy Land of Metal Element.","This time, he planned to bring the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog and Wally. After all, he was only going for the Metal Element Fruit Gathering. He wouldn’t be staying there for too long.","It was the large black dog’s own choice, while Wally’s calculation ability was highly valued by Ling Han.","He accompanied the two women, and brought the large black dog and Wally to the Foreign Affairs Department.","The large black dog’s mouth was wide open. He wanted to say something, but all he could say was, “Woof, woof, woof.”","In this world, it was just an ordinary dog, so how could it possibly open its mouth to speak?","At the very least, it had to reach the Blood Transformation Tier and consume the Transformation Fruit to be able to speak human language, and even transform into human form.","Though so many days had passed, the large black dog was still not used to it. It barked endlessly, yet could not say anything, which made it feel extremely uncomfortable.","Ling Han was naturally very familiar with it, and said with a smile, “Are you trying to say that I’m doing quite well now?”","The large black dog hurriedly nodded. There was no need for its intelligence to awaken again. However, it was still too weak now, so it couldn’t even speak.","However, it couldn’t be stopped even if it couldn’t speak. The large black dog still raised a paw, as if he was giving Ling Han a thumbs up.","Ling Han wore a strange expression, and said, “Say, when you came out of the inner world, didn’t your iron underwear shatter? What’s up with this one now?”","The large black dog was currently wearing a pair of purple underpants, and as he walked, he would twist his behind. This was truly an eyesore.","“Woof, woof, woof, woof!” The large black dog barked repeatedly, as if he was complaining.","Ling Han could just barely understand. It should be because its present physique was still unable to wear iron underwear, so it could only wear cloth. It was a dog that knew shame.","As for where this pair of underpants had come from, Ling Han didn’t want to know. He kept feeling that this inside story was too dirty.","“Yi, Ling Han, you’re finally back!” Xuanyuan Dingguo walked out. He swept an eye over the empress and Hu Niu, and a stunned expression appeared on his face. Thankfully, the two women had covered their faces, and he could only see their figures. Otherwise, he would not be stunned, but rather dumbfounded.","Then, when he saw the large black dog, he couldn’t help but drool. “Where did you get this mutt from? It’s so fat, are you eating dog meat tonight?” The large black dog was enraged. He actually dared to say that he wanted to eat dog meat in front of Grandpa Dog? And eat Grandpa Dog?","It scuttled out, and opened its mouth to bite.","See if I won’t bite you to death, b@stard.","“Let go! Let go!” Xuanyuan Dingguo shouted loudly. With his strength, he naturally couldn’t be bitten by the large black dog. However, being dragged around by a dog was humiliating enough.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Has anything happened these few days?” “No, there are just some rumors saying that you’re not qualified to participate in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering. You don’t live up to your name, and you’re not worthy of being called a prodigy of the Imperial Capital,” Xuanyuan Dingguo said.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He did not take this kind of empty reputation to heart. Moreover, he was not the prodigy of the Imperial Capital, but rather the greatest prodigy of the universe, all right?","“And these two are?” Xuanyuan Dingguo approached and asked softly. His eyes drifted to the empress and Hu Niu.","“Your elder sisters-in-law,” Ling Han replied.","“Pei, it’s younger sisters-in-law!” Xuanyuan Dingguo immediately said. He then shamelessly greeted the two women, saying, “That brat Ling Han is truly good at hiding. He only allowed me to see two sisters-in-law at this moment. He’s treating me like an outsider!”","“It’s elder sisters-in-law!” the empress said proudly. In her heart, she was the most important person in this world. Not counting Ling Han, as that was her husband.","Xuanyuan Dingguo couldn’t help but be startled. Why was this girl so proud? However, though the empress’s appearance was hidden, her aura was astonishing, forcefully suppressing him.","“Father!” At this time, the seven babies also ran over. The little loli followed behind, looking very laidback, while the fat pig was held in her arms. “Handsome Brother, where did you get two great beauties from?” Tang Yun’er was slightly surprised as she looked at the empress and Hu Niu.","Though the appearances of the two women were not apparent, their figures were too perfect. Furthermore, they were enchantingly voluptuous. She was sure that they were definitely great beauties, almost catching up to her – the little loli had never known modesty about her own looks.","Pa, she threw the fat pig onto the ground, and pounced towards the empress. She was too beautiful, and she really wanted to hug her.","The fat pig fell to the ground, and instantly screamed in pain. Though it could not be wounded, it was still very painful, b@stard.","However, Tang Yun’er also missed her target. Ling Han managed to pick up the empress in time, preventing the little loli from succeeding.","The large black dog immediately darted out, and pressed a paw on the fat pig, barking at Ling Han. The meaning was too simple: let’s eat roasted suckling pig tonight, and have a snack.","On the other side, Hu Niu was also drooling, “Roasted suckling pig! Roasted suckling pig! Roasted suckling pig!”","When the seven babies heard this, they instantly felt an amiable feeling towards Hu Niu. This was one with similar tastes.","“Roasted suckling pig! Roasted suckling pig!” They too called out, their small eyes bright.","The fat pig bore a deep hatred. ‘Do you all have some kind of enmity with pigs? Why do you all want to eat roasted suckling pig when you see me?’ Did a pig offend you guys?","“Gu!” It barked at the large black dog. It was all this despicable dog’s fault for starting it.","“Woof, woof, woof, woof!” The large black dog naturally wasn’t willing to be outdone. He had never been one to suffer losses. One look, and he could tell that this perverted pig was definitely scolding him.","“Gu, gu, gu.”","“Woof, woof, woof.”","Alright, now that the pig and dog had clashed, they were both shouting at each other. Though they could not understand each other’s “words”, they definitely could not allow any weakness to show, b@stard."]},{"number":3655,"title":"Chapter 3655 - Charging into the Imperial Prince Manor","paragraphs":["Charging into the Imperial Prince Manor","Translator: Henyee Translations I Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone found this interesting.","Whether it was the fat pig or the large black dog, they had clearly developed intelligence, but for various reasons, they could not speak. The pig could only bark at the dog, and the dog would bark at the pig.","All right, no roasted suckling pig, no dog meat, let’s just get something to eat,” Ling Han said with a smile.","They sat down first, and then Ling Han made arrangements.","He was going to leave Celestial Sea Planet. This trip would take at least more than half a year, so he definitely had to make proper arrangements, unlike before, when he had Princess Bixiao to act in his place.","Thinking of this, Ling Han felt that this princess of the Demon Race was still quite useful.","“You’re leaving again?” Xuanyuan Dingguo asked in astonishment. This Chief of the Foreign Affairs Department was far too incompetent. The Foreign Affairs Department had only been established for a short while, yet he had already been absent for 90% of the time.","Ling Han nodded and said, “In the future, I’ll leave the Foreign Affairs Department to you.”","Me? Can I protect the department?” Xuanyuan Dingguo appeared extremely unconfident.","“It’s fine. Now that the ownership of the various great forces has been decided, the Foreign Affairs Department actually doesn’t have much else to do. Furthermore, before I leave, I will do one more thing. I guarantee that no one would dare to trifle with the Foreign Affairs Department in future,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“What do you want to do?” Xuanyuan Dingguo suddenly felt a very bad premonition.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “To make an example. Later, I will go and give the Second Prince, the Third Prince and the others a good beating.” ‘Don’t you mess around!” Xuanyuan Dingguo instantly panicked. ‘Are you trying to get into big trouble?’","Che, he’s just the son of a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite. So what if he is beaten up?” Tang Yun’er licked the toffee with a nonchalant expression.","On the sidelines, Hu Niu was drooling, staring fixedly at the toffee in her hand. She didn’t have the slightest bit of reservedness.","Xuanyuan Dingguo inhaled sharply. How was it that each of these people was fiercer than the last?","If a Spirit Transformation True Lord was nothing, then what would something be?","“Don’t worry, don’t worry. It will be fine,” Ling Han said.","How could Xuanyuan Dingguo relax? However, he couldn’t persuade Ling Han at all, so he could only do nothing.","Ling Han invited Yin Xiujing, Lian Xuerong and the others over for a meal. This could be considered a farewell feast.","Seeing the empress and Hu Niu, even if Yin Xiujing and Lian Xuerong were proud of their exquisite beauty, they still felt ashamed of their own inferiority. And this was still because the two women were wearing veils. If they really revealed their true faces, who knew what kind of commotion it would cause.","Thus, Ling Han’s current strength was still very weak, so he could only tell the two women to keep a low profile.","After eating, Ling Han left the Foreign Affairs Department and headed directly to the manor of the Second Prince.","The empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog, the little loli, and the babies all followed behind. They were all people who liked to join in on the excitement, so how could they miss this opportunity?","Thus, this team was also very strange. There were beauties, little beauties, babies, a dog, and a pig. As they passed, everyone was dumbfounded.","What was the prodigy of the Imperial Capital trying to do?","In a short while, Ling Han had already arrived in front of the manor of the Second Prince.","As a dignified Imperial Prince, he was naturally living in a luxurious manor. It occupied an extremely large area, and was dazzling and resplendent. There were even eight large men standing guard at the entrance, looking extremely fierce.","“Hey, stop!” A large man pulled out a section of the saber at his waist, and shouted at Ling Han.","Ling Han snapped his fingers. Xiu! With a flick of his finger, the large man was instantly sent flying. Peng! The door was forcefully pushed open.","“How dare you!” The remaining seven men all drew their sabers and surrounded Ling Han and the others.","“You actually dare to behave atrociously in the residence of the Second","Imperial Prince? Are you tired of living?!”","“Who are you? Tell me your name!”","The seven of them called out one after another. Someone had sent out a signal, summoning helpers. The intruder could send one person flying with a single ’ finger. These abilities were too powerful. Even if the seven of them joined forces, they should not be a match.","‘You don’t even recognize me?’","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh. These people were really too ignorant and ill- informed.","“Woof, woof, woof, woof!” The large black dog barked, holding his stomach and laughing so hard that he was lying down.","What it meant was ‘Little Han, aren’t you boasting that you’re doing very well? Just look, even the guards at the door don’t know who you are, and you still have the nerve.’","Ling Han didn’t make a move either. With a thought, it was as if those seven large men had been grabbed by an invisible hand. They continued to wave their limbs in midair, and all of them looked terrified.","This... had they seen a ghost?","Of course not. Ling Han’s current Spiritual Power was who knew how many times stronger. He could easily lift a rock weighing a hundred to a hundred fifty thousand kilograms, what more grab seven people.","He strode into the manor, and with a wave of his Spiritual Power, the seven large men were all thrown out. They had all fainted from the impact.","This time, he was here to beat up the Second Prince. As for the others, he did not take them to heart either.","“Enemy attack!”","“Enemy attack!”","Amidst a chaotic commotion, groups of soldiers appeared, surrounding Ling Han and the others.","“Humph, Ling Han, how dare you! You even dare to barge into my manor! Do you really think that just because my Imperial Father dotes on you, you can do as you please?” The Second Imperial Prince also appeared, his expression livid.","He, a dignified Imperial Prince, actually had an enemy beating right at his doorstep. Just how humiliating was this?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and nodded, “That’s right.”","Not bad.","The Second Imperial Prince was instantly stunned. Had this brat gone mad? No matter how much you are doted on, you are still a subject, so how could you possibly step on top of your Master?","Treason! Treason!” he said balefully, his killing intent on full display.","Ling Han had delivered himself to his doorstep, so even if he killed him, Chen Fengyan wouldn’t be able to say anything.","Ling Han smiled and said, “You Imperial Princes keep targeting me just because you have someone backing you up. Do you think I don’t have a temper?”","“So what if you have a temper?” The Second Imperial Prince moved, and charged towards Ling Han, “You are a servant, and we are the masters! You are only a mortal, but we are Celestials! In our eyes, you are only an ant.”","He had already charged over in a single step, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han’s head.","Pa!","Ling Han made a move, and delivered a slap, crisp and loud.","The Second Imperial Prince was instantly sent flying back at an even faster speed than he had come. Peng! The wall behind him couldn’t block his advance at all, and a hole was instantly blasted into it. Then, he continued to fly.","Peng, peng, peng! He crashed through nine walls in one go, and only then did he stop, lying on the ground.","The Second Imperial Prince forcibly got back to his feet, his face filled with","shock, “Y-y-you have broken through to Celestial Path!”","There was only one possibility. Otherwise, no matter how awesome a Mystery Realm Tier was, that was still trash in front of a Foundation Building elite.","Ling Han stood lazily, but his Spiritual Power took form and grabbed the Second Prince, tossing him in his direction.","In terms of absolute power, Spiritual Power definitely couldn’t compete with mystical power. Even if Ling Han’s Spiritual Power was stronger than an ordinary Foundation Building cultivator’s, it was at most 250,000kg. This was inferior to the mystical power that he had even at the Meridian Opening Tier.","The strength of Spiritual Power was invisibility, and there was no speed restriction. If it was used like brute force, that would practically be a waste.","However, the Second Imperial Prince was already severely wounded at this moment, so it was impossible for him to resist. Spiritual Power was more than enough to deal with him. Moreover, wasn’t this showing off a lot?"]},{"number":3656,"title":"Chapter 3656 - Beating up the Imperial Princes","paragraphs":["Beating up the Imperial Princes","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The hundreds of soldiers all widened their eyes in shock.","Their Second Imperial Prince was picked up from the ground out of nowhere, and then tossed back towards Ling Han, as if there was an invisible giant hand controlling him.","Because of their ignorance, they all knelt down, thinking that the Gods had appeared.","The large black dog raised his head and looked around. This was the feeling he wanted, and he was so excited that he was howling.","Just as the Second Imperial Prince was about to crash into Ling Han, his body suddenly stopped in a strange manner. He hovered in midair, his limbs drooping. He glared furiously at Ling Han, “You dare to hit me, you dare to hit me!”","Pa, Ling Han slapped the Second Imperial Prince again, a crisp slap landing on the Second Imperial Prince’s face.","However, he hadn’t used too much power this time. If he had used the same attack as before, the Second Prince would most likely have been killed. At that time, Chen Fengyan definitely wouldn’t be able to sit still.","Now, however, his uncle was teaching his grand nephew a lesson. What could Chen Fengyan say?","“I’m hitting you. Are you dissatisfied?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Don’t be arrogant!” the Second Imperial Prince said through gritted teeth. “Even if you’ve advanced to the Celestial Path, this is still the Imperial Capital. The power left behind by my Imperial Father is completely capable of suppressing you!”","“Oh.” Ling Han nodded, and asked in reply, “Don’t you think it’s strange that when I’ve already come to blows, but why isn’t anyone stopping me?”","That’s right.","The Second Imperial Prince was slightly dazed. Previously, when they had made a move on Ling Han, hadn’t the Formation Spirit immediately appeared? And now? Had he gone out to lunch or a washroom break?","“Because I represent justice!” Ling Han said in all seriousness.","“Woof, woof, woof!” The large black dog was the first to burst into laughter. Ling Han represented justice?","This two-faced man, what a joke.","“Justice is invincible,” Ling Han continued, his tone incredibly serious.","The Second Imperial Prince faltered for a moment before almost exploding in fury.","Are you playing with me?","Justice and invincibility? Invincible your sister!","If justice was truly invincible, then who would still cultivate?","However, it was really strange. Where was the Formation Spirit, and why was there still no reaction?","Who exactly was Chen Fengyan’s son here?","Ling Han laughed loudly as he continued to pummel the Second Imperial Prince. Only when he had almost killed the latter did he stop.","He clapped a hand on the Second Imperial Prince’s shoulder, and said with a smile, “Remember this lesson. In future, you have to behave and be good. Otherwise, a righteous uncle like me will still appear and teach you a good lesson.”","The Second Imperial Prince’s face was bruised and battered, and he was already rendered speechless. There was only one question in his mind—was he really Chen Fengyan’s son?","How could he screw his son over like this?","Ling Han exited the Second Imperial Prince’s Residence and headed to the Third Imperial Prince’s manor. Meanwhile, the news of him barging into the Second Imperial Prince’s manor and coming to blows spread even faster than him.","Everyone was filled with disbelief. Firstly, Ling Han didn’t have such courage, and secondly, he didn’t have such powerful strength. Thirdly, even if he did have the courage and strength, how could Chen Fengyan not stop him?","What a joke; who would believe that?","Thus, when Ling Han arrived at the residence of the Third Imperial Prince, this place was completely unguarded.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be reserved. He charged in and forced the Third Imperial Prince out.","“You?” When the Third Imperial Prince saw Ling Han, his face was filled with shock. He could not believe that Ling Han would really dare to charge right up to his doorstep.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Third, are you surprised? Are you surprised?”","“What an unexpected turn of events!” the Third Imperial Prince declared darkly. When he saw Ling Han, he knew that the rumors were not false. Ling Han was really so outrageously bold.","He moved at the first instant. Boom, the Celestial Path-level aura exploded. With a leap, he charged towards Ling Han, his whole body glowing, as if he was a deity from beyond the heavens.","However, in front of absolute strength, what was the use?","Peng, Ling Han merely threw a punch, and the Third Imperial Prince was sent flying, completely unable to fight back.","“Is my current battle prowess comparable to Ultimate Dao Foundation?” Ling Han stroked his chin. His accumulation of power at the mortal level was really too deep, and the foundation of the Celestial Path that he had built was an imitation of that Stone Celestial Foundation. Even the heaven and earth forbade it.","He had built the Human Dao Foundation, but it had definitely surpassed the Heavenly Dao Foundation. In fact, it could even compare to the Ultimate Dao Foundation.","After beating up the Third Imperial Prince as well, Ling Han went to the manor of the Fourth Imperial Prince.","Instantly, “rumors” arose again, saying that the Third Imperial Prince was also beaten up terribly by Ling Han.","Immediately afterward, the Fourth Prince was also beaten to a pulp.","When this news was also revealed, finally, no one thought that it was fake.","Where did so many rumors come from?","Ling Han... was he really going to defy the heavens?","The Fifth Prince, Sixth Prince, Eighth Prince, and so on were all unable to escape the fate of being thrashed to their hearts’ content. The older Imperial Princes could be considered to have completely fallen, and only the Eldest and the Seventh Princes were spared. After all, they were no longer on this planet.","This made Ling Han feel slightly regretful. However, it was fine. Very soon, he too would go to the Holy Land of Metal Element, and it would not be too late to beat them up then.","After suffering so many losses, the Imperial Princes naturally wouldn’t give up. They all begged to see Chen Fengyan, yet they didn’t even know where Chen Fengyan was cultivating in seclusion. How were they supposed to face this injustice?","They could only ask Empress Ma and the others for help, but even these consorts could only see Chen Fengyan once in a very long time, they were still unable to find him.","This matter caused a great commotion in the imperial court. The old subjects were all filled with righteous indignation, and thought that Ling Han had committed treason. He actually dared to beat up the Imperial Princes. Did he still have any regard for the laws of the nation?","They were all pleading for Ling Han to be severely punished.","This formed a united opinion in the court, but the problem was, who would be able to deal with Ling Han?","In the first place, this person was the prodigy of the Imperial Capital. Now that he had advanced into the Foundation Building Tier, not only was he invincible in Human Dao Foundation, it was as if even a Heavenly Dao Foundation couldn’t deal with him. The problem was, where in the Imperial Capital would there be Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivators?","Those sects?","In terms of intimidation towards them, perhaps Ling Han and the name of the Foreign Affairs Department would be more useful?","Thus, as long as Chen Fengyan didn’t speak, who could stop Ling Han?","“You’re awesome!” Xuanyuan Dingguo was sincerely impressed. Ling Han should be the first person to be able to sit calmly after beating up an Imperial Prince. Furthermore, he had not beaten up just one Imperial Prince, but a whole bunch of them.","In this way, who would dare to trifle with the Foreign Affairs Department?","Ling Han merely smiled. He patted Xuanyuan Dingguo’s shoulder and said, “Work hard on your cultivation, young man. I hope that when I return, you’ll have already broken through to Celestial Path.”","“Definitely,” Xuanyuan Dingguo said with a nod.","The miscellaneous matters here were basically resolved, so Ling Han decided to set out, heading towards the Holy Land of Metal Element.","As per usual, the little loli took out her shuttle and she and Ling Han sat in it. As for the other people... or dog, pig, and so on, they entered the Essence Nurturing Gourd.","‘Time to setoff!’","Xiu, the shuttle tore through the air, and soon entered into the dark universe.","After Ling Han advanced into the Foundation Building Tier, he gained the ability to fly on a tool. However, if he wanted to fly on a tool, he needed to infuse a portion of his divine sense into his “tool”. However, Ling Han still wanted to forge the Origin Gold in the Holy Land of Metal Element. In future, he would also use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning as a weapon. If he split out a portion of his divine sense on a tool now, wouldn’t it be a waste?","Thus, he temporarily suppressed the thought of flying on a tool, and decided to forge out the Origin Gold first.","The little girl followed the star chart and began to search for spatial nodes to traverse through space. Otherwise, who knew how long it would take to fly from here to the Holy Land of Metal Element."]},{"number":3657,"title":"Chapter 3657 - Black Moon Planet","paragraphs":["Black Moon Planet","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The shuttle passed through one node after another, leaving an endless distance behind it.","Even so, half a year later, the shuttle finally arrived at the Black Moon Planet.","The Black Moon Plane was a great planet Though there had never been an Ancestral King, there had been a considerable number of Saints. Thus, there were a considerable number of Holy Lands on the Black Moon Planet, such as the Holy Land of Metal Element, the Holy Land of Crimson Fire, the Holy Land of Intentionless, and so on.","However, that was all in the past. Whichever Holy Land no longer had a Saint standing guard, they had all long since died.","However, even though the Saints had died, the Saint Tools had still been left behind. It could exist for a very, very long time. Thus, these Holy Lands were still very powerful, and everyone needed to respect them.","That was because once the Saint Tool showed its might, it could even kill Venerate Tier elites.","Furthermore, there would definitely be techniques left behind by Saints in the Holy Lands. One only had to learn a little bit, and his battle prowess would be enough to overwhelm his peers, which naturally made the Holy Lands even more superior.","Peng!","The little loli steered the shuttle to land, but since she was steering it, how could she possibly land safely?","Under the violent collision, Tang Yun’er and Ling Han screamed in excitement.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. How did the adults in her family teach their children?","Tang Yun’er put away the shuttle with a regretful expression. When she saw the structure below, she thought it was some sect, but when she crashed into it, she found out that it was an abandoned place.","Ling Han released the empress and the others. In this half year’s time, none of them had been able to absorb the power of heaven and earth, so their cultivation level had practically stagnated.","From this aspect, it was really good to directly teleport through formations, saving time and effort.","Coincidentally, the sun had just risen, so it was just right for them to cultivate.","The empress and the others all sat down in cross-legged positions, absorbing the power of heaven and earth to boost their cultivation level.","Ling Han didn’t waste any time. Although the Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique was no longer all that useful, it still had some effect, no matter how tiny it was. He couldn’t waste it.","He opened all the apertures in his body, extracting the power of heaven and earth.","Yi, the power of heaven and earth here was much denser.","Ling Han nodded. As expected of a great planet. The power of heaven and earth was far richer.","However, it was precisely because the power of heaven and earth was dense here that the resistance that one had to overcome in order to fly here was also greater. Probably, only one in ten Foundation Building Tiers would be able to fly on a Tool at most.","Furthermore, the mountains and plains would also be much sturdier than Celestial Sea Planet, and would not be destroyed so easily.","Moreover, a considerable number of Saints had appeared here before, so they would definitely strengthen the planet.","The most important thing now was to get a Celestial Path-level cultivation technique, but who would easily teach such a technique?","When it came to urgency, it was definitely the large black dog, who was the most anxious. That was because he belonged to the chatterbox type. It would be uncomfortable even if he did not speak for a moment, what more when it had already been more than half a year, and he could only “woof woof woof woof”?","Thus, it definitely had to cultivate to the Blood Transformation Tier as soon as possible. That way, even if it didn’t ingest the Transformation Fruit, it wouldn’t be a problem for it to speak.","It sat on its knees like a human, its two front paws still clasped together, and added with a pair of eye-catching purple underpants, it was flamboyant to the point of speechlessness.","After everyone finished cultivating, Ling Han and the others set off. They were completely unfamiliar with the Black Moon Planet, so they had to know where the Holy Land of Metal Element was first.","Everyone was still packed into the gourd. Ling Han used the movement technique, and his speed had already broken through 20 times the speed of sound. If he used the Imminent Skyline, it would be even faster. Though this was also very exhausting on mystical power, just how deep was Ling Han’s foundation?","If it was not for the fact that his physique could not keep up, he could completely run for eight to ten years.","In less than half an hour, Ling Han entered into a small town.","He let everyone out first, and they all entered into a restaurant. On one side, they could have a snack, while on the other, they would gather some information.","It wasn’t long before Ling Han grasped some preliminary information.","This was the Shadow Demon Town, and it was named after the nearby Shadow Demon Mountain. Moreover, this place also belonged to the territory of the Holy Land of Metal Element.","However, every Holy Land had once been incredibly prosperous and powerful. Thus, the territory of the Holy Land of Metal Element was even larger than the Celestial Sea Planet. This place only belonged to the outer circle of the Holy Land of Metal Element.","The Metal Element Fruit Gathering was a distinguished gathering of the Holy Land of Metal Element, and would only open once every twenty years. Thus, even the residents of this place had no lack of understanding of this event.","How were the people on the Black Moon Planet supposed to participate in this gathering?","Simple. One only had to enter into the territory of the Holy Land of Metal Element, and pass through one test after another, and one would be qualified.","What kind of test was this?","There were nine-storey towers everywhere in the Holy Land of Metal Element, but they were divided into three levels, Black Iron, Silver and Gold. As long as one could pass through these three types of nine-storey towers, he would be qualified to go to the real Holy Land of Metal Element.","In truth, those like the Eldest Imperial Prince had only obtained the right to go to the Holy Land of Metal Element, and was not directly qualified to participate in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering.","To Ling Han, as long as he passed through the three towers, he would be standing on the same level as the Eldest Imperial Prince, Hong Tianbu and the others.","Coincidentally, there was a nine-storey tower on the Shadow Demon Mountain, which was Black Iron-level.","Only by passing through the nine-storey tower of Black Iron level could one go to the nine-storey tower of Silver level, and then the nine-storey tower of Gold level. It was said that if one passed through the nine-storey tower in a short enough time, they could also receive rewards, which were basically cultivation techniques or martial arts techniques.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel his heart palpitate. Although this kind of reward technique definitely wouldn’t be a high-level technique, he now had zero cultivation technique. No matter how bad it was, it was still better than zero.","Very well!","After eating, Ling Han brought everyone up the Shadow Demon Mountain.","Shadow Demon Mountain was extremely tall. The empress and Hu Niu were only slightly stronger than normal people, and after walking for a short while, they were already panting. However, they saw this as a kind of training exercise, and only when they were completely exhausted did they enter into the Essence Nurturing Gourd.","The little loli, the large black dog, and the fat pig were also slacking off, and followed them in. Only the seven toddlers accompanied Ling Han.","After more than half an hour, Ling Han arrived at the summit. He saw that there was indeed a tall black tower built at the summit. It had a total of nine floors, and there were no windows or doors.","It was very lively at the foot of the tower, with many people queuing up.","The nine-storey tower could only accommodate one person at a time.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry either. He sat at the side and waited. In any case, there were still a few months until the Metal Element Fruit Gathering.","Now that he had advanced into Celestial Path, he was finally qualified to study Celestial level formations. In the half year he had spent in the galaxy, he had not been idle either, and had been flipping through that precious book on formations.","No wonder he had never understood Celestial level formations before, because Celestial level formations required the use of a large amount of Spiritual Power.","For example, the area he was standing in nowwas very normal, but a Grandmaster Formation Master only had to step on it, and he would be able to change the terrain, forming a killing formation.","A formation formed with a single thought; that was the level of Grandmaster.","Of course, there were some heaven and earth powers that were too powerful, and even Grandmaster Formation Masters could not change them with a single thought. Then, they would still need to use formation foundations, and there were incredibly harsh requirements on the ingredients.","Ling Han did have a few One Star materials, but he had not completely grasped the formation foundations yet, and could not make them into formation foundations either. He had to plan slowly.","Multiple formation patterns churned in his mind, changing to the extreme.","The formation patterns were dead, but the power of heaven and earth was alive, so merely leaning formation patterns was useless. One had to learn how to draw inferences from one example, adapting to the situation.","The path of formations was also wide and profound. Merely formation patterns alone had innumerable changes, which was enough to exhaust a whole lifetime of energy.","However, Ling Han was different. He still had Wally, who could help him predict changes.","Just as he was engrossed in his thoughts, he heard a commotion rise up in the crowd.","“Liu Zhenglong has ascended to the eighth level!”"]},{"number":3658,"title":"Chapter 3658 - Toppling the tower","paragraphs":["Toppling the tower","Translator: Henyee Translations","Editor: Henyee Translations","As long as there was someone in the nine-storey tower, the corresponding floor would light up.","Previously, the seventh level had lit up for quite a while, and now the eighth level had finally lit up, which meant that the person inside had passed through the seventh level.","“As expected of Liu Zhenglong.”","“I wonder if he can take another step further.”","“If he can reach the ninth level, or even pass through in fact, then his aptitude would be on the level of Black Iron.”","“Although Black Iron-level qualifications does not qualify him to join a Holy Land, it’s still not difficult to enter the Core Formation Tier or even the True Self Tier-level sect.”","“This is a chance for a carp to leap over the Dragon’s Gate.?”","“I’m really envious.”","Everyone was discussing spiritedly, and many people did not hide their jealousy.","Ling Han was surprised. What was there to be envious about joining a True Self Tier or Core Formation Tier-level sect?","Oh, he soon understood. This was not the Celestial Sea Planet. The environment of cultivation here was already incredibly mature and stable, and there were nine levels in the Celestial Path. Every level was clearly defined, with strict hierarchy.","To a True Self Tier cultivator, a Core Formation Tier cultivator was nothing but trash.","Thus, for a Foundation Building Tier cultivator, being able to join a Core Formation Tier-level sect was naturally a great fortune. As long as they felt that their abilities had improved, everyone would seek out a nine-storey tower to undergo a trial.","However, if one failed the challenge after entering into the nine-storey tower, they would not be able to issue another challenge within half a year’s time. It would not cause others to become too engrossed in the matter of challenges. However, not only did this Liu Zhenglong fail to pass through the ninth level, he was not even qualified to set foot on the ninth level. Very soon, the light of the eighth level dimmed, and the doors at the bottom of the tower opened, and a disheveled man walked out.","“Unfortunately, Liu Zhenglonghas still failed.”","“Sigh, it’s already so difficult to reach Black Iron aptitude. I really can’t imagine how powerful those one-star geniuses are.”","“Haha, if you are a one-star genius, you would be qualified to join the Holy Land.”","“Actually, if you’re really a one-star genius, going to a small sect is actually better. You can get more attention. There’s a saying that it’s better to be the head of a chicken than the tail of an ox.”","“No, no, no. Even if he was an ordinary disciple in a Holy Land, he would still have more confidence than the Dao Child of a small sect.”","Everyone began talking again, each having their own opinions.","That was only a one-star genius; was it really that difficult?","Ling Han thought again. In the past, in the Imperial Capital, only the Eldest Imperial Prince and Hong Tianbu could be considered as star-level prodigies. Even Princess Bixiao had only become a one-star genius after Brother Monkey unlocked the power of her bloodline.","With such a comparison, one-star geniuses were indeed rare. It was no wonder that they could be directly taken as disciples by the Holy Lands.","At first, he had thought that the conditions set by the Holy Land of Metal Element were too low, that as long as it was a one-star genius, they would be able to go to the Holy Land. Now that he thought about it, the reason why there had been so many people at that time was completely because too many extraterrestrial visitors had come. They were basically the strongest heirs and descendants of the Sect Master-level forces, so they were naturally awesome. Though Liu Zhenglong had failed to pass the test, he had still gained the support of the masses. Being able to ascend to the eighth level of the tower was already extraordinary, and he was worth befriending.","At this moment, no one dared to challenge the tower again. After all, there was no need for those who were weaker than Liu Zhenglong to join in on the excitement. They would definitely be kicked out of the tournament. Rather than not being able to challenge the tower for the next six months, it would be better to wait until they were stronger to come back.","There was no one else?","“You guys wait here,” Ling Han said to the seven babies. As long as the little guys grew up normally, they would be able to increase their cultivation level. As early as two months ago, when they were still in the galaxy, they had all stepped onto Celestial Path.","There was no test from the heaven’s calamity. It was as if they were Foundation Building Tier cultivators in the first place, and had just cultivated back to this level.","With the strength of the seven babies, without Ling Han’s protection, they were completely fine. Instead, Ling Han was worried that they would cripple someone.","“Yes, Father,” the seven babies replied in their childish voices. Because they had advanced into Celestial Path, even Sixth Baby could control whether she revealed herself or not. Finally, she no longer had to be invisible, and was always overlooked.","Ling Han set off. He had just taken a few steps, when xiu, a figure flew down from the skies and landed at the entrance of the tower.","“Flying on a Tool!” Everyone exclaimed in shock.","To fly on the Black Moon Planet, only one out of 10 Foundation Building Tier cultivators could do it. There was basically no one here that could do it, so they were naturally stunned.","That was a young man that looked to be only twenty-four or twenty-five years old, at most. He had just put away a Divine Sword, and there was a haughty expression on his face as he swept an eye over everyone, his expression filled with disdain.","“Hiss, that’s Han Qian!”","“What, Zifang Sect’s Han Qian?”","“He has always been known as a prodigy. I didn’t expect that when he had just stepped into the Foundation Building Tier, he would actually be able to fly on a tool.”","Someone recognized this person, and after he spoke up, it instantly drew a heated discussion from the masses.","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. He didn’t care who this person was, but he definitely couldn’t jump into his queue.","“Line up at the back!” he said in displeasure.","Han Qian was taken aback. He had just advanced into Celestial Path not too long ago, and had just learnt how to fly on a Tool, so he was very conceited. He thought that all the prodigies in the world were only so, and his self-confidence had soared to the extreme.","But now, someone actually dared to make him queue up at the back?","“Haha!” He sneered, “You really don’t know what you’re talking about! Firstly, there is absolutely no way that you can pass the test of the nine-storey tower, and secondly, what right do you have to command me?”","“Han Qian, you have gone too far.” A voice suddenly rang out.","Everyone turned to look at the person who had spoken. What was going on today? First, there was Ling Han, and now there was this person. They actually dared to challenge Han Qian?","That was a middle-aged man. He was tall and slender, and there was a large bow on his back.","“Huntsman Hu An!” someone exclaimed in shock.","When he heard this name, even Han Qian looked wary.","Hu An was a veteran Foundation Building Tier cultivator, and it was said that he had already formed the foundation of Heavenly Dao, which was far more powerful than him.","“First come, first served. This is the most basic rule. Don’t you even understand this?” Hu An asked calmly.","“Brother Hu is right.” Han Qian clenched his fists, forcefully suppressing his fury.","The cultivation world was very realistic. Whoever was stronger would have the right to speak.","He obediently retreated, and did not try to be brave.","Ling Han nodded at Hu An. In this day and age, it was already very rare to see anyone speaking up for justice. Though he could kill this Han Qian with a single punch, seeing someone step out to speak up for justice still made his heart","He strode into the tower, and the doors immediately closed.","This was a sealed off space, but it wasn’t dark. There was an unknown light source glowing, illuminating the inside.","The space was not small, and was circular in shape. Its radius was about nine meters, and its height was only about three meters. The walls around it seemed to be forged from black iron, exuding the cold light of metal.","Right in the middle of this iron room, there was a human figure that was forged from black iron, and was only five feet tall.","Weng! The black figure’s eyes suddenly lit up, and a powerful aura instantly emanated from its body.","Yi, this was actually a Foundation Building Tier metal figure. It looked a bit like the war colossus, but the war colossus was much more powerful than it.","Ling Han casually snapped his fingers. Pa! The metallic figure was sent flying, crashing into the wall and sliding down."]},{"number":3659,"title":"Chapter 3659 - Great Sun Lotus Technique","paragraphs":["Great Sun Lotus Technique","Translator Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was slightly surprised. This was because he had only sent the metallic figure flying with a single finger. However, it hadn’t shattered.","What kind of material was it forged from? It was so powerful.","Just as he was pondering, a flight of stairs appeared out of thin air.","Alright, if this iron man could be easily destroyed, then how many people would the Holy Land of Metal Element have to expend to maintain it? It should be known that there was not just this one Black Iron Tower.","Thus, iron men should have very strong self-healing abilities.","Ling Han walked up to the second floor. Like the first floor, this was also a metallic figure.","With an outsider invading, the iron man immediately revived and launched an attack at Ling Han.","Pa! Ling Han snapped his fingers again, sending the metallic figure flying. He had defeated his opponent in one go.","He continued upwards, and arrived at the third floor. He then went on to the fourth floor, and then to the fifth floor. He had dealt with all of them with a single strike.","Outside, when they saw the Black Iron Tower light up floor after floor, everyone was stunned. This speed was too fast, wasn’t it? It was practically as if he was strolling around. He had not met his match at all.","This guy was so strong?","“Genius!”","It is possible that a Black Iron-level prodigy is about to appear.”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock. In a small place like theirs, perhaps a prodigy that had passed through the nine-storey tower would appear only once every ten years or so.","Meanwhile, Han Qian smirked coldly. He too could do the same. The test of these nine levels of the Black Iron Tower was harder and harder with each level. Thus, as long as one’s abilities were strong enough, he would naturally be able to easily pass through the first eight levels.","“The fifth level!”","“He has reached the sixth level.”","“So fast, he’s reached the seventh level.”","“The eighth level!”","As for the ninth level?","In a short while, Ling Han had already arrived at the ninth level.","It was still the same black metal figure. It had just charged over, when it was knocked down with a punch from Ling Han.","Pa, a book fell from the top of his head, and landed on the ground.","Reward?","Ling Han picked up the book and looked at it. There were five words written on it: “Great Sun Lotus Technique”.","He flipped through it, and couldn’t help but look pleased. This was actually a cultivation technique.","Hehe, just what he needed. He was presently lacking a cultivation technique.","Ling Han couldn’t help but sit down and flip through the “Great Sun Lotus Technique”.","Very quickly, he had already flipped through it once, and had a basic understanding.","Unfortunately, it was not time for the sun to rise now, so he could not cultivate.","However, he was too curious, and couldn’t help but channel it. Instantly, the power of heaven and earth materialized in front of him, and he absorbed it, surging it into his body.","Yi, why was it that this was clearly not the time for the sun to rise, yet he could still cultivate?","So slow.","Ling Han immediately thought. This speed was about the same as him absorbing the power of heaven and earth with his Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique.","With such efficiency at this time, what would it be like to cultivate in the early morning?","As expected, whether there was a suitable cultivation technique or not was too important.","This “Great Sun Lotus Technique” was very short in length, and only corresponded to the Foundation Building Tier. It lacked the parts for Cauldron Forging Tier and the levels after. However, Ling Han didn’t care. He only needed a cultivation technique for now, and in the future, he would definitely find a first-class cultivation technique,","—Since this was used as a reward, and it was only the reward for passing through the Black Iron Tower, how good could it be?","Ling Han stood up and descended to the first floor. There was a mark on his hand, and it disappeared in a flash, invisible to the naked eye.","Did this mean that he had passed through the Black Iron Tower?","This was more or less the same as the Young Dragon Trial. They both liked to leave a mark on others.","Ling Han pushed open the doors and walked out of the tower, strolling slowly.","“Has he passed?”","“Having taken so long, it’ll be tough.”","“I guess he passed. After all, he fought so quickly on the first eight levels.” “That may not be the case. Perhaps it is precisely because he had rushed ahead too quickly, and expended all his battle prowess, so it would not be strange for him not to have passed the ninth stage.”","Everyone was whispering among themselves, while Han Qian smirked coldly. Whether Ling Han had passed or not, the time he had spent was really too long He was definitely not as strong as himself.","“Brat, just watch, and I’ll let you know what a prodigy is!” He entered the Black Iron Tower.","Ling Han had obtained a cultivation technique, so he was in a good mood. How could he possibly pay any attention to him? He directly left. Since he had already passed the Black Iron Tower’s trial, he should go and find the Silver Tower next.","He went to look for the children, yet he was surprised to discover that the seven children had actually gotten along well with Hu An, chatting and laughing.","“Making new friends?” he asked with a smile.","“Father, this uncle is so interesting,” Eldest Baby said with a smile.","“My stomach hurts from laughing.” Sixth Baby clutched her stomach.","Third Baby said coldly, “Childish.”","“Little brother, my place is located at the foot of the mountain. Why don’t you come over for a visit? It’s already late, so why don’t you spend the night at my place?’ Hu An took the initiative to extend an invitation.","Ling Han also admired his righteousness, so he nodded and said, “Thank you for the trouble.”","The two of them descended the mountain with the children. When he saw how energetic the seven children were, Hu An couldn’t help but click his tongue in wonder.","Hu An had a sizable manor at the foot of the mountain, occupying an area of three to four acres. The houses were connected, with rock gardens and a small stream, appearing very serene and elegant.","“Brother Hu is truly a refined person,” Ling Han praised.","“No, no.” Hu An laughed loudly, but his expression was very pleased.","He arranged a dinner for Ling Han and the others. Because it involved the secret of the Essence Nurturing Gourd, Ling Han couldn’t possibly let the empress and the others out. It was fine. Worse come to worst, he could just pack some food for them to eat.","“Come, let’s drink!” Hu An was very cordial, and repeatedly offered Ling Han a toast.","After talking for a while, Ling Han also found out that this Hu An was originally a hunter, but by chance, he came across a fortuitous encounter, allowing him to walk on the path of martial arts. He even leaped over the Celestial Gate, and became a Foundation Building elite.","However, it was hard to change his habits. Hu An still liked to be a hunter, so he settled down in the Shadow Demon Mountain. Occasionally, he would enter the mountains to hunt. Of course, what he was hunting now were not ordinary wild beasts, but powerful Demonic Beasts that had not developed intelligence.","“Had your fill?” Hu An waved the wine pot, and commanded a servant, “Bring me some wine.”","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, “More or less.”","“Have another jar of wine. Haha, let’s drink another pot of wine,” Hu An said with a smile.","Ling Han couldn’t convince him otherwise, so he nodded.","The wine was served, and Hu An filled Ling Han’s cup. He then poured a cup for himself, saying, “Come, cheers!”","Ling Han picked up the wine cup, and when he put it to his lips, he paused for a moment.","“What is it? Can’t get drunk?” Juan asked.","Ling Han shook his head, “This wine can’t be drunk.”","“Why?” Hu An was surprised.","“Poison!” Ling Han said calmly.","Hu An faltered for a moment before laughing loudly. “Brother Ling, are you trying to make me laugh?”","“I don’t have that attribute.” Ling Han shook his head.","Only then did Hu An frown. “Are you sure?”","“Positive.”","Hu An nodded, and said, “Liu Qi, come here for a while.”","Zhi, the doors opened, and a servant walked over. He bowed towards Hu An,","“Master, what is your command?”","“Do you know that this wine is poisonous?” Hu An asked calmly, but his voice was baleful and menacing.","Pa, that servant immediately knelt down, his forehead covered with cold sweat.","‘Tve treated you well, yet you’re repaying kindness with ingratitude. Humph!” With a wave of his hand, Hu An struck the top of the servant’s head. Pa! The servant instantly collapsed to the ground, no longer breathing.."]},{"number":3660,"title":"Chapter 3660 - Man-eating Demon","paragraphs":["Man-eating Demon","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The matter was resolved?","Ling Han glanced at Hu An, confusion flashing through his mind.","‘Aren’t you the slightest bit curious why he poisoned you?’","“Sigh!” Hu An sighed. “These servants are all people with blood on their hands. I took them down and let them cultivate their moral character here. I didn’t expect this person to bear a grudge.”","Ling Han smiled and said, “Brother Hu is truly benevolent. I’m impressed.”","“You flatter me,” Hu An said with a shake of his head. “By the looks of it, these people still lack discipline. I’ll definitely be more strict in the future.”","After the incident with the poisoned wine, they were naturally in no mood for any more food and drink. Thus, Hu An escorted them to the guest room. “Father, do you really believe the words of that bearded uncle?” Sixth Baby asked.","Ling Han shook his head, “I don’t know.”","“Then why didn’t you expose him?” Eldest Baby also asked.","“Do we have any proof?” Ling Han said with a smile. “Furthermore, I’m only suspicious now. If it’s really as he said, wouldn’t that be awkward?”","“Oh.” The seven babies all nodded.","“If he really has malicious intentions, there will definitely be a second plan if this plan does not succeed. Just wait and see how he shows his true colours,” Ling Han said. In truth, he too did not want Hu An to be a bad person. After all, there were really too few good people in this era.","They rested, but Ling Han couldn’t sleep. He lay on the bed and studied formations. This path was really wide and profound, making him feel like he couldn’t comprehend it even if he poured his heart and soul into it.","Ling Han felt that he still hadn’t grasped the basics yet. Otherwise, even though formations were ever-changing, they wouldn’t be so difficult to grasp. At the very least, he would be able to get started.","‘Hmm? He’s here.’","Ling Han sighed. He sincerely hoped that he had only misunderstood Hu An. The latter was not the evil person he had imagined, but in truth, he was disappointed.","He saw a secret compartment open, and soundlessly, a thin pipe stretched out. It was currently spewing out smoke.","If he and the kids were already asleep, then it was extremely likely that they wouldn’t have noticed. After all, Foundation Building Tier cultivators weren’t omnipotent gods, but Ling Han was already suspicious, so how could he possibly be unguarded?","He did not attack at the first instant, but rather closed his eyes, and acted as if he had already been hit.","After a while, the doors opened, and a person walked in. He was tall and slender, and under the moonlight, he cast a long shadow.","Hu An walked in. His face was slightly flushed, as if he was under extreme excitement.","“You know how much I hope that the person who comes in isn’t you,” Ling Han suddenly said, sitting up straight.","Hu An couldn’t help but feel surprised. He immediately went into a defensive stance, but in the blink of an eye, he relaxed, and asked, “You were already on guard against me?”","“Do you think that, since I almost drank a cup of poisonous wine, I should sleep so carelessly and foolishly?” Ling Han countered with a question of his own.","“You shouldn’t,” Hu An said with a shake of his head. There was a smile on his face, and he continued, “However, I’m a little confused. Why didn’t you act out earlier? Why did you deliberately pretend that you had been affected by the medicinal effects? Why did you lure me out?”","“Because I hope that this person isn’t you,” Ling Han said calmly.","Hu An was silent for a moment, then broke into a grin, though it was incredibly malevolent. “Unfortunately, I have disappointed you!”","“Why?” Ling Han asked, “Previously, you were still speaking up for justice, and now you want to harm me. This is very contradictory.”","“Does everything have to be logical?” Hu An asked slowly.","“Give me a reasonable explanation. When I make my move, I can be more efficient and give you a quick death,” Ling Han said.","“Hahaha!” Hu An laughed loudly, “You have only built the foundation of human Dao, while I have built the foundation of Heavenly Dao. Young man, do you think that you are a god just because you have passed through the nine-storey tower?”","He had built the Heavenly Dao Foundation, and his level of being had surpassed Ling Han’s. With a single glance, he could determine that Ling Han’s cultivation level was weaker than his. Then, since he was building the foundations of Heavenly Dao, and Ling Han would only be building the foundations of human Dao.","Ling Han merely looked at him, and did not speak.","“Alright, there’s no harm in telling you.” Hu An found a chair and sat down. “I’m only standing up for you because I’m taking this opportunity to have a reasonable chance of getting close to you and those seven children.”","He paused, then continued, “Let me tell you a secret. Previously, when I was still a mortal, I had once been trapped on the snowy mountain with my companion. The strong winds could forcibly tear one’s skin. When we were trapped until the ninth day, we were really unable to bear the hunger.”","“Thus, we began fighting, both wanting to kill the other.”","“Because... that’s precious food!”","“There’s naturally no need for me to explain the outcome, right?”","“Since that time, I have been captivated by human flesh, and feel that it is the most delicious thing in the world. Even if I have advanced into Celestial Path, and merely by absorbing the power of heaven and earth, I would not starve to death or die of thirst, I still want to eat human flesh.”","“Thus, I settled down here, and when I became hungry, I went to the Shadow Demon Mountain. I always managed to bring a few idiots back.”","“Let me tell you, the meat of a cultivator is more fragrant than the meat of a mortal, and after stepping onto Celestial Path, there is another active factor in the meat. Not only does it taste better, it can also help one’s cultivation level.”","“A small part of the reason why I was able to build the foundations of Heavenly Dao so quickly is because of this.”","“Oh, that’s right. The meat of a child is more fragrant. That’s why I’ve set my eyes on you.”","After Hu An finished speaking, he looked at Ling Han, as if he was anticipating him to show an expression of fear.","—Dying in a state of intense fear, one’s muscles would have a unique smell.","But to his disappointment, Ling Han’s expression was calm, and there was not the slightest bit of fluctuation.","This had far exceeded his expectations. Ling Han’s reaction was too illogical.","Ling Han tapped his finger on the table, “You deserve to die.”","“Many people said something similar before I killed them.” Hu An shrugged, “But in the end, I ate them all.”","Ling Han snapped his fingers, and xiu, a powerful force shot towards Hu An.","“A mere Human Dao Foundation!” Juan smirked coldly. “Brat, you’ve just entered Celestial Path, and all your knowledge is still stuck at the mortal level, right? Let me tell you, even a one-star genius can only be invincible at the level of Human Dao Foundation. A two-star genius can just barely match the early stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation, a three-star genius can battle the peak stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation.”","“And I am at the peak stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation!”","He casually sent out a palm strike towards the gust of energy, “Could you possibly be a three-star genius?”","Of course not. If it really was a three-star geniu, the Holy Land would have long since treated him like a treasure and taken him in as a personal disciple.","Pa, the two forces collided, and Hu An’s power instantly crumbled. Meanwhile, Ling Han’s finger was still aimed at Hu An, leaving a trail of blood on his left shoulder.","“What!” Hu An paled in shock.","Even a three-star genius could only fight him to a tie, but Ling Han actually wounded him with a single strike. What the hell was this?","Could it be... it was a four-star genius? That could be invincible even with a gap of one level!","Ling Han stood up, “Do you have any last words?”","Hu An’s eyes darted around, and he suddenly turned around and fled. A battle hammer had already appeared beneath his feet, bringing him away through the air.."]},{"number":3661,"title":"Chapter 3661: Suppression by the cornerstone of the","paragraphs":["Chapter 3661: Suppression by the cornerstone of the","Celestial Path","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Unfortunately, since Ling Han was already targeting him, how could he still escape?","Peng! Ling Han threw a punch, and with a burst of power, he quickly caught up to Hu An and sent him flying. The battle hammer smashed into the distance, breaking through several walls and creating a loud sound.","Hu An paled in shock. This was something he hadn’t expected. He couldn’t even escape?","“We can talk things over peacefully.” He suddenly smiled apologetically. The speed of his change was unexpected, but he suddenly retreated rapidly, a longbow appearing in his hands. He drew the bow, nocked an arrow and shot.","Xiu, the arrow shot over at an incredibly fast speed.","With a thought from Ling Han, the Starlight Screen appeared, and the arrow crashed into it. However, it immediately broke, and plummeted.","He was completely unconcerned as he bore down on Hu An.","Hu An gritted his teeth, shooting arrows as he retreated. Xiu, xiu, xiu! He was known as a huntsman, and his archery skills were truly extraordinary. One after another, arrows shot out at tricky angles and extremely fast speeds.","However, for Ling Han, this was completely wasted effort.","Ling Han only had to activate the Starlight Screen, and all of Hu An’s efforts would be wasted.","He approached with large strides. It looked like his steps were calm, but he was rapidly closing the distance between the two of them.","Hu An was terrified. He killed people like they were nothing, and devoured their flesh and blood. However, it was also because of this that he was especially afraid of death. He feared that he would suffer the same fate.","He gritted his teeth, and a stone that was less than the size of a soybean immediately appeared on his forehead. However, it immediately enlarged, and instantly became the size of a human head. It was as if it was forged from bronze, and an indescribable brilliance surged, exuding an indescribable intimidation.","This was the cornerstone of his Heavenly Dao.","Why was the Heavenly Dao Foundation stronger than the Human Dao Foundation? Aside from power, it was the cornerstone of Heavenly Dao, which had an intrinsic crushing effect on the cornerstone of Human Dao.","This was just like how a mortal’s aura would become extremely weak when they saw a high-ranking official.","Of course, the foundation stone of the Celestial Path was too precious. Unless absolutely necessary, no one would use it. What if it was shattered? That would be equivalent to having their cultivation level of Foundation Building reduced, and they would have to start back from the beginning again.","Now that he was going all out, he naturally wouldn’t care about this.","“Brat, in the end, you are only a Human Dao Foundation. Kneel!” Hu An shouted loudly.","Boom, the foundation stone of the Celestial Path exuded a powerful might, enough to make 90% of Human Dao Foundation cultivators go weak in the knees, losing their battle prowess.","This wasn’t something that couldn’t be resisted, but it required a cultivator of Human Dao Foundation to expend a lot of effort to resist it. If one used their power on defense, how much power would they still have left when they attacked?","There were nine levels in the Celestial Path, and not only was there a massive suppression between major tiers, it was the same even for minor levels.","Suppression on a fundamental level assaulted him, but Ling Han didn’t need to resist at all. His foundation of the Celestial Path was as steady as a boulder, and he was completely unmoved.","It should be known that this was built in imitation of the Stone Celestial Gate, so how could it be ordinary?","Hu An’s face was filled with disbelief. How was this possible? He had already summoned the foundation stone of the Celestial Path, so why was he still unable to suppress Ling Han?","Could it be that... the other party was also a Heavenly Dao Foundation cultivator, or even an Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivator in fact?","That was impossible. He could clearly sense that Ling Han’s Celestial Dao aura was inferior to his.","“Suppress! Suppress!” Hu An shouted loudly. He pushed the foundation stone of the Celestial Path towards Ling Han.","With a thought from Ling Han, he summoned his own cornerstone of the Celestial Path.","He knew that the cornerstone of the Celestial Path that he had built was very awesome, but he did not know exactly how awesome it was. Previously, he had not dared to use it recklessly against the Second Imperial Prince and the others, so he could use this Hu An to test it out.","Though there was already more than half a year since he had built the foundations of the Celestial Path, he had only really cultivated for a little over a month. Thus, it was still only the size of his pinky, and could not compare to Hu An’s foundations of the Celestial Path.","However, even though it was small, there was an ancient, primitive aura circulating around it. The Intent Realm was extremely far-reaching.","Hu An stimulated the cornerstone of the Celestial Path to attack, wanting to get closer so that he could overwhelm Ling Han. However, after taking a few steps, he discovered that his cornerstone of the Celestial Path was actually trembling.","How was this possible?","The foundation stones of the Celestial Path did not have life, so why would they tremble?","Moreover, why was it trembling? He was a Heavenly Dao Foundation, and his level of being was above Ling Han’s. If anyone was trembling, it should be Ling Han.","He could feel that his foundation stone of the Celestial Path was afraid, fearful, and did not dare to advance another step further.","He was unwilling to give up, and gritted his teeth as he continued to advance.","Ka, ka, ka, ka! A terrifying scene appeared. Cracks actually appeared on Hu An’s celestial foundation stone, instantly covering the entire foundation stone.","“How could that be!” Hu An was about to collapse. This was the foundation stone of the Celestial Path shattering on its own. It was as if he had forced a loyal subject to assassinate the monarch. That loyal subject would rather shatter than commit blasphemy against the monarch.","He had never heard of it before! A high-level foundation stone of the Celestial Path would suppress a low-level one, and even if they were suppressed, it was impossible that they would shatter on their own.","Peng, Hu An’s foundation of the Celestial Path crumbled.","Hu An was despondent. His cornerstone of the Celestial Path had shattered, and his cultivation level had instantly been severed and he had declined into mortality.","“Trash like you should not exist in this world,” Ling Han stated calmly. He delivered a palm strike, and Destructive Energy surged, enshrouding Hu An.","He had not thought that his foundation stone of the Celestial Path would actually be so awesome, and the reason for it must be that he had imitated the Stone Celestial Gate.","No wonder heaven and earth didn’t tolerate it. Its might was too terrifying; how could other Foundation Building cultivators live?","“Don’t kill me. I can tell you a huge secret,” Hu An shouted. However, the Destructive Energy had already reached him. Although he tried his best to resist, it was useless. He was soon annihilated and dissipated.","Ling Han was completely unconcerned. What great secret would this kind of man-eating demon know?","He returned to his room and entered the Essence Nurturing Gourd, where he truly rested.","Early the next morning, Ling Han and the others all came out of the gourd, cultivating under the morning sun.","Boom! The power of heaven and earth surged over.","Ling Han immediately discovered that compared to Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique, the difference was like heaven and earth.","It couldn’t be helped. The Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique only corresponded to the mortal level, and if he switched to cultivating the Great Sun Lotus Technique when he had been in the mortal level, it was guaranteed that the effects wouldn’t be as good as the Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique.","In his mind, the dao foundation of Human Dao had slightly enlarged.","The process of Human Dao Foundation was to continuously strengthen the foundation of Human Dao to the extreme. The stronger the foundation of Human Dao was, the stronger the cultivator would be.","In truth, if there really was no Spiritual Power Spirit Tool, the foundation stone of the Celestial Path could also replace it. However, there was a great risk, because once a crack appeared in the foundation stone, it would need to be repaired at a great cost, and if it shattered, one would be severed from the Foundation Building Tier.","Hence, unless it was absolutely necessary, no one would use the cornerstone of the Celestial Path to smash others. At most, they would only use it as a threat.","“My Celestial Dao foundation can also become a secret weapon.” Ling Han broke into a grin, especially now that he had only formed the foundation of Human Dao. His opponents who had Heavenly Dao Foundation and Ultimate Dao Foundation would definitely want to use the foundations of Celestial Dao to suppress him.","If that was really the case... hehe, then the other party would have gone out for wool and come back shorn.","“Little Han, you’re wearing a strange smile. You’re definitely planning to screw someone over again!” the large black dog immediately shouted.."]},{"number":3662,"title":"Chapter 3662: Alchemy Apprentice Test","paragraphs":["Chapter 3662: Alchemy Apprentice Test","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Cultivate well, don’t talk so much.” Ling Han waved his hand dismissively.","Half an hour later, everyone had finished cultivating. The empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog had all improved astonishingly. They were also cultivating Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique. When Ling Han went to the Monkey Valley for the second time, he had already asked Brother Monkey if he could teach this cultivation technique to his family and friends.","Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique, supplementary cultivation technique, added with alchemical pills... In just a few days, they had already reached Twelve Meridians.","He was sure that in a few days, they would be able to reach 20 Meridians.","Ling Han had absolute confidence in their natural talent. Which of those who could become Heavenly Venerates in the Genesis World wasn’t a supreme prodigy?","Everyone set out, heading towards White Night City.","The White Night City was the closest city to here. There was a nine-storey tower of Silver Grade there, and it was a stage that Ling Han definitely had to pass.","A day and a half later, they arrived at their destination.","Ling Han found a place to stay first, and then went to find out the whereabouts of the nine-storey tower.","This was naturally not difficult to find. Ling Han arrived very quickly, and saw that this was indeed a completely silvery white nine-storey tower, slightly taller than the Black Iron Tower. Even in the pitch-black night, it was still glowing, and was incredibly eye-catching.","There were benefits to it being night, as there weren’t many people here. Ling Han didn’t need to queue up and directly walked in.","In the first level, the originally black metallic figure had become silver in colour. The moment Ling Han entered, the silver metallic figure immediately revived and launched an attack at him.","En, they were stronger than even those on the ninth level of the Black Iron Tower.","However, compared to Ling Han, this was still insufficient. With a light flick of his finger, the silver metallic figure was sent flying.","He ascended to the second level, and almost immediately left. He charged up to the third level again.","In less than a minute, he had already passed the nine-storey tower, and most of that time, he was actually spending on climbing the tower. The true time of battle added together would only take nine seconds, at most.","Pa, another book fell from the skies, landing in front of Ling Han.","He picked it up and looked at it. There were three words written on it: “Celestial Crossing Finger.”","Ling Han roughly looked over it. This was a finger technique, and it was very powerful. Of course, it was completely incomparable to the Demonic Monkey Fists and the Three Styles of the God of War.","There was no harm in having more techniques. In any case, it wasn’t very difficult to learn. Ling Han planned to practice it when he had the time.","He was leaving.","He returned to the inn. There was still enough time for him to have a good sleep.","Early in the morning, Ling Han finished cultivating and wasn’t in a hurry to leave. The Shadow Demon Town was a small place, so he couldn’t gather much information. However, this place was different—it was a large city.","Ling Han decided to stay here for a few days. In any case, there was still a lot of time, so there was no need to rush.","Regarding this decision, the empress, Hu Niu, and the others also gladly agreed. The two women brought the little loli and the seven toddlers to go shopping. The large black dog also left. He was also a restless guy, and it was fine as long as he did not get killed and cooked.","Wally was still the best, doing his best to help Ling Han deduce formation patterns.","Ling Han also left. He was going to find a place where alchemists would gather, something along the lines of the Alchemist Society.","Because there was a lapse in the cultivation of the Celestial Sea Planet, that included alchemy, and there were pitifully few pill recipes for the mortal level, and there was only one that remained for the level after ascending into the Celestial Path.","That was the Cold Resistance Pill. After ingesting it, one would be able to resist the invasion of the cold air, but it was only limited to the level of Foundation Building Tier.","With Ling Han’s natural talent in alchemy, he had naturally mastered it long ago. In fact, because he had won a bet against those extraterrestrial visitors, he didn’t lack main ingredients, but supplementary ingredients were lacking, so he didn’t start refining.","Not long after, Ling Han found the Alchemy Alliance.","This was an organization similar to the Alchemist Society. Of course, this was only a branch of the alliance, but no matter where it was, alchemists had a unique status. The Alchemist Alliance here occupied a very large territory, and the entire structure was also built in a grand and majestic manner.","Ling Han strode in. He was just about to find someone to ask how he was going to be certified as a Celestial Path alchemist, but he had not even opened his mouth, when he was directly brought to a room. There were actually a great many people inside, and they were all sitting upright.","What was going on here?","“What are you standing around for? Find a place to sit down quickly. The alchemy apprentice test is about to begin,” that person said, and even gave Ling Han a push.","Yi, a test for alchemy apprentices? Oh, he had been misunderstood, and the other party was really too enthusiastic, not even asking him first.","Ling Han faltered, and was just about to turn around and leave, but when he recalled that he was still short of three supplementary ingredients, if he could become an alchemy apprentice, would it be easier to obtain them?","Then let’s just try the test. He too wanted to test out his abilities.","Ling Han walked in and found a place to sit down.","As expected, the exam soon began. A middle-aged man appeared. He distributed a piece of jade to everyone, “The first test is about identifying medicinal ingredients through looking at the diagram. All of you stick the jade on your foreheads. You have one minute to identify each medicinal ingredient.” Ling Han picked up the jade. It was very thin, and its weight was also very light. He pressed it against his forehead as instructed. Instantly, a medicinal herb appeared out of thin air in front of him.","Yi?","Ling Han stretched out his hand to touch it. There was actually the sense of touch, but he could not pick it up.","This was obviously virtual, but it had a very strong deception effect on divine sense. That was why it could be seen, touched, but could not be picked up.","Interesting.","Ling Han sighed with emotion before writing the words “Savage Sand Demonic Grass” on the piece of white paper.","Test his basic knowledge?","Hehe, he had long since begun to study this field, all right? This was the foundation of alchemy. If one did not even know how to recognize herbs, how could he speak of alchemy? As a Grandmaster Alchemist, Ling Han knew this fact.","A minute later, the first herb disappeared, and in its place, there was a red fruit.","“Gen Origin Fruit,” Ling Han wrote another three words.","Another minute later, the red fruit turned into a tall tree.","Ling Han practically didn’t think at all. The moment he saw it, he could write. Ten minutes later, no more medicinal ingredients appeared.","“Don’t forget to write your names on the paper, then leave and wait for the results,” the examiner said.","Everyone stood up and left the room.","They were not idle either, and began to compare their answers.","“Ah, the second question is actually the Gen Origin Fruit? I wrote the Sang Origin Fruit!” a fatso wailed.","“It is indeed very confusing. The Gen Origin Fruit looks very similar to the Sang Origin Fruit, but the Gen Origin Fruit has three very hidden golden threads, but the Sang Origin Fruit does not,” a young man said.","“Aiyo, that’s right!” The fatty pounded his head and stamped his feet, appearing extremely vexed.","“As expected of Second Young Master Sun, too insightful in recognizing herbs,” someone beside him praised.","“The Eldest Young Master of the Sun Clan is a prodigy of martial arts, whereas the Second Young Master has shown his talent in alchemy, and the clan has geniuses of two different fields!”","“This time, the title of Alchemy Apprentice of the Second Young Master is definitely assured.”","Faced with everyone’s praise, that Second Young Master Sun appeared to be very pleased, but still pretended to be modest. Waving his hand, he said, “No, no, you all are flattering me! This time, they are only recruiting three apprentices. There are many talented people here, and I may not be able to pass.”","“Hehe, Sun Shaolong, you do have some self-awareness,” a green-robed man scoffed.."]},{"number":3663,"title":"Chapter 3663: Bias","paragraphs":["Chapter 3663: Bias","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Second Young Master Sun was called Sun Shaolong. He glanced at the green-robed man, and couldn’t help but frown. He asked in displeasure, “Tan Bing, I didn’t offend you, so why are you going against me?”","I don’t like the look of you; I don’t have any ulterior motives,” the green-robed man, Tan Bing, said.","All right, all right.” A woman in purple stepped out to play mediator, “We are all from the White Night City, and we will see each other frequently. Just think of it as giving face to me, Zhuo Die.”","Sun Shaolong humphed, and said, “All right. For the sake of Sister Zhuo, I will not argue with him.”","“You speak as if I fear you.” Tan Bing was similarly proud.","“The two of you, speak less.” Zhuo Die lowered her hand.","Sun Shaolong, Tan Bing, Zhuo Die. They are members of the Ten Great Clans of White Night City, and also possess astonishing natural talent in alchemy. They are only taking in three alchemy disciples this time round. Looks like we are all here just as company for their test.”","“F***, if I had known that the three of them had come, I would not have joined in on the excitement.”","Forget it. Since I’m already here, I’ll just treat it as practice.”","Everyone shook their heads. The moment Sun Shaolong and the others appeared, they instantly lost all hope.","Not long after, the examiner came out and announced the candidates that had passed this stage.","“Sun Shaolong, Yang Xuan, Liu Shuang, Tan Bing, Zhuo Die... Ling Han.” Because Ling Han was the last to enter, he was naturally the last name to be read out. “Those who have been called, follow me, and begin the second test.” The others left helplessly. They hadn’t even passed the first test, so staying would only be embarrassing.","The remaining people entered into another room. It was also very big, but because there were more than half of them missing, it appeared very spacious. “This stage is test of recognizing pharmacology. Write down the medicinal characteristics and taboos that you have seen,” the examiner said.","Everyone was still given a piece of jade, then with a command from the examiner, it was placed on their foreheads. Instantly, an image unfolded. Yi, the difficulty level had increased.","Previously, the medicinal ingredients had been fully displayed, but now, the display was a medicinal ingredient that had been processed. It was a medicinal ingredient that had been dried.","However, this naturally was not a problem for him.","Lmg Han quickly wrote down the medicinal ingredients’ name, unique traits, and careful use of the medicine. In just half a minute, he had already finished writing.","A minute later, another set of ingredients appeared.","This time, it was a dried fruit.","After the fruit was dried, it would naturally deform and shrivel, causing a great many features that were originally very obvious to disappear.","Yet Ling Han was very relaxed, and practically did not have the sligthest bit of hesitation. His pen moved skilfully.","The third piece, the fourth piece, the fifth piece. Very soon, his blank piece of paper was filled with words.","Ten minutes soon arrived, and the examiner announced the end. Everyone wrote their names on a piece of paper, then left.","When they arrived outside, everyone began to discuss the answers again, but this time, it was obviously much more difficult. There were a few questions that everyone argued back and forth, all of them thinking that their judgement was correct, arguing so much that their faces were flushed red.","Meanwhile, the three High Level alchemy apprentices who were grading the answers also began a fierce debate.","The two of you, this matter is a little difficult to deal with!” Deng Yingwei said. He pointed at the four answer scripts on the table, “Combined with the results of the two rounds, these four people are the most outstanding, especially this person called Ling Han. He has gotten 100% correct on both tests.”","However, the recruitment of only three apprentices this time has long since been decided. Furthermore, Tan Bing, Zhuo Die and Sun Shaolong are definitely going to be enrolled, so how could there be any spots left?”","Ye Wenbin also frowned deeply, “If the results of the four of them were more or less the same, then we would be able to find some excuse to dismiss this Ling Han, but the crux of the matter is that his results have left the rest behind in the dust.”","“Yes, Zhuo Die and the others all made a mistake in the first round, and in the second round, they all made two mistakes. In total, they made a total of three mistakes, which can’t compare to Ling Han at all.”","Song Tao shook his head, “Then what do we do, among Zhuo Die’s group of three, we take one of them off the list?”","“Do you dare?” Deng Yingwei countered.","I wouldn’t dare!” Song Tao sighed. He was only a High Level alchemy apprentice. In front of the ten great clans in the city, he was not even worth a feather. How could he dare to say no?","Moreover, this was something that was already previously agreed on. If he went back on his word... the consequences would be unimaginable.","Then I can only apologize to this little friend Ling Han,” Deng Yingwei said with a smile.","Ye Wenbin nodded, and said, “In any case, he has the skill, so it’s the same the next time he comes.”","“Who asked him to be so unlucky that he just happened to encounter Zhuo Die and the others this time?” Song Tao also laughed.","“Then I’ll go announce it,” Ye Wenbin said. Previously, it was he who had gone to announce the results.","“M-hm.”","Ye Wenbin walked out of the room, gathered everyone, and began to announce the results.","There are a total of four people who have passed this time, and they are Tan Bing, Zhuo Die, Sun Shaolong and Ling Han.” He paused, “The four people whose names have been called come with me for the final round of the test.” Zhuo Die and the others were all smiling. They naturally knew that their family had already spoken to Ye Wenbin and the others. As long as they could enter into the final test, they would definitely be able to pass.","Of course, if their previous results were too poor, they could not blame others for not being able to help them.","This examination was naturally still a competition of medicinal ingredients, but there were three examiners, who took out the medicinal ingredients that had been ground into powder for them to smell, and then had them announce the names of the medicinal ingredients.","Zhuo Die and the others proceeded first, and all of them successfully passed the test. Lastly, it was Ling Han.","Ye Wenbin took out a jade box, and placed his hand on the lid. Then, he asked, “Are you ready?”","Ling Han nodded, “Yes.”","Ye Wenbin smiled at Deng Yingwei and Song Tao. The results of this test was naturally all under their control. If they were wrong, they could say that they were right, and if they were right, they could also say that they were wrong.","Of course, they wouldn’t make it so obvious. Instead, they would deliberately make it easier for Tan Bing and the others to distinguish the medicinal ingredients, and if it was Ling Han, hehe.","The jade box opened, and a medicinal fragrance instantly rushed out. Ye Wenbin did not give Ling Han the chance to smell it a few more times, and immediately closed the box again.","“Speak,” Ye Wenbin said calmly.","F***, so fast?","Ling Han mocked in his heart. Previously, Zhuo Die and the others had been sniffing here and there, and Ye Wenbin had not urged them at all, but now? He had just smelt it, and the box was already closed.","This was too unfair.","Lmg Han pondered for a moment, and 13 answers that matched his thoughts instantly appeared in his mind.","The Highest Heaven Grass, Heavenrose, Earth Origin Vine... these 13 medicinal ingredients all had this kind of smell after being ground into dust.","Great, this is deliberately targeting me, right?","Previously, the medicinal ingredients that Tan Bing and the others had identified were all very simple. Though Ling Han had not smelt them, from the medicinal ingredients themselves, the smell was very unique, but for him, this smell actually corresponded to thirteen different ingredients.","‘F*ck you!’","However, would he be so easily defeated?","“Name of the medicine?” Ye Wenbin urged, “You only have ten seconds, hurry","up.”","Ling Han was unmoved, and merely pondered quietly.."]},{"number":3664,"title":"Chapter 3664: Don’t regret it!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3664: Don’t regret it!","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Though this smell roughly corresponded to the 13 medicinal ingredients, there were still some differences between these 13 smells after a closer look.","Perhaps others would not be able to distinguish it, but this was not a problem for Ling Han, the Alchemy Emperor.","Ling Han opened his mouth, and said, “This is the horn of a horned-tiger, ground into dust.”","Ye Wenbin was taken aback. F***, that’s right.","Had he guessed correctly, or... had he really managed to distinguish it?","If it was the former, then it could only be said that Ling Han’s luck was really good, but if it was the latter, this brat’s ability to recognize herbs was too terrifying.","However, whether it was the former or the latter, neither of them could allow Ling Han to pass the test.","“Wrong, this is High Firmament Grass.” Ye Wenbin shook his head.","Ling Han couldn’t help but fly into a rage. ‘It’s fine if you’re deliberately making things difficult for me, but I clearly answered correctly, yet you’re deliberately saying that I’m wrong. This is going too far.’","“You dare to trick me?” he asked balefully.","Ye Wenbin was given a fright. He felt as if this person in front of him had transformed into an emperor, his authority boundless, causing a chill to rise up from the bottom of his heart.","However, he immediately flew into a rage out of humiliation. He was a High Level alchemy disciple. If he feared a minor character that could not even be considered an alchemy disciple, what face would he have left?","“If you’re wrong, you’re wrong. Why are you spouting so much nonsense?” he said harshly.","Ling Han looked coldly at Ye Wenbin, and after a long while, he finally said, “Think carefully before you speak. Am I right or wrong?”","“Are you threatening me?” Ye Wenbin shouted angrily.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “Whatever you think.”","“Humph, a mistake is a mistake. Even if you have a powerful background, we will not bend the rules for personal gain,” Song Tao slammed a hand on the table, and shouted loudly.","Ling Han looked at Ye Wenbin, Song Tao and Deng Yingwei, and asked, “You all think so?”","“What is the meaning of this? Are you going to threaten the three of us together?” Song Tao shouted loudly.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face, “Don’t regret it.”","“Ling Han, are you a sore loser?” Tan Bing interrupted.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded, turned and left, “Since none of you will regret it, just wait and see.”","Ye Wenbin and the others all looked coldly at Ling Han. They naturally would not be concerned about the threat of a minor character.","At first, Ling Han had not planned to take the alchemy disciple test. He was aiming to be certified as an alchemist, so he naturally would not take the title of an alchemy disciple to heart. However, being bullied like this, he could not swallow this anger.","So I am an easy target to bully?","Ling Han walked out of his room and arrived at the main hall. He asked others about the details of the alchemist test.","The test for alchemists was simple. They only needed to concoct alchemical pills on the spot.","However, Celestial pills needed Celestial medicines. If they failed, the price would be huge. If one did not have full confidence, who would come here to burn money?","Thus, the majority would start from Alchemy Apprentice.","—After becoming an Alchemy Apprentice, there would be a chance every year to obtain the ingredients for free, and take the alchemist test.","Looks like this sum of money could not be saved.","Ling Han walked around and bought three sets of ingredients. These were the three supplementary ingredients for concocting the Cold Resistance Pill, and they were what he lacked.","Thankfully, the Cold Resistance Pill was Foundation Building Tier-level in the first place. The main ingredients had to be Celestial medicine, but supplementary ingredients didn’t need to be so precious. Mortal-level was adequate.","Thus, Ling Han used jade seeds to purchase the three supplementary ingredients. Anyways, he wouldn’t have Dao Stones to pay for them.","He found an alchemy apprentice, and requested to take the alchemist test.","It wasn’t long before three alchemists arrived as witnesses.","“What pill will you concoct?” an alchemist asked.","“Cold Resistance Pill.”","“En, a One Star Celestial pill, which conforms to the rules.” The second alchemist nodded, “Little Zhang, record it down.”","“Understood,” an alchemy apprentice hurriedly replied, writing furiously.","“You, begin,” the first alchemist, Alchemist Ma, said to Ling Han.","There were many alchemy chambers in the Alchemy Alliance, and there were various kinds of formations set up to correspond to alchemical pills of different attributes.","Ling Han chose an alchemy chamber, and began concocting.","He didn’t need the help of alchemy apprentices. He would grind the ingredients into dust on the spot, and then toss the medicinal ingredients into the formation one after another. The amount was controlled very precisely.","Seeing Ling Han’s proficient movements, the three alchemists all smiled.","This was not a person who had come to waste their time. Furthermore, there was something unique about Ling Han’s technique, which caused them to have an idea that they could learn from, and benefit greatly from it.","The Celestial level alchemical pill took a longer time to concoct, and in such a long period of time, one would have to concentrate, and there could not be the slightest bit of break. Otherwise, no matter which step they took wrongly, all their previous efforts would be wasted.","This required the support of a powerful Spiritual Power. Thus, it was absolutely impossible for mortals to concoct Celestial pills. Their Spiritual Power was not enough at all.","The concoction time of this Cold Resistance Pill was about three hours. At first, no one paid attention, but after an hour, when they found out that Ling Han was still concocting, it instantly attracted a considerable number of people to go and watch.","And after two hours, more and more people came here. The majority were alchemy apprentices. They did not need to observe the concoction of high grade alchemical pills. Instead, it was the lowest grade Celestial pill concoction that was most beneficial to them.","“Song Tao, Deng Yingwei, what are you guys still doing here? There’s someone here to take the alchemist test, and he’s about to succeed.”","Song Tao and the others were talking to Tan Bing and the others. These newly advanced alchemy disciples were naturally worth celebrating, but a person suddenly stuck his head in and said to them.","“Yi, then we should go and take a look.” Song Tao hurriedly nodded.","“Quick, quick, quick.” Ye Wenbin hurriedly followed him out. “It takes a few years for an alchemy apprentice to be promoted to alchemist. Taking this step is really difficult. Observing an alchemy apprentice successfully advance to become an alchemist is not only very enlightening for us, but is also a great encouragement.”","“May I know which High Level Apprentice it is?” Deng Yingwei also said, “Could it be Gu Ming? Or Zhong Luo?”","“Neither. A person that I have never seen before, and is not an alchemy disciple either, has directly begun the alchemist examination,” the alchemy disciple that had come to call others said.","“It’s that powerful?”","They all ran out to take a look, and even Tan Bing and the others were no exception.","When they arrived outside the alchemy chamber, they could see that there was already a large crowd of people here. They could not squeeze to the front to look at the observation window at all.","—Of course, one could not be disturbed when concocting alchemical pills. Thus, aside from Ling Han, there were only three alchemists who were bearing witness and one alchemist apprentice who was keeping records. The others could only watch from the outside.","“I can’t see anything,” Deng Yingwei complained.","“That’s right. There’s people all around.” Song Tao nodded as well.","They wanted to squeeze forward, but the people in front of them could not possibly give way, so they could only call out helplessly. They wanted to leave, but they were unwilling to do so, and very much wanted to see this person who was presently undergoing the test.","If they knew that the person inside was Ling Han, they would probably want to turn around and run as far as they could.","Three hours later, Ling Han was done.","He stretched out a hand to grab it, and three alchemical pills that were spinning around appeared in his hand. They were all as red as fire.","“Please appraise.” Ling Han spread out his hands.","The three alchemists who were bearing witness all stepped forward to appraise.","“The three completed pills are all High Grade.”","“Three completed pills, two High Grade ones, and one is close to High Grade.”","“The three completed pills are all High Grade.”","The three alchemists called out respectively, while the alchemy apprentice wrote down the evaluation of the three alchemists.","“With our unanimous conclusion, passed!”"]},{"number":3665,"title":"Chapter 3665: Reversal","paragraphs":["Chapter 3665: Reversal","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","As long as two alchemists thought that Ling Han had passed the test, then Ling Han would be able to become a newly promoted alchemist, what more when the three alchemists agreed unanimously.","Of course, these three alchemists were witnesses. If it was discovered that Ling Han wasn’t equipped with the skill of an alchemist, then the three of them would also be held responsible.","Thus, no one dared to cheat when it came to the matter of alchemists.","“Congratulations!” The three alchemists congratulated Ling Han. “Let’s discuss","more often in the future.”","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","The three alchemists were all very polite towards Ling Han. This man was really young, and his future prospects were boundless.","“Congratulations!”","“Congratulations, Alchemist Ling!”","The alchemy disciples outside also spoke one after another. An alchemy disciple to an alchemist was like a Mystery Realm Tier to a Foundation Building Tier. The gap was like the gap between heaven and earth, so they had no choice but to treat him with respect. Even those old alchemy disciples whose hair had already turned white were no exception, and they bowed.","Meanwhile, Ling Han said to an alchemist, “I’ve been learning from a blind alchemist since childhood, so I actually don’t know anything about alchemy at all. I wonder if Brother can explain it to me?”","“No problem.” That person was also looking for a chance to befriend Ling Han, so he naturally agreed immediately, “Come, let’s go somewhere else to talk.”","Ling Han nodded. The two of them walked forwards, but the crowds did not disperse. The alchemy disciples that had previously been standing behind took advantage of this opportunity to squeeze forwards, wanting to catch a glimpse of Ling Han’s face, and gain some luck.","Yi?","Coincidentally, Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. He saw six faces.","Deng Yingwei, Ye Wenbin, Tan Bing and the others, and when those six people saw that the person that had been surrounded was actually Ling Han, they couldn’t help but gape widely, their expressions filled with disbelief.","This newly promoted alchemist was actually Ling Han?","It was actually Ling Han!","How could that be? Weren’t you here to apply for alchemy apprenticeship? How did you suddenly become an alchemist?","Was there something wrong with you?","He clearly possessed the strength of an alchemist, yet he actually went to take the alchemy disciple test. This was practically baffling.","However, they had teamed up to scam an alchemist, so how could they withstand Ling Han’s revenge?","The six of them exchanged looks, and all stepped back, wanting to leave. However, the crowd was excited now, and all of them were trying their best to push forwards. How could they retreat in this moment?","”Yo, so it’s you guys,” Ling Han greeted with a smile.","“Brother Ling, you guys know each other?” the alchemist beside him asked in surprise.","Ling Han nodded, “Just now, I went to take the test for alchemy disciple, and in the end, I was booted out by these three people. The reason is that there are only three quotas, and they have to ensure that those three people can take the","place.”","He had revealed everything!","When Tan Bing and the others heard this, they naturally did not run.","Otherwise, wouldn’t that be a solid proof of their crime?","“Yi?” “Ah?” “Ya?”","Everyone exclaimed in shock, all of them feeling extreme disbelief.","Who could help me figure out why Ling Han would take the alchemy apprentice test on the same day, and then the alchemist test? They were on two completely different levels, all right?","What kind of person was this!","Ling Han smiled, “At first, I had wanted to directly verify my status as an alchemist, but in the end, I had not even opened my mouth, when someone brought me to a room, and said that I would be taking the alchemy disciple test. I thought about it, and after becoming an alchemy disciple, I would be able to receive ingredients for free to concoct alchemical pills, so it doesn’t matter. In any case, I don’t need to spend too much time.”","“In the end, these three people were so awe-inspiring and domineering, forcibly dismissing me from the test.”","After saying this, he looked at Deng Yingwei and the others, causing them to break out in a cold sweat.","When everyone heard Ling Han’s explanation, they all gave an “oh”. Though Ling Han’s move was a little roundabout, it was indeed reasonable when they thought about it. A person that had not yet advanced to become an alchemist, what savings could he possibly have?","In an instant, everyone’s eyes turned to look at Tan Bing and the others.","Ling Han could become an alchemist, so how could it be that he couldn’t pass the alchemy apprentice test?","‘You people must have teamed up to cheat!","“N-no!” Ye Wenbin shook his head shakily, yet could not come up with a reasonable explanation.","The three alchemists who had been responsible for witnessing earlier had not left. One of the thick-browed alchemists immediately shouted loudly, “Song Tao, how dare you, to actually dare screw over an alchemist!”","He only recognized Song Tao. Previously, he had helped him for a period of time, helping him concoct alchemical pills. Thus, he was naturally shouting at","Song Tao.","Song Tao’s knees immediately buckled, and he fell to his knees with a thud. His eyes darted around as he tried to come up with a plan.","If Ling Han wasn’t an alchemist, and only invited three alchemists to plead his innocence, he wouldn’t be afraid. In any case, the results of the test were completely up to them to decide. As long as the three of them gritted their teeth and persisted, this convicted case could never be repealed.","But it was different now. Ling Han had become an alchemist, so the weight was completely different.","Would an alchemist be inferior to an apprentice in recognizing herbs?","-Perhaps there was such a possibility, but no alchemist would admit it. Then wouldn’t it be a complete mess?","Thus, once a disagreement arose, it would definitely be the fault of the alchemy disciple.","“Go and get Alchemist Ling’s answers for the first two rounds,” the bearded alchemist spoke up.","“Yes.”","Immediately, an alchemy apprentice ran out, and retrieved the answer sheet that Ling Han had previously given.","“Full marks for both the first and second round!”","“As expected of an alchemist.”","“En, when I was taking the test for apprentices, I had gotten two questions wrong altogether in the first two rounds.”","■’I’m slightly inferior to you, so I answered three wrong questions.” Everyone discussed spiritedly. Practically everyone had missed one or two questions, and it was rare that anyone had gotten all the answers right. The bearded alchemist smiled coldly, and looked towards Ye Wenbin and the others, “What else do you guys have to say?”","What else could he say?","Though this could not be considered evidence for the third round, it also showed Ling Han’s ability in recognizing herbs, and added with the fact that he had already become an alchemist, it was enough to prove that Ling Han’s ability in recognizing herbs had surpassed the standards of an alchemy apprentice.","All of a sudden, everyone’s eyes were filled with disdain as they looked at Ye Wenbin and the others. Some were even rejoicing in their misfortune.","The three of them actually dared to trick an alchemist-they were dead for sure!","‘Til report this to the Grandmasters and convict you!” the thick-browed alchemist said calmly. As for Tan Bing and the others, he didn’t even glance at them. Although they hadn’t cheated, Ling Han had exposed such a huge conspiracy, so they naturally would be punished accordingly.","“No! No!” Ye Wenbin and the others all knelt down.","“Grandmaster Ling, we were wrong. Please spare us!” Song Tao kowtowed to Ling Han.","Deng Yingwei and Ye Wenbin were also enlightened, and hurriedly kowtowed to Ling Han as well. The person who had tied the knot still had to be the one to undo the knot.","Ling Han was unmoved, and merely said calmly, “I have warned you before, don’t regret it in future, and now you are begging for mercy? It is too late!”","With a wave of his hand, he strode off.","“Humph, you’ve brought this upon yourself!” The thick-browed alchemist humphed coldly. As an alchemist himself, he was naturally on Ling Han’s side. A mere alchemy disciple actually dared to offend his superior; they truly deserved to die.","Ling Han didn’t need to worry about the subsequent matters. Ye Wenbin, Song Tao, and Deng Yingwei were all stripped of their status as alchemy disciples, and would never be recruited again. Meanwhile, Tan Bing, Zhuo Die, and Sun Shaolong were also stripped of their status as alchemy disciples because they had participated in the cheating. Moreover, they were banned from taking the alchemy disciple test for another three years.","This was greatly satisfying.."]},{"number":3666,"title":"Chapter 3666: You still dare to come?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3666: You still dare to come?","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Alchemists above Celestial Path and above were categorized in this manner – the three major tiers of Heaven, Earth and Human, and Earth Tier and Human Tier alchemists were further categorized into high, medium and low grade alchemists, but Heaven Tier alchemists were Heaven Tier alchemists, with no categorization of grade.","Thus, Ling Han was now a low grade Human Tier alchemist.","After being newly promoted to become an alchemist, Ling Han could choose a pill recipe of the corresponding level from the Alchemy Alliance’s pill recipe library. If he wanted to obtain more pill recipes, he would have to contribute to the Alchemy Alliance,","Ling Han’s purpose for certifying as an alchemist was to obtain the recipe for the pill. He resolutely chose the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill.","If he ingested one, it would be equivalent to several years of hard cultivation. It was what Ling Han needed now.","He looked at the pill recipe. The main ingredient was Foxwood, which was a One Star Celestial medicine. It had to be at least fifty years old, and the more mature it was, the better the effects of the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill would be.","Additionally, he also needed 34 supplementary ingredients, all of which were Mystery Realm Tier-level, so it was not difficult to obtain.","Ling Han soon familiarized himself with the pill recipe. However, Foxwood was not common, and he could not buy it even if he had the money, so he could only set it aside for now.","He sold the three Cold Resistance Pills to the Alchemy Alliance in exchange for three Dao Stones. At the same time, he also had some contribution points. Once he had accumulated enough, he would be able to trade for new pill recipes in the Alchemy Alliance.","After he was done with these matters, it was already evening. Ling Han hurriedly returned to the inn.","On the way, he also bought a geographical record. He wanted to study the Black Moon Planet in detail.","The empress and the others had already returned. They first had dinner then rested.","Ling Han flipped through his geographical record, and gained a basic understanding of the Black Moon Planet.","“In the Holy Land of Crimson Fire, there is a valley of flames. The flames burn brightly, and even Saints would not dare to enter.”","“It’s said that it was originally an ordinary valley, but at some unknown time a great fire was poured from the sky. From then onwards, it burned fiercely and has never stopped.”","“Even Saints have to be wary of it. The possibility of it being the Heavenly Dao Flames is extremely high.”","There are still more than three months until the Metal Element Fruit Gathering, so I’ll first pass through the nine-storey tower and obtain a spot. Then, I’ll make a trip to the Flame Valley and forge the Origin Gold.” “I’m an elite of the Foundation Building Tier, so isn’t it too demeaning of me not to know how to fly on a tool?”","Ling Han finally came to a decision. He would first forge the Origin Gold, and then head to the Holy Land of Metal Element.","The next morning, everyone woke up to cultivate.","Ling Han didn’t join the others. He was a Foundation Building Tier. Once he cultivated, the power of heaven and earth in the surroundings would all be absorbed by him. To say nothing of mortals, even other Foundation Building Tiers would cry from being robbed by him.","Thus, he ran to a farther location to cultivate.","Half an hour later, Ling Han returned to the inn.","Yi?","He was taken aback, because there were actually a great many strangers outside the inn. All of them had expressions of arrogance, but none of them were Celestial Path-level.","Ling Han walked over, but was stopped by those people, “Get lost, go to another place!”","What was going on?","Ling Han casually waved his hand. Pa! Those people instantly collapsed to the ground. How could they possibly stop him?","He strode in, killing intent rising up in his heart. If these people were targeting the empress and the others, he would definitely start a massacre.","“... And your face is covered. What is it? Shameful?” A woman’s voice rang out.","Ling Han immediately recognized that it was Zhuo Die.","She had come to seek revenge.","Ling Han nodded internally. Zhuo Die’s status as an alchemy disciple had been Stripped, so she must be internally displeased. However, Ling Han had not foreseen that his status as an alchemist would not be able to scare her.","Logically speaking, alchemists should have outstanding status, right?","Moreover, this matter had been started by Zhuo Die and the others in the first place, and Ling Han was also a victim.","Ling Han walked into the main hall, and saw that there were a great many people who looked to be servants here. AU of them had fierce expressions, and were dressed in the same tight fitting suit of grey. Only three people were an exception.","Tan Bing, Zhuo Die, Sun Shaolong.","As it turned out, it was not just Zhuo Die. The other two had also come.","They surrounded the empress, Hu Niu, and the babies. However, the empress and the others didn’t take these people seriously at all. They were eating breakfast, and all of them had quite a good appetite. They didn’t seem to be affected at all.","“Looks like the lesson you guys have learnt is still not enough!” Ling Han spoke up, his voice cold.","These people actually dared to extend their claws towards the people by his side; they truly deserved to die!","“Ha, I thought you had fled in fright, and actually dared to come back?” Tan Bing humphed, “It is all because of you, that we have to waste three years’ time! Do you think that just because you are an alchemist, we would not dare to touch you?”","“You’re nothing but a low level Human Grade alchemist. Even if we beat you up would the Alchemy Alliance dare to come to our place and cause trouble?” Sun ’ Shaolong continued.","They belonged to the ten great clans in the city, and they all had a grand elder of the Cauldron Forging Tier standing guard. This was the basis for their arrogance.","“What do you guys want?” Ling Han asked calmly.","“I’ll beat you up first, then make you kneel in front of us to repent!” Tan Bing said.??? 6","“Don’t worry, we will definitely exert our full effort, and make it so that you will never forget it!” Sun Shaolong also said.","Yet Zhuo Die’s expression was dark, as she said, “And castrate him! Doesn’t this guy have two women? Make it so he can only look at them in future, and cannot touch them!”","Hiss, this woman was so poisonous!","“That’s right!” Tan Bing and Sun Shaolong were stunned for a moment, then both nodded.","Ling Han asked them what they wanted to do, and that was an eye for an eye.","Whatever you guys want to do to me, I will return it to you.","“You’re the one who’s planted the seeds, so you’re the one who’s going to swallow the fruits!” he said calmly. Xiu! He charged forward, unleashing the Imminent Skyline and instantly appearing before Sun Shaolong.","After advancing into Celestial Path, Ling Han was already able to completely grasp this movement technique. It was no longer a matter of crossing 50km with a single stride, but rather a matter of extreme speed.","Sun Shaolong felt his vision blur, and there was already another person in front of him.","As a cultivator, his reaction speed was not slow. Immediately, with a shake of his hands, he delivered a palm strike towards Ling Han.","However, he was nowhere near as quick as Ling Han.","Pa, Ling Han took out the broken piece of the tombstone, and smashed it onto the top of the other’s head.","Sun Shaolong instantly collapsed to the ground. Fortunately, he was a","Foundation Building Tier cultivator. Otherwise, this smack would have been enough to obliterate his head.","However, he wouldn’t be much better off either. His forehead was bulging, and there was a large bump on his forehead. In the future, he would also be plagued by misfortune, and he would have to suffer.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and looked towards Tan Bing.","Tan Bing couldn’t help but take a step back, a chill in his heart. However he had just taken a step back, when he discovered that Ling Han was already standing where he had been. The stone slab in his hand was raised, and struck down heavily on him.","“Ah!” He released a short scream, and instantly, followed in Sun Shaolong’s","footsteps, he too collapsed onto the ground.","There was only one left.","Zhuo Die paled in shock, and hurriedly screamed, “What are you all standing around for? Go, go!”","Those servants hurriedly drew their weapons and rushed over, but how easy was it for Ling Han to deal with them?","Weng, he released the barrage of murderous aura. Pa, pa, pa, pa! Instantly, these people fell all over the ground, and all of them rolled thier eyes, as if’they had lost consciousness from a massive shock.."]},{"number":3667,"title":"Chapter 3667: A world where the strong prey on the weak","paragraphs":["Chapter 3667: A world where the strong prey on the weak","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhuo Die couldn’t help but take a few steps back.","A boundless fear rose up in her. Just how terrifying was this person in front of her?","He was able to knock over a Foundation Building cultivator with a single strike. It was unknown what kind of technique he had used, but all the servants of mortal level fell to the ground, especially the latter. This was too terrifying. What Foundation Building cultivator could be so strong?","At first, she had thought that with after joining forces with the other two, wouldn’t defeating an alchemist be as easy as waving a hand?","Who didn’t know that alchemists were only slightly more powerful in terms of Spiritual Power? However, alchemists were much weaker in terms of battle prowess.","But now?","That was not the case at all. Not only was Ling Han’s battle prowess not weak, it was shockingly strong.","What kind of monster had she encountered?","Ling Han smiled and said, “A woman’s heart is the most poisonous. Sure enough, it’s true.”","“What do you want?” Zhuo Die forced herself to calm down, and shouted lowly at Ling Han.","“Don’t worry. With how ugly you are, no one would have any designs on you,” Ling Han said calmly. Then, he turned around and said to the empress and the others, “Men can be castrated, but how can women be castrated?”","The empress was proud, and merely made a gesture of decapitation.","Meanwhile, Hu Niu bit her finger as she started to think. Meanwhile, the large black dog jumped over and continued to wave its paws, barking loudly.","No one could understand the barking of a dog, but Ling Han understood what it meant.","“You said, disfigure her?”","The large black dog nodded repeatedly.","“But she’s already so ugly, so disfigurement doesn’t mean much.” Ling Han was troubled.","Zhuo Die was furious. What part of her was ugly?","Though she could not be considered an exquisite beauty, she could still be considered a beauty, and had absolutely nothing to do with the word ‘ugly’.","However, this was not the main point. She was really afraid that Ling Han would disfigure her, and she was quietly retreating. As long as she could escape from here, she would immediately ask for help from the ancestor of her clan. To actually dare trifle with the Zhuo Clan, you were seeking your own death.","“You can’t escape!” Ling Han struck out with the stone slab. Pa, Zhuo Die instantly fell to the ground.","Towards those who wanted to harm him, there was naturally no need for him to be reserved. Ling Han castrated both Tan Bing and Sun Shaolong.","The large black dog jumped over, and ravaged Zhuo Die’s face. Then, it barked at Ling Han, indicating that it was done.","Ling Han looked at Zhuo Die’s disheveled face, and shook his head. This would definitely leave behind irrecoverable wounds.","So be it. She would remember this lesson forever.","“Let’s go.”","They exited the inn and left the White Night City, heading towards the Flowing Sand City.","Compared to the White Night City, the Flowing Sand City was a large city. There were elites of Core Formation Tier, and there was also a golden nine-storey tower here.","As long as he could pass through the golden nine-storey tower, he would be able to obtain a ticket to the Metal Element Fruit Gathering... a second grade ticket.","Four days later, they arrived at the Flowing Sand City.","On the way, the empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog had all reached 20 Meridians, and had also cleared all their meridians. Next, it was time to break through to the Blood Transformation Tier.","Ling Han had enough Treasured Fruits of Life. After finding an inn in the Flowing Sand City, the two people and one dog began to break through. Ling Han stood guard for them.","Half a day later, they advanced into the Blood Transformation Tier one after another.","Though this could not be considered an elite, it was stronger than any ordinary person. Furthermore, their lifespan had also increased greatly.","With Ling Han protecting them, the empress and the others’ path was naturally much easier than Ling Han’s. They had a cultivation technique prepared for them, and there was no need to worry about the Treasured Fruit of Life. They only had to focus on cultivating.","Only then did Ling Han go to the nine-storey tower. After obtaining this qualification, he would go to the Flame Valley and first forge the Origin Gold into the model of a Monarch Tool. Otherwise, why would he keep a precious piece of Origin Gold in storage?","He had come alone. In any case, it was just a trip, so there was no need for him to invite the empress and the others.","The golden nine-storey tower was really forged from gold. From the outside, it was a blindingly bright gold in colour.","Because it was daytime, there were some people here.","However, there were not many people that were qualified to challenge the golden nine-storey tower. The majority were only here to join in on the excitement.","Right now, it was clear that someone was attempting to pass this trial. The seventh level was lit up.","However, Ling Han had just arrived, when he saw the seventh level darken, while the eighth level lit up.","“It’s the eighth level!”","“There are only two stages left.”","“As expected of Han Qian. He’s going to soar into the sky this time.”","“Being able to pass through the golden nine-storey tower would be comparable to a one-star genius.”","“He can be taken as a disciple by the Holy Land.”","Everyone felt rueful. Most of the people here had passed through the Silver Tower, but had failed at the Golden Tower. After tempering their battle prowess for several years, they were still unable to pass.","In comparison, Han Qian had just advanced into Celestial Path not too long ago, yet already had hopes of clearing the golden nine-storey tower. This was really something to be envious of.","In a short while, the eighth level of the tower darkened, and the ninth level lit up.","Yi, that was Han Qian?","When Ling Han went to the nine-storey tower of Black Iron to train, he encountered Han Qian, and was almost cut off from the queue by him.","Now that Han Qian had entered into the golden nine-storey tower, it meant that this guy had already passed through the two nine-storey towers of Black Iron and Silver.","Now that Ling Han couldn’t enter, he could only wait.","“The ninth level is still lit.”","“They’re still fighting fiercely.”","“It’s already been fifteen minutes.”","“He’s truly powerful. Being able to battle for so long is already enough to prove his strength.”","“Yi, it’s dark!”","“Passed, or... failed?”","“Let’s just wait and see.”","In a short while, the golden tower opened, and a person walked out.","Han Qian.","His face was bright, and he looked very pleased with himself.","Obviously, he must have successfully passed through the nine-storey tower. Otherwise, if he was still so happy, he must be out of his mind.","Those around them all offered their congratulations, though it was unknown how many of them were sincere.","Han Qian was smug. As he walked, he nodded at the people around him. After taking a few steps, he suddenly stopped, and stared at a person in front of him. It was actually Ling Han!","He naturally remembered Ling Han. At that time, he had still wanted to show off his might to Ling Han after passing through the Black Iron Tower. Who would have thought that after he came out, there was no sign of Ling Han at all?","He must have been afraid.","He was a little proud, but also a little displeased. Ling Han actually dared to ignore him; this was a show of contempt towards him.","He had never thought that he would actually meet Ling Han here again.","“What a coincidence!” he said with a smile.","Ling Han ignored him completely. What time did he have to waste with this kind of trash? He strode forwards, heading towards the golden tower.","“Impudence! I’m talking to you!” Han Qian roared in rage.","“Oh no, this brat actually dared to offend Han Qian!”","“He’s a prodigy of the Zifang Sect, and his future achievements are limitless.”","“Brat, hurry up and beg Young Master Han for mercy. Perhaps he can spare you.”","Everyone was also discussing spiritedly, and some were making suggestions to Ling Han. No one was optimistic about him. After all, Han Qian had already proven his strength and talent, and there was a powerful Zifang Sect behind him.","Hearing everyone’s discussions, Han Qian’s anger subsided instead. He looked proudly at Ling Han, and said, “Kneel down and beg for your life, and I can spare your life!”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh. “I think that I didn’t offend you, yet you want to kill me. What kind of logic is that?”","“Because I am stronger than you, because this is a world where the strong prey on the weak!” Han Qian humphed, and declared loudly.."]},{"number":3668,"title":"Chapter 3668: Accidentally killed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3668: Accidentally killed","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Just because you’re powerful, you can do as you please?”","-Of course!” Han Qian smirked coldly, “So, if you want to blame someone, blame your own bad luck for not becoming an elite!","“I understand.” Ling Han nodded.","“Then why aren’t you kneeling!” Han Qian was getting a little impatient.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “Kneel down and beg me. If I’m in a good mood, perhaps I can spare your life.”","-Ha? Hahahaha!” Han Qian faltered for a moment, then laughed loudly.","What a joke; someone actually dared to make him kneel down and beg for his life?","Do you think you are the Dao Child of a great sect?","“Ignorance!” Han Qian strode towards Ling Han, “Since you are so stubborn, I","will send you on your way!”","“He’s done for!”","“Sigh, why did he have to oppose Han Qian head-on? He is the most outstanding disciple of the younger generation of the Zifang Sect. Being able to pass through the golden tower is enough to prove that he is a one-star genius, or has battle prowess that could match a one-star genius.","-He asked for it. He had already been given a chance, but he didn’t seize it.”","-Does this brat think he’s still learning skills in his own sect? That fellow disciples would still have mercy on account that they are from the same sect.”","“Serves him right!”","The people around them all shook their heads. Not one of them sympathized with Ling Han.","-This world was too realistic. If you did not have the ability, you would have to bow your head. Otherwise, don’t complain about encountering obstacles everywhere.","Han Qian approached Ling Han, but what surprised him was that Ling Han actually did not flee. He was just standing where he was and waiting for him.","Oh, this brat knew that there was no way to dodge, so he simply knelt down and accepted his fate.","“At least you have some self-awareness!” he said, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled, and with a wave of his hand, delivered a slap back at Han","Qian.","Han Qian was almost about to explode in fury. ‘You actually want to slap me? By the looks of it, you’re not resigned to your fate at all. Instead, you’re determined to fight me to the death.","But an instant later, he paled in shock.","Ling Han’s palm strike was too fast, and it just happened to pass through his defenses, leaving him with nowhere to dodge or block.","Pa he had not even finished this thought, when he had already sustained a heavy slap. A massive force surged out, and he instantly collapsed onto the ground. He felt a weng, weng, weng sound ring out in his ears, and he had almost passed out.","There was dead silence.","What was going on here? Why was it that Han Qian couldn’t even withstand a single slap from Ling Han, and directly collapsed onto the ground?","What kind of prodigy are you?","Han Qian forced himself to get back to his feet. He shook his head, trying his best to clear his mind.","His face was flushed red. No matter what the reason was, he had been knocked over with a single slap. He did not have the slightest excuse.","A cold light flashed, and a long sword appeared in his hand, covered densely with veined patterns.","“Die!” he roared, brandishing his sword in a slash.","This was a Spirit Tool. As the sword slashed out, the blade of the sword glowed, and a gorgeous Sword Qi was slashed out. Upon a closer look, thrs Sword Qi was actually formed from seals, which slashed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han threw a punch at the Sword Qi.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","What was astonishing was that the moment this Sword Qi collided, the masses of seals actually exploded, forming a terrifying shockwave.","Interesting.","Ling Han smiled faintly. No wonder Han Qian was so arrogant. He did indeed have some abilities, and was not just arrogant. However, this kind of strength was completely insufficient in front of him. The gap was too wide.","With a thought, the Starlight Screen appeared, and the shockwaves that assaulted him instantly disappeared completely.","“Take a finger from me as well!” Ling Han used the Celestial Crossing Finger.","Xiu, a burst of energy shot out, rapidly shooting towards Han Qian.","Han Gan parried the attack, easily blocking it.","“I was only careless just now!” He recovered his confidence, and struck repeatedly with his sword. Multiple seals turned into Sword Qi and shot out, forming a great explosion.","Could I do the same?","Ling Han thought internally. The reason why he had not defeated Han Qian with a single punch was because he had the intention to test it out.","He continued to point his finger, and xiu, xiu, xiu, qi swept out unhindered. After more than a hundred attacks, another burst of energy shot out, but there was the light of seals flickering.","Success!","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. When he extended a finger again, several more seals appeared in the air, which shot towards Han Qian.","Peng! Han Qian tried to block the attack, yet he detonated the seal, causing a huge explosion.","Han Qian, on the other hand, did not think that Ling Han was secretly learning from him This kind of offensive method with additional seals was very common, and belonged to the category of “fundamental”. It was absolutely impossible for him to imagine that Ling Han was capable of “contending” with him, yet did not even know the basics.","How could he know that Ling Han was simply a lone cultivator? After advancing into Celestial Path, there was no one to guide him on how he shoul cultivate. He was completely relying on his own exploration.","“Within ten moves, I will send you to the Underworld!” His confidence was increasing.","Ling Han smiled, and shot out another finger. It was still the Celestial Crossing Finger, but this time, the power of the finger was completely formed from seals.","This was terrifying. Han Qian brandished his sword to disperse the attack, yet it caused a great explosion, which instantly sent him flying.","Ling Han nodded. To be frank, these seals were the cultivator’s comprehension of the power of heaven and earth. However, they were manifested directly through seals, and at the same time, they were more condensed, forming an explosion.","In this way, the attack power was naturally even stronger. After a series of successes, Ling Han threw another punch. The seals condensed into a golden fist that smashed towards Han Qian.","This wasn’t as simple as seals. It also contained theEnergy of Metal.","With how powerful Ling Han was, he was completely capable of crushing Han Qian. Han Qian could not withstand this blow, and his defenses were forcefully shattered by the force of the punch. At this moment, the seals exploded. Peng, peng, peng, endless energy exploded on Han Qian’s body, and blood and flesh flew everywhere.","When the power of the punch surged out, a terrifying scene appeared. A hole had shockingly appeared in Han Qian’s chest. It was as big as a foot, penetrating from front to back.","Even Ling Han was given a fright. He could indeed kill Han Qian with a single punch but when he had shot out his fist just now, he had not intended to kill the latter. He only wanted to test out the effects of the combination of seals and high-level energy.","Unexpectedly, the destructive power of this blow had exceeded his expectations, and directly blasted a hole into Han Qian’s body.","A Celestial Path elite’s aura was very enduring. Even if all his internal organs were gone, Han Qian did not die on the spot. He lowered his head for a look, his face filled with disbelief. He was so powerful, so how could he possibly not be able to withstand even a single move from Ling Han?","He was so outstanding, and had a bright future ahead of him. How could he die here?","He looked at Ling Han, regret flashing through his eyes. If he had known that this person was so powerful, he should not have trifled with him.","What enmity did they have? What enmity did they have against each other?","Unfortunately, it was too late.","Peng!","Han Qian collapsed to the ground. If he were a True Self Tier cultivator, he wouldn’t have died even after sustaining such severe wounds. Worse come to worst, he could simply switch to another body and start all over again. Now, however, his only fate was to be engulfed by death.","He was dead.","There was complete silence, and no one could speak.","Han Qian was dead.","The prodigy of the Zifang Sect had died.","How was Ling Han so powerful? He was unfathomably powerful! He had killed Han Qian with a simple and ordinary punch!","Quite a number of people were shaking their heads internally. Who asked Han Qian to be so arrogant? He had not planned to pay any attention to him at all, but he was determined to approach himself. And now, great, he had lost his own life.","He deserved it.."]},{"number":3669,"title":"Chapter 3669: Flaming Canyon","paragraphs":["Chapter 3669: Flaming Canyon","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han shrugged. He had no plans to kill Han Qian, or rather, he had no plans to kill Han Qian so quickly, but who asked Han Qian to be too weak?","Forget it, there was no need to take it to heart.","He strode forwards, and walked into the golden tower.","In less than a minute, he had cleared the nine-storey tower. Pa, a pill bottle descended from above his head.","He picked it up and looked at it. There was a label on the bottle, and there were three words written on it: Tranquil Heart Pill.","Tranquil Heart Pill?","Ling Han immediately began a mental search, and soon found the information.","The Tranquil Heart Pill could allow one to clear one’s mind and see Dao, increasing one’s ability to appreciate things. Moreover, it could suppress the internal demons to a certain extent.","This was a One Star Celestial medicine. Unfortunately, it did not have much effect on him.","The Six Characters Bright King Curse was the trump card that could annihilate all internal demons.","Yi, if he could rob this golden tower, he should be able to make some money, right?","Ling Han suddenly had a strange thought. However, the golden tower was just standing there like this. If he wanted to publicly destroy it, it wouldn’t be long before someone from the Holy Land of Metal Element would run over and apprehend him.","Moreover, he couldn’t even damage the golden figures here, so wouldn’t it be even more difficult to destroy the golden tower?","Forget it, forget it. Now, he had best go and forge the Origin Gold into a tool.","Ling Han left the golden tower and met up with the others. They then set off together, heading toward the Flame Canyon.","Because the journey was relatively long, they naturally had to borrow Tang Yun’er’s shuttle. In this way, they only spent half a day’s time to enter into the territory of the Holy Land of Flames.","The shuttle landed, and it was naturally chaotic again.","Looking at the map, this place was already not far from the Flame Canyon.","Ling Han did not have everyone follow him. If everyone entered into the Flame Canyon, then the consumption of Natural Dao Water would be much, much too great. Where would he find the time to refine the Origin Gold?","Hence, Ling Han found a secluded place, and had everyone stay here first. With the protection of the seven babies, at least they would not have to fear Heavenly Dao Foundation elites.","Ling Han also left behind the Battle Armor, further increasing the chances of success.","There was also the Essence Nurturing Gourd, and Ling Han had also handed it over to the empress. At night, they could stay in the gourd. Firstly, it could increase their Spiritual Power, and secondly, it was safer.","After making all the preparations, Ling Han set out.","After advancing into Celestial Path, cultivators wouldn’t die even if they didn’t have food, clear water, or air. As long as they could absorb the power of heaven and earth, they would be able to live. Even in extreme environments, they wouldn’t have to worry about their lives.","Ling Han set off on his own, heading towards the Flame Canyon.","Before he had even walked far enough, he discovered that the ground around him was showing signs of being charred, and there were less and less trees, grass, and flowers. After walking for a while, he basically could not see any more plants. There were some that were fiery red in colour, and they were Chi Yan Grass that could survive even in lava.","Ling Han didn’t use the Natural Dao Water. As long as he could hold on, he wouldn’t use the Natural Dao Water, lest he expend too much and affect his forging of the Origin Gold.","It was not that there was no one here. There were people deliberately searching for the Chi Yan Grass here. It was said that this thing was a saintly item for boosting one’s libido, so it was very popular.","With benefits, it was naturally inevitable that there would be conflict. Ling Han was even treated as a herb harvester by others, and was attacked.","—In this place, every herb-gatherer had their own territory. This naturally was something that they had achieved through fighting with their abilities.","Ling Han didn’t unleash his fury, and he simply pushed them back before calmly passing them by.","After two hours, he arrived at the entrance to the Flame Canyon.","There was a stone tablet erected here, and there were a few words written on it: “Land of Extreme Flame, those who enter will not return.”","Ling Han swept an eye over them, and felt as if these words were about to jump out of the rock. They were grand and majestic, possessing an indescribably great aura.","The person who had written these words was definitely extraordinary.","He naturally ignored them, and strode in.","Boom! A wave of heat surged over, and Ling Han discovered that the clothes on his body immediately started to burn.","This heat was who knew how many times higher than the outside world.","Ling Han hurriedly channeled his mystical power to surround his entire body to resist this powerful power of flames.","He slowed down his pace. Now that he was here, he could no longer walk so fast. If the power of flames exploded to the extreme, he would be incinerated into ashes in an instant.","After walking for a while, just the mystical power alone was no longer enough to protect him. Ling Han channelled out the Starlight Screen. This defense was extremely strong, and once again dispelled the wave of heat.","Ling Han advanced again, but he had not walked too far, when he saw flames intertwining ahead of him. Multiple seals were blooming, like flowers in full bloom.","He slowly walked forwards, but he had not even been touched by the flames, when he saw that his Starlight Screen was melting at an extremely fast speed, like snow that had met hot water.","What terrifying power of flames.","Ling Han no longer hesitated, and took out Natural Dao Water. He drank a drop, and instantly, slivers of cold air surged out of his body, forming a water shield outside his body, cutting off the heat.","He was no longer cautious. Instead, he used the Imminent Skyline, and his speed instantly spiked.","Now, no matter how terrifying the might of the flames was, Ling Han didn’t care anymore.","He discovered that the water shield was continuously being expended, and the deeper he went into the canyon, the faster it was being expended.","Life was truly amazing. Even in this kind of extremely fiery land, there were still plants growing.","It was a blade of grass that was only half an inch tall. It was actually growing on a rock. Its five leaves spread open, and like starfish, stuck tightly onto the rock. From afar, it looked like five geckos.","“Phoenix Blood Grass!” Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He stopped and plucked the grass, placing it into his Spatial Tool.","This was a good thing. According to legends, it was dyed with the blood of a phoenix, and loved places of extreme heat the most.","The hotter and more difficult the environment was, the better the Phoenix Blood Grass grew. It was said that after ingesting it, there was an extremely low possibility that one would be able to cultivate a Flame Mystical Power.","The higher the level of the Phoenix Blood Grass, the higher the possibility of forming the Flame Mystical Power, and the more powerful the Mystical Power would be.","Of course, the higher level of the Phoenix Blood Grass, the more powerful one would need to be to match it. Otherwise, before the Mystical Power was formed, one would be burnt to ashes first.","He had not thought that there would be additional gains.","Ling Han smiled knowingly, and continued onwards.","The power of flames here was incredibly terrifying. Though there was Natural Dao Water to dispel the calamity of burning the body, it had also greatly increased the air resistance, causing Ling Han to be unable to fully unleash his speed.","After an hour, the water shield on Ling Han’s body was almost exhausted.","He didn’t dare to take any chances. After ingesting the second drop of Natural Dao Water, the power of the water instantly surged, and the water shield returned to its strongest state.","Hiss, this place was so big.","Though his speed had not been pushed to the extreme, it was still five times the speed of sound. Running at this kind of speed for an hour, he actually still had not reached the end of the valley?","In less than half an hour, Ling Han’s water shield was once again close to exhaustion.","The closer he was to the end of the valley, the stronger the power of the flames would be, and the greater the expenditure on the water shield.","If he really reached the end of the valley, just how long would a drop of Natural Dao Water be able to last?","‘Hmm?’","When Ling Han ingested the third drop of Natural Dao Water, he suddenly caught sight of a figure.."]},{"number":3670,"title":"Chapter 3670: Encountering an elite","paragraphs":["Chapter 3670: Encountering an elite","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","In such a blazing place, there was actually another person!","Did he also have Natural Dao Water, or... was his strength so heaven-defyingly powerful?","Ling Han saw very clearly that there was no water shield on that person’s body. Instead, he was covered densely with seals of fire, effectively absorbing the power of the flames.","This was an elite, and one that was powerful to the extreme. He could actually walk freely in such depths.","The other had also seen him. The power of flames here was too terrifying. His divine sense could not be activated, so he could only see him with the naked eye. Thus, Ling Han discovered the other even earlier, because he had an eye technique.","It was an old man. He had a head of crimson hair, and his eyes were like copper bells. He was dressed in white coarse clothes, and there was not the slightest bit of adornment on him. However, he exuded a powerful and invincible aura. He was first surprised, then nodded, and said to himself, “So it’s Natural Dao Water!”","To be able to recognize Natural Dao Water with a single glance, this old geezer was no ordinary character.","Of course, being able to appear here with his own strength was already proof of the old geezer’s strength.","“Very good. I want to obtain Fire Crystals and comprehend the way to communicate with high-level flame energy. In this area, there is a limited number of Fire Crystals. If there is Natural Dao Water, then I can enter into a deeper area,” the old man mumbled to himself again, but his voice was very loud, and did not fear that Ling Han would hear him at all.","p***l","Ling Han did not say another word, and directly broke out into a run towards the depths of the canyon.","Why didn’t he run back?","Firstly, he couldn’t waste the Natural Dao Water. Secondly, and most importantly, this old man was too powerful. If he ran back, it would be impossible for him to dodge. He could only enter the depths of the canyon and rely on the Heavenly Dao Flames there to stop him.","As for how he would come out later, that was a matter for the future. At present, the most important thing was to escape.","“Trying to escape?” the old man in coarse clothes said calmly. He set off in pursuit of Ling Han.","With the gap in strength between the two of them, the old man in coarse clothes should have been able to easily catch up to Ling Han, but it was different here.","The power of flames was too terrifying, forcing the old man to have to channel 99% of his power to resist. This naturally greatly affected his speed.","Ling Han, on the other hand, had a water shield to protect him, so he didn’t need to worry about the flames. He only needed to run with all his might.","One ran, while the other pursued. Though the old man had a slight advantage in speed, if he wanted to catch up to Ling Han, he would need some time.","What was the key?","The old man in coarse clothes had already reached his limit by coming here. If he continued to run in, even he wouldn’t be able to withstand the power of the flames. He wouldn’t be able to chase for more than a few steps.","He obviously knew this as well, and couldn’t help but raise a brow, brazenly making his move.","Boom, endless power condensed, turning into a giant hand of fire that grabbed out at Ling Han.","This palm strike was incredibly terrifying. Endless seals were surging in the flames, as if the God of Fire was about to bum the world to ash in his fury. However, it was useless.","The giant hand of flames descended, but it was continuously melting. The power of flames here was too terrifying. Even if the old man in coarse clothes also shot out fire element attacks, they were still rapidly disintegrating. The old man in coarse clothes frowned. In truth, he had also known that this would happen. He had only made a move to scare Ling Han.","He immediately activated his divine sense, using a level of being that was innumerable times higher to suppress Ling Han.","This was the might of a high-level cultivator, and it was used to intimidate low-level cultivators.","Boom! The might surged over, yet Ling Han was completely unmoved. He continued to run as fast as he could.","This time, the coarse-clothed elder was truly astonished.","Who was he?","Dragon Flame Venerate!","This was a supreme elite at the fourth pinnacle level. Below Saint-level, he was the most powerful.","By now, it had already been a very long time since a Saint had appeared on this planet. He was definitely the strongest, but his pressure was actually ineffective against Ling Han?","Just how strange was this?","Could this brat have a Saint Tool on him?","That couldn’t be, either. What Holy Land would hand over a Saint Tool to a mere Foundation Building Tier cultivator? Wouldn’t they be afraid that it would be snatched away?","After chasing for another two steps, the old man in coarse clothes suddenly stopped. He didn’t dare to go any deeper, or it would be an action of courting death.","However, even if this brat brought the Natural Dao Water with him, there would eventually come a time when it would be exhausted. How could it be that he would never come out?","He would just wait for him.","Ling Han moved swiftly. The water shield was rapidly being consumed, and he had no choice but to drink another drop of Natural Dao Water to maintain the activation of the water shield.","Old b@stard.","He thought to himself. Just because he saw that he had Natural Dao Water, he wanted to take him down forcefully. How shameless!","However, for the old geezer to be able to walk to such a deep place, his abilities should be world-shakingly terrifying.","By the looks of it, he wouldn’t be able to exact revenge in the short term. —If this was known to others, they would definitely cry out in madness. Have you gone mad? He is a mighty Venerate Tier elite, and your first reaction is actually not how to escape, but rather when you can get your revenge. He was really bold.","Ling Han put all of this aside first, and arrived at the depths of the Flaming Canyon. There was a pit here that had been created by a smash. It was not very big, about nine meters in diameter, and was only about three meters deep. In this place, the power of flames had reached the pinnacle.","Ling Han stretched out his head to look from afar. Even if he had Natural Dao Water, he didn’t dare to touch the flames here. He saw that the flames boiling in the pit were actually all seals, but they were indescribably mysterious. This was a high-level flame energy!","Ling Han thought. There was actually still a difference even when both was high-level energy. This was known through the level of different Spirit Diagrams.","Different Fire Spirit Diagrams communicated with completely different flames. In this place, it was possible that it had reached the pinnacle of the power of flames. Even Saints could be easily burnt to death.","Ling Han’s heart throbbed wildly. Were these seals the profound knowledge that communicated with the supreme power of flames?","He thought, but did not dare to have any hesitation. Immediately, he followed the tool refinement technique that Wu Qingxu had taught him, and attached a sliver of his divine sense to the Origin Gold, then threw the Origin Gold into the fire pit.","Boom! The symbols immediately started to pulsate madly, surrounding the Origin Gold and attempting to melt it down.","But what kind of existence was the Origin Gold?","The supreme flames that could easily bum a Saint to death did not seem to have the slightest effect on it. The Origin Gold did not change in the slightest. In fact, it did not even become red. The aura of Primal Chaos descended, and the power of lightning surged gently, steady.","Ling Han wasn’t anxious. If the Origin Gold could be so easily melted, then could it still be called the Origin Gold?","As he drank Natural Dao Water and replenished his water shield, he continued to study those seals of fire. Even if he could only grasp the slightest bit of them, they should still be greatly beneficial to him.","A guess flashed through his mind. Was the Destructive Energy also a high-level, or perhaps it was close to the highest level of energy?","This thought flashed past, and Ling Han naturally focused his energy on studying the seals of flames.","One day, two days, three days... Time slowly crept by.","Natural Dao Water was expending very quickly. Thankfully, the amount was not small either. Since the Great Emperor Wu Ya had left behind a great opportunity for his descendants, he must have made adequate preparations. Every morning, Ling Han wanted to cultivate, but the power of flames here was too terrifying, suppressing the power of heaven and earth. He couldn’t cultivate at all.","Thankfully, he had prepared a backup plan, and brought food with him. Otherwise, if he couldn’t absorb the power of heaven and earth, and didn’t eat or drink, he would really starve to death here.."]},{"number":3671,"title":"Chapter 3671: Tool Refinement","paragraphs":["Chapter 3671: Tool Refinement","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Four days, five days, six days, and there was no change to the Origin Gold at all.","This was truly a terrifying object. The aura of Primal Chaos descended, resisting the energy of the flames, and was not inferior at all.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel surprised and rueful. The Origin Gold was indeed awesome. It hadn’t been refined, and merely a pure ingredient was already so amazing. No wonder it could sweep aside all opposition in the world after instilling the might of the Ancestral King into it in the future.","It should be known that there would come a day when a Great Emperor would be aged, but the Origin Gold would not.","It would last for all eternity, and be immortal for all eternity.","Ling Han was not anxious. Going by Wu Qingxu’s words, even in a land of extreme flames, the Origin Gold would have to be melted for a whole thirty-six days, before there would be some slight change.","He would wait.","A dozen over days later, Ling Han’s mouth was dry with thirst. Even if he had the protection of the water shield, he still felt extremely hot here. This was not just on the physical level, but also on the spiritual level.","It was as if a flame had been planted in his mind, and it was about to spread endlessly, forming a great fire that would incinerate him.","Ling Han persisted. Mystical power circulated continuously in his body, and the Celestial Foundation exuded the ancient aura, suppressing that terrifying power of flames.","This was truly terrifying. Even if Ling Han was merely studying the seals of flames, he would still draw fire onto himself.","Even so, Ling Han still didn’t stop.","As long as he could hold on, he would not give up.","Twenty days! Thirty days!","By now, Ling Han was completely dehydrated and shrivelled up. It was guaranteed that no one would be able to recognize him.","Right now, he was nothing more than a dried corpse. The only difference was that he was still alive.","He finally had some enlightenment.","He thought to himself, a slight smile curling up the comers of his lips. This seal of fire was too difficult to grasp. He stared at it and finally made some progress.","32 days, 35 days, 36 days!","Ling Han discovered that the Origin Gold finally showed signs of softening.","It did not melt, but merely weakened.","This was already the limit. Even the Heavenly Dao Flames couldn’t truly melt the Origin Gold.","That sliver of divine sense of Ling Han’s had taken effect. It had been protected by the aura of Primal Chaos all this while, and had not been burnt by the flames.","His divine sense channeled and fused with the Origin Gold.","What cultivation level did he have? On what basis could he use the precious tool refined from the Origin Gold?","There was only one way, and that was to merge his spirit with the Origin Gold. From then onwards, the Origin Gold would be like a part of his body, so it would naturally be a piece of cake for him to channel it.","It had been burnt by the Heavenly Dao Flames for 36 days. There was only one purpose for this, and that was to turn the Origin Gold soft and loose. Only then would his spirit be able to spread out in every corner of the Origin Gold and perfectly fuse together.","His spirit channelled. Thankfully, the Origin Gold was inanimate. Otherwise, such a powerful existence only needed a slight thought, and it would be able to shatter his spirit.","Bit by bit, Ling Han calmed down and spread out his divine sense.","At this moment, he naturally didn’t have the energy to study the flame seals anymore. In comparison, refining the Origin Gold was definitely more important.","One day, two days, five days, Ling Han improved slightly every day. The Heavenly Dao Flames was still burning fiercely. Though it could not refine the Origin Gold, it still caused the Origin Gold to maintain a slightly weak state, creating conditions for the fusion of Ling Han’s spirit.","Nine days!","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. He had finally completely fused his divine sense with the Origin Gold.","Change!","Ling Han manipulated the Origin Gold, and with the help of the Heavenly Dao Flames, he began to mold the shape of the Origin Gold.","What shape would the Origin Gold Spirit Tool be forged into?","Ling Han had considered a great many things.","For example, the sword, the king of weapons. With a single slash, it could sever the heavens, and dazzle the universe.","For example, the saber. It was incredibly domineering, and could shatter the heavens with a single strike.","There was also the cauldron, a precious tool of an empire. The wielder of the cauldron could control the world.","However, Ling Han still preferred the Tower.","After his rebirth, his first Spirit Tool was the Black Tower. It had accompanied him for innumerable years, and he had developed affection for it as well.","The Black Tower was forged by the Karmic Life Heavenly Venerable, so he would forge his own tower-shaped precious tool.","It was decided then.","In the fire pit, the Origin Gold was changing shape. The Heavenly Dao Flames couldn’t melt it, but added with Ling Han’s control through divine sense, this could allow the Origin Gold to shape itself.","-There was no power in this world that could change the Origin Gold, aside from the Origin Gold itself.","The model of a small tower appeared, and Ling Han continued to carefully mould it. Nine levels appeared on the body of the tower, and then it became more and more detailed.","As the Origin Gold, it naturally couldn’t be so simple. Every level formed an independent space, which was very big.","However, Ling Han’s Spiritual Power was limited. After reaching a certain level, he could no longer open further spaces.","It was fine. His spirit had already fused with the Origin Gold. In future, as his divine sense became stronger, he would naturally be able to continue opening up space.","The purpose of coming here was to merge his spirit with the Origin Gold. This could only be done in a situation when the Heavenly Dao Flames melted the Origin Gold until it was slightly weak.","“Come!” Ling Han said lightly, and the tower that was forged from the Origin Gold spun and flew towards him. It floated above his head, and an aura of Primal Chaos poured down. Lightning flashed, as if it was a deadly weapon that was delivering punishment on behalf of the heavens.","This aura of Primal Chaos was extraordinarily heavy, and could overwhelm all. Furthermore, the power of lightning was incomparable, capable of destroying everything.","Of course, Ling Han’s current strength wasn’t enough, so he could only channel out a bit of the might of the two. However, in the Foundation Building Tier, he probably wouldn’t be able to find a worthy opponent.","Ling Han laughed loudly. A Foundation Building Tier cultivator already possessed the most powerful precious tool; who in this world could compare? Unfortunately, this was built by him, so it naturally could not possibly possess the might of an Imperial Weapon. It only possessed endless growth and potential.","“From now onwards, your name will be Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower!”","Ling Han wanted to leave, but just as he raised his foot, a thought flashed through his mind, and he turned his gaze to the fire pit.","Could he absorb some flames?","Although he didn’t dare to touch the flames, didn’t he still have the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower?","“Retrieve!” He drew out the precious tower, and arrived above the fire pit. With a thought, the space on the ninth floor of the precious tower instantly opened, and began to absorb the flames.","He really could!","Haha, this was great.","However, after the Heavenly Dao Flames entered into the precious tower’s space, it immediately dispersed from the flame seals as if it had shattered. It was originally only the size of a fist, but now it actually turned into a sea of flames, causing the tower’s space, while being obviously large, not being able to collect many flames.","So be it if there weren’t many. Again.","Ling Han filled all nine levels of the tower with Heavenly Dao Flames — or rather, slightly inferior Heavenly Dao Flames.","The Heavenly Dao Flames were capable of burning Saints to death. If it had been one level higher, then it shouldn’t have been difficult for it to burn Venerate Tier elites to death, right?","Hehe, just how many Saints were there in this world?","Venerate Tier elites should be regarded as the most powerful beings in the universe, right? Then, if he could burn even Venerate Tier elites to death, just how awesome would his trump card be?","“If that old b@stard is still waiting for me outside, I’ll burn him to death.","Ling Han murmured, then strode out of the valley.","He was already running out of Natural Dao Water. If he didn’t leave now, he would be burned to death here.","After storing away the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, Ling Han ran quickly and soon left the innermost depths of the canyon. The might of the flames dropped drastically, and the expenditure of the water shield also slowed down.","“Brat, do you really think you can escape from this old man’s grasp?” A calm voice’rang out, and the old man in coarse clothes appeared once more.","Dragon Flame Venerate!","Ling Han had confidence now, so he was naturally unafraid. He retreated deeper into the canyon, as in that kind of extremely fiery place, he could greatly weaken his opponent’s strength. Otherwise, if he died the moment his opponent made a move, he would not even be able to have the chance to unleash the Heavenly Dao Flames.","“Old b@stard, is there something wrong with your brain? Have I offended you?”"]},{"number":3672,"title":"Chapter 3672: Burning a Venerate Tier","paragraphs":["Chapter 3672: Burning a Venerate Tier","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han had complaints, and the Dragon Flame Venerate could understand that, but this brat was too outrageously bold; he actually dared to call him old b@stard?","He was a Venerate Tier elite, the strongest below Saint Tier!","“You’re seeking death!” he said balefully. He raised his hand to grab at Ling Han.","If Ling Han treated him respectfully, then just because Ling Han could resist his intimidation, perhaps he would observe Ling Han for a while. If Ling Han’s talent was good enough, he would not mind taking him as a disciple.","However, after hearing Ling Han’s curse, he naturally wouldn’t have such thoughts anymore.","Regardless of whether you were a prodigy or not, in front of a Venerate Tier elite, you were nothing but dust and trash.","Boom! The large hand grabbed over, and it was as if even the stars in the sky could be easily captured.","The power of a Venerate Tier elite was boundlessly terrifying.","Yet Ling Han smirked coldly. With a thought, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower appeared. Then, a level of space on the tower’s body opened, and towering flames blazed.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower itself could only be considered a One Star Tool. However, it was incredibly sturdy, and even Saints could not possibly damage it. But now that it was filled with Heavenly Dao Flames, its might was completely different.","This weakened version of the Heavenly Dao Flames might not be able to burn the Saint to death, but the Dragon Flame Venerate was no Saint.","Boom! Flames blazed, incinerating everything.","“What?!” the Dragon Flame Venerate exclaimed in astonishment. He hurriedly retreated.","He didn’t even dare to touch these flames.","But in this place, the power of flames was too strong, so he could not retreat quickly either.","The surging flames chased after his behind, and its speed was slightly faster, getting closer and closer.","However, the Dragon Flame Venerate was running out of the valley, and his speed was also getting faster and faster. Though the flames were closing in, its speed was becoming slower and slower.","It had still caught up!","The Dragon Flame Venerate let out a pained scream as his bottom was burned.","He made a prompt decision, and turned his hand into a saber. A slash descended, and a sanguine light blazed. One side of his behind was instantly severed, and the flames did not spread all over his body.","Even so, there was still fire poison entering his body, which left a huge problem for him.","The Dragon Flame Venerate turned around and gave Ling Han a meaningful look. However, his steps became even faster. Xiu! He instantly disappeared without a trace.","He had been severely wounded, so his top priority now was to expel the fire poison. Otherwise, even if he decided to sacrifice his “behind”, it would still be inevitable that he would die.","This was a great humiliation. He had actually suffered such a great loss at the hands of a Foundation Building Tier cultivator.","That was... a Saint Tool?","Only a Saint Tool could contain such terrifying Heavenly Dao Flames, capable of burning even Venerate Tier elites to death.","His eyes were red with envy. This brat was definitely not the heir of some Holy Land of the Black Moon Planet. This was because he had seen all the Saint Tools on this planet, and none of them were tower-shaped.","He would recover from his injuries, then find Ling Han, kill him, and snatch his weapon!","...Ling Han was probably the first person in history to wound a Venerate Tier elite when he was only in the Foundation Building Tier, and was resented by a Venerate Tier elite for it, right?","This was a completely impossible feat, because the existence of the Origin Gold and the Heavenly Dao Flames had transformed an impossible feat into a reality.","The power of heaven and earth was truly amazing.","Unfortunately, he had wasted one floor’s worth of Heavenly Dao Flames.","Ling Han thought for a moment. He still had some Natural Dao Water, so he’d just enter the bottom of the valley again.","He resolutely returned and filled up the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower before leaving the Flaming Canyon. After this trip, there were only five drops of Natural Dao Water left, which was completely not enough to enter the canyon again.","“The Origin Gold can completely resist the Heavenly Dao Flames, so if I use it to protect me, can it help me reach the end of the valley?”","Ling Han was extremely curious. He didn’t dare to try it in the valley. If he failed, he would directly be burned to ashes.","He summoned the precious tower, which hovered above his head. Streaks of Primal Chaos aura flowed down from it. Then, he strode forwards, and entered into the valley.","The wave of heat surged over, yet it was blocked by the Primal Chaos aura, preventing it from penetrating at all.","It really worked!","Ling Han was overjoyed. In this way, even without the Natural Dao Water, he would still be able to endlessly replenish the Heavenly Dao Flames.","However, he soon discovered that this was a wonderful wish.","He went deeper, and still felt waves of heat. If he went further, he would also be injured.","Sigh, even with the protection of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he still wouldn’t be able to reach the end of the valley.","Ling Han could only retreat out of the valley. When he arrived outside the valley again, not only did he drink water madly, he even submerged himself in the water, and absorbed the power of heaven and earth, even if he could only draw a sliver of it now.","His shrivelled body quickly became plump. In less than half an hour, he had returned to normal.","“Phew.” He exhaled, but there was actually a trace of flames.","Even with the Natural Dao Water’s protection, after so many days, a sliver of fire poison had accumulated in his body. Thankfully, now that he had left the Flaming Canyon, and ingested a drop of Natural Dao Water, the fire poison was finally dispelled completely.","The Imperial Weapon had been successfully refined, and an old b@stard had also been burnt. Ling Han was in a very good mood. He finally had a true trump card that could oppose even Venerate Tiers.","“Ling Han, why have you only just returned? Niu missed you so much!” When Ling Han found the empress and the others, Hu Niu was the first to jump over. Like an octopus, she wrapped around Ling Han.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Haven’t 1 already said that I need close to two months’ time?”","“Niu doesn’t care, Niu just misses you!” Hu Niu clung onto Ling Han’s body, unwilling to get off.","“Father, I want a hug.”","“Please give me a hug!”","The seven babies also squeezed in. They naturally had to join in on the excitement.","“Alright, we should leave here,” Ling Han said with a smile.","He had best hurry. Who knew if that old b@stard would send people to hunt him down?","Ling Han presently had a trump card against Venerate Tiers, but as long as it was a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, he would be able to beat him into submission. How many times could the Heavenly Dao Flames be used?","Thus, he had best flee as soon as possible.","“Have you gotten into trouble again?” the empress asked. It was still her who knew Ling Han better.","Ling Han laughed drily, “I might have offended a Venerate Tier elite, and burned off half his behind.”","Hearing these words, everyone was speechless. Even Tang Yun’er rolled her eyes madly.","She was already good at causing trouble, but compared with Ling Han, she was like an amateur compared to an expert. They were completely on two different levels.","It should be known that even her paternal grandfather and maternal grandfather were only Venerate Tier elites.","“Handsome Brother, you’re bluffing, right?!” She refused to believe that a mere Foundation Building cultivator could wound a Venerate Tier cultivator. The gulf between them was boundless.","“Hehe, believe it or not, it’s up to you.” Ling Han patted the little loli’s shoulder.","They quickly left, and only when they returned to the territory of the Holy Land of Metal Element did they all sigh in relief.","“It’s time to go to the Metal Element Fruit Gathering.”","The territory of the Holy Land of Metal Element and the Holy Land of Metal Element were two different things. In terms of area, the Holy Land of Metal Element was only ten thousandth of the size of their territory. After Ling Han and the others travelled for another two days, they finally arrived at the real Holy Land of Metal Element.","It was truly majestic and incomparable.","A majestic peak pierced into the clouds. It was unknown how high it was. There was golden mist curling around the mountains, and thousands of meters of divine light shone. Occasionally, Celestial Cranes could be seen flying past, as if they were in a celestial realm.","This was only the most direct impression. If one sensed it, they would discover that the power of heaven and earth here was incredibly dense. When cultivating the power of heaven and earth here, it was no weaker than when the sun first rose in other places.","Then what would it be like to cultivate here in the morning?","Thus, this was qualified to be called a Holy Land!"]},{"number":3673,"title":"Chapter 3673: Arrival at the Holy Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 3673: Arrival at the Holy Land","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Boom, a ball of flames danced in Ling Han’s hand. It was very small, and looked like a flame, but the wave of heat it exuded was incredibly terrifying. It could melt even Divine Metal of a slightly lower grade.","This was what he had appreciated from the Heavenly Dao Flames.","Communicating with high-level energy didn’t necessarily require a Spirit Diagram. Previously, Ling Han had only memorized a single flame seal, and after mastering it, he naturally communicated with high-level flame energy.","This was incomparable to the flame energy that he had previously grasped.","En, the Spirit Diagram should only be a means of communicating with high-level energy. Now that he had completely comprehended the flame seal, it was equivalent to having grasped a corresponding Spirit Diagram.","Of course, he had only deciphered a single seal, so this flame was pitifully weak. It was just a small flame.","“When I become stronger in the future, I’ll go to the Flaming Canyon and master all the seals. That’s something that can burn even Saints to death,” Ling Han murmured.","In these two months, everyone had improved greatly. The empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog had all advanced into Extreme Bone Tier.","Unfortunately, they had all broken through from Sixth Change, and were unable to reach Seventh Change.","This was related to the Power of Dimension in his body. It couldn’t be forced.","Ling Han considered for a moment, then decided to have everyone continue waiting for him outside, and not enter into the Holy Land of Metal Element with him.","Firstly, he could not possibly bring such a large number of people with him. Then, all of them would only be able to enter into the Essence Nurturing Gourd.","Secondly, even if he did, with the power of the Holy Land of Metal Element, how could it be that theHoly Land of Metal Element wouldn’t recognize the Essence Nurturing Gourd?","This was a treasure that even a Spirit Transformation True Lord would be tempted by. How could he protect it?","He had come to collect benefits, and had no wish to become a wealth-delivering boy.","Thus, it was better for everyone to stay here. The Essence Nurturing Gourd was also handed into the care of the empress.","In any case, their cultivation levels were too low, so even if they were given celestial fruits, it would not be of much use.","Aside from a Spatial Spirit Tool, Ling Han only had the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower with him.","“I have to disguise this treasure. Otherwise, this scene would be too astonishing. The Primal Chaos aura would be boiling, and lightning would be closely intertwined. Even an idiot would know that it is extraordinary,” he mumbled.","This was easy to deal with. What kind of God Tool was the Origin Gold? It could be big or small, and it was all up to him to decide. It immediately shrunk to the size of a thumb, and he used it like an ornament for his hair sash, hanging it on his head.","This was one aspect. On the other side, Ling Han also caused the God Tool to keep a low profile. The aura of Primal Chaos no longer descended, and lightning was no longer intertwined. It looked like a very ordinary One Star precious tool. Even if it was slightly more powerful, no one would think that it had been forged from Origin Gold.","“Now, I can fly, right?”","With a thought from Ling Han, he began to ride on his Tool.","He jumped onto the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This precious tower floated gently and didn’t fall.","“Let’s go.”","Ling Han issued a command, and the precious tower immediately advanced, but its speed was too fast. With a xiu, Ling Han flipped down from above, and fell onto the ground with a thud.","The precious tower slowly flew back, and hung above Ling Han’s head.","“Can’t you fly slower?”","Ling Han mocked. However, he also knew that this was impossible. With the strength of a Foundation Building Tier cultivator, he was still unable to make the precious tool fly at a low speed. Otherwise, it would not be able to overcome the gravity fields at all.","He once again jumped onto the precious tower. This time, he used his mystical power to press down on himself, firmly sticking close to the precious tower.","“Let’s go again.”","Ling Han gave a soft shout, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower flew again at an extremely fast speed.","It was as if he had stuck onto it, and did not fall off again.","Faster.","Ling Han injected even more mystical power into the tower, and the speed of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower instantly soared.","Ten times the speed of sound, fifteen times, twenty times. However, the limit was only twenty times, which was the same speed as Ling Han running at full speed, but the advantage was that he could fly in the air and ignore all obstacles.","For a normal Foundation Building Tier cultivator, flying on a Tool was an extremely difficult task, but for Ling Han, this was a piece of cake, and he didn’t know how difficult it was at all.","Riding on his precious tool, he soon arrived at the main gate of the Holy Land.","The entire Holy Land was protected by a formation. With Ling Han’s current formation abilities, there was absolutely no way he could break through it. Furthermore, there was absolutely no need for him to break through it. In the first place, he would be able to enter boldly.","“Who goes there? You have come to the Holy Land, and still dare to fly on a Tool?” Immediately, someone shouted at him.","Ling Han descended, but he had just learnt how to fly, so he was naturally in a very sorry state. With a bang, he crashed into a rock.","“Pul” A woman’s laughter was heard, and then she said, “Senior Brother Jia, he should have just leamt how to fly on a Tool, so don’t make things difficult for him.”","Ling Han gritted his teeth and put away the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. He then turned around to take a look.","There were two young people standing at the main gate, a man and a woman. They were both in the Foundation Building Tier. Moreover, the man should have reached Heavenly Dao Foundation, as his level of being was clearly slightly superior Ling Han, and the woman should also be a Human Dao Foundation. Her level of being was equal to Ling Han’s.","“I’m here to attend the Metal Element Fruit Gathering,” Ling Han said with a faint smile.","“You?” The male, Senior Brother Jia couldn’t help but laugh loudly, “Are you worthy?”","Ling Han’s expression did not change, and he said calmly, “It is not up to you to decide whether I am worthy or otherwise.”","Senior Brother Jia couldn’t help but feel angry. This brat actually dared to insult him?","He humphed, “Brat, what kind of place do you think this is?” He moved aggressively, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han. A vigorous power surged over, endless seals blazing.","“Senior Brother Jia!” The woman hurriedly stepped forward to block him.","Senior Brother Jia hurriedly withdrew his hand, and complained, “Junior Sister, what are you doing?”","Yet the woman smiled at Ling Han, and asked, “This one, have you passed through the three types of nine-storey towers?”","Ling Han nodded earnestly, “Yes.”","“Then come over here, and I’ll examine you,” the woman continued.","Ling Han walked over as instructed, and did not even cast a second look at that Senior Brother Jia or whatnot, angering that Senior Brother Jia so much that his eyes were spitting fire.","The woman pointed at a white jade at the mountain’s entrance, “Come, place your hand on it.”","Ling Han stretched out a hand and pressed down on the jade. Instantly, the invisible mark that he had previously been struck by the nine-storey tower surfaced, exuding a bright light.","“Senior Brother Jia, he has passed through the nine-storey towers, and obtained the qualification to join the Holy Land,” the woman turned and said to Senior Brother Jia.","“Humph, so what?” Senior Brother Jia was unconcerned.","There were many people who had passed through the nine-storey towers, but a great many had been expelled after entering into the Holy Land for one or two years, and less than one-tenth of them could stay behind. Thus, he did not take Ling Han seriously at all.","“Senior Brother!” The woman stomped her foot, then smiled at Ling Han. “My name is Liu Lin, so you can just call me Senior Sister Liu. What’s your name?”","“Ling Han.”","“Junior Brother Ling, follow me.” Liu Lin waved a hand, and brought Ling Han with her into the main gate.","Ling Han nodded, smiled faintly at Senior Brother Jia, and strode off.","“Detestable brat!” Senior Brother Jia raised his fists, appearing extremely displeased.","With his status, there was originally no need for him to stand guard here. However, for the sake of courting Liu Lin, he had taken the initiative to come. However, he had not even said a few words to Beauty Liu, when he was interrupted by Ling Han’s appearance.","This was actually the true reason for his anger. Now, it was even better. Liu Lin brought Ling Han in, and actually left him alone to watch over the main gate.","Did they really think that he was a doorman?"]},{"number":3674,"title":"Chapter 3674: Final Tournament","paragraphs":["Chapter 3674: Final Tournament","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han would never have imagined that he would be able to offend someone even though he had just come over very, very normally.","Of course, he would not care either. If he had offended him, so be it. What was the big deal about it?","Liu Lin was very cordial, chattering all the way, introducing the Holy Land of","Metal Element to Ling Han.","The Holy Land was divided into a total of seven areas. For Foundation Building disciples like them, they could only move around in the first three areas, and the last four areas belonged to forbidden territory. If they entered without permission, the lightest punishment would be a violent beating, and a heavy punishment would be a violent beating before they were expelled from the sect.","“You want to participate in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering and not join the Holy Land?” When Liu Lin found out about Ling Han’s thoughts, she couldn’t help but exclaim in shock, appearing very confused.","This was the Holy Land of Metal Element. No matter where it was in the vast galaxy, it could be considered supreme.","You were able to join a Holy Land, so why are you still being so picky?","Ling Han smiled and said, “I don’t have such thoughts yet. “You’re truly a weirdo,” Liu Lin said with a shake of her head. “Fine, you have your own thoughts.”","She brought Ling Han to a group of buildings, then arranged for Ling Han to stay in a room.","“The people living here will all be participating in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering 13 days later. Just wait for the notice.","“All right, thanks.” Ling Han nodded.","Liu Lin left, while Ling Han walked into his room, closed the doors, and began to study formation techniques.","This path was wide and profound, especially for Celestial level Formations. It was the hardest to start, and without “enlightenment”, one really wouldn’t be able to grasp the slightest bit of it.","Ling Han had Wally’s help, and his improvement in formations was extremely fast. However, he was still far from being able to step through these doors.","He diligently studied it. If he could really grasp formations, then his battle prowess would be greatly strengthened. In future, when he ventured into ancient sites, or went to steal someone else’s woman, they would both be useful.","In these few days, his improvement was extremely great.","In the past two months, he hadn’t cultivated. However, Ling Han had been tempered in extremely harsh environments all this while, so his spirit had become much stronger.","He opened his apertures and extracted the power of heaven and earth. The Celestial Foundation in his mind slowly grew stronger.","It was really too advantageous to cultivate here. One day was comparable to ten days in other places.","13 days quickly passed, and someone finally came to inform that they were to participate in a competition. Only the victor would be qualified to participate in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering.","For Ling Han, this was something that he had long since known, but for others, this was too sudden.","But what could be done? How could it be that they could argue with the Holy Land?","So be it if it was a competition. Everyone here was filled with confidence in","themselves.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before putting on a mask. There were definitely a great many people here that had not expected that he would come to the Holy Land of Metal Element. Then, let the surprise become even fiercer.","Ling Han walked out, yet shockingly discovered that there were actually quite a number of people whose faces had not been revealed.","Some had veined patterns drawn on their faces, and their facial features could not be seen at all. Some were wearing cloaks that enshrouded their entire person, while some were wearing masks.","Was this because they were afraid that they would be embarrassed after being eliminated, so they deliberately hid their faces?","Ling Han saw a great many extraterrestrial visitors that had appeared on the Celestial Sea Planet, but there were even more unfamiliar faces. They should be prodigies that the Holy Land of Metal Element had summoned from other planets.","The Eldest Imperial Prince, the Seventh Imperial Prince, Hong Tianbu, and Niu Jianhua!","A faint smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. These guys, just wait for him to deal with them.","Everyone followed an envoy from the Holy Land, and arrived at a plaza. “Next, you guys still have the last test to pass.” A middle-aged man appeared. He was tall and slender, and stood proudly in the sky.","Stand quietly in midair?","This had to be a Core Formation Tier elite, at least.","Everyone was solemn. Even though many of them had Sect Master-level backgrounds, they were not even worth mentioning in a Holy Land, and he was also far stronger than them, so they were not qualified to challenge him.","“Through this Transfer Formation, you will enter into a place called the Frost Origin Mystery Realm.”","“The first twelve people to come out of the Frost Origin Mystery Realm are qualified to participate in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering!","“In this Mystery Realm, it is not forbidden to use any kind of means, nor is it forbidden to kill. Thus, if you are afraid of death, there is no need for you to","go.”","“Additionally, there are Ice Origin Stones on every peak of the Mystery Realm. You guys should be aware of their effects, so I won’t say much.” “Finally, there is also a Celestial Tree there. It is presently the time for the fruits to ripen. If you all have the ability, you can harvest it as you like, and consider it your reward.”","“Those who have decided to participate, walk forwards. Enter the Transfer Formation. Cowards, scram immediately!”","When this person finished speaking, everyone couldn’t help but feel hesitant.","There were actually only twelve spots?","How many people did they have here? At least tens of thousands.","Tens of thousands of people contending for twelve spots; this competition was too fierce, wasn’t it?","“Forget it. It’s just being able to eat a few celestial fruits. It’s not worth it.” Immediately, someone thought of retreating.","There was no lack of descendants of Sect Master-level forces here. For the sake of a few celestial fruits, to come to blows, firstly, it was not worth it, and secondly, it would degrade their status.","However, there were also many people who believed in their own strength. To say nothing of the fact that only twelve people could win, even if there was only one, it would definitely be them.","There were a few thousand people that chose to give up, but there were still about two thousand that stayed behind.","“GO on.” The middle-aged man from the Holy Land of Metal Element waved his hand, and commanded the people that had stayed behind to enter the Transfer Formation.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The Transfer Formation lit up continuously. It could transport around a hundred people each time, so its efficiency was quite amazing.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry. He was the last batch, less than a hundred people, just over fifty people. Thus, the formation appeared very spacious. Xiu, a brilliant light surged past, and the scene in front of them immediately changed.","A powerful chill assaulted them, and everyone involuntarily crossed their arms over their chests.","There were not just the fifty over people that had just been teleported here. There were also those people that had been teleported here previously, but there were already a great many people that had walked forwards.","“The first 12 people who return are qualified to participate in the fruit gathering. Wouldn’t that be a piece of cake? They just have to eactivate the Transfer Formation,” someone immediately said.","“Tsk!” He was immediately teased by the people beside him.","“What is it? Do you think I’m wrong?” the person from before asked coldly. “Firstly, are you a Formation Master, so you know how to activate formations? Secondly, as long as you’re not an idiot, you should have discovered that this Transfer Formation is a one-way formation. This is the place of entry, and the Transfer Formation for leaving is naturally at the end of the Mystery Realm.” The person who teased him said calmly.","This rendered the person from before speechless, and he could only glare harshly at him.","Ling Han observed for a moment. He was presently on a plain, covered with pure white snow. The accumulated snow was as deep as two feet, and with a single step, it would reach his knee.","However, this naturally wasn’t a problem for Celestial Path elites. Even if they couldn’t fly on Celestial Tools, it was fine. They only needed a little bit of power to stand.","Ahead of them, a large number of people had already left on their Tools, but there was also a small number that chose to run on the snow, thinking that it might not be safe to fly in the air.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then also moved his body, and began to sprint on the snowy ground.."]},{"number":3675,"title":"Chapter 3675: Ice Valley","paragraphs":["Chapter 3675: Ice Valley","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hu, snow fluttered, and the cold wind was bone-chilling.","Ling Han stimulated a high-level flame energy, and his body instantly warmed up. However, it was as if this accumulated snow was also condensed from high-level ice energy. It had a very strong restraining effect on flame energy, forcing Ling Han to continuously extract flame energy for replenishment.","This was extremely exhausting on his Spiritual Power.","The Heavenly Dao Flames was not effective here. Firstly, there was only a tiny flame, and secondly, the destructive power of this thing was too great. It could only be used against enemies, but for warmth? Don’t burn yourself into ashes first.","Since the level of this flame energy was not high enough, he would switch to something else.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen, and instantly, the apertures all over his body lit up, forming a bell of stars.","The chill was blocked outside, and could no longer invade Ling Han’s body.","However, though this no longer expended Ling Han’s Spiritual Power, his mystical power was still continuously draining away.","Thankfully, Ling Han’s reserves of mystical power were astonishingly large.","This kind of expenditure was really no big deal.","What about the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower?","This could resist extreme flames, so what if it was cold?","Ling Han summoned the precious tower, which floated above his head, emanating wisps of Primal Chaos aura.","If he had not caused the precious tool to maintain a low profile, there would definitely be millions of scenes, and even Saints would be moved. But now, though the Primal Chaos aura was a little extraordinary, it was only so. At most, it could only be considered extraordinary among Foundation Building","Tiers.","This effect was immediately apparent. Wrapped in Primal Chaos aura, Ling","Han seemed to be impervious to all attacks.","The Origin Gold was the Origin Gold. Even if it had not been fused with the power of the Ancestral King, within the corresponding cultivation level, this was invincible.","En, just like him.","Ling Han thought narcissistically. He was invincible among his peers, like Origin Gold, like an Imperial Weapon.","His speed was astonishing, so what if the wind and snow intertwined? He strolled casually, and using twenty times the speed of sound, he soon caught up to the person in front of him.","However, this snowy plain was too large, and it was impossible for everyone to walk in a straight line. There would definitely be a great many people that he had surpassed, yet had never come across.","Ling Han’s speed was too fast. A great many people only reacted after he had surpassed them, and there was no chance for them to make a move even if they wanted to.","After running like this for half an hour, they finally reached the end of the snowy plains. A canyon lay ahead of them, with snow and ice raging.","Hu, a cold wind blew past, and actually turned into a massive vulture. As it swept past, it was like a bird king from the ancient times that was out on a trip, its might astonishing.","Even if they were very far away, Ling Han still felt a strong wariness, and hurriedly retreated.","He didn’t know if the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could block this cold air, but if it wasn’t necessary, he didn’t want to take the risk.","The cold winds howled, and lasted for a whole five minutes. A great many people suddenly appeared in the canyon, advancing forwards, but their speed was extremely slow.","As it turned out, there were caves everywhere in the canyon. Previously, those people must have stayed in the caves to avoid the cold, and only came out when the cold wind blew past.","Obviously, Ling Han wasn’t the only one who had realized how terrifying the cold wind was. Of course, it was also possible that others had seen that someone had been implicated, and had thus learnt their lesson.","Ling Han also stepped into the canyon. He could see very clearly that there was a cave about every thirty meters or so on either side of the canyon. It wasn’t very deep, at most six meters.","The moment he entered, he immediately discovered that the gravity here was astonishingly strong. To say nothing of flying, even walking on snow was incredibly difficult.","No wonder those people in front were so slow.","Could the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower resist this gravity?","Ling Han summoned the precious tower again, and felt his whole body become light, ready to fly at any time.","As expected of the embryonic form of the Imperial Weapon. It was too awesome.","Ling Han didn’t dare to use it. Although the precious tower kept a low profile, if he could move freely here with the precious tower, wouldn’t that be telling others that this precious tool was an amazing item?","He put away the precious tower again, and walked forwards in the snow, slowly and steadily.","In any case, everyone’s speed was the same, so it didn’t matter.","After walking for less than ten minutes, hu, a strong gust of wind whistled, and instantly, a bone-deep chill assaulted him.","That strange wind was coming again.","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest, and hurriedly searched for a cave to shelter himself from the wind.","The people in front were not idle either. They too stepped aside, and entered into the mountain cave.","In just a short while, the cold wind surged past madly. Even in the cave, Ling Han felt a bone-deep chill assault him, causing him to shiver.","Cold, it was really cold. If he was blown by the cold wind head-on, would he directly be turned into an ice statue?","This was extremely likely.","After the cold wind passed, Ling Han exited the cave and continued his journey. He had to walk out of this canyon as soon as possible. Otherwise, if he kept being blown by the cold wind like this, it would affect his speed too much. He had wonderful ideas but reality was cruel. Without the protection of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he couldn’t go any faster.","He tried to summon the flame energy, but with a gust of cold wind, it was directly extinguished.","F*ck!’","The coldness here was so terrifying?","Ling Han channeled the Starlight Screen, and this was much better. The gravity had decreased greatly, causing his speed to increase explosively.","Most people could only move one step at a time, but Ling Han could jump. With a single leap, he could cover more than six meters. It couldn’t compare to being outside, but in here, this was already considered godly speed.","He soon surpassed a blue-robed young man. The latter stared at his back for a while, and did not make a move, but when he surpassed another red-robed young man, he was attacked by the latter.","in this place, everyone was a competitor, and only twelve spots could be won. Boom, that young man in red robes was very overbearing. He waved his hand and shot out a golden fist force, with multiple seals flickering.","Ling Han humphed, and also shot out a punch, but it was very ordinary. “You’re seeking death!” the red-robed young man said with a sneer. He hadn’t even formed a seal in his power, so how powerful could it be?","Peng, the two powers clashed, and energy exploded. A large amount of accumulated snow was sent flying, and the expression of the young man in red robes changed drastically. His opponent’s punch was extremely solid, and directly shattered his force, continuing to attack him.","It was too fast, there was no way to dodge.","Peng, he was sent flying, and his figure drew an arc in midair, crashing heavily into the mountain wall. Then, he fell headfirst into the accumulated snow.","Before Ling Han could decide how he was going to deal with this guy, hu, a coldness rose up abruptly, and that super cold wind came again.","Ling Han hurriedly found a place to hide and leaped into the mountain cave. The cold wind came and went at an astonishing speed, and he couldn’t delay at all.","“Aiya, there’s another outside.” Only at this moment did he remember that there was another young man in red robes outside.","When the cold wind blew past, Ling Han walked out of the cave, and saw that the young man in red had already turned into an ice statue, without the slightest sign of life.","No matter what, this was still a one-star genius, or a prodigy whose battle prowess was comparable to a one-star genius, and he had died just like that. He had brought this upon himself. Who asked him to be so cruel?","Ling Han did not feel much sympathy, but he frowned. It was said that a one-star genius was already qualified to join a Holy Land, but they had entered here to carry out the final competition, and there was a risk of death, yet the Holy Land did not care in the slightest.","Was this really a selection process for talented recruits?"]},{"number":3676,"title":"Chapter 3676: Meeting the Seventh Imperial Prince again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3676: Meeting the Seventh Imperial Prince again","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han shook his head, and continued onwards.","After walking for a while, the sky gradually darkened. The cold winds stopped blowing, but the temperature in the canyon dropped drastically, and by the looks of it, it would continue to drop.","Ling Han decided not to continue the journey. Instead, he would find a cave to stay in for the night, to avoid this super low temperature.","The moment he entered the cave, the coldness had indeed subsided considerably.","Ling Han tried to start a fire, but the temperature here was so low that even wood couldn’t burn. He took out rations, wanting to barbeque them with high-level flames, but that was too powerful, directly burning the rations into ashes.","F***","Ling Han had no choice but to absorb the power of heaven and earth to replenish his energy. Although it was weak, it was better than nothing.","However, this power of heaven and earth also seemed to have been frozen. There was only one word for it—cold.","Ling Han closed his eyes to rest. There were still people continuing their journey outside. This was a great opportunity for them to surpass others. If they were not careful, they could possibly die here.","One, two, there were quite a number of people who passed by this cave. Some would come in for a temporary rest, but they sat at the entrance of the cave, maintaining a very great distance from Ling Han.","One couldn’t be unguarded against others. Everyone here was a competitor.","Ling Han didn’t react at all. As long as others didn’t provoke him, he couldn’t be bothered to make a move either.","With his observations of this Mystery Realm, going out was not something that could be done in a day or two.","There was no hurry. He would take things slowly.","People came and went. Ling Han could see very clearly that those who tried to be brave all had pale faces, and a great amount of coldness was accumulated in their internal organs. Once it exploded, it would definitely be fatal.","Even if it didn’t explode, it would still bury a seed of illness, and cause endless trouble in the future.","After a while, the sky had completely darkened, and the temperature had also dropped to rock bottom. No one dared to force themselves to continue their journey, and they all sought out caves to avoid the cold.","Shua, a figure flashed past, and another person had already appeared in the cave.","Yi, ya?","Ling Han was surprised. There was actually such a coincidence in this world!","This person was actually the Seventh Imperial Prince.","“Get out!” the Seventh Imperial Prince stated calmly. His voice was not loud, but it was filled with pressure.","He was used to being an Imperial Prince. Even though he had come to the Holy Land of Metal Element, where there were many people whose backgrounds were not inferior to his, or even superior to his in fact, it was still difficult for him to restrain his arrogance.","Since he had encountered him, he would settle the score.","“Why?” Ling Han asked, his tone similarly calm.","The Seventh Imperial Prince humphed, “Either get out, or die!”","Ling Han shrugged and said, “It’s so cold outside right now, so going out will only lead to death. What difference does it make whether I go out or not? Moreover, I arrived here first, so don’t you think that’s going too far?”","“What do you mean by going too far? My abilities are stronger than yours, so I can do as I please.” The Seventh Imperial Prince was impatient, “If you do not go out, your only fate would be death. If you go out, there is still a chance of survival. Make your choice.”","Ling Han shook his head, “How would I know if your strength is not just empty boasting? Who knows, you may just be trash.”","“Fine, if you insist on courting death, I’ll oblige you!” The Seventh Imperial Prince finally became impatient. He glared at Ling Han, and Spiritual Power instantly surged out.","Ling Han only acted as if he had not noticed, and asked, “Why are you glaring at me?”","Yi?","The Seventh Imperial Prince was startled. He had shot out Spiritual Power, and his original intention was to destroy the other’s divine sense. He was an elite of Spiritual Power, and killing someone could be done with a single thought, but not only had Ling Han Han not died, he did not even have the slightest reaction. This was too strange.","He wasn’t stupid, and he immediately said with a sneer, “Fine, so you’re pretending to be a pig to eat a tiger!”","Even if the other party wasn’t an elite of Spiritual Power, he must have also cultivated a secret technique of stabilizing his divine sense, or carried a precious tool that could defend against attacks to divine sense.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “I already said that you only know how to boast. As expected.”","The Seventh Imperial Prince was unmoved. With a thought, xiu, xiu, xiu, dozens of short swords instantly appeared, slashing towards Ling Han.","Ling Han spread out his Spiritual Power to form a net, blocking all these short swords.","This wasn’t a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool, and it was completely dependent on whose Spiritual Power was stronger. The stronger one would be able to gain control.","“What!” The Seventh Imperial Prince was finally stunned. This was the most direct contest of Spiritual Power, and the result was that the other was not the slightest bit inferior to himself.","This masked man was actually also an elite of Spiritual Power!","He frowned deeply, and a sliver of regret welled up in him. If he had known earlier, he would have preferred to be a little slower, and spend the night in a cave some way behind.","Right now, the temperature had already dropped to rock bottom. If he left, he would definitely die.","“All right, I have approved of your strength. You can rest here.” The Seventh Imperial Prince nodded.","Ling Han laughed in spite of himself, “You are too funny. I was the one who came here first in the first place, so what need is there for you to give alms? Furthermore, I have not acknowledged your strength, so how could a piece of trash like you be worthy of staying with me?”","“You’re so arrogant!” the Seventh Imperial Prince said balefully.","“With strength, you naturally can be arrogant!” Ling Han moved. Xiu, xiu, xiu! The Lightning Fist was activated, and instantly, multiple punches shot towards the Seventh Imperial Prince at an incredibly fast speed.","“Yi?” The Seventh Imperial Prince’s expression was filled with surprise. Of course, he was not shocked by how powerful the Lightning Fist was. In truth, this fist technique was still quite extraordinary in the mortal level, but in the Celestial Path level, it could only be considered extremely ordinary.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have gifted it to Ling Han in the first place.","He naturally recognized this fist technique, and it was precisely because of this that he was surprised.","Could it be that it was... impossible!","That person had not set foot on the Celestial Path, and had not received any invitation either, so how could he possibly appear here?","“Have you thought of something?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“You, you, you?” The Seventh Imperial Prince’s face was filled with disbelief.","“That’s right. I’m here.” Ling Han removed his mask.","Pu, it really was him!","The Seventh Imperial Prince’s mouth was wide open, completely big enough to fit an egg.","Though he had already guessed this, he did not think that there was the slightest possibility of it, but when he saw Ling Han standing in front of him, alive and well, he was so shocked that his scalp went numb.","How was this possible?","Why had Ling Han appeared here?","Had he seen wrongly?","Had he seen a ghost?","“Why are you here?” The Seventh Imperial Prince still asked.","“You don’t have to worry about that,” Ling Han said calmly. “Now, let’s continue the previous topic. I don’t think you have the right to stay with me. Are you getting lost or not?”","“Ling Han, though your natural talent in cultivation is freakish, after advancing into Celestial Path, it is practically impossible for you to surpass your cultivation level to battle me.” The Seventh Imperial Prince attempted to convince Ling Han, “If you fight me to the death, even if you can defeat me, you yourself would not be able to gain any advantage, and would definitely be severely injured.”","In this year, he had been cultivating in the Holy Land, and had received too many benefits. He had already cultivated to the peak stage of Human Dao Foundation. Ling Han, on the other hand, must have just advanced into Celestial Path, and there was a massive gap in their cultivation levels.","“Hehe, why don’t you give it a try!” Ling Han attacked again, blasting towards the Seventh Imperial Prince.","This time, he was finally serious. A terrifying power surged. That was a power that could easily crush even a peak stage Heavenly Dao Foundation.","Peng!","With this strike, the Seventh Imperial Prince instantly threw up blood madly.","The gap in strength was as wide as could be.."]},{"number":3677,"title":"Chapter 3677: Unavoidable Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 3677: Unavoidable Death","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“How could you possibly be so strong!” The Seventh Imperial Prince said as he coughed up blood.","He was at the peak stage of Human Dao Foundation, and only needed some time to accumulate enough power, and he could already attempt to break through to Heavenly Dao Foundation.","Furthermore, above Celestial Path, the gap between prodigies would shrink considerably. He was also a one-star genius, so how could he possibly be so different from someone who had just entered Celestial Path?","He was dissatisfied. He was the son of a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and who was Ling Han? Could he compare to him?","But now, he had been easily defeated by Ling Han.","“Because I am a prodigy,” Ling Han said smilingly, and delivered a slap. Pa, the Seventh Imperial Prince once again threw up blood.","The Seventh Imperial Prince almost exploded in fury at this reply. This was really a vile character that had achieved success.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Seventh, I am very disappointed in you.”","W-what?","The Seventh Imperial Prince’s eyes widened. What kind of tone was that? Are you my elder, to actually use such a tone to speak of me?","“As your granduncle, bullying a junior like you is a bit demeaning, but who asked you to do too many bad things? Merely on account of the matter of slaughtering Huju City, I can’t possibly spare you,” Ling Han said.","The Seventh Imperial Prince was both furious and anxious. Are you treating me like your grandson?","Damn it! Damn it! He was already over a hundred years old, yet was treated as a junior by a wet-behind-the-ears brat!","“Ling Han, you want to offend your superior?” the Seventh Imperial Prince called out. He was filled with fear. This was not Celestial Sea Planet, nor was it the Imperial Capital.","Pa, Ling Han slapped him across the face, “I already told you, I am your granduncle, and you dare to speak to me in this tone?”","The Seventh Imperial Prince glared at him, “Not only have you insulted me, you have even insulted my father. How dare you, a mere Foundation Building Tier cultivator actually dares to humiliate a Spirit Transformation True Lord!”","Pa, the sound of a slap was crisp.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “Why haven’t you learnt your lesson yet? I already said that I’m your granduncle.”","The Seventh Imperial Prince glared angrily at Ling Han. He swore that once he returned to Celestial Sea Planet, he would definitely report this to Chen Fengyan. Ling Han was really unbelievably arrogant. Did he think that just because he had received the favour of the Emperor, he could do as he liked?","You were able to stand in a high position because you had gained the favour of the Emperor, but the moment you fell out of favor, you would be trash.","-Old Seventh, for Chen Fengyan’s sake, you’ve repeatedly targeted me, but I can let you off the hook for those matters,” Ling Han said with a serious expression. “However, your mistake was slaughtering Huju City. This is a complete act of inhumanity. If I spare your life, how can I face those who died unjustly?”","The Seventh Imperial Prince gaped, as if he could not believe this. After a while, he finally said, “You are actually going to kill me for the deaths of some lowly commoners?”","“Lowly commoners?” Ling Han shook his head, “You don’t understand!” There were countless living beings in the dimensions inside his body. By the standards of this world, all of them were incredibly lowly, but the combined beliefs of countless lowly people allowed Ling Han to create a miracle of cultivation. This was the power of the weak.","“You can’t kill me! You can’t!” the Seventh Imperial Prince shouted harshly. He was an Imperial Prince, an Imperial Prince!","He was filled with extreme regret. If he hadn’t wanted to capture Ling Han back then, and if he hadn’t acted without hesitation, how could he have ended up like today?","He was filled with resentment. He was an outstanding talent that was destined to do great things, and his father was also a Spirit Transformation True Lord. Yet, he had to die at the hands of a Human Dao Foundation cultivator. He felt wronged, and he felt aggrieved. He was unwilling to accept this.","-Ah!” he roared madly, his eyes glaring furiously at Ling Han, as if he wanted to kill the latter with a single look.","He didn’t want to die. He really didn’t want to die.","Ling Han was unmoved. He sent out a palm strike, and Destructive Energy boiled. With only a surge, the Seventh Imperial Prince was immediately annihilated, as if he had never existed.","Though this could not be considered a very strong opponent, Ling Han still felt an indescribable ease.","He had avenged the wronged deaths of a city’s citizens, and it was as if a burden had been lifted from his shoulders.","He closed his eyes to rest, and formation patterns floated in his mind, continuously evolving.","Now, whenever he was free, he would study formation patterns. Alchemy was no big deal to him, but he was much worse in the art of formations, though he was actually very talented in formations as well.","A night passed, and Ling Han didn’t waste any time. He cultivated for half an hour before trying to walk out of the cave.","Cold.","Ling Han shuddered upon seeing this. Even the Starlight Screen that he had channeled out was unable to resist the invasion of the frosty aura. He was unable to leave this place.","In the canyon, the sun appeared especially late. Only after more than an hour did the first ray of sunlight shine down.","Ling Han made another attempt, and this time, the coldness had subsided considerably. Though it was still very cold, it was already tolerable.","He walked out, and jumped in the snow, leaving behind deep footprints. Hu, not long after, a cold wind howled over, and the temperature instantly dropped drastically. Everyone hurriedly found a cave to avoid the cold, and returned to the rhythm of yesterday.","After walking for an entire day, Ling Han still hadn’t walked out of the valley. When night fell, he had no choice but to find a cave to spend the night in.","“Scram!” Unexpectedly, there were two other people in the cave. When they saw him, one of the men in white immediately shouted.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “It’s a big place, so one more person wouldn’t make a difference.”","“It doesn’t matter, it’s up to me to decide!” the white-robed man said with a humph. His face was filled with disdain.","Ling Han wasn’t reserved anymore, and said, “This cave isn’t owned by your family, and you want me to leave? Hehe.”","-If you don’t leave, then I’ll chase you out.” The white-robed man strode over. Boom, the violent aura in his body surged out, “A mere Human Dao Foundation, I can crush you with a single finger!”","He indeed had the right to be arrogant, because he was a one-star genius and had the cultivation level of Heavenly Dao Foundation.","A Heavenly Dao Foundation was invincible, so how could he possibly take a Human Dao Foundation cultivator seriously?","His aura alone was enough to suppress Ling Han.","However, when the surging aura surged past, it did not have the slightest effect.","-Yi?” The white-robed man showed a hint of surprise, but he immediately showed a hint of pride. If his aura could not be suppressed, he would use the cornerstone of the Celestial Path.","-Your willpower can be tempered to become incredibly tenacious, but the suppression of the foundation stone of Heavenly Dao on the foundation stone of Human Dao was the difference of cultivation level, and could not be avoided.","Weng, he released the foundation stone of the Celestial Path. Golden light flickered, and there was an endlessly powerful aura exuding from him. Competing with the foundation stones of the Celestial Path?","Ling Han also drew out his own cornerstone of the Celestial Path. The Celestial Foundation that he had built to imitate that primitive Celestial Gate was plain and unadorned, like a stubborn rock that could be seen anywhere, but the aura it exuded was enough to make an Ultimate Dao Foundation tremble.","A Human Dao Foundation actually dared to compete with him in Celestial Foundation?","The white-robed man almost spluttered in laughter, but it was only an instant, and he gave a muffled humph. Not only was his aura completely suppressed, even the cornerstone of his Celestial Path was trembling, as if it was about to shatter.","F***, what was going on here?","He hurriedly put away the foundation stone of the Celestial Path. If he continued to be exposed to Ling Han’s “firepower”, even the foundation stone of the Celestial Path would be shattered. His cultivation level would be suppressed to the mortal level.","Even so, his aura was still suppressed. He could only unleash 70% of his battle prowess at most, and this was still because his natural talent was extraordinary, and his willpower was tenacious. Otherwise, if it was another Heavenly Dao Foundation cultivator, it was possible that his battle prowess would be sliced in half, or even more.","Heavens, how could there be such a Human Dao Foundation.","“You must have come across some great opportunity. In fact, when you were building the foundation of the Celestial Path, you must have infused some incredibly powerful Divine Stone into it, and that is why a mere Human Dao Foundation would have such might!” The white-robed man regained his composure, “But no matter what, you are only a Human Dao Foundation.” He moved aggressively, grabbing out at Ling Han. Even if he could only unleash 70% of his battle prowess, he was still certain of victory.."]},{"number":3678,"title":"Chapter 3678: Extremely Two-faced","paragraphs":["Chapter 3678: Extremely Two-faced","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han bared his teeth in a grin. People always thought that he was easy to bully because of his low cultivation level, but this kind of person would usually end up in tragedy.","He clenched his fist, and greeted the other’s attack.","Peng!","The two forces collided, and the white-robed man’s body was instantly pushed back. Then, he was pushed back continuously.","What!","Putting aside the fact that he did not dare believe it, even the other yellow-robed man felt the same. His mouth was half-gaping, and he almost spluttered.","What was going on here? A weakling that was merely a Human Dao Foundation was actually able to send a one-star genius of Heavenly Dao Foundation flying with a single punch?","“Who are you?” the white-robed man asked. “Liu Jin from the Flying Star Sect? Zheng Xiaotian from the Storm Galaxy? Dao Child Han Yun from the Nine Underworlds?”","The people he was talking about were all recognized as well-known figures of the younger generation in the galaxy. It was said that they could even defeat a three-star genius at the same cultivation level. Their natural talent was unimaginably powerful.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “What is it? Do you want to form relations now?”","“Don’t be too smug. I may not lose to you!” The white-robed man was cold. Even if Ling Han was a four-star genius, he was only invincible against Heavenly Dao Foundation. He was a one-star genius of Heavenly Dao Foundation, and definitely wouldn’t lose to Ling Han.","He moved again, launching an attack at Ling Han.","This time, he was going all out, using a celestial technique. High-level energy surged out, and masses of silver seals dispersed, blasting towards Ling Han.","Ling Han merely tapped out a finger, and it was done very easily.","Celestial Crossing Finger.","This was a celestial technique, but its grade wasn’t high. Since it was given out as a reward by the Holy Land of Metal Element, it naturally couldn’t be all that valuable.","But in Ling Han’s hands, even if it was a celestial technique that was not considered a high-level celestial technique, it still exploded with astonishing might.","Pu! The white-robed man’s attack instantly crumbled as the force of Ling Han’s tap swept over. However, the force from Ling Han’s finger didn’t dissipate, continuing to attack the white-robed man.","The white-robed man hurriedly retreated. However, this cave was narrow, so he could only retreat and not dodge left and right. Thus, he actually couldn’t escape either. He could only roar and throw a series of punches. After a few consecutive punches, he finally dispersed the force of Ling Han’s finger completely.","Both he and the yellow-robed man paled in shock. How could there be such a powerful Human Dao Foundation?","Ling Han smiled, and put away the foundation stone of the Celestial Path, “Don’t say that I am bullying you.”","The cornerstone of the Celestial Path retracted, and the white-robed man was no longer suppressed. His battle prowess recovered completely.","“Arrogance!” The white-robed man humphed, yet thought that Ling Han was an idiot, not exploiting his advantage.","This should be the heir of a great sect, or even the likes of Dao Child, but it was obvious that he had just travelled the world, so his brain was still not very bright.","He couldn’t help but feel his heart throb wildly. This kind of Dao Child should possess an astonishing rare treasure, right?","He would snatch it!","He roared loudly, and charged towards Ling Han, wanting to apprehend Ling Han swiftly.","However, just as he was about to rush over, Ling Han revealed a mischievous grin.","The cornerstone of the Celestial Path had reappeared!","Instantly, the white-robed man’s strength plummeted.","‘You, f*ck, f*ck, f*ck!’","A string of curses raced through the white-robed man’s mind. To think that he had thought that Ling Han was a naive and hot-blooded youth who didn’t know how to make use of his advantages. Who would’ve thought that he was the one who was so foolish and naive?","Two-faced, he was really too f*cking two-faced, he was practically screwing him over!","Peng! Ling Han threw a punch, which landed on the white-robed man’s face. The latter screamed in pain, and instantly collapsed to the ground.","If his battle prowess had been suppressed all this while, he wouldn’t have been in such a miserable state. However, he had clearly calculated his strength, and all his attacks were based on this. Yet, the benchmark had suddenly changed. How could this not cause him to panic and lose his balance?","That was why he had said that Ling Han was screwing him over.","“You are too treacherous!” The other yellow-robed man rebuked loudly.","Ling Han shrugged, and said with a smile, “Eve thought about it. If I don’t use my advantages, I’ll be called a fool by you guys. Thus, I’ve decided not to pretend to be a fool.”","‘F*ck you,’ the white-robed man wanted to cry as Ling Han stepped on him.","As it turned out, he was the idiot here.","“Hand over all your belongings. Otherwise, I’ll throw you guys out for a breath of fresh air,” Ling Han said calmly.","You? Are you robbing us?","“What’s with that look?” Ling Han asked in displeasure. “Hurry up. My patience is limited.”","The white-robed man had no choice but to look at his companion for help.","“Sir, you have gone too far!” The yellow-robed man could not tolerate this. He drew out a sword, which was instantly activated, and instantly, a cold light flickered.","He charged towards Ling Han, wanting to save his companion.","Ling Han didn’t worry about the white-robed man fleeing. The outside of this cave could directly freeze someone to death. If he wanted to die, he could do as he liked.","He stepped hard. Peng, his figure shot out, greeting the yellow-robed man.","“Ah—” The white-robed man screamed, his expression plaintive. ‘If you want to fight, just fight. Why do you have to step on me? My bones are about to break.’","Ling Han stepped forwards, and shot out a punch.","The yellow-robed man guarded against him using the cornerstone of the Celestial Path to suppress him. This strike was actually 30% offensive and 70% defensive.","However, Ling Han had absolutely no intention of using the cornerstone of the Celestial Path to suppress others. He activated the Starlight Screen, and just like that, crashed directly into the sword light, and then punched out directly.","Peng! With a single strike, the yellow-robed man was sent flying, crashing heavily into the cave wall.","Thankfully, this mountain rock was extraordinarily sturdy. Otherwise, with such a collision, even ordinary mountains would crumble.","At first, the white-robed man had still been cursing Ling Han for being treacherous and devious, but after seeing this scene, he had completely lost all his temper.","Even if he didn’t screw him over, he was still no match for him in a head-on confrontation.","How could there be such a terrifying person?","Even if it was a four-star genius, even if he was stronger than them, he would at least have to go through a tough battle to be able to defeat them. How could it be so easy?","A five, five-star genius?","“I’ll repeat it again. It’s a robbery,” Ling Han said with a smile.","The two of them yielded. This gap in strength was really too wide. They were completely no match for him.","Those who understood practicality were prodigies.","They all took out their Spatial Spirit Tool, and handed them over to Ling Han.","Ling Han accepted it, and swept a glance over it with his divine sense. Involuntarily, he couldn’t help but smile in satisfaction, “Not bad, not bad. Your background is quite rich.”","The two of them wanted to cry. They had really never seen such a prodigy actually rob someone in such a public setting.","Did he have any shame?","But looking at the mask on Ling Han’s face, it was clear that this guy was shameless.","They didn’t dare to make a sound. Right now, Ling Han was only trying to rob them of their wealth. What if he wanted to kill them?","Ling Han naturally didn’t hold back, occupying a spot deep inside the cave. He had the white-robed and yellow-robed men stand guard outside, while he closed his eyes to rest.","Seeing how Ling Han looked like he was sleeping soundly, the white-robed man and his companion were both slightly tempted. Should they take the chance to make a move and kill Ling Han? Not only would they be able to take back their losses, they would also be able to take revenge.","But when they recalled the gap in strength between them and Ling Han, they exchanged a look, and both shook their heads, dismissing this wonderful idea.","What if this was a trap that Ling Han had dug out for them?","This wouldn’t be the first time that they had been tricked.."]},{"number":3679,"title":"Chapter 3679: What a coincidence","paragraphs":["Chapter 3679: What a coincidence","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The night passed, and the sun had just risen.","Whether it was Ling Han or the other two men, they were all sitting cross-legged and cultivating.","Sitting cross-legged was only a common form of cultivation. It did not mean that this was absolutely necessary for cultivation. Some people were used to cultivating while running. Unless there was a special restriction on cultivation techniques, they could completely choose any form they liked when cultivating.","Ordinarily speaking, this kind of cross-legged position was the most suitable for calming one’s mental state, so it was the most widely used.","After the cultivation ended, the two men’s expressions were filled with anxiety. They couldn’t wait for the sunlight to shine on them, so that they could leave Ling Han in time. If they stayed for another second, they were afraid that they would be screwed over again.","Thus, when the first ray of sunlight shone over, the two of them ran as if their behinds had been bitten by a dog.","Was he really that terrifying?","Ling Han reflected for a moment, smiled, and also left through the cave.","This canyon was astonishingly long, and their speed was really too slow. Another day passed, and Ling Han still found a cave to avoid the cold. This time, he found a cave with no one, but very soon, someone appeared, his attitude domineering, demanding that he get out.","Against this kind of person, Ling Han did not have any reservations. He directly moved to suppress them, then ransacked them. His gains were not too bad.","He couldn’t help but feel his heart palpitate. This was a way to earn money.","In the next few days, he encountered a great many ignorant people, and the result was the same. They were all suppressed by him, robbed, and there was no exception.","Soon, there was a legend in the valley. There was a masked man who specialized in robbery, and his actions were extremely terrible.","This caused the other people who were also wearing masks to unfortunately be implicated, and besieged by a great many people. That was because everyone knew that this masked man was very “rich”.","Ling Han was naturally no exception either. He was targeted by some people, but he could oppose even Ultimate Dao Foundation, so who would he be afraid of?","Another five days later, they finally walked out of this canyon.","The temperature rapidly rose again. Though it was still a world of ice and snow, it was already within tolerable limits. There was no cold wind that assaulted them, forcing them to find a cave to hide in.","This was a plain that was not too big, and there was a tall mountain ahead of them.","There was an Ice Origin Stone on the mountain!","Ling Han sped up. This was a treasure that he was determined to obtain. With the help of the Ice Origin Stone, the empress and the others could quickly catch up to him in terms of cultivation level.","Of course, they didn’t need to cultivate Seventh Change,, Seventh Inscriptions, and so on. Added with Ling Han’s help, the time needed to advance into Celestial Path would definitely be much shorter than Ling Han’s.","Previously, Ling Han’s speed could not be considered fast. Thus, after arriving here, he began to speed up.","Half a day later, he arrived at the summit.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He had not even gotten close, when the sounds of battle were heard. Ling Han walked a few more steps, and saw that there were presently seven people engaged in a great battle. However, it was not a battle royale, but rather six against one.","The person who had been beaten... yi, the Eldest Imperial Prince.","The Eldest Imperial Prince was not weak. In any case, he was still a one-star genius. Although it was only ninth grade, his Divine Physique was still a Divine Physique, after all. During his burst of power, even a one-star genius wouldn’t dare to face him head-on.","However, he had too many opponents now, and all of them were not much weaker than him. If six of them attacked at the same time, the Eldest Imperial Prince would not be able to hold on any longer. Even if he used the Azure Star Physique, it was useless. Blood was continuously spraying from his body.","If it was not for the fact that the six of them were also wary of the Eldest Imperial Prince fighting to the death against one of them, and did not dare to push too hard, they believed that the Eldest Imperial Prince would definitely not be able to hold on for so long.","“What’s the point?” someone said. “You’re destined to fail, so why don’t you hand over the Ice Origin Stone and spare yourself the physical pain?”","“It’s not worth sacrificing one’s life for an Ice Origin Stone,” another person said.","Indeed, there was no need for them to commit murder. Thus, as long as the Eldest Imperial Prince was willing to withdraw, they would also be happy to have less trouble.","The Eldest Imperial Prince did not speak, and merely attacked with all his might, wanting to carve out a path of blood.","However, the six of them were really not weak. Each of them guarded a specific direction, and that was to exhaust the explosive power of his Divine Physique. As long as this period of time was dragged out, the Eldest Imperial Prince would be like a piece of cake for them.","The Eldest Imperial Prince obviously knew this as well. He barged around recklessly. If this burst of power was dragged out, then he would decisively admit defeat. The Ice Origin Stone was naturally not as important as his life.","Ling Han shook his head, and strode over.","The appearance of a stranger naturally attracted the attention of the seven people in the battle, but when they discovered that Ling Han was only a Human Dao Foundation, they all withdrew their attention.","Because they were all Heavenly Dao Foundation cultivators, even if they had just broken through not too long ago, compared to Human Dao Foundation, one was like the heavens, and the other was like the earth. There was absolutely no need to care.","Without another word, Ling Han directly charged into the battle.","“How dare you!”","“A mere Human Dao Foundation dares to interfere?”","“Get lost!”","The six people in the battle all launched attacks at Ling Han. Firstly, it was difficult for the Eldest Imperial Prince to even protect himself, and secondly, he hoped that someone would come out and cause trouble. Only then would he have a chance to escape. Then, it was naturally impossible for him to make a move on Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly as he activated the Celestial Crossing Finger. Xiu, xiu, xiu! He continued to unleash finger attacks at the six people.","“What!”","“Not good!”","“How could the Celestial Crossing Finger have such powerful might?”","The six of them all exclaimed in shock. No one had expected that Ling Han’s strength would actually be so strong. To say nothing of being able to match Heavenly Dao Foundation, he wouldn’t be at a disadvantage even if it was one against six.","A freak, a super freak.","They all exploded one after another, unleashing their strongest techniques, but in front of Ling Han, all this was in vain.","In fact, Ling Han had only channeled an ordinary Celestial Crossing Finger.","In just a few minutes, the six of them were beaten to the ground by Ling Han.","The Eldest Imperial Prince was slightly stunned. The other was too strong, that even he did not dare to flee.","Most importantly, he knew that he couldn’t escape, and once he offended Ling Han, Ling Han’s terrifying battle prowess was something that he couldn’t match. Who knows, it might bring about a fatal disaster.","“Thank you for your help, sir.” The Eldest Imperial Prince raised his clasped hands in Ling Han’s direction.","Ling Han nodded, “Though I don’t like the look of you, as your elder, there is no reason for me to just stand by and watch as you are bullied.”","Instantly, the Eldest Imperial Prince’s face was unhappy. You are my f****** elder?","My father is a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and you have only just entered into Celestial Path. How could that be possible?","However, he had just been saved by Ling Han, after all, so he couldn’t bring himself to glare back at him. Thus, he simply kept quiet, and only cursed Ling Han in his mind, though he didn’t know who Ling Han was either.","Ling Han chuckled, and said to the six people that were lying down, “Hand over all your Spatial Spirit Tools.”","The six of them faltered, then immediately came to their senses.","“You’re that great thief!” they exclaimed in unison.","Who would have thought that this great thief was only a Human Dao Foundation cultivator? However, the strength of his battle prowess was truly astounding.","“Since you know who I am, hurry up,” Ling Han said impatiently with a wave of his hand.","The six of them were exasperated, so they could only take out their Spatial Spirit Tools and hand them over to Ling Han. Money was only a worldly possession, so how could it be more important than their lives?","“And you as well.” Ling Han looked towards the Eldest Imperial Prince.","W-what?","The Eldest Imperial Prince was instantly dumbfounded.."]},{"number":3680,"title":"Chapter 3680: Even robbing me?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3680: Even robbing me?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","‘Aren’t you my elder? Didn’t you come to save me?’","Why was it that even he wanted to rob him now?","The Eldest Imperial Prince gaped widely, an expression of disbelief on his face.","He had never seen this kind of “elder” before. He even wanted to rob his own juniors. F***.","“What is it? Reluctant?” Ling Han glared at him, “If I had not saved you, would you have been able to save your own life? Furthermore, what if one of these people has a special fondness for a$$-r@ping? Just think, how terrible would that be?”","The other six hurriedly shook their heads. None of them had any abnormal sexual orientation. They definitely would not be interested in a man’s a**.","Ling Han looked at the six of them balefully, yet said calmly, “You guys have to think carefully. Are you interested in men or not?”","This... was a blatant threat.","The six of them had no choice but to nod. Looking at how Ling Han was acting, he was going to make a move at the slightest disagreement.","Forget it. For the sake of their own life, they had best make a sacrifice. In any case, no one would know.","They all nodded instead of shaking their heads.","“Hiss, so many gays!” Ling Han pretended to be stunned, then clapped a hand on the Eldest Imperial Prince’s shoulder, “I had thought that there was only one gay, but I had not thought that all six of them were gays. You see, it was fortunate that I had saved you, wasn’t it? Otherwise, if you had been ganged up on by so many people, just how miserable would you be?”","The Eldest Imperial Prince’s mouth was half-gaping. F***, there was absolutely no one that was interested in his a**. It was all forced out by you, all right?","But faced with Ling Han’s “abuse of authority”, what could he say?","He obediently handed over the Ice Origin Stone. Otherwise, if Ling Han searched him, he wouldn’t be able to keep it either.","Thus, he might as well take the initiative himself.","Ling Han broke into a smile, then patted the Eldest Imperial Prince’s shoulder, and said to the other six people, “This is my grand nephew. You all have to be more polite, or I will cause trouble for you at any time.”","The Eldest Imperial Prince’s expression was dark. Though he had not been beaten, the displeasure in his heart was not much inferior to the other six.","“Alright, I’m leaving. You don’t have to see me out.” Ling Han strode off.","Who would see you our? Who the hell would be seeing you out!","Including the Eldest Imperial Prince, everyone wanted nothing more than to rush up and stomp on Ling Han, but in reality, they could only watch as he left.","Ling Han continued to advance. By now, he should be the person walking in front, heading towards the second peak.","“Who would’ve thought? The Eldest Imperial Prince has actually advanced into the Heavenly Dao Foundation.”","“This cultivation speed is so fast!”","“Without enough Treasured Fruits of Life, how did he charge up?”","“Were they given by the Holy Land?”","“From this aspect, the Holy Lands are really willing to sacrifice a lot.”","“However, looking at the cruelty of this competition, it doesn’t seem to match the selection of talented people.”","“What on earth are they planning?”","Ling Han thought as he walked, but he wasn’t a roundworm in the Holy Land of Metal Element’s stomach, so how could he possibly know?","A day later, he arrived at the top of the second mountain peak.","The summit was very flat, covered with pure white snow, and in the snow, there was a large rock that stuck out extraordinarily, and there were a few small rocks that looked like ice cubes piled on top of it.","“Ice Origin Stone.”","Ling Han strode over, but after a few steps, he stopped in his tracks.","“It’s protected by a formation!”","He murmured. Though he had not grasped Celestial Path Tier-level formation techniques, it was a piece of cake for him to discover the existence of a formation.","“Extraordinary.” Ling Han waved his hand, and instantly, patches of accumulated snow were sent flying, revealing the ground.","With the large rock as the centre, the ground was covered densely with multiple silver veined patterns. There seemed to be no pattern to it, but upon closer look, it seemed to conform to some kind of principle, causing one to be captivated and want to comprehend it.","Ling Han threw a rock over. The rock had not even landed, when a ray of light shot out. Pa, the rock was shattered.","“Judging by this attack, its might is probably the peak stage of the Ultimate Dao Foundation.”","Ling Han walked forwards in a daze. Merely by looking at it like this, there was no way he would be able to unravel the formation in this lifetime.","When he stepped onto the silver veined pattern, xiu, a flash of light instantly blasted towards him.","Ling Han clenched a fist to counter. Peng! The ray of light was instantly extinguished, but he also felt a slight pain in his fist, allowing him to directly realize that the battle prowess of the peak stage of Ultimate Dao Foundation should be able to match him.","However, before he could advance, xiu, xiu, xiu, three streaks of light shot out at the same time, striking towards him again.","These lights were all emitted from the veined patterns on the ground, so they were all from below, but from different angles.","Ling Han was unafraid, throwing punches continuously.","Peng, peng, peng! With just three punches, he destroyed the three attacks again.","However, before the first wave was over, another wave rose, and another nine streaks of light shot over.","Was there really no end to it?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel interested. If he only wanted to study the secret of formations, he would die in the end. Now that he had entered into the formation, he thought that he could use this as a reference, and that should be able to enlighten him faster.","He activated the Starlight Screen, and xiu, xiu, xiu! Rays of light shot over. However, after they collided with the Starlight Screen, they all shattered, unable to take another step forward.","However, the Starlight Screen wasn’t omnipotent. After suffering nine attacks, cracks appeared on the light screen, and Ling Han needed to use his mystical power to repair them. The cracks quickly disappeared, and the price was naturally expending Ling Han’s mystical power.","The nine streaks of light were blocked, and next... there were 27 streaks of light!","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Rays of light shot out in unison. This time, they were much fiercer. Though they were all blocked by the Starlight Screen, the light screen also crumbled after it blocked them. There was absolutely no chance to mend it.","The mystical power used to repair the light screen was far smaller than activating the Starlight Screen again. Of course, what Ling Han lacked the least was mystical power reserves, which could completely challenge the mystical power of a Spirit Transformation True Lord.","After 21 flashes of light, there were 63 flashes!","This time, Ling Han didn’t dare to parry. He hurriedly retreated, or he would be riddled with holes.","Interesting.","Ling Han stepped into the formation again. This time, the light that he shot out became a single streak again, beginning a new cycle.","He knew that if he activated the Imminent Skyline, he would only be able to sustain three waves of light at most. In other words, he would only need to sustain nine beams of light at most. The Starlight Screen would be able to block all of them.","However, after taking away the Ice Origin Stone, would this formation still be effective?","Because this could possibly be a formation eye, the formation’s core. Once the core was gone, the formation’s might would naturally be gone.","For the sake of studying formations, Ling Han decided not to take the Ice Origin Stone first. In any case, it was his.","He walked onto the formation from different angles, and continuously attempted to do so.","As expected, leaning in isolation was far inferior to actual practice. Enlightenment continuously rose up in Ling Han’s heart. He felt that in another two to three days, he would definitely be able to master this formation.","And with the comprehension of one technique, it would aid comprehension of all techniques, and he would really have gained rudimentary mastery of formations.","Half a day passed very quickly.","Xiu, a figure suddenly leaped out, arriving at the summit.","This was a young man with a dignified aura. He was tall and sturdy, and his hair was very short, only an inch long. He exuded a capable and experienced aura.","“Scram!” He stared at Ling Han and spat out a word.."]},{"number":3681,"title":"Chapter 3681: Battling Ultimate Dao Foundation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3681: Battling Ultimate Dao Foundation","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was currently studying formation techniques, and was completely focused. How could he be in the mood to pay attention to him?","The sturdy man couldn’t help but show a hint of anger, and said, “Are you seeking death?”","Lmg Han still ignored him. He was presently at a crucial point. Once he comprehended this stage, his grasp of this formation would definitely improve greatly.","“Howdare you!” the man roared in fury. He raised his palm and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Xiu, it just so happened that Ling Han had activated the formation, and 27 flashes of light shot out, shattering his Starlight Screen. Thus, faced with the blow from the sturdy man, Ling Han could only raise his fist in response, or he would be injured.","Peng! The punch landed, and that person’s palm strike was shattered. However, Ling Han also frowned slightly. Under the rebound of power, his fist hurt slightly.","He stepped out of the formation, and looked at the sturdy man, feeling very displeased.","Being disturbed by the other party, his thoughts were interrupted, and it just happened to be at this point, causing him to waste at least an hour’s time.","Humph, if you can’t crack the formation, then get lost!” the sturdy man said coldly.","Ling Han cocked his head at him, and said, “I’m in a bad mood right now.”","“So what? Do you want to hit me?” The sturdy man humphed. His name was Nangong Lin, and he was a one-star genius that had attained Ultimate Dao Foundation. If he hadn’t been tied down by a matter previously, how could he have come here so late?","However, it didn’t matter. He was already walking at the forefront, and all the Ice Origin Stones that came after would belong to him.","Beat you to the point that even your mother can’t recognize you.” Ling Han rushed out. He was presently in a very bad mood. He definitely had to find someone and give him a beating.","“A mere Human Dao Foundation dares to be insolent in front of me.” Nangong Lin smirked coldly, and pressed out a hand, intending to apprehend Ling Han. Boom, the two forces crashed into each other, instantly forming a great storm. Ling Han and Nangong Lin both took a few steps back at the same time, but if one were to compare, they would discover that Ling Han had taken a few more steps back.","He was already freakish. He was only in Human Dao Foundation, yet he was already capable of matching the peak stage of Ultimate Dao Foundation. However, no matter what, Nangong Lin was still a one-star genius. Logically speaking, he could be considered invincible in Ultimate Dao Foundation, so he was naturally stronger than Ling Han. Otherwise, there would really be no justice.","“En?” Nangong Lin’s expression suddenly became serious, but he immediately came to a realization, “I almost fell for your trick. You are definitely not Human Dao Foundation, but rather peak stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation, or even Ultimate Dao Foundation.”","How could there be such a strong Human Dao Foundation? Wouldn’t that have to be a six-star genius?","Looking at the galaxy nearby-not planets, the number of four-star geniuses wouldn’t exceed ten people, while six-star geniuses? Hehe.","“How devious. Are you trying to screw me over?” Nangong Lin looked furious. If he wasn’t Ultimate Dao Foundation, and was only building Heavenly Dao Foundation, would he have fallen into the latter’s trap due to his carelessness? Screw your sister!” Ling Han charged over again, and was still attacking head-on.","It didn’t matter that his power was slightly inferior. This wasn’t all of his battle prowess.","Ling Han unleashed the Celestial Crossing Finger. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Streaks of finger power shot toward Nangong Lin.","“Celestial Crossing Finger? Haha!” Nangong Lin smirked coldly, “Using such a weak celestial technique, Celestial Crossing Finger, to deal with me, where did you get such courage from?”","He also channeled a celestial technique. Multiple seals shone brilliantly, and as expected, the battle prowess he exploded with was even above Ling Han, immediately suppressing Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t say anything. He wanted to defeat his opponent with the Celestial Crossing Finger, an ordinary celestial technique.","He activated his eye technique, and instantly, the surroundings appeared in another form in front of him.","Nangong Lin delivered a strike, and brilliance filled the skies, completely concealing the course of his attack. It had a strong confusion effect, and this was also the unique trait of the majority of celestial techniques. They would use this kind of method to hide the course of attack.","However, after Lmg Han activated his eye technique, no matter how brilliant the light was, it couldn’t cover his eyes.","Xiu, he tapped out a finger, and the force just happened to pass through the gap in Nangong Lin’s attack, and shot towards the latter’s neck.","Nangong Lin had never imagined that this attack would come. However, he was a one-star genius that had formed Ultimate Dao Foundation, after all. Thus, his ability to adapt was naturally powerful. He hurriedly turned his head to the ‘ side, dodging this attack.","Pu, blood spurted from the side of his neck, and he still did not manage to completely dodge this blow.","He flew into a thunderous rage. Just now, he had still been belittling Ling Han. In the end, Ling Han immediately made him bleed with a single strike.","This was a slap to the face.","He roared loudly. Boom! High-level energy surged, and he charged towards","Ling Han with black-colored energy.","Ling Han unleashed a barrage of murderous aura. Weng! Nangong Lin was instantly affected, and his attacks instantly became sluggish.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The Celestial Crossing Finger shot out, aimed directly at the weakest point of Nangong Ling’s defense.","Nangong Lin had no choice but to switch to defense. He would first deal with","the threat from the Celestial Crossing Finger.","He wanted to counterattack again, but the moment he launched an attack, he would be suppressed by the barrage of murderous aura, and could only be’ forced to switch to defense.","Combined with the barrage of murderous aura and eye technique, the Celestial Crossing Finger, an ordinary celestial technique, released a brilliant light.","Who would still dare to say that the Celestial Crossing Finger was not good enough?","Pu! Pu! Pu!","Nangong Lin was still continuously hit. Though it was only some superficial wounds, with some blood splashing out, it still caused him to fly into a thunderous rage.","“What about the Celestial Crossing Finger?” Ling Han asked calmly.","Nangong Lin was speechless. Although he knew that this wasn’t because the Celestial Crossing Finger was extraordinary, but rather because Ling Han had a technique that could affect his mind. Moreover, Ling Han’s insight was especially good, and he could always see through his attacks.","But so what? Wasn’t this Ling Han’s strength?","He wasn’t so shameless that he would demand that Ling Han could only battle","him with the Celestial Crossing Finger.","“Don’t be happy too soon,” Nangong Lin said coldly. He shook lightly, and a flash of white light surged out from his body. Then, it turned into a small white jade-like tower, glowing with light.","This was his precious tool, and it was quite extraordinary. It was forged from a Three Star material, and had great room for improvement. In future, when he became a great elite of Core Formation Tier, this white jade tower would naturally become a precious tool of Core Formation Tier-level.","Of course, this would need a very long time. Even if he was very confident, that","day would have to be at least a hundred years later.","How powerful would a One Star precious tool forged from a Three Star material be?","It was naturally no issue for him to sweep aside all his peers.","Weng, the precious tower trembled slightly, and an indescribable might circulated. It was like a great elite had severed his own cultivation level to cultivate again. Though his abilities would be limited by his cultivation level, in terms of quality, he had a crushing advantage.","Humph!” Nangong Lin regained his confidence, his expression filled with arrogance.","Lmg Han couldn’t help but wear a strange expression. A tower-shaped precious tool?","The Black Tower hated tower-shaped precious tools the most. After such a long time, Ling Han would naturally be affected as well.","Then let’s have a competition!","Ling Han also summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which floated above his head and exuded wisps of precious aura. However, because the precious tool kept a low profile, he couldn’t see anything special about it.","“You think you’re worthy of using a tower-shaped precious tool?” Nangong Lin sneered. “Go!” he shouted lightly, and immediately steered the precious tower towards Ling Han.","This was forged from a Three Star material, let’s see if I won’t smash you to death!"]},{"number":3682,"title":"Chapter 3682: Comprehending formations","paragraphs":["Chapter 3682: Comprehending formations","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Weng, the white jade tower spun lightly, yet was pressing down at an extremely fast speed.","This was forged from a Three Star material, and was naturally not something that an ordinary One Star precious tool could compare to. Immediately, a terrifying pressure pressed down on him. This was the might of the material itself, which was enough to suppress all One Star Spirit Tools.","However, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower wasn’t affected at all.","How was this possible!","Nangong Lin’s jaw dropped. He could not believe this at all.","This was his White Jade Demon Suppression Tower, forged from a Three Star material, and added with the fact that he had been tempering it day and night with his cultivation level of Ultimate Dao Foundation, to be fair, even he was no match for it.","But now?","It was completely ineffective!","He didn’t know that this was still because Ling Han had the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower keep a low profile. Otherwise, with the might of the Origin Gold, it could completely suppress three-star ingredients in terms of quality, and it wasn’t impossible for it to make a three-star material self- destruct even.","The world was huge, and of all the ingredients, the Origin Gold was naturally the most superior. It was the ruler of all weapons, and could suppress all Divine Metals.","“Come, you want to compete in Spirit Tools? I’ll oblige you!” With a thought from Ling Han, zi, a bolt of lightning immediately shot out from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, shooting towards Nangong Lin.","This strike was extraordinarily fast!","What kind of existence was the Origin Gold?","One that could forge Imperial Weapons!","Even if it was only a One Star Spirit Tool, it was still an overlord of this level. This attack was so fast that no Foundation Building Tier cultivator could dodge it. Otherwise, the Origin Gold was really not living up to its name.","Nangong Lin was instantly hit. A powerful electric current surged over, and he felt his whole body tremble. It was so uncomfortable that he wanted to vomit out the food in his stomach.","He hurriedly summoned the White Jade Tower back, pouring down energy to protect him.","When Ling Han saw this, he couldn’t help but laugh loudly. That was because Nangong Lin had been completely charred by this lightning bolt. He could even smell the fragrance of the meat.","This bolt of lightning was not a technique that he had instilled into it, but rather the might that came with the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This piece of Origin Gold was nurtured in Primal Chaos, and tempered in the pool of electricity. By nature, it had two effects.","Unfortunately, because Ling Han’s divine sense had been infused into the Origin Gold, the might of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower would also be affected by Ling Han’s cultivation level. Otherwise, with the might of the Origin Gold, even Saints could be killed.","Nangong Lin looked at Ling Han. He was a little confused at this moment.","The opponent in front of him was too strange.","From a level of being, it looked like he was Human Dao Foundation, but his battle prowess was not weaker than even him. Comparing Spirit Tools, his White Jade Demon Suppression Tower that was forged from three-star materials was actually unable to suppress him. This was extremely inconceivable.","“Go!” He was naturally unwilling to give up. He pointed a finger at Ling Han, and the white jade tower immediately shot out a ray of light, which turned into a flying sword that slashed towards Ling Han.","Peng!","The flying sword struck the precious Qi of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Not only did it not manage to penetrate it, it directly shattered by itself.","p* * *","Nangong Lin was dumbfounded. He stared blankly at Ling Han.","That attack just now was definitely a direct confrontation between the two precious tools, and the result was... the complete defeat of the White Jade Demon Suppression Tower.","A precious tool forged from three-star materials had actually been completely defeated?","Nangong Lin’s heart trembled madly. Then there was only one possibility, and that was the material used to forge that precious tool of his was above three stars.","Heavens, was it a True Self Tier-level material, or... Spirit Transformation Tier?","Nangong Lin couldn’t help but feel greedy. To say nothing of him, even True Self Tier and Spirit Transformation True Lords would go crazy for this kind of material.","“Hehe, if it’s not yours, then don’t think too much about it.” Ling Han charged over, launching a series of attacks.","This time, Ling Han didn’t use the Celestial Crossing Finger anymore. Instead, he used the Demonic Monkey Fists. Boom! A terrifying aura rolled out, and a Demonic Monkeyappeared. It was nine meters tall, and roared as it pounced at Nangong Lin.","Zi, zi, zi! Multiple arcs of lightning also shot out from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, launching a second attack at Nangong Lin.","Nangong Lin hurriedly channeled the White Jade Tower to defend himself. However, this could block the power of the Demonic Monkey Fists, yet it couldn’ t block the Primordial Demonic Monkey that had manifested. It continuously attacked his mind, making him feel extremely uncomfortable.","Meanwhile, the lightning of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could not be blocked, and he could only slice off a portion of its might. It still electrocuted Nangong Lin to the point that his whole body went numb, and he was close to death.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and his attacks were like a wild storm, soon blasting Nangong Lin to the ground.","So what if he was Ultimate Dao Foundation?","Ling Han was not reserved at all, and searched Nangong Lin. The White Jade Demon Suppression Tower was naturally not spared either. This was a Three Star material, and if he sold it to a Core Formation Tier elite, he could completely melt it and reforge it, immediately becoming a precious tool of the Core Formation Tier.","This could be sold for a high price.","“Give me back my precious tower!” Nangong Lin lay on the ground, his face filled with fury.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “If you are not convinced, you can come and seek me out for revenge in future. I will not change my surname, nor will I change my name. Niu Jianhua.”","In any case, he was wearing a mask, so no one recognized him.","“You’re that masked thief!” Realization dawned on Nangong Lin.","“It’s your Grandpa Niu!” Ling Han knocked Nangong Lin unconscious with a single slap.","En, should he wear the Battle Armor that he had snatched from Niu Jianhua in the future? Wouldn’t that make him even more similar?","Ling Han continued to study the formation technique, stimulating the formation technique to attack him, thus allowing the formation technique to appear and allow him to study it.","In a short while, another person ran over, but when he saw Nangong Lin lying on the ground, that person resolutely did not make a move on Ling Han. Instead, he circled around him.","—Nangong Lin was really too miserable. He had been stripped to the point that he was only wearing underpants.","After this, more and more people came up. Most of them would directly take a detour when they saw Nangong Lin, but there were also a few people who thought that they were extraordinary, and thought that they were stronger than Nangong Lin. In the end, it was naturally impossible for them to escape the fate of being beaten down. They were placed together with Nangong Lin, and all the treasures were plundered.","When night fell, there were a total of eleven people piled up, which was quite a large number.","At this time, no one else dared to make a move on Ling Han. Those 11 half- naked men were really too intimidating.","The night at the summit was also very cold, but it had not reached the point of freezing one to death. Ling Han was still studying the formation technique. The enlightenment in his heart continued to arise, and he felt that he was not far from a breakthrough.","The night passed, and the sun rose.","If one stood on the mountaintop, they would be able to see the sun rise and the first rays of the morning sun descended. Instantly, the darkness receded like a tidal wave.","Ling Han was at a critical moment. He temporarily set aside his cultivation and continued to study the formation.","Another day and a half passed, and he suddenly released a long bout of laughter.","He had comprehended, not only this formation, but also the art of formations itself. It was a comprehension of everything.","“Come!”","He stepped down, and instantly, a ball of light spread out from the sole of his foot, turning into a dozen over veined patterns, intertwining with those veined patterns on the ground. He took another step, yet the entire formation had no reaction at all.","He had temporarily suppressed this formation.","Ling Han walked over and easily took away the Ice Origin Stone. Once the Ice Origin Stone was gone, the glowing veined patterns on the ground immediately dimmed.","As expected, the Ice Origin Stone was the formation eye, and once it was taken away, the formation would lose its effect."]},{"number":3683,"title":"Chapter 3683: Silver Dragon Fish","paragraphs":["Chapter 3683: Silver Dragon Fish","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor. Henyee Translations","After obtaining Ice Origin Stones and stepping on the path of formations, Ling","Han was extremely happy.","He laughed loudly, and strode off.","There were still many mountain peaks here, and he should be able to obtain a great many Ice Origin Stones.","Ling Han leaped up and sped down the mountain. The gravity here was still very strong, and Foundation Building Tier cultivators couldn’t fly. Of course, if Ling Han didn’t mind exposing the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, then flying wouldn’t be a problem.","Not long after, he arrived at the second mountain peak.","However, the Ice Origin Stone here had already been taken, and Ling Han could still sense the faint aura of the formation.","He paced around on the formation, injecting power into it one after another. There was mystical power and Spiritual Power, and after a few steps, the already dim veined patterns on the ground all lit up, as if the formation had come back to life.","This was not just an appearance, but had really happened.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face as he activated the formation again.","However, there was no formation eye, so activating it was only temporary. When the power he injected was exhausted, the formation would naturally dim again.","“Now, I can only be so calm after activating the formations that are already there.When I can change the landscape with a single stomp and form a formation, that would be awesome.”","Ling Han mused ruefully, but he was really too far away from this step. That could be called a Formation Grandmaster, and now?","He had just crossed the threshold.","He continued to advance, but after descending this mountain, a fork appeared ahead of him. There were a total of three paths that he could take.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before deciding to take the first option. He strode forwards. After walking for about half an hour, a lake appeared ahead of him, and beside the lake, there was a large group of people surrounding it. Some were even attacking the lake, and with a boom, there was a huge splash.","What were they doing?","Ling Han walked over, patted the shoulder of the person beside him, and asked, “Brother, what are you guys doing?”","The person was given a fright. Ling Han had actually approached him soundlessly, and he had only reacted after a tap on his shoulder?","If Ling Han wanted to kill him, then wouldn’t he already be dead? Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. However, he didn’t dare to show the slightest bit of anger on his face, fearing that Ling Han would really kill him in a fit of anger.","“There are Silver Dragon Fish here,” he said honestly.","“What’s that?” Ling Han muttered. He had only made up for his knowledge of alchemy. Basically, he could recognize all medicinal ingredients and alchemical pills with a single glance. In fact, even if they were ground into dust, he only needed to smell them.","But as for other things, his knowledge was limited. After all, his energy was","also limited.","That person really wanted to roll his eyes. You don’t even know Silver Dragon Fish, so how did you manage to reach Foundation Building Tier?","He only dared to say this in his heart, but said, “The Silver Dragon Fish is completely silver, and swims in the water like a shrunken True Dragon, which is why it has the name of Silver Dragon Fish. And the Silver Dragon Fish can increase cultivation level. Though it is not instantaneous, it would be reflected slowly in future, and the effects would be astonishing.”","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’. No wonder so many people were blasting madly at the lake waters. As expected, they had ulterior motives.","“Why don’t you just dive in and capture them?” he asked again. “Sigh, who doesn’t want to?” That person shookhis head, “But there’s nothing to be done. This lake water looks to be flowing, and has not frozen over, but the temperature is astonishingly low. If you jump in, you would directly freeze all the blood in your body, and sink to the bottom.”","“Even if you can rely on a rare treasure to resist the cold, those Silver Dragon Fish are swimming very quickly in the water, much faster than us.","Ling Han nodded. Before he could decide whether to go into the water to catch fish or continue forward, he saw that a few people had actually walked back.","When he asked, he found out that there was no path ahead.","How could there be no path?","As it turned out, there was a large gate blocking the path ahead of them, and the large gate could not be touched at all. The power of lightning was seeping out, and they could not climb over it no matter how hard they tried. There were only two options: one, go back the way they had come, or two, find the key, because there was a lock on the door.","“Since this is a test set by the Holy Land of Metal Element, there must be a key? that can open the lock. We came back to mobilize everyone to search for clues,” one of the returning people said.","However, only a few people responded. Since so many people chose to stay here to catch the Silver Dragon Fish, how could they just set aside the Sliver Dragon Fish and search for the key?","Who knew if it even existed?","“Who knows, there may not be any key at all. This is a dead end, and we would have to go through another path,” someone said.","The few people who had returned previously decided to turn around and explore the other two paths.","The people left behind could very easily choose. If those few people did not return all this while, it meant that the other two options were a way out – at least, one of them had to be the way out.","Thus, everyone continued to fish.","Yet a thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind. Could this key be in the lake?","Otherwise, the appearance of this lake would have been far too abrupt.","Let’s look around.","He arrived at the banks of the lake. He had not even entered into the water, when a baleful coldness was already bearing down on him.","“A mere Human Dao Foundation, get lost,” someone immediately shouted at him.","This was a man, but his appearance was interesting, because the eyebrows of others were all linear, and as for his? They were small circles.","There was another person beside him, who also looked interesting. His hair was actually divided into three areas, and he had tied it into three braids.","“Yi, a masked man?” The braided man asked in surprise, “Could it be that great thief?”","“How could that be? A mere Human Dao Foundation,” the man with the eyebrow said disdainfully.","“True,” the braided man nodded.","Tm really sorry. My cultivation level is too low. 1","Ling Han couldn’t help but rub his chin in shock. Could such a low cultivation level also become a point of mockery?","“Are you still not getting lost?” The man with the eyebrows was getting impatient, and delivered a palm strike towards Ling Han, wanting to blast him into the lake.","Ling Han raised a brow, and also delivered a palm strike.","Peng!","A powerful energy fluctuation overflowed, and various seals exploded madly.","The man with the eyebrows collapsed to the ground.","“Ah— 11 he screamed, blood gushing from his body.","The braided man watched with fear and trepidation. How could this be a Human Dao Foundation? Was there such a powerful Human Dao Foundation? This guy must be a Heavenly Dao Foundation or even in fact Ultimate Dao Foundation, and then used a special cultivation technique or precious tool to change the fluctuation of his vital signs. That was why he looked like a Human Dao Foundation.","Ling Han didn’t say another word. He first plundered the browed man clean, then threw him into the lake.","“I’m about to die from the cold!” the man with the eyebrows screamed. Ignoring the pain all over his body, he hurriedly used all four of his limbs and swam up from the lake.","Thankfully, Ling Han had no intention of killing him. Otherwise, as long as he didn’t let him ashore, the man with the eyebrows would definitely be dead.","“That great thief is here!”","“It’s him!”","“So this is how he looks like.”","“Of course. He has a mask on his face, so that’s naturally how he looks like. Everyone looked over. The masked man, robbery. With these two factors added together, it was natural that everyone could guess Ling Han’s identity.","At this moment, everyone was staring at Ling Han. This guy had robbed many, many people, so he should have a lot of treasures on him."]},{"number":3684,"title":"Chapter 3684: Exterminated","paragraphs":["Chapter 3684: Exterminated","Translator: Henyee Translations , Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back, and asked calmly, “what is it? Someone still wants to gift me a treasure?”","‘You are really arrogant. You are merely Human Dao Foundation!” Immediately, someone declared coldly.","‘He definitely can’t be Human Dao Foundation. He must be Heavenly Dao Foundation or even Ultimate Dao Foundation in disguise,” someone hurriedly corrected.","“That’s right. There is no such strong Human Dao Foundation in this world. ” This won the agreement of a great many people.","Humph, whether it’s Heavenly Dao Foundation or Ultimate Dao Foundation you ‘re only one person!” The person from before said, “Let’s attack together ’ and we’ll be able to defeat him in a few moves.”","Many people nodded in agreement. Ling Han possessed far too many treasures and this was enough to make anyone envious.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and said, “Alright, how many people want to share my treasures? Please stand on the left side. I’ll count the number of people and each person can get a few.”","Yi, so cowardly?","True, this guy was all alone, so how could he stand against so many people here?","A considerable number of people walked out laughingly. They would be able to reap a harvest if they took two steps, so why not?","Ling Han looked around, and there were about 35 of them.","”That’s all?” He felt a little regretful. There were more than a hundred people","“Less nonsense, hand over the treasure!” someone shouted harshly.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “I’ve changed my mind. Since there are only so few of you, why don’t I defeat all of you and rob you clean?”","The people on the left side looked at each other, and they all burst into laughter.","There were more than 30 of them, and Heavenly Dao Foundations made up the majority. Where did you get such courage from?","“Let’s make things clear first. Don’t run.” Ling Han smiled, then charged towards these people.","Imminent Skyline activated, and his speed was extremely fast. Peng, he had already crashed into someone, and sent that person flying, crashing into another person on the side.","The person beside him was unguarded, and when he saw a dark figure crash towards him, he instinctively raised his palm and delivered a palm strike.","Only when the palm strike landed on that person did he finally come to his senses, but by this time, it was already too late for him to stop. Pa, blood and flesh was mangled, and that person’s head had actually exploded.","“You’ve killed someone,” Ling Han said to the person who had attacked.","“No, I didn’t do it on purpose,” that person was still a little confused, and subconsciously said.","“Ai, my condolences,” Ling Han continued.","The person faltered for a moment before coming to his senses. He pointed at Ling Han and said, “It’s you! You were the one who threw him over!” “I was the one who crashed into him, but you were the one who killed him.” Ling Han nodded, “Everyone, you guys be the judge.”","“Humph, glib tongue, let’s charge together!” The people on the sidelines did not fall for it. They all rushed forwards, ganging up on Ling Han.","Ling Han merely smiled. The barrage of murderous aura activated. Weng it surged towards everyone.","This was the most powerful weapon in group battles. With a single charge, everyone was hit, and their attacks instantly became chaotic.","Lmg Han laughed loudly, and charged towards one of them. The Eighteen Claws of the Golden Eagle spread out, and he was like an ancient bird king that was about to hunt the whole world.","That person hurriedly parried, and the others immediately came back to their senses, launching attacks at Ling Han.","Ling Han only acted as if he didn’t feel anything, and simply attacked his opponent madly.","Was he seeking his own death?","More than thirty Foundation Building Tier cultivators attacked at the same time. To say nothing of Heavenly Dao Foundation, even Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivators would flee at the sight of such an attack.","Peng!","Peng, peng, peng, peng!","Ling Han exchanged a punch with that person, but he suffered the combined attacks of more than 30 people behind him. Instantly, light exploded, and seals spread out.","However, it was useless. When the light dissipated, everyone shockingly discovered that Ling Han hadn’t collapsed at all. Instead, he continued to target his opponent and bombard him madly.","How was this possible?","Are your defenses stronger than Cauldron Forging Tier?","“You, you guys, look!” Someone pointed at Ling Han, his expression ambiguous.","Everyone stared at Ling Han, all of them gritting their teeth.","This guy is actually wearing so many pieces of armor!”","F***, no wonder it can’t be penetrated.”","“There are over a dozen layers!”","They were all speechless. Ling Han was wearing a total of over a dozen Battle Armors. This was a Celestial Tool, so it naturally could change its size. Though it could not become the size of a planet, and as small as a pendant like the Origin Gold, it was completely no problem for it to change its size a dozen over times.","Ling Han wore over a dozen layers of armor. Just how terrifying was this defense? Even high-level energy could not possibly penetrate through so many layers of armor.","“Use the power of shockwave,” someone called out.","“That’s right. Armor can only withstand high-level energy and piercing attacks. As long as we use a shock attack, it can still transmit power onto his body.”","“Die!”","These people once again rushed forwards, and attacked Ling Han harshly.","Ling Han only targeted one person and attacked. That person was Heavenly Dao Foundation, so how could he block Ling Han’s attack?","In just a few moves, he was beaten to the ground by Ling Han.","“Who’s the third?” He glanced at another person, and aggressively made his move.","This was still a Heavenly Dao Foundation cultivator, so how could he possibly be a match for Ling Han? After a few moves, he was also beaten to the ground by Ling Han.","“Why is this guy still standing?” Seeing that three people on their side had already fallen, but Ling Han was still alive and kicking, everyone could not accept this.","Even if you were wearing a dozen over layers of armor, it was still impossible for your defenses to be unbreakable. This wasn’t a dozen over Foundation Building Tier cultivators working together to protect you.","However, how could they have known that Ling Han had perfected his cultivation of the mortal level? His defenses far surpassed those of ordinary Foundation Building Tier cultivators, and added with the Starlight Screen, his defenses had reached an unimaginable level.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The people here collapsed continuously. Five, ten, fifteen, twenty!","Upon seeing this, everyone was stunned into silence.","Was this a myth?","One person was going to complete an impossible mission to defeat more than thirty people of the same cultivation level?","Without a doubt, it wasn’t long before the remaining dozen or so people all collapsed to the ground.","As Ling Han plundered the treasures on them, he turned to the remaining cultivators, “You guys really don’t plan to make a move?”","He was a very principled person. If others did not make a move on him, he","would not take the initiative to provoke him either.","“You are very arrogant,” a young man in Ultimate Dao Foundation said. “But you are also very strong.”","Ling Han sighed. If no one made a move, he would not be able to rob more people.","After plundering everything, he felt a little frustrated, because though Spatial Spirit Tools were small, once there were too many of them, they would still take up space Spatial Spirit Tools could not store Spatial Spirit Tools. Forcibly squeezing them in would only have one result, and one would definitely shatter, or both would shatter.","He put these Spatial Spirit Tools into a bag, then carried them on his back.","Wearing over a dozen pieces of armour, and carrying a bulging sack, Ling Han’s image was really very much like a thief.","He couldn’t help but feel gloomy. However, he couldn’t throw away the Spatial","Spirit Tools, right???? F","No matter what, this thing could still be sold for a Dao Stone. Furthermore, there were a few that were especially large, and their value was considerably","Let s just go with that. Who would dare to criticize him?","Lmg Han got into the water and tested the temperature.","It was bone-chilling cold, but after Ling Han spread out the Starlight Screen it was completely capable of resisting this kind of low temperature."]},{"number":3685,"title":"Chapter 3685: Old Clam","paragraphs":["Chapter 3685: Old Clam","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han didn’t plan to stand guard on the surface of the lake. That would be too inefficient.","Since the Starlight Screen could resist extreme cold, what did he have to fear?","Ling Han entered the lake and immediately started to swim.","On the shore, those who had been robbed had no face to continue, and turned around to walk back, while those who had stayed behind looked at the lake surface and smirked coldly.","Did he think that he was the only one who could enter the lake?","After setting up a shield, there were more and more people who could go into the water, but why was everyone staying on the shore?","That was because the lake water was too cold. Spreading out a shield would expend too much mystical power. Even if it was Ultimate Dao Foundation, he could only last for about five minutes. However, since he was in the lake, his speed was extraordinarily slow. What could be done in five minutes?","“You’re not going to turn back until you crash into a wall?”","“Heh, it won’t be long before he pops out on his own.”","“How laughable. Do you think we can’t go into the water?”","A considerable number of people smirked coldly. When Ling Han came out of the water, they would definitely mock him.","In the lake, Ling Han felt like he was being restrained. The resistance of the lake waters was extraordinarily strong, causing his swimming speed to slow down. With his previous judgement of the speed of the Silver Dragon Fish, it should be impossible for him to catch up.","Going up just like that?","How could that be allowed?","Ling Han dived downwards, and soon arrived at the bottom of the lake.","He had two purposes. Firstly, of course, he had to catch the Silver Dragon Fish. Secondly, he suspected that there was a key at the bottom of the lake that could open the lock to the main doors ahead of him.","Though this lake couldn’t be considered too deep, it was still 180 meters deep, and light could only reach 30 meters below the surface of the water. At this depth, the lake was naturally completely pitch-black, and only Ling Han’s Starlight Screen was flickering with light.","Of course, the sunlight couldn’t reach this place, so Ling Han wasn’t worried that the light emitting from his body would be noticed by the people on the shore.","He unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which hovered above his head and poured down streams of Primal Chaos aura, expelling both the lake water and the coldness.","Ling Han put away the Starlight Screen. He didn’t need the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and he could still stay here for a few months. There was no other reason, but there were really too many reserves of mystical power that could support him to be so extravagant.","However, since he had a precious tool to use, why should he waste mystical power?","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower protected him, and Ling Han was unaffected by all techniques. At least, lake water of this level could no longer affect him.","His speed immediately returned to normal. He activated his Eye Technique, and even the darkness couldn’t obstruct his vision.","He saw that six meters away, there was a school of Silver Dragon Fish slowly swimming around.","Xiu, Ling Han rushed over, and stretched out a hand to grab it.","How could those Silver Dragon Fish have foreseen that someone would actually dare dive into the water to catch them?","This reaction was extremely slow. In fact, it didn’t even have the time to turn around before it was captured by Ling Han.","There were a total of eleven.","Ling Han couldn’t help but break into a smile. In just a short while, his gains had surpassed anyone else. In fact, even the top five in fact added together couldn’t compare to his gains.","However, there were many people with him, and there were also many gluttons. He had to capture more.","Ling Han swam around in the lake, and began a great hunt.","One minute, two minutes, three minutes, four minutes.","“He’s about to come out.”","“To be able to last until now, he is not weak either.”","On the shore, everyone spoke one after another. Previously, the person who had lasted the longest among them was five minutes. They were sure that Ling Han definitely could not surpass this limit, and would definitely come out five minutes ago.","However, another minute quickly passed.","The surface of the lake was calm, and the waves rippled. Only when someone struck the surface of the water by the lake would there be ripples.","Where had this person popped out from?","“No way, this brat can actually hold on for so long?” A considerable number revealed shocked expressions. This was already equal to the best result. Furthermore, Ling Han still hadn’t surfaced, and was continuously breaking records.","“Could it be that he ingested alchemical pills in the water to replenish his mystical power?”","“Now, the best Mystical Power Pill can only recover 10% of mystical power at a time, and if taken continuously for a short period of time, the medicinal effects will continuously be halved.”","“En, so no matter how wealthy he is, he would only be able to last six to seven minutes, at most.”","Everyone expressed their agreement one after another. Even if there was a great alchemist willing to support them at all costs, it was impossible that there would be no limit.","However, very soon, six minutes had passed, followed by seven minutes, eight minutes, and even ten minutes, but Ling Han still did not appear.","“F***, have we seen a ghost?” someone exclaimed in shock, his face filled with disbelief.","The expressions of the others were not much better either. It had already been ten minutes, and that had doubled the best result.","“Could it be that he has already died below?”","“Possibly.”","“That guy was very stubborn. He probably had to hold on until his limit, but in the end, he did not manage to float back up in time, and died below.”","“En, he must be dead.”","Many people came to this conclusion, and after another five minutes, everyone came to the same conclusion, and that was Ling Han must have died.","They continued to do whatever they were doing, and the people who came after them continued to stream over.","However, the people who had ran to the other two paths had not returned all this while. It was probable that there was no lockdown of the main doors there, and their path was smooth and unobstructed.","However, there were Silver Dragon Fish here. Many people clearly knew that the other two paths could be the way out, but they still lingered here.","However, they didn’t know if it was an illusion, but they realized that there were fewer and fewer Silver Dragon Fish swimming towards the surface of the water.","And underneath the lake, Ling Han swam endlessly, his gains increasing further and further.","As he hunted, he was also searching for any hidden key.","“If it’s really a key, then the chances of finding it in the mud and sand at the bottom of the lake are endlessly small.”","“So, if there really is a key, then the hiding place must be very obvious.”","“Hmm?”","Ling Han suddenly stopped, and saw a stretch of corals ahead of him.","Why were there corals in the fresh water?","Ling Han mocked internally, but his eyes did not stop on the coral, but rather on a large clam in the corals.","This large clam was as big as a screen, and was presently spread open. A pearl the size of a human head could be clearly seen inside.","This pearl was completely golden, exuding light, and appeared very striking in the dark waters.","And beside the pearl, there was also a black key.","Hehe, found it.","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. The fact that this old clam could grow to such a large size meant that it had probably lived for several hundred years, or even more than a thousand years, right?","Thus, this golden pearl was definitely very nutritious. If it was used for an alchemical pill, its effects would definitely be excellent.","Not bad, this was a pleasant surprise.","Ling Han swam over, and when it felt the change in the water flow, the old clam immediately closed its lid.","How was he supposed to stop ir?","Ling Han unleashed a murderous aura attack, and the old clam’s divine sense was instantly captured. It became weak, and the clam shell that had initially been tightly closed immediately loosened a bit. Ling Han easily opened it.","However, Ling Han didn’t kill it. He simply retrieved the golden pearl and key.","“It’s said that clam meat is fresh, so it’s a bit of a pity,” Ling Han mumbled to himself.."]},{"number":3686,"title":"Chapter 3686: Coincidental encounter","paragraphs":["Chapter 3686: Coincidental encounter","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor. Henyee Translations","Ling Han swam around in the lake again, but there were not many Silver Dragon Fish left. At most, there would not be more than ten left.","Forget it. He would just let them rest here, and continue to reproduce. He floated upwards, and with a splash, rushed out of the water’s surface.","“What a huge fish!” A person was by the lake, and he exclaimed in surprise. He had never thought that such a large Silver Dragon Fish would jump out.","With such a big splash, was this the Silver Dragon Fish King?","He immediately prepared himself to make a move. He was going to use his mystical power to trap this “Fish King”, and drag it onto the shore.","Boom, the mystical power was like silk, winding towards Ling Han.","Ling Han naturally didn’t know that he was being treated like a Silver Dragon Fish and a fish king at that. He only knew that someone had launched an attack at him, but their purpose wasn’t to kill him. Instead, they simply wanted to capture him.","Who would be so bold?","Ling Han humphed and replied with a punch of his own.","‘F*ck! I’ve seen a ghost!’","That person’s eyes were wide open. Now, he naturally saw clearly that this wasn’t a fish king that had popped out of the lake, but a person!","He had just arrived not too long ago, so he naturally hadn’t seen Ling Han dive into the water. How could he have imagined that a person would suddenly appear from below?","Water ghost?","He definitely did not believe that this was a person, because he knew how cold the lake waters were. There was no one that could last more than five minutes, and he had already been here for at least more than an hour. In this period of time, there was definitely no one that had dived into the water. At most, they had only tested the water temperature.","Thus, if someone had crawled out from the bottom of the lake, they must be a water ghost.","Peng!","Ling Han threw a punch, shattering his opponent’s power. The remaining power did not dissipate, and the person was sent flying.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the other party only wanted to capture him and not","kill him, Ling Han wouldn’t have held back either.","On second thought, he understood. The other party thought of him as a giant Silver Dragon Fish.","“Yi!” “Ah!” “F***!”","When they saw Ling Han clearly, the people by the lake all exclaimed in surprise. These were all people who had seen Ling Han dive into the water before.","He had come out! He had come out!","Heavens, just how long had passed?","It had almost been a day.","Are you a f****** monster, to actually be able to stay close to a day at the bottom of such a cold lake? Are you a Silver Dragon Fish that has taken human form, and so naturally could resist the cold?","Xiu, someone jumped over. This was a slender young man. He swept an eye over Ling Han, and asked, “Why can you stay in the lake for so long?”","“Do I know you?” Ling Han asked calmly.","The young man was taken aback, and subconsciously exclaimed, “How are you worthy of knowing me!”","p*** did he know how to speak properly?","“Since I don’t even know who you are, why should I answer you?” Ling Han countered.","The young man flew into a thunderous rage, “Because I am Yue Haoming!” -Never heard of it.” Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, an expression of disdain on his face.","“Humph, don’t think that you can be arrogant in front of me just because you have defeated so many people previously.” Yue Haoming said coldly, “As I see it, your strength is only so-so!”","He was a prodigy that had formed Ultimate Dao Foundation, so he naturally thought that in this Mystery Realm, the people here could only contend with him, at most.","Ling Han cracked a smile. Xiu, he charged towards Yue Haoming. The barrage of murderous aura shot out, and Yue Haoming couldn’t help but grunt. There was a stabbing pain in his mind, as well as an indescribable feeling of fear.","He couldn’t help but feel shocked. Without facing it personally, no one could imagine the might of the barrage of murderous aura.","His strength was actually not inferior to Ling Han’s. In terms of raw power, he was even far superior. However, once he lost the initiative, he fell into a passive position, and had no choice but to first parry Ling Han’s attacks.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and shot out both fists in a series of punches. The Demonic Monkey Fists was already used, and the 108 layers of power stacked together were shot out in the manner of Frequency Attack.","This was too terrifying. Even if Yue Haoming was a one-star genius that had formed Ultimate Dao Foundation, so what? He was completely unable to fight back – he had just caught his breath, and just when he was about to make a move, he was struck by a murderous aura attack that caused his mind to temporarily go blank, and he could only passively defend again.","In about a hundred moves, Yue Haoming was blasted onto the ground.","Seeing this scene, everyone’s expressions became serious. Previously, even if Ling Han had defeated 35 Foundation Building cultivators single-handedly, not one of them had been Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivators. Though everyone recognized Ling Han’s strength, they did not think that they would lose to Ling Han.","A large part of the reason for this was because Ling Han was wearing over a dozen layers of armor. This was extremely useful against low-level cultivators.","But now, Ling Han had completely defeated Yue Haoming with a violent attack, displaying his terrifying abilities.","This person... was terrifying.","Ling Han smiled, and swept Yue Haoming clean, “Knowing that I am short of money, you took the initiative to gift me treasures. I, Niu Jianhua, thank you very much.”","-You!” Yue Haoming stared fixedly at Ling Han. Niu Jianhua, he would remember this name. He had actually robbed him so badly that he was only wearing underpants. In future, he would definitely get his revenge, definitely.","Ling Han naturally would not be concerned. Go and seek revenge on Niu Jianhua, young man!","He strode off. Since he had already caught all the Silver Dragon Fish, and obtained the key, what was the point of staying here any longer?","Very soon, he arrived in front of the great doors that those people had spoken of. These doors were built in the middle of a canyon, and just happened to be blocking the way.","The door was completely black, and by the looks of it, it should have been forged from metal. Lightning could be seen flickering on the door.","This door couldn’t be touched, and one would be electrocuted upon contact. Ling Han took out the key and shot it at the keyhole. With a sharp sound, the key entered the keyhole.","He then used his Spiritual Power to control it, and the key started to turn. Ka, a crisp sound rang out.","The great doors did not open, but the light of lightning that was flickering on them had disappeared.","Ling Han pressed his hands down, a smile curling up the corners of his lips. He didn’t feel it at all.","He gave a strong push, and ka, ka, ka, the great doors slowly opened.","He was leaving.","He strode forwards, passed through the main doors, and continued onwards. The canyon soon ended, and a new snowy peak appeared ahead of him. After a few leaps and landings, Ling Han arrived at the foot of the mountain. He was just about to climb the mountain, when he saw that there was an intense battle not far away.","These two people were both wearing Battle Armors, and their battle was incredibly intense.","‘Ya?’","Ling Han recognized them. These two people were actually Princess Bixiao and Niu Jianhua, respectively!","These two people had both come to the Holy Land of Metal Element. Ling Han could imagine this, but it was actually so coincidental that they would meet. -Princess Bixiao was wearing his Battle Armor, so Niu Jianhua naturally recognized her. Thus, he would definitely step forward to ask, so it was very normal for them to come to blows.","The problem was, where had this guy gotten a Battle Armor from?","Ling Han merely swept an eye over them, and had a direct understanding of their battle prowess. They were both at the peak stage of Human Dao Foundation, and they were both one-star geniuses. With the help of the Battle Armor, they could just barely reach about 20% to 40% battle prowess of a one-star genius.","However, Niu Jianhua’s Battle Armor was clearly inferiors This was normal. Otherwise, he wouldn’t only have two suits of Battle Armor on him. This pair of Battle Armor was probably brought by those old servants.","“Great thief, let me deal with you!” Ling Han let out a battle cry and jumped","out.."]},{"number":3687,"title":"Chapter 3687: Killing Niu Jianhua","paragraphs":["Chapter 3687: Killing Niu Jianhua","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","What was going on?","Princess Bixiao and Niu Jianhua both turned to look at Ling Han.","It’s you!” After Niu Jianhua faltered for a moment, he immediately gritted his teeth.","He hated Ling Han very much, and recognized Ling Han with a single glance. That was because the latter was wearing his armor – Ling Han had worn his Battle Armor on the outside in order to attract animosity for Niu Jianhua.","Princess Bixiao faltered for a moment before revealing a pleasantly surprised expression.","She was confident in Ling Han’s talent, but there could be accidents in everything. It was only now that she saw Ling Han that she could finally relax. Yi, why had she recognized Ling Han?","He was wearing a mask!","Princess Bixiao was slightly dazed. Her understanding of Ling Han was so familiar that she didn’t even need to see his face, and would be able to recognize him just by looking at his figure?","Ling Han looked towards Niu Jianhua, killing intent flickering in his eyes. Previously, Niu Jianhua had led a few old servants to ambush him at the Primordial Sect, and he had almost really died at this person’s hands.","Of course, he had to avenge this.","“It’s you, and... you’re also that great thief!” Niu Jianhua’s reaction wasn’t slow at all. When he saw that Ling Han was wearing over a dozen Battle Armors, he immediately came to his senses.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Wrong, you are that great thief.”","“You, you dare frame me?” Niu Jianhua was quite smart.","“Clever!” Ling Han gave him a thumbs up, generously giving him approval.","“You deserve to die!” Niu Jianhua was furious. This person was too despicable. He actually impersonated him to rob others, smearing his reputation.","He roared, and paid no further attention to Princess Bixiao. He then charged towards Ling Han.","“Don’t even think about leaving!” Princess Bixiao hurriedly caught up to him. Now, though Ling Han had advanced into Foundation Building Tier, compared to people like them who had long since arrived at the Holy Land, after a year of hard cultivation, their cultivation level had advanced rapidly. For example, she and Niu Jianhua had both reached the peak stage of Foundation Building Tier. As for Ling Han?","Without such good conditions, he should be at the early stage of Human Dao Foundation.","She was naturally worried that Ling Han would be no match for him, and be wounded by Niu Jianhua.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them battled all the way. Niu Jianhua was indeed unable to shake off Princess Bixiao, but Princess Bixiao was also unable to block Niu Jianhua and get in front of him.","“Leave quickly!” Princess Bixiao said to Ling Han through her divine sense.","Why was this guy still standing there?","Ling Han chuckled and said, “It’s fine. Leave this kind of degenerate to me.” “You dare to call me degenerate?” Niu Jianhua roared in fury. “No matter who you are, I’ll make you bleed all over today!”","Ling Han smiled, and snapped his fingers at Niu Jianhua. Xiu, a burst of energy shot out. It was Celestial Crossing Finger.","This was a very ordinary celestial technique, but from Ling Han’s hands, and being received by Niu Jianhua, it was completely different.","-For example, if a Saint moved, even if he did not use the celestial technique, that attack would still be able to destroy a planet.","The force was extremely fast, and Niu Jianhua couldn’t dodge it at all. With a pu, the force hit his chest, and a terrifying power surged out, sending him flying backwards.","Peng, Niu Jianhua fell heavily onto the ground, his expression completely dumbfounded.","He, actually, could not block a single finger from Ling Han?","How was this possible?","He lowered his head and saw that there was a groove on the Battle Armor that was slowly recovering.","He was shocked. The power of Ling Han’s finger had actually caused the Battle Armor to cave in. Just how terrifying was this power? And if it was not for the fact that he still had the protection of this Battle Armor, then wouldn’t he have been insta-killed with a single strike?","What kind of terrifying monster was this?","When he broke through to Celestial Path, Ling Han was definitely still at the mortal level. Moreover, he hadn’t even arrived at the Mystery Realm yet, so how could he possess such battle prowess now?","He got back to his feet, and felt a great pain in his chest. Even if the Battle Armor had dispersed most of the might of Ling Han’s finger, there was still a portion that had taken effect on him, and he felt as if even his bones had been broken.","This gap in strength was really as wide as the sky.","Niu Jianhua did not hesitate any longer. Immediately, he turned around and broke into a run.","‘Ow, ow, ow!’","As he ran, he stumbled and almost fell. The bones in his chest really seemed to have broken, and he felt pain every time he moved.","However, for the sake of survival, he suppressed this urge and continued to flee.","Princess Bixiao was also dazed on the sidelines. She knew that Ling Han was freakish, but definitely did not think that Ling Han would still have such terrifying battle prowess after advancing into Celestial Path. After all, above Celestial Path, the gap among prodigies had actually shrunk considerably. Cultivation level was the main factor.","However, Ling Han’s actions had completely overturned this perception of hers.","Precisely because of this, it wasn’t until Niu Jianhua ran far away that she finally came to her senses.","They couldn’t allow this person to escape. Otherwise, if he asked the great elite of Spirit Transformation Tier to come out, that wouldn’t be a joke.","“Ling Han, chase after him!” she called out, as she too began her pursuit.","Ling Han smiled and said, “There’s no hurry.”","He strolled onwards, neither too fast nor too slow.","Princess Bixiao couldn’t help but be rendered speechless. ‘What are you still showing off for at this time? Hurry up and get rid of this future threat.’","Niu Jianhua also saw it, and he couldn’t help but smirk coldly. This time, as long as he managed to escape, he would immediately think of a way to return to the home planet, and then ask the elites to kill Ling Han.","-Killing a Foundation Building cultivator, a Cauldron Forging Tier was enough; there was absolutely no need to alert the old man.","Peng!","However, before he could finish his thought, he felt his body tremble. Then, he was sent flying, and crashed heavily into a large tree.","He fell down, and it was as if his whole body had fallen apart. He did not have the slightest bit of strength left.","What was going on here?","He shockingly discovered that Ling Han was presently standing next to him! Hiss, when did the other party catch up to him? How did he catch up to him? Impossible.","Xiu, at this moment, Princess Bixiao finally arrived gracefully. Her face was filled with shock, because she had seen very clearly just now. Ling Han had caught up to Niu Jianhua at an indescribable speed, and then sent the latter flying.","This terrifying speed, this terrifying power!","Ling Han cracked a smile, and said to Princess Bixiao, “I already said there’s no need to rush, right?”","Yes, you are awesome, so whatever you say is naturally right.","In any case, Princess Bixiao couldn’t speak, and could only feel deep shock.","Ling Han ransacked Niu Jianhua again, but this guy was really very poor now. Aside from the Battle Armor he was wearing, there was nothing else of value.","Niu Jianhua, on the other hand, felt so furious that he wanted to die. This was the second time, this was already the second time.","Ling Han smiled, and comforted him, “Don’t worry, there won’t be a third time.”","Niu Jianhua’s heart was filled with killing intent. He thought to himself that there naturally wouldn’t be a third time, because he would ask elites to kill Ling Han at all costs.","“Because you’re about to die,” Ling Han said seriously.","W-what?","Niu Jianhua was taken aback. The word ‘death’ seemed to be miles away from him.","He was too young, and the day that his lifespan would dry up was still far in sight. Furthermore, he was the descendant of a great elite of Spirit Transformation Tier, so who would dare kill him?","But now, when he saw Ling Han’s murderous and stern expression, he knew that Ling Han was definitely not just scaring him.","“Don’t-” he opened his mouth to call out, but he had not even finished his words, when pa, Ling Han had already sent out a palm strike. Destructive Energy surged from him, instantly turning him into nothing.."]},{"number":3688,"title":"Chapter 3688: Toxic tongue","paragraphs":["Chapter 3688: Toxic tongue","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","“Beauty, we haven’t seen each other for a year, and you seem to have become even more beautiful.” Ling Han waved a hand at Princess Bixiao.","Princess Bixiao humphed, “I haven’t seen you for a year, and you seem to have","become glib-tongued.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “One is in high spirits at a happy occasion,","so I’ll just banter with you for a while.”","What joyous occasion was this?","Princess Bixiao didn’t ask. She wasn’t the type to gossip, so she said with a","serious expression, “You go ahead first.”","“Yi, you dislike me so much?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","Princess Bixiao shook her head, and said, “I’m too weak here, so I’ll only drag","you down.”","So that was how it was.","Ling Han smiled and said, “It’s fine. I’m very strong.","Princess Bixiao still shook her head, “I want to stand where I should be standing with my own strength, and sit where I should be sitting.","Ling Han remained silent for a moment before nodding and saying, “Alright,","then I’ll take my leave first.”","He respected the other’s thoughts. His figure soared, and xiu, he quickly left.","Princess Bixiao stared at his receding back, and did not withdraw her gaze even after Ling Han had disappeared. She was a little dazed, and a little dumb.","She wasn’t as proud as she said. She didn’t want to go with Ling Han, because she didn’t want to become a burden on him.","She was willing to stand in an inconspicuous corner, and watch Ling Han soar through the skies, dazzling the world.","In terms of understanding of women, Ling Han was still far from being as talented as he was in martial arts, alchemy, and formations. He really thought that Princess Bixiao had refused to go with him because of her pride.","“Really, we’re considered comrades, so there’s nothing wrong with helping","each other.”","He mumbled to himself as he climbed the mountain. Soon, he arrived at the summit, but the formation here had already dimmed. Obviously, the Ice Origin Stone had already been taken.","Ling Han didn’t stop, and he continued to advance.","He remembered that someone from the Holy Land of Metal Element had said that there was a Celestial Tree here, and its fruits just happened to ripen.","Where was it?","He quickened his pace. Previously, because he had been studying formation techniques, and had gone to catch fish in the lake, his position as first place had long since been lost.","He climbed one mountain after another, but the formations on them had all stopped, while the Ice Origin Stone had been taken away.","Half a day later, Ling Han arrived at a new mountain peak. Finally, the formation here was still channeling, and there were presently a great many people that were forcefully barging in.","Ling Han’S eyes swept over them, and immediately, an intent to kill appeared","in his eyes.","Hong Tianbu!","He hadn’t even made a move, and the Ice Origin Stone already belonged to someone else. It was snatched by a young man in green robes.","It wasn’t that his strength was invincible, but rather that he had drawn out an oil lamp. Under the enshrouding light, countless shadowy figures appeared, and the attacks that assaulted him were all dispersed, allowing him to rush to the front and take the Ice Origin Stone.","“Hahaha, a bunch of trash!” This green-robed young man immediately began","to mock them.","Ling Han was astonished. There was no shortage of elites here, so was it really good for you to have such a toxic tongue?","Sure enough, someone immediately humphed, and said, “Luo Xuan, you’re too conceited! This is only an Ice Origin Stone, so we might not take it seriously. What need is there for you to fight over it with all our might?","“You can’t win, so where do all these excuses come from?” The green-robed young man, Luo Xuan, laughed madly, “Come, come, come. Taking advantage of this opportunity, I will beat all of you to the ground. For this Metal Element Fruit Gathering, it will be enough for me to participate alone.”","“Idiot.” The person from before said coldly, “There should be a Celestial Tree ahead of us. At that time, I will let you have your wish, and have a contest with you.”","“An Jiuyue, if you’re afraid, then you’re afraid. Don’t find excuses,” Luo Xuan continued to mock him.","-With such a toxic mouth, it was really not easy for him to reach this age.","However, An Jiuyue didn’t pay him any heed. He simply activated his movement technique and continued to advance.","Once he left, everyone followed behind him. Indeed, to them, heirs of True Self Tier, Spirit Transformation Tier, and even Minor Advanced Tier elites, Ice Origin Stones couldn’t be considered precious treasures. Who would take this seriously?","Previously, they had only competed because they wanted to prove that they were stronger than others.","But if you used a treasure to obtain it, that would be boring. How could it be that they did not know that Luo Xuan’s treasure would expend lamp oil when channelling it?","That was refined by a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and even True Self Tier elites wouldn’t be able to replenish it.","Luo Xuan didn’t get the chance to show off, so he was naturally a little displeased. His eyes swept over the surroundings, and when he saw Ling Han looking at him with a faint smile, he couldn’t help but feel irritated, “What are you looking at? You’re seeking death!”","This was indeed a mad dog, biting anyone it caught.","At first, Ling Han had wanted to immediately make a move on Hong Tianbu, but when he recalled that there was still a Celestial Tree in front of him, he would just fight them both at that time.","He shook his head at Luo Xuan, “Has no one told you that your mouth is too toxic?”","A dangerous expression appeared on Luo Xuan’s face. He did not think that he had a toxic mouth, but rather that he was so strong, so he was naturally qualified to guide the world.","-Don’t you know that a loose tongue causes trouble??” he asked balefully.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “So you actually know this idiom.”","“You’re seeking death!” Luo Xuan charged over and threw a punch. Boom! A terrifying force surged over, filling the sky with green light. Seals spread out, and there was also high-level energy that was similarly green in colour.","Ling Han wasn’t careless. He didn’t know what had happened before, but it was possible that there were other opportunities on the plains at the beginning, causing Hong Tianbu and the others to fail to charge at the front. However, for those that could maintain their position at the front, their abilities couldn’t be underestimated.","He also unleashed his full power to exchange a blow with Luo Xuan. Peng! Energy surged, and the seal shattered, causing a huge explosion.","Ling Han took a few steps back, and felt the blood in his body boil. Even his skin was cracking, and blood was seeping out.","What powerful power.","He immediately gained a direct understanding of Luo Xuan’s strength. The latter had the cultivation level of Ultimate Dao Foundation, and was also a two-star genius.","This person’s mouth was despicable, but his abilities were truly powerful. “Die! Die! Die!” Luo Xuan took advantage of his victory to follow up on his attack. He brandished his fists, bringing with him endless energy, and blasted them madly at Ling Han. “A piece of trash like you actually dares to criticize me? Die! Die!”","Ling Han humphed as he unleashed his murderous aura. With an “oh”, Luo Xuan immediately let out a muffled groan, and a pained expression appeared on his face. His attack also faltered.","However, Luo Xuan had the advantage of two minor levels of cultivation level, after all. Moreover, he himself was a two-star genius, so the murderous aura attack didn’t have much effect on him. It was only an instant, and he continued to push the attack forwards.","-Detestable guy, you actually dare to stab me with your divine sense. I am going to chop you into pieces!” This provoked Luo Xuan instead, causing him to go crazy.","Ling Han was naturally unconcerned. Another barrage of murderous aura shot out, and he used the Demonic Monkey Fists to clash with Luo Xuan.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Under the barrage of murderous aura, Luo Xuan’s strength was naturally affected, and added with the Frequency Attack from the Demonic Monkey Fists, Ling Han’s battle prowess was not the slightest bit inferior to Luo Xuan. “Damn it! Damn it!” Luo Xuan roared in fury, but there was nothing he could do. No matter how he resisted, he was still unable to be immune to the barrage of murderous aura.","He clearly had an absolute advantage in strength.","“Striking Celestial Technique!” He used his ultimate move, and a terrifying aura seeped out of his body.","Shua, a streak of light slashed out at Ling Han.. It was extraordinarily fast, and even Ling Han did not manage to dodge it!"]},{"number":3689,"title":"Chapter 3689: Ghostly Underworld Light","paragraphs":["Chapter 3689: Ghostly Underworld Light","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Fortunately, I wore a few more clothes!” Ling Han lowered his head to look. This ray of light swept past, and the Battle Armor on his left arm was actually completely sliced open. There was even a gash on his skin, and blood was presently seeping out.","Thankfully, it was only a very thin wound. Otherwise, blood would not be oozing out, but rather gushing out.","F***, what a freak!","When Luo Xuan saw this, he was also startled. In his opinion, this slash was enough to cut off Ling Han’s arm, but now, it had actually only sliced off a little skin, and a little blood was seeping out.","Was there anyone as freakish as you, wearing so many Battle Armors on your body?","The Battle Armor’s main purpose wasn’t defense, but rather to borrow the Battle Armor’s energy to increase one’s battle prowess. This was because the Battle Armor’s defense had an obvious weakness. It couldn’t defend against shock-type attacks, and wearing too many would also affect one’s flexibility. The Battle Armor could spread out a shield, but the shield couldn’t be stacked, so the effect of wearing however many layers was the same.","However, the Battle Armor’s anti-cutting attacks were extremely effective. Just now, the dozen over layers of armor had all taken effect, blocking his celestial technique almost completely.","This was really a blind cat meeting a dead mouse?.","“Humph, you can block one strike from me, and can you block ten, or even a hundred strikes?” Luo Xuan smirked coldly. He only had to attack a few more times, and even if you had worn over a dozen Battle Armors, so what? He would still be able to destroy them all.","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s expression was calm, and he asked calmly, “How many times can you use such a powerful move?”","Luo Xuan instantly faltered. The stronger the might of the celestial technique, the greater the burden would naturally be on him, and he would not be able to use it too many times.","He humphed, “It would not be a problem for me to deal with you.” “Then why don’t you give it a try?” Ling Han was naturally unafraid. He stretched out his right hand in front of him. Chi, a small flame immediately began to burn.","Heavenly Dao Flames.","This wasn’t the Heavenly Dao Flames that Ling Han had harvested from the Flaming Canyon. Instead, it was Ling Han’s comprehension of the Heavenly Dao Flames through the flame seals communicating with high-level energy. When Luo Xuan saw this, he couldn’t help but laugh loudly. This little flame wanted to oppose him?","However, it wasn’t long before he stopped laughing.","This little flame was not simple.","Luo Xuan was arrogant, but how could a two-star genius be an idiot? On the other hand, he was extremely smart and had good insight.","High-level energy was divided into grades, and the feeling that this flame gave him... seemed to be the strongest flame in the world, capable of burning even Saints to death.","Of course, he had never seen a Saint before, nor did he know the might of a Saint. However, these flames were far too powerful, so he couldn’t help but feel this way.","“Hand over the corresponding Fire Spirit Diagram!” he shouted at Ling Han, “I can spare your life.”","Ling Han smiled faintly, “In your dreams.”","“You’re not going to tell me? Then I’ll force you to tell me!” Luo Xuan charged over. He was going to capture Ling Han and force out the Spirit Diagram.","The level of this Spirit Diagram was definitely astonishingly high. If he could obtain it, it would allow his battle prowess to soar, and in future, his battle prowess would rise to another level. It was also possible for him to advance into the ranks of three-star geniuses.","Ling Han brandished his fists in response. Boom, boom, boom! The two of them were embroiled in an intense battle.","Without using the celestial technique, Luo Xuan was no stronger than Ling Han. Furthermore, Ling Han had also used the Heavenly Dao Flames. Even though it was just a small flame, Luo Xuan didn’t dare to touch it at all.","In this way, Luo Xuan was naturally at a disadvantage.","“Humph, don’t think that I have no way to deal with you.” Luo Xuan channelled out another celestial technique, and struck out rapidly with both palms. Seals spread out, and even the heaven and earth paled in colour.","He also used high-level energy. Though it was inferior to the Heavenly Dao Flames, it could also increase battle prowess.","The two of them battled fiercely, and for the moment, it was hard to decide who was stronger between them.","“Striking Celestial Technique!” Luo Xuan suddenly used this powerful move again. It was probably because the “cooldown time” had passed.","Ling Han humphed, “Do you think I’m afraid of you!”","Three Styles of the God of War!","He also channeled his own powerful move. Suddenly, it was as if he had become the center of heaven and earth. Endless energy surged out, converging in his body, allowing him to become a vessel.","Boom!","The power of heaven and earth was unleashed, and surged towards Luo Xuan. What was even more terrifying was the fact that there was Heavenly Dao Flames embedded in this terrifying energy!","And this was still because Ling Han’s understanding of the Three Styles of the God of War was limited by his cultivation level, and there was no way to turn force into a seal. Otherwise, this might would be even more terrifying.","The Three Styles of the God of War against Striking Celestial Technique!","Frightening energy collided, forming a small-scale mushroom cloud that rose into the air.","Luo Xuan was shocked. In this exchange, he actually did not get the upper hand. Instead, his hands were burnt by the power of the flames. Thankfully, it was only a slight wound to his flesh.","Xiu! Ling Han charged over, unleashing the second form of the Three Styles of God of War.","Luo Xuan gritted his teeth, and struck again with the Striking Celestial Technique.","Boom!","The astonishing power exploded once more, causing the entire mountain to rumble loudly. An unlucky fool just happened to walk up to the summit at this moment, and was immediately sent flying by the shockwave that had seeped out.","Ling Han was furious as he unleashed the third style of the Three Styles of the God of War.","Luo Xuan was shocked. Striking Celestial Technique could not be channelled continuously. He had used it twice consecutively, and his body was already boiling. A mouthful of blood was in his throat, and he was just about to spit it out.","However, faced with Ling Han’s attack, did he have a chance to dodge?","-It was as if he had been restrained by the heaven, and had nowhere to run at all.","Then, he would just fight him head-on!","Luo Xuan once again struck out with the Striking Celestial Technique towards Ling Han.","Boom! The two ultimate moves collided for the third time.","“F*ck!” The person who had been sent flying had just climbed back up. He was filled with anger. Who had he offended? He had just appeared, and he had already been sent flying. Naturally, he had to seek an explanation.","But he had just run back, and had not even finished his words, when he was sent flying again. The extent of the trauma in his heart at this moment could naturally be imagined.","Pu, Luo Xuan spat out a mouthful of blood. He could no longer suppress the boiling inside his body.","He didn’t want to be on the back foot any longer, so he hurriedly retrieved his precious tool.","An oil lamp. This was a precious tool of extremely high grade, especially the oil within. It had been refined by a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and as flames spewed out, its might was boundless.","Using this to kill a mere Foundation Building Tier cultivator was really like using a sledgehammer to kill a chicken, but aside from that, what else could match his opponent’s terrifying celestial technique?","He naturally did not know that Ling Han’s Three Styles of = the God of War was not much better than his Striking Celestial Technique. After using it once, it would take quite a while before he could use it a second time. Otherwise, it was possible that he would be the first to shatter.","“You should be proud of yourself for being able to force me to use the Ghostly Underworld Lamp!” Luo Xuan said proudly. With a thought, the oil lamp immediately lit up. Instantly, ghostly shadows appeared all around them, filled with a baleful and terrifying aura.","What a heavy evil Qi!","Ling Han’s heart clenched, and he felt his entire body go cold. It was as if countless cold hands were pressing down on him, wanting to extract his life essence and turn him into a dried corpse.","“An!” he shouted loudly. The Buddhist Race’s Six Characters Bright King Curse specialized in subduing evil beasts and suppressing internal demons.","Instantly, shrill ghostly wails rang out in the surroundings, as if those vengeful ghosts had been injured, and were wailing loudly.","“You are a member of the Buddhist Race?” Luo Xuan revealed an expression of shock. The Buddhist Race belonged to the Imperial Clan, one of the strongest forces in the world. For example, for those like him who cultivated an evil art, the greatest taboo was Buddhism."]},{"number":3690,"title":"Chapter 3690: Forming a Corpse into a Tool","paragraphs":["Chapter 3690: Forming a Corpse into a Tool","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han rubbed his head, and asked, “Do you have no eyes, or do I indeed have no hair?”","The Buddhist Race was not a bloodline-specific group. As long as one was willing to convert, anyone could become a member of the Buddhist Race. However, if one wanted to join the Buddhist Race, the first step was to shave, and sever all his mortal bonds, signifying that he had let go of everything in the past.","Luo Xuan stared at Ling Han’s hair. Who knows, Ling Han’s hair may have been expedited by mystical power.","“This is real!” Ling Han was furious, and shot out a murderous aura attack towards Luo Xuan.","Luo Xuan only felt a pain in his mind, and almost screamed out in pain. No matter how many times he sustained this kind of attack, he could not get used to it. It always caused him unbearable pain.","“I will make your death too horrible to look at!” he said through gritted teeth.","“Die!” He blew lightly at the oil lamp, and instantly, the flame that was originally only the size of a soybean suddenly shot up. A green flame burned towards Ling Han.","This was... ghost fire!","Ling Han saw very clearly. One after another, skulls popped out of the green flames, baring their mouths, as if they wanted to swallow him whole.","“An!”","The chant of the Buddhist Race was called out loudly, expelling evil and repelling demons.","The skulls were indeed affected, but this Ghostly Underworld Lamp was a replica of a precious treasure. Though its grade wasn’t high, the lamp oil used inside was personally refined by a Spirit Transformation True Lord, so its might was naturally extraordinary.","If Ling Han was in the Spiritual Transformation Tier, then he would be able to suppress evil even if it was just a single word “An”. However, the problem was that he was only in the Foundation Building Tier.","If a Foundation Building cultivator could eliminate the power of a Spirit Transformation True Lord, that would truly be illogical.","“Hahaha, ignorant fool!” Luo Xuan was proud. By now, the ghostly flames had already surrounded Ling Han. Ling Han had nowhere to go, and could only wait for death. “This lamp oil was refined by a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and what ingredients are used? Cauldron Forging Tier corpse oil, at least!”","F***, no wonder it was so evil!","Ling Han’s eyes sharpened, and he said, “You actually refined a tool from a corpse? You truly deserve death!”","“Since they are already dead, it’s not a waste to make use of trash.” Luo Xuan chuckled, and said, “Don’t worry, even though you’re only at the Foundation Building Tier, I won’t waste it either. I’ll personally refine your corpse into corpse oil!”","“Refine your sister!” Ling Han roared loudly. Xiu! The Heavenly Pattern Jade shot out.","Luo Xuan was just smug, thinking that Ling Han was already a dead man. Who would have thought that Ling Han would have such a deadly weapon?","Under the impact of 30 times the speed of sound, with the distance between the two of them being only about 30 meters, how much time would it need?","As fast as lightning, Heavenly Pattern Jade passed through the sea of flames and arrived before Luo Xuan’s chest.","Luo Xuan was shocked, but did not take it to heart. What could a mere concealed weapon do to him?","He also activated his divine sense, transforming it into a net of Spiritual Power to block the Heavenly Pattern Jade.","This was a pure contest of Spiritual Power.","However, his expression immediately changed.","F***, this was too heavy. It was like a mountain was rolling over, and was not something that his divine sense could stop at all.","His divine sense was far too powerful, no?","Cauldron Forging Tier?","That’s right. At least, it had to be someone in the Cauldron Forging Tier that could deliver such terrifying power.","But how could a Foundation Building Tier cultivator possibly possess Cauldron Forging Tier-level Spiritual Power?","Realization dawned on him. This was not because Ling Han’s Spiritual Power was too strong, but rather that this was a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool!","The strength of the Spiritual Power Spirit Tool was that it could use one’s Spiritual Power to first compress its weight. It clearly weighed 5,000kg, or even millions of kg, but could be compressed to a few grams. When it was shot out with Spiritual Power to reach its maximum speed, it recovered to its normal weight.","To block such an attack, just how strong would that Spiritual Power have to be?","It had to be 10,000 times stronger than the other, or even millions of times stronger!","They were both in the Foundation Building Tier, so how was this possible?","In this instant, countless thoughts flashed through Luo Xuan’s mind. He hurriedly pushed the oil lamp to block it, while he slanted his head to the side.","Pa, a crisp sound rang out, and blood gushed out. Luo Xuan’s right hand had been smashed into bits, and the oil lamp in his hand was naturally lost as well, drawing out an arc in the air.","“Ah—” Luo Xuan screamed in pain. One of his arms had been forcefully shattered, so it was naturally extraordinarily painful, and what pained him even more was the fact that losing a hand would cause his battle prowess to drop greatly. How would he be able to join the ranks of prodigies in future?","“Killing people to refine their corpses is unacceptable to the heaven and earth!” Ling Han charged over, “I’ll send you on your way!”","Luo Xuan hurriedly pulled himself together. Now was not the time to cry out in pain.","He set off in pursuit of the oil lamp. Now that he had lost a hand, his battle prowess had dropped drastically. He had to rely on the might of the Spirit Tool, or he would really be blasted into smithereens by Ling Han.","How could Ling Han allow him to succeed? He activated the Imminent Skyline, and peng, he crashed into Luo Xuan.","Luo Xuan looked at his fingertips that were about to touch the Ghostly Underworld Light, but a powerful force assaulted him, and his figure involuntarily flew out.","“No!” Seeing that he was getting further and further away from the Ghostly Underworld Light, he released a loud roar.","Ling Han humphed, and stretched out a hand to grab the Ghostly Underworld Light. However, he had just stretched out his hand, when a powerful feeling of danger rose up in his heart.","He hurriedly retracted his hand, and without the slightest hesitation, channeled the Starlight Screen.","Boom, a field of ghostly flames sprayed out, surrounding him.","The Starlight Screen very quickly melted. This ghostly flame was incredibly powerful. To say nothing of the might reaching Cauldron Forging Tier, its might definitely far surpassed the ordinary Ultimate Foundation Tier.","Ling Han had no choice but to summon the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. The precious tower hovered above his head, sending down streaks of Primal Chaos aura.","“Hahahaha!” Luo Xuan laughed loudly. Previously, he had deliberately pretended to be furious. In truth, that Ghostly Underworld Lamp had already fused with his divine sense, and there was absolutely no need for actual contact to be able to unleash its might.","Ling Han’s body was surrounded by ghostly flames when he came into close contact with it, so he could only be burned into a dried corpse.","—Against the Ghostly Underworld Lamp, there was only one way to survive, and that was to run when he saw it, so that the Ghostly Underworld Lamp would not be given the chance to unleash its might.","However, his laughter soon came to an abrupt stop.","What was going on?","Ling Han summoned a precious tower, and it actually blocked the ghostly flames?","This was refined by a Spirit Transformation True Lord. The ghostly flames were enough to pose a threat to even those at Cauldron Forging Tier, and now it actually couldn’t burn a Foundation Building cultivator to death? No, it couldn’t burn through the defenses of a precious tool that belonged to a Foundation Building Tier cultivator?","Ling Han didn’t waste any time. Limited by his cultivation level, the might of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was also limited. It couldn’t resist the ghost flames for a long time, so he had to end the battle as soon as possible.","He charged out, and his terrifying battle prowess surged, launching a flurry of attacks at Luo Xuan.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Luo Xuan was exhausted from parrying the attacks. He was severely wounded, and without a single arm, his battle prowess had naturally declined greatly, so how could he possibly withstand Ling Han’s barrage of attacks?","Zi, zi, zi! Lightning bolts shot out continuously from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and the air of Primal Chaos also descended. Every bolt of lightning was as heavy as a mountain.","Luo Xuan was astonished. What kind of precious tool was this? Wasn’t it a little too terrifying?","“I can’t accept this!” he roared at the sky, tears of blood streaming from his eyes.","In terms of true battle prowess, he thought that he was stronger than Ling Han, but because Ling Han had too many precious tools, he had first crippled one of his arms, and also blocked the Ghostly Underworld Light, causing him to fall into desperate straits.","Thus, he was unwilling to accept this.."]},{"number":3691,"title":"Chapter 3691: Strange Tree","paragraphs":["Chapter 3691: Strange Tree","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han naturally didn’t show any mercy.","Firstly, there was no need to talk about fairness to this kind of person who refined corpse oil into a precious tool. Secondly, wasn’t it also him who had used the precious tool first? Thirdly, what cultivation level was Ling Han?","It was already unfair for an Ultimate Dao Foundation against a Human Dao Foundation in the first place,so what if he used a precious tool?","He forcefully suppressed him, each strike fatal.","“Who are you? Who are you?” Luo Xuan roared in fury.","“The one who’s going to kill you is Niu Jianhua,” Ling Han said calmly. In any case, Niu Jianhua had already taken a lot of blame for him, so it didn’t matter if he took another. As for Ling Han... he had never been to the Black Moon Planet before.","There wouldn’t be anyone who would connect a Low Grade Human Tier alchemist, Ling Han, with a great thief in the Mystery Realm, right?","“Niu Jianhua! Niu Jianhua!” Luo Xuan gritted his teeth. He knew that he would definitely not be spared today, and was using a technique to carve the name of the culprit who had “killed” him. The instant he died, it would appear on his personal memorial tablet at his sect.","There would definitely be someone who would avenge him.","“Hahahaha, Niu Jianhua, do you think that you can kill me in this Mystery Realm and no one would know?” Luo Xuan laughed loudly, “You are wrong. I have my own means to inform my Master.”","“Are you threatening me?” Ling Han’s attacks didn’t stop. At this point, how could he give up halfway?","“That’s right.” Luo Xuan said coldly, “If you don’t want to be hunted down eternally by the Earth Ghost Sect, you had best stop immediately! The two of us are of the same generation, but if you kill me, then you would have formed a life-or-death enmity with the Earth Ghost Sect!”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “I am the Buddhist Race’s Dao Child, so why would I be afraid of demons and monsters like you?”","F***, didn’t you previously say that you weren’t a member of the Buddhist Race? Why have you now become the Dao Child of the Buddhist Race?","Luo Xuan was a little dazed, and even more swayed. Was the identity that Ling Han had previously revealed to him false?","Ling Han unleashed the Three Styles of the God of War again, launching a mad barrage of attacks at Luo Xuan.","Previously, when Luo Xuan was in his prime condition, he was already extremely strained to parry these three styles. Now that he had crippled one of his arms, how was he supposed to block?","He just barely managed to block the first two styles, but when he came to the third style, he was blasted violently, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also delivered a twofold attack. The power of lightning and the air of Primal Chaos intertwined, and this power was also incredibly terrifying.","Peng!","Luo Xuan fell onto the ground. A burnt smell wafted from his body, and several dozen of his bones had been broken.","“You, who exactly are you?” He forcibly raised his head, looking at Ling Han. “Niu Jianhua,” Ling Han said. He threw a punch, and the Heavenly Dao Flames swept over, burning Luo Xuan into ashes.","Ding, a ring landed on the ground. This was Luo Xuan’s Spatial Spirit Tool. Ling Han stowed it away without any reservations. Then, he suppressed it with the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and also stored the Ghostly Underworld Light into his Spatial Spirit Tool.","—Since Luo Xuan was dead, the divine sense that he had left in the Ghostly Underworld Lamp was naturally destroyed as well, and could no longer pose a threat to Ling Han.","-How to deal with this evil weapon is a problem.” Ling Han frowned. This kind of evil thing naturally could not be sold, and he himself could not possibly use","it either.","Forget it. When he refined the ingredients in the future, he should be able to forge it into other precious tools.","Ling Han collected his emotions, and continued onwards, chasing after the rest.","His battle with Luo Xuan had indeed delayed some time. After advancing for about half an hour, he had also walked out of the mountains. A plain appeared ahead of him. He had not walked too far, and the plain had already reached its end.","There was a tree there, a very strange tree. Its leaves were pitifully small, only the size of soybeans, but there were a great many massive fruits borne on it.","These fruits were really huge, and came in all sorts of shapes and sizes. Some looked like humans, some looked like wolves, some looked like eagles, and some looked like fish. They hung from the tree, and were heavy, pressing down so hard that even the branches were bent, making one worry that they would","break from the strain.","The branches of the tree were as black as iron, and the leaves were crimson red, as if they were stained with blood, while the fruits were pure white. With such a comparison, it was extraordinarily clear which was which..","There were a great many people beneath the tree. Hong Tianbu, An Jiuyue and the people who had previously fought over the Ice Origin Stone.","They all sat on the ground, raising their heads to look at the tree. For a long time, they did not move, as if they were not afraid of having their necks broken.","Ling Han was extremely curious, and he strode over. However, no one paid him any attention.","Just at this moment, pa, a fruit on the tree broke off from the branch and landed heavily on the ground.","Yi, no one was fighting over it?","Ling Han looked to his left and right, only to see that everyone was seated firmly. They didn’t look like they were going to stand up and fight for the throne.","Pa! The fruit was far too ripe, and it instantly cracked apart. Boundless divine light instantly surged into the surroundings.","Looking closely, there were multiple seals in this light.","At this moment, everyone looked eager.","Xiu! A streak of divine light shot toward the northwest.","Instantly, the people in that direction began to compete. They all leaped towards that streak of light, as if they wanted to capture this streak of light.","Just as these people were locked in a fierce battle, another streak of divine light suddenly shot out, heading directly east.","Ling Han just happened to be in this direction, and seeing that everyone was fighting over it, he followed the trend and joined the ranks of those fighting over it.","“Get lost!”","“That’s mine!”","“Those who block me will be killed without mercy!”","Everyone roared in fury, unleashing powerful attacks one after another, attacking indiscriminately.","Ling Han humphed as he unleashed his murderous aura. Weng! Everyone felt a pain in their minds, and their attacks instantly slowed down.","This was only an instant, but Ling Han only needed this instant. The Imminent Skyline was used, and his speed was extraordinarily fast. He had already collided with the divine light, and instantly, that light surged into his body. Endless enlightenment instantly arose in Ling Han’s mind. It was as if he had become a hundred times smarter. Things that he couldn’t figure out or understand under normal circumstances instantly became clear and simple.","Yi, this could help him comprehend Dao!","Ling Han was astounded. What kind of tree was this? It looked so strange, and the fallen fruits couldn’t be eaten, but they emitted divine light that could help one comprehend Dao.","No wonder everyone was fighting over it. This divine light was indeed a good thing.","Even though the fruit was astonishingly huge, in truth, it was completely exhausted after shooting out five flashes of light. The skin of the fruit collapsed, and it was completely empty.","Each of the five streaks of divine light had their own master. Ling Han managed to snatch one, Hong Tianbu managed to snatch one, An Jiuyue managed to snatch one, and Cheng Daohe and Hong Xinghan also managed to obtain one each. Ling Han found out the names of these two people when he heard them being called.","Whether it was those that had obtained the divine light or those that had not, they all sat down.","Since no one came to cause trouble, Ling Han was also happy to begin comprehension.","Multiple formation patterns appeared in his mind. Even if he was already at the beginner level, these formation patterns were too complex, and it was still incredibly difficult to grasp them.","Now, with the help of the divine light, his comprehension ability had an astonishing improvement, which was naturally used to study formation patterns.","-In alchemy and martial arts, he actually did not need this kind of additional help.","In less than ten minutes, this kind of strengthening effect disappeared, and Ling Han had only grasped one formation pattern.","Sigh, so slow.."]},{"number":3692,"title":"Chapter 3692: Seizing the divine light","paragraphs":["Chapter 3692: Seizing the divine light","Translator: Henyee Translations I Editor: Henyee Translations","If those Formation Masters heard Ling Han’s complaints, they would definitely be furious.","This was too infuriating.","Just to comprehend a single formation pattern, which of them hadn’t spent five years or even ten years? You grasped one in ten minutes, and you think it’s slow?","Why was it so difficult to become a Formation Master? This was one of the reasons. If you needed so much time to comprehend a formation pattern, then constructing a formation would need dozens or even hundreds of formation patterns, so how many years would that take?","Moreover, formation patterns also had the ability to evolve and change into thousands of different shapes, making it even more difficult to grasp.","Ling Han had always been accustomed to being fast, so he naturally felt that it had been more than half a year since he had advanced into Celestial Path, and only then did he manage to grasp a formation pattern. This was practically as slow as a snail.","He would just have to wait for another divine light.","Ling Han thought internally. One streak of divine light could increase his comprehension ability by ten minutes, then would two streaks be twenty minutes, and three streaks be thirty minutes?","En, next, he would have to snatch all the divine light.","However, this would make him a public enemy, right?","It was fine. He would just kill them all.","Ling Han thought. Killing intent surged, with a kind of madness.","Hold on, why had he become bloodthirsty?","Ling Han hurriedly recited the Six Characters Bright King Curse in his mind. An, instantly, a the Buddhist chant reverberated in his body, and his killing intent immediately retreated.","He couldn’t help but feel a chill run down his spine.","“I seem to have been unknowingly affected, and have become bloodthirsty.”","“Is it because of the side effects of that divine light?”","“Or is it this tree?”","“This thing definitely doesn’t exist among Celestial Plants that can be used as medicine.”","When this fruit falls to the ground, it shoots out divine light in all directions, but can increase one’s comprehension ability. Clearly, it could not possibly be’ used in medicine, so I did not see any corresponding Celestial Seed in the information on alchemy.”","“What’s the Holy Land of Metal Element doing?”","“This must be the Celestial Plant that they speak of, yet they want us to kill each other?”","Ling Han had long since suspected the actions of the Holy Land of Metal Element. Now, he was naturally even more apprehensive, but he was still unafraid, because the Primal Chaos Exreme Lightning Tower still contained the reaHeavenly Dao Flames. Though its current might had decreased to below the level of a Saint, the Holy Land of Metal Element no longer had a Saint either.","Worse come to worst, he would burn down the Holy Land!","Ling Han nodded. Then, it was even more necessary for him to keep his identity a secret. He did not want others to pursue him all the way to Celestial Sea Planet.","En, Niu Jianhua, you continue to show your remaining usefulness, and take the blame for him.","After half an hour, pa, a new fruit fell down.","“Mine!”","“Get lost!”","“Those who block me will die!”","Everyone came to blows, incredibly frenzied, drawing blood at every turn.","Ling Han used the Imminent Skyline, and coupled with the barrage of murderous aura, he successfully snatched the first streak of divine light.","And when the second divine light shot out, he snatched it again.","“B@stard!”","“You’ve gone too far!”","“Die!”","This enraged everyone in that direction, and they all directed their attacks at Ling Han.","Ling Han unleashed a murderous aura attack. Weng! Everyone felt a pain in their minds, and their attacks couldn’t help but slow down.","Ling Han activated the Imminent Skyline. His speed was incredible. Xiu! He faced the divine light head-on and caught hold of the second one.","“Damn it!”","This time, the remaining people were all furious. Even the people from the other directions moved one after another. This caused Ling Han to continue snatching; that divine light would also be his.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and streaked towards the third divine light that had just appeared. The Starlight Screen spread out, boosting his powerful defense. “Humph!” Hong Tianbu made a move. He tapped out a finger, and instantly, endless black light condensed, blasting towards Ling Han.","This attack was extraordinarily fast. Pu, it landed on the Starlight Screen, and actually created a hole in the light barrier. Thankfully, the power of the finger had also been exhausted, and it turned back into bits of light.","As expected of Hong Tianbu.","This guy was Heavenly Dao Foundation, and he himself was a super genius. Combined with the eye of the Primordial Beast, his battle prowess was truly unfathomable.","Ling Han ignored him. Right now, the most important thing was to contend for the divine light.","He sped up, unleashing the murderous aura and seizing the opportunity to snatch it.","The third divine light had been successfully captured!","However, everyone was in a riot now, blasting towards Ling Han. With these people joining forces, even Ling Han didn’t dare to face them head-on. He hurriedly turned around and fled.","Three flashes of divine light... would be enough for half an hour.","Imminent Skyline was activated, and no one could catch up to him.","After Ling Han shook them off, he immediately stopped, channeled the power of divine light, and began to appreciate formations.","Sure enough, the three streaks of divine light gave him thirty minutes to comprehend.","He had mastered another three formation patterns, very good.","Ling Han quietly hid himself, waiting for the new fruit to fall.","In just over a minute, a fruit fell. Pa, divine light shone brilliantly.","Now was the time!","Ling Han charged out. Using the Imminent Skyline, he was as fast as lightning.","“Here it is again!”","“That great thief!”","“Niu Jianhua, f*ck your ancestors!”","Everyone was gritting their teeth, wanting nothing more than to tear him into pieces.","Ling Han laughed loudly. The barrage of murderous aura was time-tested, and no one could escape. Even if it was only for an instant, it was enough for Ling Han.??? 6","He was slightly faster than everyone else, and the divine light entered his body.","“P***l”","“Damn guy!”","Everyone’s anger soared, but what could they do?","Ling Han always had a way to paralyze their attacks, and his speed was slightly faster, so they could only watch helplessly as Ling Han snatched away the divine light.","This feeling was really too terrible.","Ling Han laughed loudly. He was like a soaring dragon in the sea, and his speed was extraordinarily fast. As he circled around the Celestial Tree at high speed, he waited for the second divine light to shoot out.","“In your dreams!” Everyone was enraged, and they all summoned their precious tools, launching a barrage of attacks at Ling Han.","However, there were far too many people at this moment, so the precious tools instantly unleashed an indiscriminate barrage of attacks, causing a huge commotion.","There was an indescribable aura affecting everyone here, causing them to become bloodthirsty. Now that the massacre had begun, no one could stop.","A chaotic battle broke out. Everyone’s eyes were red, seeing any one of them as an opponent, and attacked without any reservations.","However, even under such circumstances, there were still people who remained conscious.","Ling Han had the Six Characters Bright King Curse, and in addition, Hong Tianbu, An Jiuyue, and Cheng Daohe all had their own methods. There was a glimmer of precious light flickering on their bodies, resisting that thing that could make one lose their senses.","They continued to pursue the divine light, while they continued to defend against the frenzied attacks of the others.","However, in terms of speed, none of them could compare to Ling Han. Among the five flashes of divine light, Ling Han alone had three. This was already enough. It would be a waste even if he had more.","Ling Han didn’t linger in battle any longer. He turned around and left.","In the Holy Land of Metal Element, there were presently three youngsters with outstanding reputations stare at a jade wall, and the jade wall was actually showing the scene of Ling Han, Hong Tianbu and the others fighting beneath the Celestial Tree.","“Old Seventh, who do you think is the strongest among these people?” a white-robed man asked. His face was as fair as jade, and there was a small red mole between his brows.","The person he referred to as Seventh also had a handsome face. He wore a creamy yellow long robe, and carried a long sword on his back. He had a rather confident air.","If the other disciples of the Holy Land of Metal Element were here, they would definitely recognize that this was the well-known Twelve Star Envoys of the Holy Land.","The white-robed man, Hou Yongzheng, was ranked fifth. The yellow-robed young man, Shi An, was ranked seventh, and the third was Wen Feiwen, who was ranked ninth.."]},{"number":3693,"title":"Chapter 3693: Twelve Candidates","paragraphs":["Chapter 3693: Twelve Candidates","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Hong Tianbu, of course,” Shi An replied.","Hou Yongzheng was surprised, and asked, “Why are you not optimistic about that great thief?”","“Niu Jianhua?” Shi An shook his head, “Though his strength is not too bad, most of the time, he wins by depending on treasures and movement techniques. Thus, I think Hong Tianbu is still stronger.’ 1","“Then what about An Jiuyue?” Wen Feiwen interrupted, “There’s also Cheng Daohe. They’re all no weaker than Hong Tianbu, right?”","“Much weaker,” Shi An said with a shake of his head. “Ninth, your taste is still a little lacking.”","“Sigh, so what if we know who’s the strongest?” Shi An shook his head, and said, “Eldest Senior Brother, Second Senior Sister and the others would choose first. Whether it’s Hong Tianbu , or Niu Jianhua, An Jiuyue, or Cheng Daohe, it’s impossible that they will be left for us.”","“Hehe, these people are really stupid. Did they think that there would be great fortune waiting for them?” Wen Feiwen scoffed.","“Forget it. Being able to stand out from so many prodigies, every single one of them is a prodigy among prodigies.” Hou Yongzheng shook his head, his interest waning slightly. They were ranked at the bottom of the Twelve Stars Envoys, so they could only pick the “leftovers”.","“Heh, it’s a shame that we can only reveal the truth to them to years later. Just the thought of it makes me eager to see the expressions on their faces,” Shi An said with a hint of mockery.","Inside the Mystery Realm.","After Ling Han digested the three flashes of divine light, he grasped another three formation patterns. He quietly hid, and saw that under the Celestial Tree, there were already a dozen over people lying down, their blood dyeing the ground red.","This competition was really fierce, and under normal circumstances, would these prodigies fight so desperately for the sake of temporarily improving their comprehension ability?","It was obviously impossible.","It was as if the Holy Land of Metal Element was cultivating a parasite, using brutal slaughter to determine the limited victors. As for how great the losses would be, they did not take it to heart at all.","Ling Han waited, and when a new fruit fell, he charged out, snatching the divine light.","Time slowly passed, and there were fewer and fewer fruits on the tree, while the number of people at the bottom of the tree actually did not decrease because of the replenishment of those who came later.","Under such circumstances, elites naturally stood out.","Ling Han, Hong Tianbu, An Qiye, Cheng Daohe, and so on. Not only did the few powerful figures persist, but they also had their own gains. However, the others added together did not have as many gains as Ling Han alone?.","Seven days later, all the fruits on the tree had fallen.","The fruits were gone, so they naturally had to continue forward. However, everyone discovered that there was no path ahead of them.","This plain was the end of the Mystery Realm, and there was no way out.","How were they supposed to return?","Another half a day later, a change suddenly took place underneath the Celestial Tree. It was just a pillar of light soaring into the skies.","What was going on?","Everyone gathered around, only to see a complex formation appearing beneath the large tree.","“This is the Transfer Formation,” someone said.","“The way out!”","Quite a number of people were pleasantly surprised. Their speed was not very fast, and they had initially thought that there was no hope for them to charge into the top 12. They had not expected that the formation for them to leave would open so late.","This time, everyone was standing on the same starting line, and everyone had a chance.","Everyone was waiting. Once the formation activated, they would launch an attack. This was first come, first served, and those who were stronger might not have the last laugh.","Very soon, the formation patterns were all displayed, and lit up one after another.","They could leave now.","Instantly, everyone rushed forwards. There was no need to defeat others, as long as they were fast enough.","“A bunch of trash trying to reap without sowing?” An Jiuyue said with a cold chuckle. With a shake of her hands, energy surged into the surroundings, unleashing an indiscriminate barrage of attacks.","Peng, peng, peng! The people in the surroundings were all sent flying.","“Scram!” Hong Tianbu also roared loudly. The single eye of the Primordial Beast opened, and xiu, a ray of light shot out. Wherever it touched, everyone would be turned into stone.","Cheng Daohe slashed out with his sword, and Sword Qi danced, capable of striking the heavens. Everyone dodged.","Meanwhile, Ling Han shot out a murderous aura attack. Everyone was affected, but the stronger one’s strength and willpower, the shorter the time they would be affected.","With this wave, there were only less than twenty people that could continue forward.","The 20 or so people continued to battle. Peng, peng, peng! Occasionally, someone would be sent flying.","There were fewer and fewer people, eighteen, fifteen, thirteen.","After another person left the battle, there were finally only 12 people left.","Everyone stopped attacking. The namelist of 12 people was out, and there was no need for them to continue fighting.","Xiu, a streak of light surged past, enveloping Ling Han and the others, and then they all disappeared.","They were the first to leave the Mystery Realm.","“Haha, congratulations on becoming the 12 people who were the first to fight out of the Mystery Realm, qualifying to participate in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering.” An elder walked out and said to the 12 people, “Come, follow me.” After they left, people gradually came out behind them, but they were immediately sent out of the Holy Land.","This was a Holy Land, and even a Sect Master-level great elite ordinarily did not have the right to enter here.","Led by the old man, Ling Han and the others arrived at a garden. The environment was beautiful, and a refreshing fragrance wafted.","There was a long table in the garden, and it was made up of six square tables that were laid out with white brocade.","“Come, sit,” the old man said, making a gesture of invitation.","Everyone sat down, one after another. Who knew what celestial fruits the Holy Land of Metal Element would offer to welcome them.","Meanwhile, Ling Han looked at the old man. This should be a Cauldron Forging Tier elite, or a Core Formation Tier elite, exuding an incredibly powerful aura of life.","In just a short while, a beautiful female attendant appeared gracefully, delivering a plate of fruits, which had an indescribable fragrance.","“Ten Star Fruit!” Everyone exclaimed in shock, unable to conceal their excitement.","The Ten Star Fruit was priceless, and it could fundamentally improve the physique of a cultivator. Even mediocre cultivators could possibly become prodigies.","The elder smiled, and said, “I’m Duanmu Xue, and you can all address me as Mr. Duanmu. I’m hosting the Metal Element Fruit Gathering this time, and aside from wanting to see the prodigies of the world, I also want to bestow upon all of you a great opportunity.”","The fortune of the Ten Star Fruit was indeed rare.","Duanmu Xue continued, “Aside from the Ten Star Fruit, there is also the Replenishing Source Fruit. The act of cultivation is heaven-defying. Though as the cultivation level increases, the lifespan would also increase, it would actually cause great wear and tear on the body.”","“For example, those in the Cauldron Forging Tier can theoretically live for around 2000 years, but there aren’t many that can truly live for 2000 years. Most can only live for about 1500 years.”","“Why?”","“It’s because the vitality in one’s body has been expended too much, causing one’s lifespan to greatly decrease.”","Duanmu Xue paused for a moment, then continued, “Thus, if you want to walk further on the path of cultivation, you would have to use the Treasured Fruit to compensate for the loss of vitality at every cultivation level.”","“The Replenishing Source Fruit is such a treasure.”","Everyone nodded one after another. Most of them came from forces of Spirit Transformation Tier or even Minor Advanced Tier, so they naturally had no shortage of understanding about this. However, treasures like the Replenishing Source Fruit and the Ten Star Fruit could only be possessed by the Holy Lands.","They all picked up the Treasured Fruit and ate it. This was indeed a great opportunity."]},{"number":3694,"title":"Chapter 3694: Purpose of the Holy Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 3694: Purpose of the Holy Land","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","After everyone had finished eating, Duanmu Xue spoke again, and said, “Aside from the Treasured Fruit, I have another amazing cultivation technique here. As long as you all join the Holy Land and become registered disciples, I can teach it to you.”","Everyone was pleasantly surprised. Something that could be called an extraordinary cultivation technique by the Holy Land, what kind of cultivation technique was it?","Was this created by a Saint?","Meanwhile, Ling Han was surprised. Previously, the bloodshed in the Mystery Realm was so cruel, but now, they were given Treasured Fruits, and also given an amazing cultivation technique. The contrast was really too great.","Just look, he only had to be a registered disciple, so just how much freedom would he have?","However, the Holy Land of Metal Element had sacrificed so much just to obtain a few registered disciples? What was the point?","Ling Han didn’t believe that the Holy Land of Metal Element would be so kind, not giving benefits to their own people, and to outsiders instead. They weren’t fools.","Thus, he couldn’t understand why the Holy Land of Metal Element would be so generous.","“Dare I ask, Mr Duanmu, what is this amazing cultivation technique?” someone asked.","Duanmu Xue nodded, and said, “This is called Seven Saints Divine Art, and can increase your cultivation speed by more than ten times. Furthermore, the quality of mystical power would also be greatly improved. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, your power would clearly be stronger than your opponent.”","Everyone was both surprised and delighted. They were shocked that the Holy Land of Metal Element was actually willing to take out such an important cultivation technique and teach it to them. They were naturally delighted because after learning this cultivation technique, their futures would be bright and dazzling.","Not a single person was suspicious?","Ling Han was astonished. How could treasures fall from the sky for no reason? Were they all idiots?","No, not one of these people was an idiot. The reason why they all looked like they had been blinded by lard was probably because they had been affected by the Celestial Tree previously.","At that time, even he had almost transformed into a murderous demon. Thankfully, he had the Six Characters Bright King Curse to dispel the internal demon in his heart.","This wouldn’t change a person’s mind, but it would definitely have an effect, making them only see the benefits.","Alarm bells rang loudly in Ling Han’s mind. What was this Holy Land of Metal Element doing? They were definitely up to no good.","He remained calm and collected. Worse come to worst, he could just summon the Heavenly Dao Flames. In any case, he was “Niu Jianhua”, and they wouldn’t be able to find him.","“However, cultivating the Seven Saints Divine Art requires the cooperation of two people, one yin and one yang. As the saying goes, solitary yin doesn’t breed, and solitary yang doesn’t grow,” Duanmu Xue said seriously. He clapped his hands, and another twelve people walked over.","Hou Yongzheng, Shi An, and Wen Feiwen were among them. They were precisely the Twelve Star Envoys of the Holy Land of Metal Element.","“Let me introduce. These twelve people are the Twelve Star Envoys of the Holy Land, and they are also the twelve strongest members of the younger generation of our Holy Land,” Duanmu Xue said with a smile. “When one cultivates the Seven Saints Divine Art, the faster one’s partner can cultivate, the faster one’s own cultivation speed will also increase.”","“The Twelve Star Envoys have long since cultivated the Yang chapter of the Seven Saints Divine Art. Now, they will make their choice, and pass on the Yin chapter of the Seven Saints Divine Art. There are also some specific ceremonies that have to be carried out. These are all necessary.”","Hou Yongzheng and the others walked over, and didn’t spend much time either. It was as if they had long since decided, and had each found their own training partner.","Ling Han’s training partner was a woman. She was extremely beautiful, and was also the only female among the Twelve Star Envoys. Her figure was extremely tall, and she was dressed in a tight-fitting red outfit, completely highlighting her impressive figure.","She nodded at Ling Han, and said, “What a coincidence. Junior Brother Niu, my surname is Ma, and my name is Ma Fenyu.”","Was it really a coincidence between a bull and a horse??","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “I would have to disappoint Miss Ma. I have no plans to join a Holy Land, and cultivate this Seven Saints Divine Art.”","When these words fell, everyone was stunned.","Not cultivating?","A cultivation technique that could increase the rate of cultivation by at least tenfold, and you won’t cultivate it?","This was the cultivation technique of a Holy Land!","Could it be that you don’t know what the Twelve Star Envoys represent?","In every generation, only extremely outstanding disciples would be qualified to become candidates for the position of Twelve Star Envoy, and they would have to go through countless competitions before they could officially become a Star Envoy.","Once he became a Star Envoy, this would be a lifetime position. Even if he disappeared or died, it would not be replaced or replenished.","In future, the Star Envoys would all be big shots of the Holy Land, and had hopes of becoming great elites on the level of Sect Master.","Thus, to be able to practice the Seven Saints Divine Art together with a Star Envoy, what kind of great fortune was that?","You actually refused?","Ma Fenyu had not expected this either. She stared blankly at Ling Han, and for a moment, did not know what to say.","“Hehe, I have no plans to cultivate this Seven Saints Divine Art either.” Another voice rang out.","Hong Tianbu!","Duanmu Xue’s expression was a little ugly. Ling Han and Hong Tianbu had the highest standing among this group of people, and they were also the ones he valued the most, yet now they were both saying no?","He humphed, and said, “What a joke. The teachings of the Holy Lands are not something that I would beg you all to learn.” He swept an eye over the others, and asked, “Is there anyone else that does not want to learn?”","No one spoke. Even if their divine sense wasn’t affected, they probably wouldn’t be able to resist the temptation of the Seven Saints Divine Art, right?","“All right, you guys can leave first.” Duanmu Xue waved her hand.","Everyone left, leaving only Ling Han, Hong Tianbu, Duanmu Xue, Ma Yufen, and Jiang Zhengping—Jiang Zhengping was Hong Tianbu’s training partner.","“You guys... really don’t want to learn?” Duanmu Xue’s previously gentle expression changed, and an ominous glint flashed across his face.","Ling Han smiled, “Didn’t Mr Duanmu just say that there is no need to beg us to cultivate the technique of the Holy Land? Then please send us off.”","He very much wanted to personally capture Hong Tianbu and bring him back to the Imperial Capital.","Duanmu Xue sneered, “After eating the Treasured Fruit of our Holy Land, you want to leave just like that?”","Hong Tianbu’s expression changed drastically, and he said, “As expected, there’s a conspiracy behind your teaching of the cultivation technique!”","He had fused with the eye of a Primordial Beast, so his willpower was naturally strong. Though his mind was also slightly affected, it was far better than others.","Duanmu Xue laughed loudly, and said, “Of course! We’re not a charity, specialized in doing good deeds.”","“But what conspiracy could there be in passing on cultivation techniques?” Ling Han asked.","“You don’t have to know that,” Jiang Zhengping said.","Yet Duanmu Xue smiled, and said, “It’s fine. Just tell him. In any case, he can’t possibly run out.”","He was an elite of the Core Formation Tier. So what if Ling Han was a 10-star genius? He could smack him to death with a single hand.","Since he had already said so, it would not be proper for Jiang Zhengping to object further. He only wore a dark expression, very displeased.","He had his eye on Hong Tianbu’s aptitude, but the latter objected. It would be difficult to find another high quality cauldron.","“It’s true that the Seven Saints Divine Art can increase your cultivation speed by 10 times,” Duanmu Xue said calmly. “However, this is at the cost of expending your lifespans. Thus, you can only live for 10 years at most.”","Both Ling Han and Hong Tianbu’s expressions changed drastically. This was far too devious.","“But what benefits do you have?” Hong Tianbu asked in a solemn voice.","“Of course there is,” Duanmu Xue said with a smile. “Have you forgotten that you guys still have a cultivation partner? Ten years later, your cultivation partner will completely absorb your fruits of cultivation, and it would not be a problem for them to charge up to the cultivation level of a major tier in one go, saving a few hundred years, or even a thousand years of hard cultivation in fact!”","F***, so ruthless!"]},{"number":3695,"title":"Chapter 3695: Burning the Holy Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 3695: Burning the Holy Land","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","“You guys are really ruthless!” Hong Tianbu said.","A noble Holy Land was actually so despicable!","“You guys only have two options. The first option is to die now, and the second option is to continue living for another ten years. I can guarantee you that you guys will have an extremely exciting life in these ten years,” Duanmu Xue said.","“Excitingyour sister!” Ling Han scoffed, “I’ll let you have this opportunity.” “Hehe, if I am talented enough, I would be willing to become a cauldron, and contribute to the Holy Land,” Duanmy Xue said calmly, “This is a great mission. Though there are only ten exciting years left of your lives, in future, your lives will continue on in the corresponding Star Envoy, dazzling the entire universe.”","This was really cheap talk; there was no need for you to sacrifice yourself.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “You’re merely a force of Saint-level, so why are you acting all high and mighty? Don’t forget, you people don’t even have a Saint. At most, you only have a few Venerate Tier elites standing guard, and you still say that you can illuminate the entire galaxy. This is practically hilarious.”","“How dare you!” Jiang Zhengping shouted harshly.","Duanmu Xue waved his hand, and said, “Young man, everyone has a predetermined fate, and your fate is to become the cauldron of the Twelve Star Envoys, burning your life force for their sake.”","“Humph!” Hong Tianbu smirked coldly. He had obtained the personal teachings of a Spirit Transformation True Lord. Moreover, his luck was heaven-defying, and he had even fused with the eye of a Primordial Beast. Thus, he had obtained countless rare treasures.","Now, could a Core Formation Tier cultivator trap him?","Meanwhile, Ling Han shook his head, “Old geezer, do you know that you are planting a calamity of destruction for the Holy Land!”","“Ha, hahaha!” Duanmu Xue laughed loudly.","Jiang Zhengping and Ma Yufen also bared their mouths and smirked coldly. A mere Foundation Building junior actually said that he would destroy the Holy Land; wasn’t that the biggest joke in the world?","To say nothing of the fact that the Holy Land still had a Saint Tool, with Venerate Tiers at the fourth pinnacle level standing by, even if a few Cauldron Forging Tier elites were dispatched, they would still be able to easily crush Ling Han into dust.","Threatening the Holy Land?","Hehe, they really did not know where he had gotten such courage from.","“Oh, what tricks do you have? Show me,” Duanmu Xue said. He was also bored, and that was why he had gone to tease such a minor character.","In any case, he had nothing else to do anyway.","Ling Han smiled, “You really want to see it?”","“Don’t hide it, use it,” Duanmu Xue said indifferently.","“You won’t regret it?” Ling Han asked again.","“You only know how to speak glibly, and I can’t be bothered to waste any more time on you.” Duanmu Xue smirked coldly. He stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at Ling Han.","A cultivator of Core Formation Tier moved. Boom, his aura was like a mountain, crushing everything in its path.","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This time, the precious tool no longer kept a low profile. The air of Primal Chaos descended, and lightning flickered, exuding a powerful aura that could suppress the nine heavens and ten lands.","Duanmu Xue couldn’t help but pause in his attacks. He stared fixedly at the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and his eyes were about to light up.","“This is... a Saint Tool?” His heart throbbed wildly. Aside from Saint Grade materials, how could there possibly be such an aura?","He couldn’t be blamed for being blind. He was only at the Core Formation Tier, so even if he were born in a Holy Land, he couldn’t possibly have seen a Saint Tool. After all, even Saint Tools couldn’t remain indestructible for eternity. Thus, in order to ensure that Saint Tools could last as long as possible, the power of heaven and earth was usually used to suppress and seal them, preventing them from ageing.","If he could obtain a Saint-level ingredient, just how strong would he become? Even if he handed it over to the higher-ups of the Holy Land, it would definitely be a great contribution and he could obtain unimaginable cultivation resources in exchange.","To say nothing of True Self Tier elites, even reaching Sect Master-level might not be an extravagant hope.","“Hahaha, I never thought that you would actually have such a treasure hidden on you!” Duanmu Xue laughed loudly, and continued to stretch out his hand, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “You’ve brought this upon yourself!” With a thought, the ninth level of the Primal Chaos Extreme LightningTower opened. Hong, the terrifying Heavenly Dao Flames surged out violently, turning into a wave of endless flames.","This was Heavenly Dao Flames. Even if it was slightly weaker than it had been in the Flaming Canyon, it was still capable of burning a Venerate Tier to death. What kind of terrifying existence was this?","Boom, the waves of fire surged rapidly, and instantly spread to Duanmu Xue,","Ma Yufen and Jiang Zhengping.","“Ah-”","“No!”","The three of them screamed in agony, their expressions filled with endless terror. However, what was the use? As the flames swept past them, they did not even leave behind the slightest bit of ash.","They were all extremely dissatisfied, especially Duanmu Xue. He was a Core Formation Tier elite, and his true battle prowess was enough to insta-kill Ling Han. However, in front of the Heavenly Dao Flames, he became a piece of trash that couldn’t be any weaker.","There was even less need to mention Ma Yufen and Jiang Zhengping. Though they were the Star Envoys of this generation, what were mere Foundation Building Tier cultivators worth in front of Heavenly Dao Flames?","On the other hand, Hong Tianbu was truly extraordinary.","Ling Han saw very clearly that when the Heavenly Dao Flames surged past, a massive single eye appeared above his head, emitting light. It actually turned the Heavenly Dao Flames into stone for a moment. Though it was only for an instant, it gave him a chance to escape.","He tore open a talisman, and with a ‘xiu’, it instantly disappeared.","This was probably something like Talisman Weapon, which could allow him to travel ten thousand miles.","Ling Han was slightly surprised. Looks like he had still underestimated Hong Tianbu. At first, he had thought that the eye of the Primordial Beast that Hong Tianbu had fused together with would only be Sect Master-level, at most, but from the look of things now, it was very possible that it had reached the level of Venerate Tier.","Strange, wasn’t the Celestial Sea Planet a low-level planet? At most, it was a medium-level planet, so how could there be such a big shot like the Venerate Tier?","Boom, just as he was pondering, the Heavenly Dao Flames also spread wider and wider, as if it wanted to turn the entire Holy Land into a sea of flames. The Heavenly Dao Flames were too terrifying, and could even kill Venerate Tier elites. There was nothing that could stop them from burning their way over. Thankfully, the further this spread out, the slower the progress of the Heavenly Dao Flames would be. Otherwise, no one would be spared.","Even so, the entire Holy Land was still in a state of chaos, with endless screams of pain ringing out.","People could leave, but the Celestial Plants couldn’t!","Wherever the flames passed, the Medicinal Gardens along the way were all burnt to ashes.","Seizing this opportunity, he fled.","Ling Han thought to himself. He hurriedly used the Imminent Skyline and fled. “Who dares to be insolent in a Holy Land!” A terrifying voice rang out, and then a massive figure appeared in the skies. It was at least three thousand meters tall, but it seemed to have been formed from light, and did not have any physical feeling.","This was a Venerate Tier from the Holy Land. He lived at the summit, so he was affected by the Heavenly Dao Flames at a later time. He had also lost the chance to make a move at the first instant.","He delivered a palm strike, wanting to extinguish the flames, but his palm strike had instead drawn fire onto himself. Not only had the flames not been extinguished, they were instead burning upwards along his hand.","Boom, his whole body was burning fiercely.","The Heavenly Dao Flames were capable of annihilating Venerate Tier elites. “Heavens, even the Origin Bear Venerate is no match. Could it be that another Holy Land has sent out a Saint Tool to attack?”","Seeing this, the survivors of the Holy Land all exclaimed in shock.","Weng, just at this moment, a golden light soared from the mountains. Then, a golden ruler appeared in midair, exuding an indescribably terrifying aura. Saint Tool, Heaven Measuring Metal Ruler!"]},{"number":3696,"title":"Chapter 3696: Return","paragraphs":["Chapter 3696: Return","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This was the Heaven Measuring Metal Ruler, and it had been forged by the Metal Element Saint all those years ago. It was a genuine Saint Tool!","The moment this ruler appeared, endless golden light descended. The great power of heaven and earth was also drawn, condensing the endless power of heaven and earth, which pressed down on the Heavenly Dao Flames.","If this Heavenly Dao Flames had not been weakened, then even the Saint Tool would not be able to suppress it. This was a terrifying flame that could burn a Saint to death in the first place.","However, the might of the Heavenly Dao Flames had already been weakened, so it was no match for the Saint Tool.","However, the Heavenly Dao Flames was still the Heavenly Dao Flames. Although the Heavenly Dao Flames could be suppressed, it wasn’t so easily extinguished. It could only extinguish the flames bit by bit. This wasn’t something that could be done in a short while, but would take at least eight to ten days, or even longer.","The only good news was that the flames had finally stopped spreading.","The members of the Holy Land of Metal Element were all furious and confused. What in the world was going on?","Had some Holy Land attacked?","Otherwise, how could even a Venerate Tier was not able to block these flames? Even the Heaven Measuring Golden Ruler had to expend so much effort to extinguish them?","As a noble Holy Land, two-thirds of its territory had actually been directly burnt down. For the moment, there was no way to keep track of how many people had died, but the Medicinal Gardens could not be moved. The losses could be said to be very direct.","There was only one word for it: disastrous!","Which force was it? They definitely had to take responsibility, and definitely had to pay compensation!","Every disciple of the Holy Land was incredibly furious. They would definitely not let this matter go, definitely not.","Ling Han had already ran out of the Holy Land. Now that the situation was so chaotic, who would care about a mere Human Dao Foundation like him?","Furthermore, he had already removed the Battle Armor and mask — the Battle Armor had long since been severely damaged, and he had directly thrown it away. The mask could also possibly expose his identity, and he too had thrown it aside.","Right now, he wasn’t “Niu Jianhua” who was participating in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering. Instead, he was a young Human Tier Low Grade alchemist.","He first found the empress and the others, and did not say anything else, leaving with them.","When they arrived at the next city, Ling Han went out to make enquiries, and soon found out.","—After the Holy Land of Metal Element was tossed around like this, the two Venerate Tier elites that had gone out had already been summoned back, and one Venerate Tier elite that had gone into seclusion had been woken up. Added with another overseer, the four Venerate Tier elites had all gone crazy, searching for the whereabouts of the attackers.","At first, they suspected that it was the doing of another Holy Land, especially the Holy Land of Crimson Fire. Their Flaming Mirror could spew out fiery flames that could kill Venerate Tier elites.","However, after carefully distinguishing the power of flames, it was very easy to discover that the flames blasted out by the Flaming Mirror were different from this.","Thus, this should have nothing to do with the Holy Land of Crimson Fire.","They traced the source of the flames, and finally discovered that the flames had started from the venue where the Metal Element Fruit Gathering was hosted. At that time, there had been 12 outsiders, and 10 of them had followed ten of the Star Envoys. Only two of them had stayed behind.","One was Hong Tianbu, and the other was called Niu Jianhua.","Thus, these terrifying flames must be related to these two people.","Find these two people!","The Holy Land of Metal Element issued a bounty for Hong Tianbu and Niu Jianhua.","Both of them had their names and origins, so it was naturally not difficult to find them.","“Yi, how did you become Niu Jianhua?” The little loli licked the candy, and suddenly gave an ‘oh’. “You screwed him over again!”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “What nonsense are you spouting?”","Since he was sure that he wasn’t implicated in this matter, Ling Han decided to return to Celestial Sea Planet. In the case of Princess Bixiao, it was heard that those who had not made it into the top 12 had all been kicked out of the Holy Land, so she would have to think of a way to return on her own.","Then he would first find Princess Bixiao, and let her have a free ride. Otherwise, she really would not be able to return to Celestial Sea Planet.","...The Holy Land of Metal Element was presently burnt so badly, so how could they still be in the mood to send these people back?","“Yi, husband, is this your newly married wife?” the empress asked.","“Howcould that be!” Ling Han immediately shook his head, and said with a righteous expression, “Previously, there was only one thought in my head, and that was how to get you guys out. How could I be in the mood to flirt with others?”","“That may not be the case,” the empress said calmly. “Husband, you are so outstanding. There are too many women that have pounced over on their own.” The princess of the Demon Race? That couldn’t be, right?","“That’s right, Father is the most outstanding!” Third Baby nodded. Like the empress, she was also the proud type.","“Alright, stop sucking up. Let’s hurry up and find her, then return,” Ling Han said.","As the main culprit, Ling Han still felt a little guilty. Naturally, he had to leave as soon as possible to feel safe.","He went to find Princess Bixiao. She was in the Seven Void City, and all those who had come to attend the Metal Element Fruit Gathering were staying here. The Holy Land of Metal Element had said that it would send them back in the future, but it didn’t say how long.","Thus, Ling Han easily found Princess Bixiao.","“Yi, these two are—” When Princess Bixiao saw the empress and Hu Niu, she couldn’t help but feel surprised.","She didn’t remember that Ling Han had these two people by his side.","“Oh, they’re both my wives,” Ling Han said casually.","Princess Bixiao was instantly stunned. ‘Are you here to attend the Metal Element Fruit Gathering, or are you here to pick up girls?’ Moreover, there were two of them in one go.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “We’ve already married long ago. We’ve already had many children and grandchildren.”","This was the honest truth, but how could Princess Bixiao believe it?","Just look at him. He looked to be only twenty years old, and he actually had grandchildren?","Hehe!","Princess Bixiao shook her head internally. Pei, this fickle man!","If she had known earlier, she should have made a move earlier, and pushed Ling Han down. In that way, she would at least be First Madam.","Pei, pei, pei! What nonsense was she letting her imagination run wild for? She did not like this kind of fickle man.","They returned, and the shuttle streaked through the air, heading towards Celestial Sea Planet.","They traversed through the nodes, and this was another long journey of half a year.","Ling Han didn’t feel that time was hard to pass. Although he couldn’t cultivate, he could study formation patterns, and this would need to expend countless time and effort in the first place.","Unknowingly, half a year had passed, and the shuttle had finally returned to Celestial Sea Planet.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think that it would be great if there was a Transfer Formation that connected the Celestial Sea Planet directly to other planets. Then, with a xiu, he would be able to traverse the boundless galaxy, and reach his destination directly — at worst, he would just have to jump a few times between a few formations.","After returning to the Imperial Capital, Ling Han first went to visit Lin Luo and the others.","As expected of a great elite that could cultivate to the Seventh Tier in the Genesis World. Those few that had once been Seventh Tier Heavenly Venerates had now advanced into the Enlightenment Tier. Being able to reach such heights in a year and a half, even with the help of cultivation resources provided by Ling Han, the strength of their natural talent could still be seen.","In comparison, the empress and the others had lost a year’s time to cultivate on the Black Moon Planet because they had followed Ling Han to the Black Moon Planet. At present, they were still only Blood Transformation Tiers, which was considerably inferior.","Unfortunately, even Lin Luo and the others were unable to cultivate the Seventh Change, the Seventh Extreme, and the Seven Inscriptions.","Since Ling Han was the only one who could do it, a special case like him could be ignored.","He could break through his limits at every cultivation level. No matter where he was, he was a prodigy among prodigies.","After advancing into Celestial Path, all of them could become four-star geniuses, or perhaps even higher, right?","Before long, Lin Luo, Zhou Heng and the others would be able to share Ling Han’s burden.","Ling Han temporarily stayed low, studying formation techniques."]},{"number":3697,"title":"Chapter 3697: Celestial Sea Planet’s glory","paragraphs":["Chapter 3697: Celestial Sea Planet’s glory","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","With Wally’s help, Ling Han’s grasp of formation patterns became deeper and deeper. He believed that it wouldn’t take long for him to grasp enough formation patterns and lay out the first formation.","The large black dog finally advanced into the Blood Transformation Tier. After ingesting a Transformation Fruit, he could finally open his mouth to speak. Of course, he could also take human form, but he obviously preferred the form of a dog. He still maintained the form of a dog. Furthermore, he was wearing iron underwear again, always feeling that this would protect his vital points better.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel curious. Had this guy’s an*s been dug out by his own kind in his last life? Why was he so anxious about his behind?","“Grandpa Dog’s going to suffocate to death!” After the large black dogwas able to speak, he continued to speak for a whole three days, directly making the pervert pig pass out. It was clear how capable and annoying the large black dog was.?????????????????????? 5","Ling Han handed the Ice Origin Stones to the empress and Hu Niu. The large black dog also received a few, helping them quickly increase their cultivation. With Ice Origin Stones, Brother Monkey Cultivation Technique, support cultivation technique, and large amounts of resources, the empress and the others’ cultivation levels were rapidly catching up.","In only half a month, the two people and one dog advanced into Extreme Bone Tier, and in another dozen over days, they broke through again, advancing into Inscription Tier at a chillingly fast speed.","Ling Han even stopped his comprehension of formation patterns, and deliberately came out to warn them not to break through so quicldy, or there would definitely be great problems.","Another half month passed, and Ling Han finally grasped enough formation patterns to construct the first Celestial level formation.","He walked casually, and his speed wasn’t fast. It looked ordinary, but with every step, Spiritual Power would change the power of heaven and earth. Multiple veined patterns that couldn’t be seen with the naked eye spread out on the ground.","After walking three rounds, Ling Han finally stopped, revealing a smile.","The formation was completed.","Come, go in and play.” Ling Han picked up the perverted pig, and shua, threw it in.","Gu! The perverted pig released a blood-curdling scream, as he stared at Ling Han with a bitter and hateful gaze. This b@stard, always having Uncle Pig take the attack of the formation, b@stard, b@stard.","Pa, the fat pig landed, and instantly, those invisible veined patterns on the ground lit up at the same time, turning into thirty-six pillars of light that shot towards the fat pig.","“Gu! Gu! Gu!” As the pervert pig screamed, he hurriedly fled out of the formation. Pity his short legs; his running really made people anxious. Meanwhile, Ling Han revealed a satisfied smile. This was actually the formation that protected the Ice Origin Stone in the Frost Origin Mystery Realm. He had modified it, and it was no longer one, three, or nine pillars of light increasing gradually in number. Instead, he directly shot out thirty-six pillars of light.","However, the formation patterns he grasped were still limited, so thirty-six pillars of light were the limit.","Additionally, he had only used his Spiritual Power to temporarily change the power of heaven and earth. The time this formation existed was extremely limited, and very soon, the power of heaven and earth would return to normal, and the formation would naturally cease to exist.","If he wanted the formation to last forever, he would have to use the formation foundations.","“Since it’s proven that the formation works, I’ll start creating formation foundations.” Ling Han nodded, then felt a grip tighten on his trouser leg. He looked down, and saw that the pervert pig was biting his trouser leg, his expression filled with deep hatred.","Don’t be so stingy. Your skin is thick, and you’re fine anyways,” Ling Han said with a smile.","‘Fine my a*s! It hurts like hell, b@stard!’","The pervert wasn’t willing to let go, and just bit down tightly.","If you want to bite, then bite.","Ling Han set off, continuing to do his own things.","Ling Han! Ling Han!” Xuanyuan Dingguo’s anxious voice traveled over, and it wasn’t long before he appeared. “Big news! Big news! Really big news!” Ling Han smiled faintly, “What big news has made you so anxious?” Xuanyuan Dingguo panted heavily, and he was just about to speak. However, he suddenly faltered, pointed at the perverted pig, and said, “Why is there a pig biting on your pants?”","“It’s fine. Don’t worry about it,” Ling Han said with a smile. He took two steps, then sat down.","Xuanyuan Dingguo stared at Ling Han, feeling that the appearance of a pig hanging from Ling Han’s leg—this was a bit funny.","So weird but attractive, he couldn’t even move his eyes away.","‘Er, Xuanyuan, where’s the big news?” Ling Han asked.","“Oh.” Xuanyuan Dingguo shook his head, forcibly averted his gaze, and said, Do you know that this Celestial Sea Planet of ours is actually very impressive, very impressive!”","“How impressive?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“We... have produced a Saint before!” Xuanyuan Dingguo said. He looked forward to seeing Ling Han’s expression of shock.","However, he was disappointed. Ling Han didn’t look shocked, only a little confused.","Ling Han was indeed very confused. If a Saint had appeared on Celestial Sea Planet, then wouldn’t their grade be even higher than the Moonlight Planet? However, why had the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire bestowed the Celestial Sea Planet on the ancestors of the Chen Clan?","How could there be such a good thing?","“How do you know?” Ling Han asked.","Xuanyuan Dingguo pretended to be mysterious and said, “You guess?”","Ling Han merely looked at him, and did not speak.","Xuanyuan Dingguo’s expression instantly became resentful. ‘It’s not like you’ll lose a piece of flesh if you guess. How uncooperative.’ He sighed, and said, “It’s already a hot topic now. It’s just that you won’t know since you are hiding here and don’t come out.’","How could this kind of news be spread out for no reason? There has to be someone who said it first,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Xuanyuan Dingguo nodded and said, “It’s the four great sects.”","There were many forces on the Celestial Sea Planet, but only Primordial Sect, Nine Spirits Sect, and the other four Spiritual Transformation Tier-level forces could be called the four great sects.","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’, and said, “That alone can’t be considered big news right?”","Xuanyuan Dingguo nodded and said, “You don’t know, but Celestial Sea Planet was a great planet that nurtured a Saint. He was called Ancient Sun Saint, and his abilities were so powerful that he could destroy planets with a flip of his hand. He’s ranked among the top even in the universe.”","‘Thinking back to the past, all the top prodigies in the galaxy had lined up to come to our place, wanting to become disciples of Ancient Sun Saint. Countless elites had travelled through the galaxy to come here, just to listen to the teachings of Ancient Sun Saint.”","“Stop, stop, stop!” Ling Han hurriedly waved his hands, “Get to the point.”","The point...” Xuanyuan Dingguo glanced at the perverted pig. He kept feeling that this scene was weirdly captivating, and he couldn’t help but look over. “However, who knows how many millenia ago, a huge event happened.” He didn’t keep him in suspense, and continued, “It is said that countless elites appeared out of nowhere that year, wanting to invade the Celestial Sea Planet. As a result, Ancient Sun Saint led the cultivators of the Celestial Sea Planet to battle fiercely with those elites.”","“In the end, those invading elites were all annihilated, and the Ancient Sun Saint had also died. The elites of the Celestial Sea Planet had also died completely.”","“It is said that the great battle was incredibly cruel, and even destroyed the Celestial Sea Planet. Thus, our Celestial Sea Planet suddenly fell from a top-tier great planet to an ordinary planet. The present Celestial Sea Planet is only the largest shard left from the previous planet.”","Sigh, if these elites hadn’t suddenly charged over, wouldn’t we have had the protection of a Saint? Wouldn’t we have been incredibly mighty?”"]},{"number":3698,"title":"Chapter 3698: Inheritance of a Saint","paragraphs":["Chapter 3698: Inheritance of a Saint","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han patted Xuanyuan Dingguo’s shoulder and said, “Be realistic. However, if it’s just this, it can’t be regarded as big news, right?”","It could only be said that Celestial Sea Planet had a glorious history.","Xuanyuan Dingguo glanced at him and said, “You’re a hot-tempered person. Can’t you wait patiently for me to finish?”","Ling Han raised his hands and said, “Fine, fine, fine. Just say it, I won’t interrupt.”","Xuanyuan Dingguo finally said, “Our Celestial Sea Planet has produced a Saint before, so it naturally has the inheritance of a Saint as well!”","Only now did Ling Han take him seriously, “Now, do we have the whereabouts of the inheritance of the Saint?”","“Look at you. You just said not to interrupt, so why are you interrupting again?” Xuanyuan Dingguo pointed out.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel speechless. ‘You’ll be beaten if you speak like this, do you know that?’","“During the great battle, the nearby galaxy had all become dead planets. Even in the tens of thousands of years after the battle ended, no one could enter, as they would be killed by the chaotic energy,” Xuanyuan Dingguo said again.","“When the chaotic energy dissipated a little, great elites entered to search for the inheritance of the Saint, but they still couldn’t find it.”","“After searching for tens of thousands of years, there was still no result. Everyone thought that the inheritance of the Saint had also been destroyed in the great battle.”","“From then onwards, Celestial Sea Planet became a small planet that no one took to heart.”","Xuanyuan Dingguo paused, then continued, “Until now.”","“What’s going on now?” Ling Han asked.","“Now, hehe.” Xuanyuan Dingguo kept Ling Han hanging for a while, then said, “Previously, didn’t our Celestial Sea Planet become a prison? Those like the Primordial True Lord and Nine Spirits True Lord were imprisoned for several thousand years and had nothing to do all day, so they did a lot of research, and actually discovered some information about the ancient times there.”","“Those are a few stone tablets. They record the inheritance of the Ancient Sun Saint.”","“It is said that the Ancient Sun Saint has not been able to find a suitable successor all this while, and was worried that when his lifespan had reached its end, his own Dao would be lost, so he set up a Mystery Realm as a test for descendants.”","“As long as you pass the test of this Mystery Realm, you will be able to obtain the inheritance of the Saint!”","Xuanyuan Dingguo was filled with envy. “If I can obtain the inheritance of a Saint, then what would a Spirit Transformation True Lord be worth? I can kill him with a single palm strike.”","Ling Han smiled, and did not strike a blow on him.","Even if he had obtained the inheritance of a Saint, the height that he could reach would still have to depend on his own natural talent. Otherwise, wouldn’t there be Venerate Tier elites everywhere in the Holy Land, and as many Sect Masters as dogs?","The inheritance of a Saint could indeed help a cultivator improve further, but if one’s original limit was Cauldron Forging Tier, then at most, hewould only reach the level of Core Formation Tier, and could not possibly break through the limits.","Xuanyuan Dingguo still hadn’t reached Mystery Realm Tier, so his natural talent could only be considered average. In the future, being able to leap over the Celestial Gate should be his limit. Wanting to kill a Spirit Transformation True Lord with a single palm strike was destined to only be a wonderful idea.","“At present, the four great True Lords are all searching for the location of that Mystery Realm.” Xuanyuan Dingguo said, “It is said that in the past tens of thousands of years, that Mystery Realm has also opened, but no one has passed the test. And now, it should be very close to the opening of this Mystery Realm.”","“I’m definitely going to seize this opportunity to soar into the sky,” Xuanyuan Dingguo said as he patted Ling Han’s shoulder. “In the future, I’ll protect you.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh loudly, and nodded, “Sure.”","A thought flashed in his mind. Although he now had the Great Sun Lotus Technique, which allowed him to cultivate, that was a reward given through the lowest level of the nine-storey towers, the Black Iron Tower, so how much better could it be?","If he could obtain a Saint’s mental cultivation technique... then his cultivation speed would definitely increase to another level.","You see, more than a year had passed, and he had not advanced much in the stage of Human Dao Foundation. His cultivation technique was really too poor.","—There was naturally another reason for this. For example, there was a whole year’s time that he had spent traversing through the universe, and there was no way for him to cultivate at all.","Ling Han secretly decided that if this whatnot Mystery Realm opened, he would definitely interfere.","“Probably, this Mystery Realm is located in our Dark North Nation. Otherwise, it would be fine for the four Spirit Transformation True Lords to search on their own, so why do they need to spread the news? They definitely want His Majesty to cooperate,” Xuanyuan Dingguo said.","Ling Han thought so as well. Otherwise, the four Spirit Transformation True Lords could just silently make a fortune.","Could it be that the Primordial True Lord and the others had escaped from the prison, buthad not managed to escape far enough from Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, and that was for the sake of Ancient Sun Saint’s inheritance?","It was extremely possible. For the sake of obtaining the inheritance of the Saint, taking this kind of risk was definitely worth it. Who knows, they may even have a chance to become Saints. By then, they could seek out the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire for revenge, and that would be a small matter.","Even if they did not become Saints, if this allowed them to take another step further, and become great elites at the level of Sect Master, with how big the world was, where could they not go?","Ling Han wanted to concoct the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill. However, he couldn’t find Foxwood. This was in the hands of the five great Spirit Transformation Tier-level forces, and couldn’t be bought at all.","—The present Celestial Sea Planet seemed to be in the stage of enlightenment, and the market was not adequate. Probably, only Ling Han was the only alchemist above Celestial Path. In such an environment, how could Celestial level medicinal ingredients possibly circulate in the market?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel like he was about to leave the Celestial Sea Planet. In this place, his alchemy abilities wouldn’t be reflected at all.","However, he had best wait for that Mystery Realm first.","After a few days, Ling Han was studying formations, but a feeling of apprehension rose up in his heart. He opened the door and looked into the distance, only to see a pillar of light soaring into the sky, brighter than even the sun.","After a while, the pillar of light disappeared, but after an hour, the pillar of light reappeared, as if sending out a signal.","There were many theories about this light.","Some said that a precious tool was about to appear, while others thought that a great elite was concocting a Celestial pill, and its celestial light had soared into the skies. There were also some said that an Innate Divine Physique had appeared. There was a considerable number of believers for each theory.","However, in the end, these were all proven to be rumors.","This was the birth of a Mystery Realm, and this Mystery Realm was the Moon Occult Mystery Realm where one could obtain the inheritance of the Ancient Sun Saint!","Ling Han brought the empress and the others with him, and rushed to the place where the pillar of light had shot out at the first instant.","This was an ordinary place, a desolate plain. Occasionally, there would be a few weeds growing here and there, appearing to be very lifeless. However, every hour, a thick pillar of light would shoot up into the skies, directly sinking into the depths of the galaxy.","Where was the Mystery Realm?","It hadn’t officially opened yet, so the entrance couldn’t be seen?","Ling Han settled down nearby. Once the Mystery Realm opened, he would enter at the first instant.","And in the next few days, there was a storm brewing.","Because this Mystery Realm was located in the Dark North Nation, the Primordial True Lord and the others naturally wouldn’t stand by and watch. They all rushed over with a large number of elites, exerting pressure on Chen Fengyan. Obviously, once the Mystery Realm opened, they would also barge in.","Not only that, but flashes of light from Transfer Formations actually appeared in various places on the Celestial Sea Planet, and a considerable number of young prodigies poured in.","These young prodigies had brought with them a letter from a Sect Master-level elite at least, and “hoped” that elites like Chen Fengyan, Primordial True Lord and the other elites could give them some face and allow these youngsters to enter into the Moon Occult Mystery Realm."]},{"number":3699,"title":"Chapter 3699: Small marketplace","paragraphs":["Chapter 3699: Small marketplace","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","How had it alerted so many extraterrestrial visitors?","As it turned out, the Mystery Realm’s light illuminated the galaxy. At least, the galaxies nearby could see it clearly. The great elites made some calculations, and discovered that the Moon Occult Mystery Realm had once again opened, so they activated the Transfer Formation, sending their descendants to the Celestial Sea Planet.","Because the Celestial Sea Planet was a great planet in the ancient times, there was naturally no shortage of Transfer Formations that transcended galaxies. However, after the Celestial Sea Planet disintegrated, its level dropped drastically, so no one was teleported here again.","— Transferring once would consume a great amount of resources, and even the Holy Lands would feel the pinch.","But this time was different. The Moon Occult Mystery Realm was directly related to the inheritance of a Saint, and even Spiritual Transformation Tier forces would grit their teeth and teleport their juniors over.","Those extraterrestrial visitors knew even more about the Moon Occult Mystery Realm.","It would only open once every 10,000 years, and the entry condition was Foundation Building Tier—Cauldron Forging Tier elites and above could also enter, but their cultivation level would be suppressed to Foundation Building Tier.","10,000 years ago, the Moon Occult Mystery Realm had actually opened as well. However, no one had obtained the inheritance of the Saint.","This time, the Moon Occult Mystery Realm was about to open. Thus, those forces that knew of the existence of the Moon Occult Mystery Realm immediately sent people over to contend for the great opportunity.","This was the inheritance of a Saint, so who wouldn’t be tempted?","However, because the higher one’s cultivation level was teleported, the greater the price one would have to pay. In any case, those with the cultivation level of Sect Master-level would also be weakened when he entered into the Mystery Realm, so what was the point of such a mighty figure coming?","Thus, they had only sent their juniors over, who brought a letter with them. By now, there was probably no one on the Celestial Sea Planet that would dare not give them face.","If they were really angered, and spared no expense to teleport here, wouldn’t Celestial Sea Planet be instantly destroyed?","Previously, when Celestial Sea Planet revived, a great many well-known figures of the younger generation came, such as Niu Jianhua and the others. They even wanted to obtain top-grade Foundation Building Divine Stones her, snatching the great opportunities.","However, in comparison, the group of people from before could only be considered... ordinary.","Would a prodigy from a true great sect lack such low-level materials?","Hence, right until this time, when it involved the inheritance of the Saint, true prodigies finally came.","It was said that the prodigies that had come this time were really extraordinary. There was no shortage of three-star geniuses. It was said that they were also four-star geniuses, which was very amazing.","Because the basic requirement for entering into the Mystery Realm was Foundation Building, Ling Han first sent the empress, Hu Niu and the others back to the Imperial Capital. That was Dark North Nation’s base camp, and for the moment, no one dared to mess around, so it was quite safe.","When Ling Han returned, only Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby were left by his side.","Princess Bixiao had advanced into the Foundation Building Tier, so she naturally had to enter into the Moon Occult Mystery Realm. Meanwhile, Sixth Baby’s invisibility technique had great uses, so Ling Han kept her with him. The other babies were in the Imperial Capital protecting the empress and the others.","Tang Yun’er also stayed in the Imperial Capital. She had already been conquered by the empress’s charms, and stuck to the empress every day like a bug. Since the empress didn’t come, she naturally couldn’t be bothered to pay attention to Ling Han.","Moreover, she wouldn’t be able to enter the Mystery Realm either.","Everyone was waiting. Since the Mystery Realm was glowing, it meant that it was close to opening.","Some people were very low-key, and simply waited in secret, but there were some people who were very arrogant. They were born on a high-tier planet, and had a Sect Master, or even great elites like Venerate Tier, backing them up. Now that they had come to such a backward planet, how could they possibly know how to behave?","Who dared to touch them? Who dared to punish them? Wouldn’t they be afraid that the big shots behind them would immediately come over through the Transfer Formation and flatten Celestial Sea Planet?","In the past few days, there had been an endless stream of fights and scuffles. There had also been a banquet hosted by well-connected extraterrestrial prodigies, who had established a wide network, in preparation for entering into the Mystery Realm.","Though Ling Han was the number one prodigy among the natives, he had been completely overlooked.","—On such a backward planet, what prodigy could there be?","Even the strongest was only a Spirit Transformation Tier.","In the eyes of these prodigies, the inheritance of the Saint in the Moon Occult Mystery Realm was completely prepared for them. They only had to enter, and stretch out a hand, and they would be able to obtain the inheritance of the Saint.","And coming out of the Mystery Realm was the real difficulty, because there was no force that would allow anyone to easily take away the inheritance of the Saint. A great battle would definitely break out.","A large number of people had gathered here, and it was possible that they would not be spending just a day or two here. Thus, there were a great many tents erected nearby, and there were some that were even more exaggerated. The Spatial Celestial Spirit Tool actually contained a small courtyard, and tossed there, it was like they were the locals.","There were all kinds of people, even if they were prodigies. There were those who were hardworking, and there were also those who were laidback. There were those who were pure-hearted and had few desires, and there were also those who were lustful.","Recently, there had been cases of women being molested, and there was more than one pervert, causing everyone to be anxious. A great many women no longer dared to go out.","Once there were many people, a small marketplace was formed here. After all, every planet had its own specialty products, and very rarely could they be sold across galaxies. This time was a very good opportunity.","Ling Han and Princess Bixiao were also very interested, so they brought Sixth Baby along with them to join in on the excitement.","There were a lot of these things, and there was also quite a lot of good stuff. Unfortunately, they all had to be traded with Dao Stones, and no one accepted jade seeds at all.","Ling Han only had three Dao Stones on him, but there was quite a lot of One or Two Star-level materials. Previously, he had robbed so many people, so his gains were naturally considerable.","He had also set up a street stall, and Princess Bixiao was responsible for the flow of customers. A great beauty was always capable of attracting the eyes of others.","As expected, there were endless people coming over, but after seeing the beauty, the majority would also look at the goods on the street stall in passing. If they had their eye on them, they would naturally make a move.","In fact, the best seller was naturally the Silver Dragon Fish. This kind of treasure was exclusive to the Holy Land, but there were only so many Silver Dragon Fish, so how could Ling Han possibly take them out? There wasn’t even enough to share among his own people.","After selling for an entire morning, the number of Dao Stones in Ling Han’s possession had also reached several hundred.","He decided to close up the stall first and see if there was any Foxwood. He would then refine the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill. Combined with the Silver Dragon Fish, his cultivation would definitely advance by a significant amount.","He turned around, and he really found Foxwood. It was very mature, and was sold for thirty Dao Stones each. However, he only needed one tenth of it every time he concocted an alchemical pill, so he could concoct the alchemical pill a great many times.","“Friend, did you buy Foxwood to concoct the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill?” the stall keeper asked.","“En.” Ling Han nodded.","The stall keeper looked surprised, “You know how to concoct alchemical pills?”","“A little.” Ling Han was very modest.","“Then if you refine Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills, can you sell me a few?” the stall keeper said. “In return, I can sell you even older Foxwood.”","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He was naturally filled with confidence in his ability to concoct alchemical pills. If there was a large supply of Foxwood, then the people by his side would have a guaranteed rate of cultivation when they set foot on Celestial Path in the future.","“Deal.”","Ling Han handed the Dao Stones over, and was just about to tell Princess Bixiao to leave, but when he looked left and right, this Demon Race princess was nowhere to be seen.","“Yi, where is he?” He couldn’t help but find it strange.","“Father, that monkey princess went over there. She said that it’s very strange that someone is selling a rock over there so she’ll go and take a look,” Sixth Baby said.","Monkey princess?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel annoyed and amused. When had the seven babies given Princess Bixiao such a nickname?","Hugging the Sixth Baby, he walked towards where Princess Bixiao was. She wasn’t far from him.","However, before he arrived, he heard a commotion.."]},{"number":3700,"title":"Chapter 3700: Hou Qingbai","paragraphs":["Chapter 3700: Hou Qingbai","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Scram!” Princess Bixiao’s sharp voice rang out.","“What a hot beauty, but I like her!” A man’s voice rang out, appearing to be very shameless, “Beauty, follow me in the future. Whatever you want, I will buy for you!”","“I already said, scram!” Princess Bixiao shouted again. There was a powerful fury in her voice.","“Tsk, this face is so fair. Come, let me touch it,” the man continued.","Boom!","The sound of battle rang out, and a wave of energy surged over.","Ling Han couldn’t help as his eyes became sharp. This was someone teasing Princess Bixiao.","Though he did not have any ideas about this princess of the Demon Race, there was no reason for him to allow others to bully her.","“Haha, she is indeed a rose with thorns. Brother likes her!”","“Pervert!”","Ling Han walked over, only to see that Princess Bixiao was presently engaged in a fierce battle with a man in green robes. That man looked to be around 25 or 26 years old, and had a sloppy expression on his face. His attacks were even more despicable, and his eyes were focused on Princess Bixiao’s face, breasts, and thighs, as he stretched out his claws.","This caused Princess Bixiao to feel very wary. Even if she could knock him down with a single strike, she did not want to take the risk of him touching her jade body.","She could only draw out the distance between them, and use her power to attack from afar. However, the man in green was closing in on her step by step, every move despicable, causing Princess Bixiao to rebuke him furiously, but she could do nothing.","This meant that though the man in green was shameless, his abilities were very strong. Otherwise, he could not have possibly forced Princess Bixiao into such a sorry state.","Now, this batch of extraterrestrial visitors had come to conspire for the inheritance of the Saint. To say nothing of Sect Master, Venerate Tier-level forces, even the heirs of the Holy Lands would be tempted — to be able to grasp two ultimate techniques of Saints, wasn’t that better than one?","Thus, the overall strength of this group of young people was much stronger than before, whether it was their cultivation level or natural talent.","Ling Han naturally couldn’t bear to watch on. With a leap, he had already arrived between Princess Bixiao and the man in green.","“Scram!” The man in green frowned, and revealed an expression of disgust. His right hand formed into a palm, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han. Boom, there was actually a strange phenomenon of the moon hanging in the middle of the sky, illuminating all ages.","Ling Han humphed as he unleashed his Demonic Monkey Fists.","Boom!","The man in green’s expression changed immediately, and he couldn’t help but step back continuously. He only steadied his footing after taking nine steps back, but his face was completely flushed. With a ‘wah’, he spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Yi, Hou Qingbai was actually wounded!” someone immediately shouted from the sidelines.","“Hou Qingbai is a two-star genius who has reached Heavenly Dao Foundation. The only person who can defeat him should be an Ultimate Dao Foundation.”","“That person should be a native of the Celestial Sea Planet. I have seen a holographic image of him before. I think his name is Ling Han, and together with another prodigy, Hong Tianbu, they are known as the Twin Prodigies of the Imperial City.”","“Two prodigies of the Imperial Capital? Haha, I’m about to die of laughter. A mere native dares to boast like this.”","“Don’t forget, Hou Qingbai has just been defeated by him.”","“It’s probably a one-star genius of Ultimate Dao Foundation. It wouldn’t be strange for him to defeat Hou Qingbai.”","At first, everyone had not taken it to heart. They were all looking at their own merchandise, but Hou Qingbai was actually sent flying with a single punch from a native. This naturally attracted everyone’s attention, and they all walked over.","“Yi, this person’s life force isn’t very strong.” Someone sensed Ling Han’s life force, and immediately revealed an expression of shock.","“It seems like he’s only a Human Dao Foundation!”","“Haha, how could that be possible? A Human Dao Foundation cultivator wants to defeat a two-star genius of Heavenly Dao Foundation, then what kind of battle prowess does he have to be?”","“It has to be four stars, at least.”","“Four stars? How could that be possible for such a backward planet?”","“It is indeed impossible!”","Everyone shook their heads. They looked down on Celestial Sea Planet 1000 times over, so they naturally wouldn’t believe that Ling Han was a four-star genius. This was like someone saying that a Saint had been born on a small planet.","What a colossal joke.","Hou Qingbai rubbed his chest to soothe the discomfort in his body. His eyes burned as he stared at Ling Han and said, “You actually dare to interfere in my matters, and you even dare to wound me. You’re truly tired of living.”","Ling Han clasped his hands behind his back and said calmly, “Kneel down and apologize to my friend, and I’ll spare your life.”","“Haha!” Hou Qingbai couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. This was really too ridiculous. A native actually dared to make him kneel down and beg for mercy?","“Pretty boy, you have absolutely no idea who I am, right?” Hou Qingbai smirked coldly. He was not an idiot. Before teasing Princess Bixiao, he had already investigated the latter’s identity. After all, it was very possible that she was really the Holy Daughter of a great sect, or the princess of a Majestic Empire Then, he would be seeking death.","But Princess Bixiao was a native, so what kind of background could she have?","Only now was he completely unrestrained, treating Princess Bixiao like a meal on a plate.","But who would have expected that another native would jump out, and actually dare to ruin his plans, and even in fact injure him in public?","He could not tolerate this.","“I am Hou Qingbai, and my father is Hou Longsheng, the Sect Master of the Pleasure Forest Sect, a great elite of Minor Advanced Tier!” he declared proudly.","What cultivation level was the Minor Advanced Tier? A great elite of Sect Master-level!","As long as one such existence was dispatched, they would be able to sweep aside all opposition in Celestial Sea Planet, suppressing a planet single-handedly!","“Don’t blame me for not giving you a chance to live,” Hou Qingbai said calmly. “Kneel down and kowtow a hundred times, and I can consider sparing your life.”","This was called giving someone a taste of their own medicine, and you want me to kneel? Hehe, I will make you kneel until your bones break.","Hearing Hou Qingbai’s words, the people in the area all crossed their arms over their chests and sneered.","Regardless of the truth of the matter, as extraterrestrial visitors, they were naturally on Hou Qingbai’s side. They all looked down on the natives.","You see, even the strongest elite was only a Spirit Transformation Tier. Too weak, so how could they possibly take him seriously?","If they were weak, they would be beaten and bullied. This was an iron rule of the cultivation world.","No one would sympathize with the weak. Elites could do as they pleased.","Ling Han smiled calmly and said, “My patience is limited. If you don’t kneel within 10 or so minutes, I’ll kill you!”","His tone was very ordinary, as if he was talking about something that could not be more ordinary.","Hou Qingbai felt humiliated. Ling Han actually dared to disrespect him?","He had already revealed his identity.","Damn it!","“Are you so determined to seek death?” Hou Qingbai sneered. He pressed lightly on his chest, and a brilliant light surged out, covering his entire body. Instantly, a green Battle Armor appeared on his body.","“This is the Soaring Cloud Battle Armor, which can increase battle prowess by one star!” he declared proudly.","In the previous attack, Ling Han had only been slightly stronger than him. There was definitely not as big a gap as a single star.","“One, two, three...” Ling Han began counting.","Hou Qingbai almost exploded in fury. Ling Han was completely looking down on him!","Why was this native so despicable?","“I’m going to tear you into pieces, and feed every bit of your flesh and blood to the dogs,” he said through gritted teeth.","“Six, seven, eight...” Ling Han continued to count.","Everyone couldn’t help but laugh in spite of themselves. This native really had a personality, and was very courageous.","This scene was going to be quite interesting.."]}]);
